    "homepage_text": "åäº¬å¤§å­¦çéè®¡ç®æºç ç©¶æ\nä¸­æ\n|\nEnglish\nHome\nAbout us\nPeople\nResearch\nPlatform\nEvent\nLecture\né¦é¡µ\nÂ\n>\nÂ\n>\nè¯¦æ\nTeam\n> Liangcai Gao\nLiangcai Gao\nAssociate Professor\nDocument Recognition and Retrieval, Digital Publishing\nTelï¼\n(86)10-82529655\nCLOSE\nEnglish\n|\nä¸­æ\nLinks:\nWangXuan\nFOUNDER\nCCES\nPEKING University\nContact us\nTel: 86-10-6275 4420 Â Â Â\nFax: 86-10-6275 4532\nDean MailBoxï¼icst748 at pku.edu.cn\nAddressï¼No. 128 Zhongguancun North Street, Haidian District, Beijing, \n        100871, P. R. China\nLinks:\nWangXuan\nFOUNDER\nPEKING University\nÂ© Copyright 2017 All Rights Reserved\nWangxuan Institute of Computer Technology, Peking University"
