    "homepage_text": "Junyang Lin\nJunyang Lin\nQwen Team\nResearch Interests\nAreas of current research focus\nLarge Language Models\nScaling laws, architecture design, and efficient training methods for large language models.\nAI Agents\nAutonomous agents capable of multi-step reasoning and tool usage.\nMultimodal Learning\nUnified models across text, vision, and other modalities.\nLong-Horizon Reasoning\nEnabling models for extended sequential planning and execution.\nWorld Models\nUnifying vision-based understanding and generation for comprehensive world modeling.\nReinforcement Learning\nReinforcement learning algorithms co-designed with scalable infrastructure.\nSelected Publications\nSelected academic work\nQwen3 Technical Report\nA. Yang, A. Li, B. Yang, B. Zhang, ...\nJ. Lin\n, ...\narXiv preprint arXiv:2505.09388, 2025\narXiv\nCode\nQwen3-VL Technical Report\nS. Bai, K. Chen, X. Liu, J. Wang, ...\nJ. Lin\n, ...\narXiv preprint arXiv:2502.13923, 2025\narXiv\nCode\nQwen3-Coder: Agentic Coding in the World\nS. Bai, P. Wang, W. Ge, X. Liu, ...\nJ. Lin\n, ...\nQwen Blog, 2025\nBlog\nCode\nGroup Sequence Policy Optimization\nC. Zheng, S. Liu, M. Li, X. Chen, B. Yu, C. Gao, K. Dang, Y. Liu, R. Men, A. Yang,\nJ. Lin\n, J. Zhou\narXiv preprint arXiv:2507.18071, 2025\narXiv\nCode\nGated Attention for Large Language Models: Non-linearity, Sparsity, and Attention-Sink-Free\nZ. Qiu, Z. Wang, B. Zheng, Z. Huang, K. Wen, S. Yang, R. Men, L. Yu, F. Huang, S. Huang, D. Liu, J. Zhou,\nJ. Lin\nNeurIPS 2025\narXiv\nCode\nQwen-Image Technical Report\nY. Chu, Z. Cui, K. Dang, X. Deng, F. Huang, ...\nJ. Lin\n, ...\narXiv preprint arXiv:2505.10338, 2025\narXiv\nCode\nContact\nReach out for collaborations or inquiries\njustinlin930319@gmail.com\nAlibaba:\njunyang.ljy@alibaba-inc.com"
