    "homepage_text": "Yoo, Chang D. - KAIST 전기 및 전자공학부\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nSITEMAP\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nINTRANET\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nPeople & Life\nProfessor\nHome\nPeople & Life\nFaculty\nYoo, Chang D.\nYoo, Chang D.\nResearch Areas\nAI & Machine Learning, Multimedia Signal Processing, Robotics & Control, Human Computer Interaction\nResearch\nDeep Learning, Machine Learning, Computer Vision, Audio/Speech Processing\nLaboratory\nArtificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Lab. (AIM)\nBuilding\nLG Innovation Hall (N24)\n2111\nExtension\n#3470\nEmail\ncd_yoo@kaist.ac.kr\nWebsite\nhttp://sanctusfactory.com/\nResearch Group\nSignal\ndivision\nDegree\nPh.D. (2006) MIT\nAchievements\nT. Vu, H. Jang, T. X. Pham and C. D. Yoo, “Cascade RPN: Delving into High-Quality Region Proposal Network with Adaptive Convolution”, In Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NIPS) spotlight, 2019.\nJ. Kim, T. Kim, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Edge-Labeling Graph Neural Network for Few-shot Learning”, In International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) oral, 2019.\nJ. Kim, M. Ma, K. Kim, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Progressive Attention Memory Network for Movie Story Question Answering”, In International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019.\nS. Kang, J. Kim, H. Choi, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Pivot Correlational Neural Network for Multimodal Video Categorization”, In European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2018.\nV. Thang, T. M. Luu, C. D. Yoo, “Perception-enhanced image super-resolution via relativistic generative adversarial networks”, In PIRM workshop, European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2018.\nNext\nKim, Choong-Ki\nShow List\nAbout Us\nOverview\nWelcome Message\nHistory\nOrganization Chart\nEE Division\nEE Visual Identity\nEE Publication\nEE Facilities\nMaps & Directions\nVirtual Campus Tour\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nResearch Centers\nResearch Highlights\nResearch Labs\nEE-X\nAI in EE\nAI in Wave Division\nAI in Communication Division\nAI in Device Division\nAI in Signal Division\nAI in Computer Division\nAI in Circuit Division\nPeople & Life\nFaculty\nStaff\nStudent Activities\nEE International Office\nOutstanding Lecture Award\nBest Paper Award\nDean's List\nAcademics\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nDual Degree\nCo-op Program\nEE Externship\nGraduation Thesis & Qualifying Exam.\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nInternational Students\nScholarships and Living Expenses\nNews & Event\nNotice\nCalendar\nSeminar\nEvents\nPress\nJob Openings\nNewsletter\nFaculty Recruitment\nGive\nGive\nAbout Us\nOverview\nWelcome Message\nHistory\nStatus\nAnnual Report\nMaps & Directions\nVirtual Campus Tour\nResearch\nCore Areas\nResearch Centers\nResearch Highlights\nEE-X\nAI in EE\nAI in Wave Division\nAI in Communication Division\nAI in Device Division\nAI in Signal Division\nAI in Computer Division\nAI in Circuit Division\nPeople & Life\nFaculty\nStaff\nStudent Activities\nUndergraduate Programs\nEE International Office\nStudent Facilities\nAlumni Interviews\nAcademics\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nDual Degree\nCo-op Program\nExternal Relations\nGive\nEducational Cooperation\nIndustrial Cooperation\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nInternational Students\nScholarships and Living Expenses\nNews & Event\nNotice\nCalendar\nSeminar\nEvents\nPress\nJob Openings\nNewsletter\n34141 대전광역시 유성구 대학로 291 한국과학기술원(KAIST)\nTel. 042-350-3411\nFax. 042-350-3410\nCopyright ⓒ 2015 KAIST Electrical Engineering. All rights reserved.\nMade by PRESSCAT\nWebsite Feedback\n34141 대전광역시 유성구 대학로 291 한국과학기술원(KAIST)\nTel. 042-350-3411\nFax. 042-350-3410\nCopyright ⓒ 2015 KAIST Electrical Engineering. All rights reserved.\nMade by PRESSCAT\nRecruitment\nContact Us\n채용정보\n문의하기\n34141 대전광역시 유성구 대학로 291 한국과학기술원(KAIST)\nTel. 042-350-3411\nFax. 042-350-3410\nCopyright ⓒ 2015 KAIST Electrical Engineering. All rights reserved.\nMade by PRESSCAT\n채용정보\n문의하기\n34141 대