    "homepage_text": "Kelvin C.K. Chan\nKelvin C.K. Chan\nSenior Research Scientist\nGoogle DeepMind\nEmail:\nkelvinckchan [at] google.com\nBiography\nKelvin is a Senior Research Scientist at Google DeepMind, specializing in multimodal models with a\n                focus on image generation and editing. He is a core contributor to Google's  Gemini 3 Pro Image (Nano Banana Pro), Gemini 2.5 Flash Image (Nano\n                Banana), Imagen and Gemini 2.0 Flash Native Image Generation. He earned his B.Sc. and B.Eng. degrees\n                from The Chinese University of Hong\n                Kong, and his M.Phil. degree in Mathematics from the same university. He then went on to receive his\n                Ph.D. in Computer Science from Nanyang\n                Technological University in Singapore, where he was supervised by\nProf. Chen Change Loy\nat\nMMLab@NTU\n. He was awarded the NTU\n                SCSE Outstanding PhD Thesis Award in 2023 for his research on low-level vision. He is a recipient\n                of the Google\n                PhD Fellowship in 2021.\nNews\n➤ [11/2025]\nGemini 3 Pro Image (Nano Banana Pro)\nis released.\n➤ [10/2025]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICML 2026.\n➤ [08/2025]\nGemini 2.5 Flash Image (Nano Banana)\nis released.\n➤ [08/2025]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for CVPR 2026.\n➤ [08/2025]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICLR 2026.\n➤ [07/2025]\nThe technical report of\nGemini 2.5\nis released to arXiv.\n➤ [03/2025]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for NeurIPS 2025.\n➤ [12/2024]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICML 2025.\n➤ [08/2024]\nThe technical report of\nImagen 3\nis released to arXiv.\n➤ [08/2024]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICLR 2025.\n➤ [08/2024]\nReVersion\nis accepted to SIGGRAPH Asia 2024.\n➤ [06/2024]\nStableSR\nis accepted to IJCV\n.\n➤ [06/2024]\nInvited talk in the\nAIS workshop\nat CVPR 2024.\n➤ [05/2024]\nI am moving from Google Research to Google DeepMind.\n➤ [05/2024]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for NeurIPS 2024.\n➤ [03/2024]\n2 papers (\nInstruct-Imagen\nand\nSAG\n) are\n                accepted to CVPR\n                2024.\n➤ [09/2023]\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICLR 2024.\n➤ [07/2023]\nI received the\nNTU SCSE Outstanding PhD Thesis Award\n.\n➤ [01/2023]\nI joined Google as a\nResearch Scientist\n.\nPublications\nTechnical Report\nGemini 2.5: Pushing the Frontier with Advanced Reasoning, Multimodality, Long Context,\n                                and Next Generation Agentic Capabilities\nGemini Team\narXiv preprint arXiv:2507.06261\n[PDF]\n[Web]\n[BibTeX]\n@article{gemini2025gemini,\nauthor = {Gemini Team},\ntitle = {Gemini 2.5: Pushing the Frontier with Advanced Reasoning, Multimodality, Long Context, and Next Generation Agentic Capabilities},\narticle = {arXiv preprint arXiv:2507.06261},\nyear = {2025}\n}\nImagen 3\nJason Baldridge, Jakob Bauer, Mukul Bhutani, Nicole Brichtova, Andrew Bunner,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Yichang Chen, Sander Dieleman, Yuqing Du et al.\narXiv preprint arXiv:2408.07009\n[PDF]\n[Web]\n[BibTeX]\n@article{baldridge2024imagen,\nauthor = {Baldridge, Jason and Bauer, Jakob and Bhutani, Mukul and Brichtova, Nicole and Bunner, Andrew and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Chen, Yichang and Dieleman, Sander and Du, Yuqing et al.},\ntitle = {Imagen 3},\narticle = {arXiv preprint arXiv:2408.07009},\nyear = {2024}\n}\nConferences\nReVersion: Diffusion-Based Relation Inversion from Images\nZiqi Huang, Tianxing Wu, Yuming Jiang,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Ziwei Liu\nSIGGRAPH Asia, 2024\n[PDF]\n[Code]\n[Project Page]\n[Video]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{huang2024reversion,\nauthor = {Huang, Ziqi and Wu, Tianxiang and Jiang, Yuming and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Liu, Ziwei},\ntitle = {ReVersion: Diffusion-Based Relation Inversion from Images},\nbooktitle = {SIGGRAPH Asia},\nyear = {2024}\n}\nInstruct-Imagen: Image Generation with Multi-modal Instruction\nHexiang Hu*,\nKelvin C.K. Chan*\n, Yu-Chuan Su*, Wenhu Chen*, Yandong Li,\n                                Kihyuk Sohn, Yang Zhao,\nXue Ben, Boqing Gong, William Cohen, Ming-Wei Chang, Xuhui\n                                Jia\nCVPR, 2024\n(Oral)\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{hu2024instruct, \nauthor = {Hu, Hexiang and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Su, Yu-Chuan and Chen, Wenhu and Li, Yandong and Sohn, Kihyuk and Zhao, Yang and Ben, Xue and Gong, Boqing and Cohen, William and Chang, Ming-Wei and Jia, Xuhui},\ntitle = {Instruct-Imagen: Image Generation with Multi-modal Instruction},\nbooktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear = {2024}\n}\nImproving Subject-Driven Image Synthesis with Subject-Agnostic Guidance\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Yang Zhao, Xuhui Jia, Ming-Hsuan Yang, Huisheng\n                                Wang\nCVPR, 2024\n[PDF]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{chan2024subject, \nauthor = {Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Yang, Zhao and Jia, Xuhui and Yang, Ming-Hsuan and Wang, Huisheng},\ntitle = {Improving Subject-Driven Image Synthesis with Subject-Agnostic Guidance},\nbooktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear = {2024}\n}\nDual Associated Encoder for Face Restoration\nYu-Ju Tsai, Yu-Lun Liu, Lu Qi,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Ming-Hsuan Yang\nICLR, 2024\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{zhou2023propainter,\ntitle={Dual Associated Encoder for Face Restoration},\nauthor={Tsai, Yu-Ju Tsai and Liu, Yu-Lun and Qi, Lu and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Yang, Ming-Hsuan},\nbooktitle={International Conference on Learning Representations},\nyear={2024}\n}\nProPainter: Improving Propagation and Transformer for Video Inpainting\nShangchen Zhou, Chongyi Li,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Chen Change Loy\nICCV, 2023\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{zhou2023propainter,\ntitle={ProPainter: Improving Propagation and Transformer for Video Inpainting},\nauthor={Zhou, Shangchen and Li, Chongyi and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Loy, Chen Change},\nbooktitle={Proceedings of IEEE International Conference on Computer Vision},\nyear={2023}\n}\nCollaborative Diffusion for Multi-Modal Face Generation and Editing\nZiqi Huang,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Yuming Jiang, Ziwei Liu,\nCVPR, 2023\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[Video]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{huang2023collaborative,\ntitle={Collaborative Diffusion for Multi-Modal Face Generation and Editing},\nauthor={Huang, Ziqi and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Jiang, Yuming and Liu, Ziwei},\nbooktitle={Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear={2023}\n}\nExploring CLIP for Assessing the Look and Feel of Images\nJianyi Wang,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Chen Change Loy\nAAAI, 2023\n[PDF]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{wang2023exploring,\ntitle={Exploring CLIP for Assessing the Look and Feel of Images},\nauthor={Wang, Jianyi and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Loy, Chen Change},\nbooktitle={AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence},\nyear={2023}\n}\nTowards Robust Blind Face Restoration with Codebook Lookup TransFormer\nShangzhou Zhou,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Chongyi Li, Chen Change Loy\nNeurIPS, 2022\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[Video]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{zhou2022codeformer,\ntitle={Towards Robust Blind Face Restoration with Codebook Lookup TransFormer},\nauthor={Zhou, Shangchen and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Li, Chongyi and Loy, Chen Change},\nbooktitle={Neural Information Processing Systems},\nyear={2022}\n}\nRealBasicVSR: Investigating Tradeoffs in Real-World Video Super-Resolution\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Shangchen Zhou, Xiangyu Xu, Chen Change Loy\nCVPR, 2022\n[PDF]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{chan2022investigating,\nauthor = {Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Zhou, Shangchen and Xu, Xiangyu and Loy, Chen Change},\ntitle = {Investigating Tradeoffs in Real-World Video Super-Resolution},\nbooktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear = {2022}\n}\nBasicVSR++: Improving Video Super-Resolution with Enhanced Propagation and Alignment\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Shangchen Zhou, Xiangyu Xu, Chen Change Loy\nCVPR, 2022\nChampions\n, NTIRE 2021 Challenges on Video Restoration and\n                                Enhancement\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{chan2022basicvsrplusplus,\nauthor = {Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Zhou, Shangchen and Xu, Xiangyu and Loy, Chen Change},\ntitle = {BasicVSR++: Improving Video Super-Resolution with Enhanced Propagation and Alignment},\nbooktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear = {2022}\n}\nBasicVSR: The Search for Essential Components in Video Super-Resolution and Beyond\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Xintao Wang, Ke Yu, Chao Dong, Chen Change Loy\nCVPR, 2021\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{chan2021basicvsr,\ntitle={BasicVSR: The search for essential components in video super-resolution and beyond},\nauthor={Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Wang, Xintao and Yu, Ke and Dong, Chao and Loy, Chen Change},\nbooktitle={Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear={2021}\n}\nGLEAN: Generative Latent Bank for Large-Factor Image Super-Resolution\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Xintao Wang, Xiangyu Xu, Jinwei Gu, Chen Change Loy\nCVPR, 2021\n(Oral)\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{chan2021glean,\ntitle={GLEAN: Generative latent bank for large-factor image super-resolution},\nauthor={Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Wang, Xintao and Xu, Xiangyu and Gu, Jinwei and Loy, Chen Change},\nbooktitle={Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},\nyear={2021}\n}\nRobust Reference-based Super-Resolution via C²-Matching\nYuming Jiang,\nKelvin C.K. Chan\n, Xintao Wang, Chen Change Loy, Ziwei Liu\nCVPR, 2021\n[PDF]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\n[Dataset]\n[BibTeX]\n@inproceedings{jiang2021robust,\ntitle={Robust Reference-based Super-Resolution via C2-Matching},\nauthor={Jiang, Yuming and Chan, Kelvin C.K. and Wang, Xintao and Loy,