={4},\n  year={2024},\n  publisher={Springer}\n}\nCopy\nThe Generalized Tensor Decomposition with Heterogeneous Tensor Product for Third-Order Tensors\nYun-Yang Liu, Xi-Le Zhao, Meng Ding, Jianjun Wang,\nTai-Xiang Jiang\n, Ting-Zhu Huang\nJournal of Scientific Computing, 2024.\nPDF\nBibTeX\n@article{liu2024generalized,\n  title={The Generalized...[truncated]"
