    "homepage_text": "Dr. Qiang Yang, EE Zhejiang University-Zhejiang University Personal homepage\nHome\nZJU Profile\nZJU Services\nAbout\nBasic Info Search\nFull Text Search\nFull Text Search\nBasic Info Search\n中文\n|\nEnglish\nWelcome !\nMain\nLogout\nLogin\nRelated People\nAnother batch\nLast updated\n2026-03-19\nTotal visits\n:38717\nQiang Yang\nPh.D.\nProfessor\n|\nDoctoral supervisor\nDepartment\nCollege of Electrical Engineering\nPhone\n0571-87953296\nE-mail\nqyang@zju.edu.cn\nAddress\nElectrical Eng. Bd. Offic 104-A\nResearch\nSmart energy networks; Large scale complex system modeling and optimization; Data analytics; Machine learning based control; Cyber-security of critical infrastructures\nBiography\nCourses\nPublications\nResearch Projects\nResearch contributions\nBooks\nAcademic services"
