    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Zhaohui Xue's Home page\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nWelcome to Zhaohui Xue's Home page\nZhaohui Xue (薛朝辉), Professor,\nPhD\nsupervisor\nWorking at:\nCollege of Geography and Remote Sensing\n,\nHohai University\nResearch Interests:\nHyperspectral remote sensing:\nSpectral-spatial feature extraction, Image Classification\nMachine learning:\nDeep Learning, sparse representation, semi-supervised learning, active learning, ensemble learning, etc.\nLand surface properties:\nSoil moisture retrieval, vegetation phenology analysis, time series analysis.\nOther Home Pages:\nMy home page in HHU\n,\n科研之友\nMy Github\n,\nMy ORCID\nGoogle Scholar\n,\nResearch Gate\n,\nMy\nWeb of Science Researcher\nNews:\nNew!\nZ. Li, Z. Xue,\nM. Jia*\n, X. Nie, H. Wu, M. Zhang, H. Su.\nDEMAE: Diffusion Enhanced Masked Autoencoder for Hyperspectral Image Classification With few Labeled Samples\n[J]. IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing, 2024: 1-1.\n(SCI, JCR一区\n, 中科院一区\n)\nS. Cheng,\nZ. Xue*\n, Z. Li, A. Xu, H. Su.\nSpectral-Spatial Score Fusion Attention Network for Hyperspectral Image Classification with Limited Samples\n[J]. IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing, 2024, doi: 10.1109/JSTARS.2024.3440254.\n(SCI, JCR一区\n, 中科院二区\n)\nY. Wang,\nZ. Xue*\n,\nM. Jia*\n, Z. Liu, H. Su.\nHypergraph Convolutional Network With Multiple Hyperedges Fusion for Hyperspectral Image Classification Under Limited Samples\n[J]. IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing, 2024,\ndoi: 10.1109/TGRS.2024.3440271\n.\n(SCI, JCR一区\n, 中科院一区\n)\nS. Qian,\nZ. Xue*\n, M. Jia, Y. Chen, H. Su.\nTemporal-spectral-semantic-aware convolutional transformer network for multi-class tidal wetland change detection in Greater Bay Area\n[J]. ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 2024, 216: 126-141.\n(SCI, JCR一区\n, 中科院一区\n)\nC. Sun,\nZ. Xue*\n, L. Zhang, H. Su.\nLocal Peak Savitzky-Golay for Spatio-Temporal Reconstruction of Landsat NDVI Time Series: A Case Study Over the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau\n[J]. IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing, 2024, 17: 13439-13455.\n(SCI, JCR一区\n, 中科院二区\n)\nMap tracker:\n©\nCopyright 2015 by Zhaohui Xue\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
