    "homepage_text": "On Journey... | Liang Lin's Website\nOn Journey…\nLiang Lin's Website\nProf. Liang Lin’s homepage\nI am a full Professor of Sun Yat-sen University (SYSU)  and Fellow of IEEE/IAPR/IET. My research focuses on the following aspects:\nMachine Perception and Learning\n— General Multi-modal Understanding; Holistic Image and Video Parsing; Cross-modal Content Generation\n— Representation Learning; Foundation Models; Reinforced Agent Learning; Causal Inference and Reasoning\nEmbodied AI Models\n— Digital Avartar; Human Machine Interaction\n— Vision-Language-Action Models for Robotics; Long Range Task Planning\nI am supervising the\nHCP-I2\nLab:\nHuman-Cyber-Physical Intelligence Integration, SYSU.\nLiang Lin (林倞)\n✉Contact\nMail Address:\nSchool of Data and Computer Science, Sun Yat-Sen University (East Campus), Higher Education Mega Center, Guangzhou 510006, China.\nE-mail: linliang (at) live.com; linlng (at) mail.sysu.edu.cn\nNews\nTest\nHello world!"
  },
