    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Guang-Zhong Sun's homepage\nGuang-Zhong Sun\nPh.D, Professor\nAlgorithm and Data Application (Ada) Research Group\nNational High Performance Computing Center (Hefei)\nSchool  of Computer Science and Technology\nUniversity  of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n[ä¸­æç®ä»]\nContact Information\nEmail\ngzsun AT ustc.edu.cn, gz.sun AT acm.org\nFax\n+86-551-63601013\nTel\n+86-551-63602443\nAddress\nRoom 506(Lab), Room 505(Office),New Research Building\n(Map)\n, East Campus of USTC\nWeb\nhttp://staff.ustc.edu.cn/~gzsun/\nLast updated on Jan 28, 2023 (\nunder construction\n)"
