    "homepage_text": "Yuesong's Homepage\nYuesong Shen\nDeep learning alchemist\nBayesian sect\nResearcher @\nHuawei HKRC\n(lastname).(firstname)@huawei.com\nFollow\nLinkedIn\nGoogle Scholar\nX (Twitter)\nGitHub\n欢迎! Welcome! Bienvenue! Willkommen!\nI am Yuesong, currently working at\nHuawei Hong Kong Research Center\nas a researcher.\nPreviously, I have obtained my PhD and MSc Informatics degree from\nTechnical University of Munich\nand\nDiplôme \n  d'Ingénieur\nfrom\nÉcole polytechnique\n. \n  I have done internships and student jobs in companies such as\nTechnicolor\n,\nValeo\n, and\nArtisense\n,\n  and have collaborated with research groups such as the\nApproximate Bayesian Inference\nTeam from\nRIKEN AIP\nin Japan.\nDuring my doctoral studies at the\nComputer Vision Group\n, I have worked on topics including Bayesian deep learning, uncertainty estimation, \n  graph neural networks, probabilistic graphical models, computer vision applications, etc.\nEnter your search term..."
