    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Closet of Sock Xu\nBio\n|\nPublication\n|\nIntern Opening\nYou found Xu! I do\nDesign\n, I write\nCode\n, I like plain HTML.\nI have a mixture background of design and tech. I am a 3rd year Phd student supervised by Dr. Ya-Qin Zhang in Tsinghua University. During my Phd study, I have interned in Zhipu.AI, MSRA and Kuaishou. \n\t\t\tPrior to that I worked as a Research Assistant in\nInstitute for AI Industry Research (AIR), Tsinghua University.\nPrior to that I worked as a Researcher in Codec Group,\nSensetime Research\n.\n\t\t\tBefore that I worked as a Research Intern in\nMedia Computing Group,\n\t\t\t\tMicrosoft Research Asia\nunder supervision of Dr. Li Bin & Dr. Lu Yan. Before that I worked as a\n\t\t\tResearch Intern in\nVideo\n\t\t\t\tLab,\n\t\t\t\tNew York University\nunder supervision of Dr. Yao Wang. Before that I was an architecture intern in\nAedas Ltd, Hong Kong Office\nwith Christine Lam and David\n\t\t\tClayton.\n\t\t\tProudly I graduated with Master of Science from\nNew York University\nunder\n\t\t\tsupervision of Dr. Ahmed Ansari. Proudly I graduated with Bachelor of Achitecture from\nSchool of\n\t\t\t\tArchitecture, Tsinghua University\n, under supervision of Dr. Weixin Huang.\nMy research interests span from Media Computing to Image Processing. Academic discussion or say hi, email to\nx.tongda@nyu.edu.\nIf you are an employer, I am eligible for intern / part-time only as I am a student. My CV is here\nhere."
  },
