    "homepage_text": "﻿\nYong Liu's HOMEPAGE\nYong Liu    刘勇\nI am an Associate Professor at\nInstitute of Computational Mathematics and Scientific/Engineering Computing\n,\nAcademy of Mathematics and Systems Science Chinese Academy of Sciences\n.\r\n                    My research area is numerical analysis and scientific computing.\nHere is my\nCV\n.\nI am currently looking for master's or Ph.D. students who are passionate about mathematics and have a strong enthusiasm for research. If you are interested in my research direction, please email me for details.\nContact:\nEmail: yongliu@lsec.cc.ac.cn\nMailing address:\nNo. 55 Zhongguancun East Road, Academy of Mathematics and Systems Science, Chinese Academy of Sciences\nBeijing 100190, P.R. China"
