    "homepage_text": "Zhi Zhou's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZhi Zhou's Homepage\nHome\nZhi Zhou (周知)\nOffice:\nTU709, Yip Kit Chuen Bldg.\nPhone:\n852-6098-9295\nE-mail:\nzhizhou0125@gmail.com,\nzhizhou@polyu.edu.hk\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nEducation\nB.S., Mathematics, Nanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics,  Jun 2010.\nPh.D., Mathematics, Texas A&M University,  Aug 2015.  Advisor:\nRaytcho Lazarov\n,\nBangti Jin\nEmployment\nAssociate Professor, July 2023 — current,\nHong Kong Polytechnic University.\nAssistant Professor, Jun 2017 — June 2023, Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\nPostdoc, August 2015- Jun 2017 the Computational Mathematics and Multiscale Modeling group (\nCM3\n) at Columbia University.  Mentor:\nQiang Du\nResearch interests\nNumerical Methods for PDEs\nNonlocal/Fractional PDEs\nComputational Inverse Problems and Optimal Control\nScientific Computations, Machine Learning\nProfessional Recognition\nHighly Cited Researcher in Mathematics,  Web of Science Clarivate, Nov 2025\nFrontiers of Science Award in Mathematics, International Congress of Basic Sciences, July 2024\nEarly Career Award, Research Grants Council of Hong Kong, October 2018.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
