    "homepage_text": "Ching-Yu Lin\n      -  Taipei Medical University\nTaipei Medical University Home\nHelp & FAQ,\nLink opens in a new tab\nEnglish\n中文\nSearch content at Taipei Medical University\nView Scopus Profile\nChing-Yu Lin\nProfessor\n,\nSchool of Medical Laboratory Science and Biotechnology\nJoint-Appointment Professor\n,\nPh.D. Program in Medical Biotechnology\nJoint-Appointment Professor\n,\nPh.D. Program for Cancer Molecular Biology and Drug Discovery\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0001-8269-797X\nEmail\ncylin\ntmu.edu\ntw\nh-index\n2392\nCitations\n30\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n1998                 …\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nEducation\n2007 M.S. (Science) National Taiwan University\n1997 Ph.D., National Taiwan University\n1991 M.S. (Science) National Taiwan University\nExperience\n2020.07- Professor, Ph.D. Program in Medical Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n2018.08- Professor, School of Medical Laboratory Science and Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n2017.08- Professor, Ph.D. Program in Medical Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n2015.02-2017.07 Associate Professor, Ph.D. Program in Medical Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n2012.08-2018.07 Associate Professor, School of Medical Laboratory Science and Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n2007.08-2012.07 Assistant Professor, School of Medical Laboratory Science and Biotechnology, Taipei Medical University\n1997.12-2007.08 Head of Yuan-San Imstitute, King-Car Food Company\nResearch Interests\nProteomics\nBlood protein post-translational modification in cancer and autoimmune diseases\nGlycation/Oxidative modification\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Ching-Yu Lin is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n6\nSimilar Profiles\nWart Virus\nMedicine and Dentistry\n100%\nAutoantibodies\nBiochemistry, Genetics and Molecular Biology\n89%\nCancer Cell\nBiochemistry, Genetics and Molecular Biology\n68%\nProstate Cancer\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n68%\nRheumatoid Arthritis\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n56%\nGenotype\nMedicine and Dentistry\n56%\nNeoplasm\nMedicine and Dentistry\n52%\n4 Hydroxynonenal\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n51%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nProjects\n12\nFinished\n使用瓜氨酸間α胰蛋白酶抑制劑重鏈3542-556 胜肽之螢光奈米鑽石自旋提升側流免疫感測器用於檢測類風濕性關節炎的開發和驗證\nLin, C.-Y.\n(PI)\n1/1/25\n→\n12/31/25\nProject\n:\nB - Project of TMU\n›\ni - Other (Funded by TMU)\n使用瓜氨酸間α胰蛋白酶抑制劑重鏈3542-556 胜肽之螢光奈米鑽石自旋提升側流免疫感測器用於檢測類風濕性關節炎的開發和驗證\nLin, C.-Y.\n(PI)\n1/1/25\n→\n12/31/25\nProject\n:\nC - Project of Alliance\n›\nm - National Taiwan University of Science and Technology\nCardiovascular Risk in Diabetes Mellitus: the Pathogenic Role of Novel Anti-Malondialdehyde Modified-Peptide Adduct Autoantibodies in Plasma and Importing Machine Learning for Predicting Coronary Artery Disease in Patients with Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus\nLin, C.-Y.\n(PI)\n8/1/23\n→\n7/31/24\nProject\n:\nA - Government Institution\n›\nb - National Science and Technology Council\nClinical Assay for Colorectal Carcinoma Early Detection Using Wheat Germ Agglutinin-Multiple Reaction Monitoring Mass Spectrometry Kit: U.S. Fda Guideline\nLin, C.-Y.\n(PI)\n6/1/22\n→\n5/31/23\nProject\n:\nA - Government Institution\n›\nb - National Science and Technology Council\n開發肺癌檢測血液DNA甲基化生物標記之專利地圖分析---以USPTO/TW/EPO/WIPO資料庫為例\nLin, C.-Y.\n(PI)\n7/1/20\n→\n2/1/21\nProject\n:\nA - Government Institution\n›\nb - National Science and Technology Council\nView all 12 projects\nResearch output\n76\nArticle\n6\nComment/debate\n6\nReview article\n1\nBook\n2\nMore\n1\nChapter\n1\nLetter\nElectrodeposited nanoflower platinum films for high-sensitivity glucose sensing and cellular activity monitoring\nLee, Y. L., Tseng, C. C., Chung, R. J.,\nLin, C. Y.\n,\nFan, Y. J.\n& Chen, P. C.,\nFeb 15 2026\n,\nIn:\nSurface and Coatings Technology.\n522\n, 133146.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nPlatinum\n100%\nElevated levels of nitrotyrosine-modified protein adducts and their association with the severity of primary sjogren’s syndrome and secondary sjogren’s syndrome with rheumatoid arthritis in Taiwanese Patients\nTeng, H. E.,\nTsai, Y. H.\n, Mo, Y. C., Lu, Y. J., Lin, H. T.,\nChang, Y. S.\n&\nLin, C. Y.\n,\n2025\n, (Accepted/In press)\nIn:\nClinical Rheumatology.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nRheumatoid Arthritis\n100%\n3 Nitrotyrosine\n100%\nSjoegren Syndrome\n100%\nInflammatory Arthritis\n100%\nSjögren's Syndrome\n100%\nProstate cancer cells elevate glycolysis and G6PD in response to caffeic acid phenethyl ester-induced growth inhibition\nLin, T. P., Chen, P. C.,\nLin, C. Y.\n, Wang, B. J., Kuo, Y. Y., Yeh, C. C., Tseng, J. C., Huo, C., Kao, C. L., Shih, L. J., Chen, J. K., Li, C. Y., Hour, T. C. & Chuu, C. P.,\nDec 2025\n,\nIn:\nBMC Cancer.\n25\n,\n1\n, 95.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nPopulus\n100%\nSedoheptulose 7-Phosphate\n100%\nLow Levels of IgM Recognizing 4-Hydroxy-2-Nonenal-Modified Apolipoprotein A-I Peptide and Its Association with the Severity of Coronary Artery Disease in Taiwanese Patients\nLei, M. H., Hsu, P. W., Tsai, Y. T., Chang, C. C., Tsai, I. J., Hsu, H., Cheng, M. H., Huang, Y. L., Lin, H. T., Hsu, Y. C. &\nLin, C. Y.\n,\nJun 2024\n,\nIn:\nCurrent Issues in Molecular Biology.\n46\n,\n6\n,\np. 6267-6283\n17 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nCoronary Artery Disease\n100%\nApolipoprotein A\n100%\n4 Hydroxynonenal\n100%\nImmunoglobulin M\n100%\nAutoantibodies\n23%\n3\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nNanomaterials in the treatment and diagnosis of rheumatoid arthritis: Advanced approaches\nAngela, S., Fadhilah, G., Wei-Wen Hsiao, W., Lin, H. Y., Ko, J., Lu, S. C. W.,\nLee, C. C.\n,\nChang, Y. S.\n,\nLin, C. Y.\n, Chang, H. C. & Chiang, W. H.,\nAug 1 2024\n,\nIn:\nSLAS Technology.\n29\n,\n4\n,\np. 100146\n1 p.\n, 100146.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nReview article\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nRheumatoid Arthritis\n100%\nNanomaterial\n100%\nInflammatory Arthritis\n100%\nNanostructured Material\n100%\nBiological Marker\n33%\n8\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nView all 91 research outputs\nDatasets\nAdditional file 5 of Isotypes of autoantibodies against novel differential 4-hydroxy-2-nonenal-modified peptide adducts in serum is associated with rheumatoid arthritis in Taiwanese women\nTsai, K.-L. (Contributor),\nChang, C.-C.\n(Creator),\nChang, Y.-S.\n(Creator), Lu, Y.-Y. (Creator), Tsai, I.-J. (Contributor),\nChen, J.-H.\n(Creator),\nLin, S.-H.\n(Creator), Tai, C.-C. (Contributor), Lin, Y.-F. (Creator), Chang, H.-W. (Creator),\nLin, C.-Y.\n(Creator) & Su, E.C.-Y. (Creator), Figshare,\n2021\nDOI\n:\n10.6084/m9.figshare.13889400.v1\n,\nhttps://springernature.figshare.com/articles/dataset/Additional_file_5_of_Isotypes_of_autoantibodies_against_novel_differential_4-hydroxy-2-nonenal-modified_peptide_adducts_in_serum_is_associated_with_rheumatoid_arthritis_in_Taiwanese_women/13889400/1\nDataset\nAdditional file 3 of Isotypes of autoantibodies against novel differential 4-hydroxy-2-nonenal-modified peptide adducts in serum is associated with rheumatoid arthritis in Taiwanese women\nChen, J.-H.\n(Creator), Tai, C.-C. (Contributor),\nLin, S.-H.\n(Creator), Chang, H.-W. (Creator),\nChang, C.-C.\n(Creator), Tsai