    "homepage_text": "Wu Lab @CAS | 运筹学研究与应用\nSkip to primary content\nSkip to secondary content\nWu Lab @CAS\n运筹学研究与应用\nSearch\nA new paper on blockchain\nPosted on\n2020-01-10\nby\nLing-Yun Wu\nOur paper of\nFramework and algorithms for identifying honest blocks in blockchain\nhas been published on\nPLoS ONE\n.\nA new paper published in BiB\nPosted on\n2017-08-09\nby\nLing-Yun Wu\nOur paper of MarkRank for\ndiscovering cooperative biomarkers from heterogeneous data\nhas been published on\nBriefings in Bioinformatics\n. Congratulations to Duanchen!\nHello world!\nPosted on\n2015-11-23\nby\nLing-Yun Wu\nWelcome to Ling-Yun Wu’s Lab. This is the brand new version of Lab’s homepage!\nSearch\nRecent Posts\nA new paper on blockchain\nA new paper published in BiB\nHello world!\nArchives\nJanuary 2020\nAugust 2017\nNovember 2015\nCategories\nNews\nLinks\nAMSS / 中科院数学院\nORSC / 中国运筹学会\nAPORC / 亚太运筹中心\nZHANGroup\nMeta\nLog in\nEntries feed\nComments feed\nWordPress.org"
