    "homepage_text": "Lek-Heng Lim\nLH's Homepage\nProfessor in the\nComputational and Applied Mathematics Initiative\n,  the\nDepartment of \nStatistics\n, and the\nCollege\n.\nProfile:\ncv\n,\npapers\n,\ntalks\n,\nteaching\n,\nmeetings\n,\npeople\n.\nLek-Heng Lim\nLek-Heng Lim\n5747 South Ellis Avenue, Jones\n122C\nChicago, IL 60637\nTel: 1-773-702-4263\nFax: 1-773-702-9810\nE-mail:\nlekheng@uchicago.edu"
