    "homepage_text": "Homepage of Bo Wahlberg\nBo Wahlberg\nProfessor\nDecision and Control Systems\nSchool\n  of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science\nKTH\n  Royal Institute of Technology\nSE-100\n  44 Stockholm\nSWEDEN\nPhone:\n  +46 70 565 5846 (mobile)\nEmail:\nbo@kth.se\n·\nI am the professor of chair in Automatic Control at KTH since 1991.\n·\nI am an IEEE Fellow since 2007 for\nmy contribution to system identification using orthonormal basis functions.\n·\nI am an IFAC Fellow since 2019 for\ncontributions to system identification and the development of orthonormal basis\nfunction.\n·\nI am a Fellow of the Royal Swedish\nAcademy of Engineering Sciences (IVA), Electrical Engineering Division since\n2023\nMy\nmain research interests include system identification, modeling and control of\nindustrial processes, machine learning and statistical signal processing with\napplications in automated transportation systems and electric propulsion.\nFor\nmore\ndetails\nsee my KTH profile at\nhttps://www.kth.se/profile/bo\nOur\nbook\nis\nfreely available at\nSpringer\nOur\n2021 article\nWARA-PS: a research arena\nfor public safety demonstrations and autonomous collaborative rescue robotics\nexperimentation\nby Olov\nAndersson\nPatrick\nDoherty, Mårten\nLager, Jens-Olof Lindh, Linnea Persson, Elin A. Topp, Jesper Tordenlid and Bo\nWahlberg\ncan\nbe found\nhere\nLast\nmodified\n: Februari 21, 2024"
  },
