    "homepage_text": "Ping TAN 譚 平 | DEPARTMENT OF ELECTRONIC & COMPUTER ENGINEERING\nSkip to main content\nMore about HKUST\nUniversity News\nAcademic Departments A-Z\nLife@HKUST\nLibrary\nMap & Directions\nCareers at HKUST\nFaculty Profiles\nAbout HKUST\nSchool of Engineering\nA\nA\nA\nSearch\nHKUST\nHKUST\nHKUST\nDEPARTMENT OF ELECTRONIC & COMPUTER ENGINEERING\nIntroduction\nMessage from Department Head\nMission and Core Values\nAbout ECE\nPrograms\nOverview\nUndergraduate Programs\nBEng (ELEC)\nBEng in Microelectronics and Integrated Circuits (MEIC)\nBEng (CPEG)\nBEng & BBA (EEGBM)\nPostgraduate Programs\nPhD in ECE\nMPhil in ECE\nMSc (ELEG)\nMSc (IC)\nMSc (Telecom)\nStudent Highlights\nPG Intranet\nEnrichment\nAcademic Advising (ELEC2910/3910)\nFinal Year Project/Thesis (ELEC4900/4901)\nCo-op Program (ELEC4910)\nExchange Programs\nUndergraduate Research\nInternship Program (ELEC2991)\nInternship Program (ELEC2992 for MEIC)\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate Programs\nPostgraduate Programs\nPhD Early Admissions Scheme\nPeople\nFaculty\nRecognitions\nAdmin & Technical Staff\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nMulti-disciplinary Themes\nResearch Facilities\nBooks Published\nStudents\nCareers\nNetworking\nIndustry Day 2025\nAlumni\nAccomplishment\nUpdates\nAlumni Association\nStay Connected\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nQAE\nECE Advisory Board\nUG Curriculum Committee\nUG Student Affairs Committee\nUG Staff-Student Liaison Committee\nPG Committee\nAlumni Committee\nSafety\nNews & Events\nNews\nEvents\nMultimedia\nJoin Us\nSchool of Engineering\nSearch\nHKUST\nHKUST\nHKUST\nDEPARTMENT OF ELECTRONIC & COMPUTER ENGINEERING\nMenu\nIntroduction\nMessage from Department Head\nMission and Core Values\nAbout ECE\nPrograms\nOverview\nUndergraduate Programs\nBEng (ELEC)\nBEng in Microelectronics and Integrated Circuits (MEIC)\nBEng (CPEG)\nBEng & BBA (EEGBM)\nPostgraduate Programs\nPhD in ECE\nMPhil in ECE\nMSc (ELEG)\nMSc (IC)\nMSc (Telecom)\nStudent Highlights\nPG Intranet\nEnrichment\nAcademic Advising (ELEC2910/3910)\nFinal Year Project/Thesis (ELEC4900/4901)\nCo-op Program (ELEC4910)\nExchange Programs\nUndergraduate Research\nInternship Program (ELEC2991)\nInternship Program (ELEC2992 for MEIC)\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate Programs\nPostgraduate Programs\nPhD Early Admissions Scheme\nPeople\nFaculty\nRecognitions\nAdmin & Technical Staff\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nMulti-disciplinary Themes\nResearch Facilities\nBooks Published\nStudents\nCareers\nNetworking\nIndustry Day 2025\nAlumni\nAccomplishment\nUpdates\nAlumni Association\nStay Connected\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nQAE\nECE Advisory Board\nUG Curriculum Committee\nUG Student Affairs Committee\nUG Staff-Student Liaison Committee\nPG Committee\nAlumni Committee\nSafety\nNews & Events\nNews\nEvents\nMultimedia\nJoin Us\nSchool of Engineering\nEnter your search terms\nPing\nTAN\n譚 平\nPhD in Computer Science\nProfessor\npingtan@ust.hk\nRoom 2414\n(852) 3469 2587\n(852) 2358 1485\nGoogle Scholar Citation\nPersonal Homepage\nResearch Area\nData Science and AI (DSAI)\nControl and Robotic Systems (CRS)\nResearch Interests\nComputer graphics\nComputer vision\nRobotics\nProfile\nProfile\n1996-2000, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Bachelor\n2000-2003, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Master\n2003-2007, Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\n2007-2014, National University of Singapore, Assistant Professor, Associate Professor\n2014-2019, Simon Fraser University, Canada, Associate Professor\n2019-2022, DAMO Academy, Alibaba, Head of XR Lab"
