[7] Liping Chen, Kong-Aik Lee, Bin Ma, Wu Guo, Haizhou Li, Li-Rong Dai, Minimum Divergence Estimation of Speaker Prior in Multi-Session PLDA, ICASSP.  FLORENCE, ITALY:IEEE, MAY 4-9, 2014.\n[8] Shaofei Xue, Ossama Abdel-Hamid, Hui Jiang, Li-Rong Dai, Direct Adaptation of Hybrid DNN/HMM Model for Fast Speaker Adaptation, ICASSP.  FLORENCE, ITALY:IEEE, MAY 4-9, 2014.\n[9] Shiliang Zhang, Yebo Bao, Pan Zhou, Hui Jiang, Li-Rong Dai, Improving deep neural networks for LVCSR using dropout and shrinking structure, ICASSP.  FLORENCE, ITALY:IEEE, MAY 4-9, 2014.\n[10] Chen-Yu Yang, Zhen-Hua Ling, and Li-Rong Dai, \"Unsupervised Prosodic Labeling of Speech Synthesis Databases Using Context-Dependent HMMs\", IEICE Transactions on Information and Systems, vol.E97-D, no.6, pp. 1449-1460, 2014..\ntotal11   1/2\nfirst\nprevious\nnext\nlast\nPage\nCopyright © 2013 University of Science and Technology of China."
