    "homepage_text": "Hao Min Zhou - Home Page\nHaomin Zhou\nSchool of Mathematics\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\nAtlanta, GA 30332\nOffice: Skiles 240A\nTel: (404)894-2712\nemail :\nhmzhou at\n          math.gatech.edu\nBrief CV:\nProfessor, School of Mathematics, Georgia Tech, 2012-present\nAssociate Professor,\nSchool of Mathematics\n,\nGeorgia Tech\n, 2008-2012.\nAssistant Professor,\nSchool of Mathematics\n,\nGeorgia Tech\n, 2003-2008.\nvon Karman Instructor and Postdoctoral Scholar,\nApplied and Computational\n            Mathematics\n,\nCaltech\n,\n          2000 - 2003.\nPh.D.,\nDepartment of\n            Mathematics\n,\nUCLA\n,\n          June, 2000.\nM.Phil.,\nDepartment\n            of Mathematics\n,\nthe\n            Chinese Univeristy of Hong Kong\n, August, 1996\nB.Sc.,\nDepartment of\n            Mathematics\n,\nPeking\n            University\n, China, 1991.\nResearch Interests:\nOptimal transport and control algorithms\nMachine learning methods in numerical PDEs\nWavelets and PDE techniques in digital image and video\n          processing\nAnalysis and computations of stochastic differential\n          equations\nMy research is mainly supported by\nONR\nand\nNSF\ngrants\n        including the\nCAREER Award\n.\nCV\nAwards/Grants\nPatents\nResearch\nPublications\nTeaching\nLinks\nA link to\nAIMS\njournal\nInverse Problem and Imaging (IPI)\n.\nReturn to\nSchool of\n        Mathematics home page\nat Georgia Tech.\nLast modified:\n        Monday, 11-Aug-2008 15:25:43 EDT"
