    "homepage_text": "Charles Ling's Home Page\nCharles Ling, Ph.D., Professor\nMSc and PhD\n,\nUPenn\nProfessor\n, \nin\nComputer \nScience\nat\nWestern University\nScience Distinguished Research Professor\nFellow,\nCanadian Academy of Engineering (CAE)\nDirector\n,\nData Mining and \nBusiness Intelligence Lab\nAssociate Scientist\n,\nLawson Health Research Institute\nEmail\n: x@y, where x = charles.ling, y = uwo.ca; OR, x = prof.ling,\ny = gmail.com\nOffice\n: MC 374;\nPhone\n: (+1) 519 661 3341 \n(Email is the best way to contact him)\nResearch:\nMachine learning, deep learning, LLMs, AI\nPublished over\n220 \npeer-reviewed research papers\nI am looking for top students for PhD and Msc Degrees\nI am looking for top software engineers to work on killer-app\nresearch projects\nGrants\n,\norganizational roles\nand\ninvited talks\nExtensive industrial experience with London Life, Sun, MSR, NEC, Baidu, ...\nTeaching: students login your OWL\nBook:\nCrafting Your Research Future\nA Guide to Successful Master's and Ph.D. Degrees in Science & Engineering\n(\nmore\n).\nDownload the book free\nfor licensed universities. Just click the pdf links and see...\nYou can order\nthe \nprinted book\nfrom Amazon.\nSeries Co-editor\non Professionalism and Career Advancement for Scientists and Engineers\nVideo\n:\na talk given to all 800+ incoming graduate students in 2014.\nStudent Supervision:\nCurrently 5 PhD and 4 Msc students\nSpecial mention:\nHarry Zhang\nand\nVictor Sheng\n, both\nobtained PhD within 3 years.\nAI and Education\nDetails\nPower Thinking video (Opening)\nMailing Address:\nProf. Charles Ling, Department of Computer Science, \nWestern University, London, Ontario N6A 5B7. Canada"
  },
