    "homepage_text": "Weiran Yao's Homepage\nWeiran Yao\nProfessor of Control Science and Engineering\nDepartment of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology\nKey Laboratory of Autonomous Intelligent Unmanned Systems, MIIT, P. R. China\n#92 West Dazhi Street, Nangang District, Harbin 150001, P. R. China\nEducational Experience\nSep. 2015 – Apr. 2020, Doctor of Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nOct. 2017 – Jan. 2018, Visiting Ph.D. Student, University of Toronto, Toronto, Canada\nSep. 2013 – Jul. 2015, Master of Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nSep. 2009 – Jul. 2013, Bachelor of Engineering (with Hons.), Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nProfessional Experience\nDec. 2024 – present, Full Professor, Department of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nDec. 2022 – present, Doctoral Student Supervisor, Control Science and Engineering Discipline, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nApr. 2022 – present, Master Student Supervisor, Control Science and Engineering Discipline, Harbin, China\nDec. 2021 – Dec. 2024, Associate Professor, Department of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nJul. 2020 – Dec. 2021, Assistant Professor, Department of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, China\nAcademic Honors and Awards\n2024 International Conference on Advanced Unmanned Aerial Systems (ICAUAS) Best Paper Award (2024)\n2023 IEEE International Conference on Unmanned Systems (ICUS) Best Paper Award (2023)\nGuidance, Navigation and Control (GNC) Best Paper Award (2022)\nYoung Elite Scientist Sponsorship Program by China Association for Science and Technology (2022)\nHeilongjiang Science Fund for Excellent Young Scholars (2021)\nYouth Top-notch Talent Program of Harbin Institute of Technology (2021)\nExcellent Doctoral Dissertation Award of Harbin Institute of Technology (2021)\nExcellent Graduate Award of Harbin Institute of Technology (2020)\nResearch Interests\nAutonomous unmanned swarm systems\nMulti-robot task planning and control\nAutonomous decision-making of unmanned systems\nSpacecraft assembly and experimental technology\nAcademic Activities\nAssociate Editor\n(2023- )\n, IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA)\nGuest Editor (2024- )\n, Special Issue “Mission Planning, Perception and Control for Drones in Wide-Area Operations” in Drones (now open for submission:\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/journal/drones/special_issues/MQQD3UL0G1\n)\nGuest Editor (2024- )\n, Special Issue “Robust Sliding Mode Control and State Estimation in Dynamic Systems” in Processes (now open for submission:\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/journal/processes/special_issues/R09F4QUGCL\n)\nGuest Editor (2022- )\n, Special Issue “Mobile Robotics and Autonomous Intelligent Systems” in Applied Science (now open for submission:\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/journal/applsci/special_issues/mobile_robotic\n)\nGuest Editor (2022)\n, Special Issue “Safety and Security of Robotic Systems: Intelligent Algorithms” in Frontiers in Neurorobotics (submission closed:\nhttps://www.frontiersin.org/research-topics/44942/safety-and-security-of-robotic-systems-intelligent-algorithms\n)\nYouth Editorial Board Member (2024- )\n, Advances in Astronautics Science and Technology\nYouth Editorial Board Member (2025- )\n, Tactical Missile Technology (in Chinese)\nYouth Editorial Board Member (2023- )\n, Electronics Optics and Control (in Chinese)\nCommittee Member\n, Technical Committee on Intelligent Unmanned Systems Modeling and Simulation, China Simulation Federation\nCommittee Member\n, Technical Committee on Unmanned Systems, Chinese Institute of Command and Control (CICC)\nCommittee Member\n, Technical Committee on Intelligent Control and System, Chinese Institute of Command and Control (CICC)\nLiaison\n, The Eighth Council of Chinese Society of Astronautics\nSenior Member\n, Chinese Society of Astronautics\nReviewer\nfor more than 40 journals and conferences including INT J ROBOT RES, ACM COMPUT SURV, ACM T IST, AIAA J, EXPERT SYST APPL, IEEE T RO, IEEE T CYBERNETICS, IEEE T CST, IEEE/ASME T MECH, IEEE T AES, IEEE T ASE, IEEE T MC, IEEE T ITS, IEEE IoT J, IEEE RA L, etc.\nTopical Advisory Panel Member (2023- )\n, Drones\nTopical Advisory Panel Member (2023- )\n, Applied Sciences\nSession Chair\n, Special Session “Cooperative Perception, Planning and Control of Wide-area Multi-task Unmanned Systems” in the 2024 7th IEEE International Conference on Unmanned Systems (ICUS 2024)\nSession Chair\n, Special Session “Perception, Decision, and Control for Unmanned Aerial Systems in Wide-area Operations” in the 2024 2nd International Conference on Advanced Unmanned Aerial Systems (ICAUAS 2024)\nSession Chair\n, Special Session “Inteligent Perception and Control of Multimodal and Multi-task Unmanned Systems” in the 2023 6th IEEE International Conference on Unmanned Systems (ICUS 2023)\nSession Chair\n, Special Session “Motion Control and Robust Control for Robotics and Manipulators” in the 2021 IEEE 30th International Symposium on Industrial Electronics (ISIE 2021)\nTechnical Committee Member\n, 2024 International Conference on Advanced Unmanned Aerial Systems (ICAUAS 2024)\nTechnical Committee Member\n, 2023 2nd International Conference on Mechatronics and Automation Technology (ICMAT 2023)\nTechnical Committee Member\n, 2023 International Conference on Advanced Unmanned Aerial Systems (ICAUAS 2023)\nTechnical Committee Member\n, 2023 3rd International Conference on Control Theory and Applications (ICoCTA 2023)\nTechnical Committee Member\n, 2022 6th International Conference on Aerospace Technology, Communications and Energy Systems (ATCES 2022)\nContact\nDepartment of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, China\nKey Laboratory of Autonomous Intelligent Unmanned Systems, MIIT, China\nAddress:\nRoom 3029, Mechanical Building, #92 West Dazhi Street, Harbin 150001, China\nE-mail:\nyaoweiran@hit.edu.cn\nRelated Links\nKey Laboratory of AIUS:\nhttp://aius.hit.edu.cn/\nPersonal Links\nHomepage@HIT:\nhttp://homepage.hit.edu.cn/WeiranYao\nWeb of Science ResearcherID:\nhttps://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/N-2543-2019\nORCID:\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-6570-3888\nGoogle Scholar:\nhttps://scholar.google.com.hk/citations?user=4urvR3YAAAAJ\nResearchGate:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Weiran-Yao\n© 2026 Weiran Yao's Homepage.\n黑ICP备19007236号-1\nEnglish\nEnglish\n简体中文"
