ew\nCluster Prototype\n100%\nHash Code\n66%\nDiverse Platform\n33%\nHeterogeneous Platform\n33%\n1\nScopus \n citations\nDPGEM: Differentially Private Generative Model with Exponential Mechanism\nHassan, U., Zhu, J., Chen, D. &\nCheung, S. C. S.\n,\n2024\n,\nProceedings - 16th IEEE International Workshop on Information Forensics and Security, WIFS 2024.\n(Proceedings - 16th IEEE International Workshop on Information Forensics and Security, WIFS 2024).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\npeer-review\nGenerative Model\n100%\nStochastics\n100%\nGenerative Artificial Intelligence\n100%\nDifferential Privacy\n60%\nImage Quality\n20%\nView all 121 Research outputs\nPrizes\nFellow, Institute for Electrical and Electronics Engineers\nCheung, S.-C.\n(Recipient),\n2020\nPrize\n:\nHonorary award\nElectronics\n100%\nFellow, Asia-Pacific Artificial Intelligence Association\nCheung, S.-C.\n(Recipient),\n2023\nPrize\n:\nHonorary award\nArtificial Intelligence\n100%\nAssociation for Computing Machinery Senior Member\nCheung, S.-C.\n(Recipient),\n2011\nPrize\n:\nHonorary award\nComputing Machinery\n100%\nYour message has successfully been sent.\nYour message was not sent due to an error.\nx\nContact Sen-Ching Cheung, Ph.D.\nSubject\n*\nMessage\n*\nYour name:\n*\nYour email:\n*\nSend me a copy of this message\n*required field\nCancel\nSend"
