    "homepage_text": "Ge Wang | çæ\nGe Wang\n| çæ\nprofessor | designer | researcher | speaker\nCV\n|\nBio\n|\nmy\ntalk\n|\nArtful \nDesign\n|\nEvents\nAssociate Professor\nCCRMA\n| \nDepartment of Music\n(also of Computer Science, by Courtesy)\nSenior Fellow & Associate Director, Stanford HAI\nStanford University\na comic book!\nArtful \nDesign: Technology in Search of the Sublime\n(a MusiComic Manifesto)\n|\nbook site\n|\nmirror site\nresearch\nselected\npublications\n|\nprojects\n|\npress clippings\nchuck\n|\nocarina\n|\nslork\n|\nvr\n|\nai\n|\nsndpeek\n|\nmy research group\nguggenheim fellowship\nteaching\n(see\nlist of all courses\n)\nmusic256a/cs476a\n: \nart of design (fall 2025)\nmusic356/cs470\n: \nmusic and AI (winter 2026)\nmusic220b\n:\ncompositional algorithms (winter 2026)\nmusic128/cs170\n:\nstanford laptop orchestra (spring 2026)\ninteraction design + artful product design\nSmule Co-founder + Chief Creative (until 2013)\nah, the great outdoors\n!\nJohn Muir Trail\n(documentary) |\nOn the Devil's Road\noffice:\nKnoll\n212\nemail:\nge\n/at/\nccrma.stanford.edu\nonline:\n@gewang.bsky.social\n|\nlinkedin\n|\ninstagram\nvideo:\nyoutube\n|\nvimeo\n|\ntech-hike-art-life\nphoto:\nall sets\n|\nstream\ni come from\nhere\n."
