. Lian, P-T. Yap,  D. Shen, Deep Bayesian Hashing with Center Prior for Multi-modal Neuroimage Retrieval, IEEE Trans. Med. Imag., 2020.\nE. Yang\n, C. Deng, C. Li, W. Liu, J. Li, D. Tao, Shared Predictive Cross-Modal Deep Quantization, IEEE Trans. Neural Netw. Learn. Syst., 29(11): 5292-5303, 2018.\nC. Deng,\nE. Yang\n, T. Liu, D. Tao, Two-Stream Deep Hashing with Class-Specific Centers for Image Search, IEEE Trans. Neural Netw. Learn. Syst., 31(6): 2189-2201, 2020.\nC. Deng,\nE. Yang\n, T. Liu, W. Liu, J. Li, D. Tao, Unsupervised Semantic-Preserving Adversarial Hashing for Image Search,  IEEE Trans. Image Process., 28(8): 4032-4044, 2019.\nE. Yang, D. Yao, T. Liu, C. Deng, Mutual Quantization for Cross-Modal Search with Noisy Labels,\nin Proc. IEEE Int. Conf. on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2022.\nE. Yang\n, T. Liu, C. Deng, W. Liu, D. Tao, DistillHash: Unsupervised Deep Hashing by Distilling Data Pairs, in Proc. IEEE Int. Conf. on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019.\nE. Yang\n, C. Deng, T. Liu, W. Liu, D. Tao, Semantic Structure-based Unsupervised Deep Hashing, in Proc. Int. Joint Conf. on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2018.\nE. Yang\n, C. Deng, W. Liu, X. Liu, D. Tao, X. Gao, Pairwise Relationship Guided Deep Hashing for Cross-Modal Retrieval, in Proc. AAAI Conf. on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2017.\nE. Yang\n, D. Yao, B. Cao, H. Guan, P-T. Yap, D. Shen,  M. Liu, Deep Disentangled Hashing with Momentum Triplets for Neuroimage Search, in Proc. Int. Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention (MICCAI), 2020.\nE. Yang\n, L. Wang, D. Steffens, G. Potter, M. Liu. Deep Factor Regression for Computer-Aided Analysis of Major Depressive Disorders with Structural MRI Data. In Proc. International Symposium on Biomedical Imaging (ISBI) 2021.\næçä¿¡æ¯ï¼\nå¢éæ¯å¹´ææ¶ä¸å®æ°éçç¡å£«ç ç©¶çååå£«ç ç©¶çï¼ç ç©¶æ¹åä¸ºäººå·¥æºè½ãå¤æ¨¡æä¿¡æ¯å¤çç­ï¼å¢éå°ä¼æä¾å