    "homepage_text": "Jun Yu's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJun Yu's Homepage\nJun Yu\nProfessor,\nDean\nSchool of Intelligent Science and Engineering\nHarbin Institute of Technology\n, Shenzhen, China\nContact Info: yujun@hit.edu.cn\nResearch Interests:\nMM\n: Multimedia Retrieval, Question Answering, Multimedia Applications (Medical), etc.\nCV\n: Embodied Intelligence, Image Segmentation, Image Generation, etc.\nDM\n: Recommender System, etc.\nBiography:\nDr. Jun Yu is currently the Dean of School of Intelligent Science and Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology (Shenzhen). His current research interests include multimedia, language and vision and social media. He has authored over 100 journal and conference papers in these areas and the Google Scholar citations for those papers is more than 21000. He served as editor of the IEEE TCSVT, IEEE TMM, Pattern Recognition and the guest editors of several international journals. He also served as technical program committee members and reviewers of  over 20 prestigious international conferences, and a reviewer of over 20 prestigious international journals. He has received the best paper awards as the first author from journals of  IEEE TMM, TIP, and TCYB. Dr. Yu joined CCF, CSIG, IEEE and ACM.\nRecent Publications:\nGoogle scholar page for Impact.\nDBLP for updated publication list.\n1. Yiqian Zhang, Buyu Liu, Jun Bao, Qiang Huang, Min Zhang, Jun Yu*, Learnability Matters: Active Learning for Video Captioning, Neural Information Processing Systems (NIPS), 2025.\n2. Buyu Liu, Kai Wang, Yansong Liu, Jun Bao, Tingting Han, Jun Yu*, MVPbev: Multi-view Perspective Image Generation from BEV with Test-time Controllability and Generalizability, ACM Multimedia, 2024.\n3. Ke Zhang, Yan Yang, Jun Yu*, Jianping Fan, Hanliang Jiang, Qingming Huang, and Weidong Han, Attribute Prototype-Guided Iterative Scene Graph for Explainable Radiology Report Generation, IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging, 2024.\n4. Yan Yang, Jun Yu*, Zhenqi Fu, Ke Zhang, Ting Yu, Xianyun Wang, Hanliang Jiang, Junhui Lv, Qingming Huang, and Weidong Han, Token-Mixer: Bind Image and Text in One Embedding Space for Medical Image Reporting, IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging, 2024.\n5. Jun Bao, Buyu Liu, Kui Ren, Jun Yu*, GLOW: Global Layout Aware Attacks on Object Detection, CVPR, 2024.\n6. Zhou Yu, Lixiang Zheng, Zhou Zhao, Fei Wu, Jianping Fan, Kui Ren, Jun Yu*, ANetQA: A Large-scale Benchmark for Fine-grained Compositional Reasoning over Untrimmed Videos, CVPR, 2023.\nProfesional Activities:\nEditor:\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits System and Video Technology (TCSVT), from 2021~2023\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM), from 2025~\nInformation Sciences, Elsevier from 2016 ~\nPattern Recognition,  Elsevier from 2019 ~\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
