    "homepage_text": "Huaiyu Dai\nSkip to main content\nElectrical and Computer Engineering\nHuaiyu Dai\nMenu\nClose\nMy Information\nCV\nResearch\nTeaching\nSearch\nHuaiyu Dai\n(in Chinese 戴怀宇)\nNews:\nI joined National Science Foundation as a rotator program director in the Division of Electrical, Communications and Cyber Systems (ECCS) of the Engineering Directorate\nFerdous Pervej joined Utah State University as an assistant professor.\nYe Hu joined University of Miami as an assistant professor\nRicheng jin joined Zhejiang University as an assistant professor\nAli Rahmati joined Qualcomm\nSrinjoy Chattopadhyay joined Amazon\nSeyyedali Hosseinalipour received ECE Doctoral Scholar of the Year award\n,\nand joined University of Buffalo at an assistant professor\nClose smart search\nFind NC State websites, locations and people\nSearch all of ncsu.edu\nSearch\nTOP LINKS\nMyPack Portal\nAccess vital records, resources and information for students, families, faculty and staff.\nUniversity Libraries\nOur campus libraries are your destinations for studying, research and expanding your mind.\nAcademic Calendar\nLook up important dates and university holidays for the upcoming academic year and beyond.\nMajors and Careers\nExplore our 100-plus degree programs and see where an NC State education can take you."
