 Chen, Xiuping Liu.\nACM Transactions on Graphics (Proc. SIGGRAPH Asia), 32(5), Article 177: 1-10, 2013.\nPaper\nWebsite\nThe Little Goldfish Soars to the Sky.\nWang Yangtuanfeng, recorded by Wang Lin.\nThe Story King for Children, 1996, issue 5.\nArticle\nAwards\nSiggraph Asia 2023, Test-of-Time Award for paper Cost-effective Printing of 3D Objects with Skin-Frame Structures.\nCCF CAD/Graphics 2023 Best Paper Honorable Mention Award for paper Neural 3D face Rendering conditioned on 2D appearance via GAN Disentanglement Method.\nEurographics 2021, Honorable Mention Best Paper Award.\nChinese Government Award for Outstanding Self Finance Students Abroad.\nUCL Computer Science Best Teaching Assistant Award.\nInternational Consortium of Chinese Mathematicians (ICCM) best paper award for the past five years.\nRabin Ezra Scholarship.\nMicrosoft PhD scholarship.\nUCL Engineering Dean’s Award.\nUSTC Outstanding Dissertation for Bachelor’s Degree.\nNational College Students Innovation Program.\nChinese Academy of Sciences and Hua Loo-Keng Talent Program Outstanding Student Scholarship.\nTeaching (@UCL)\nCOMPM054 Machine Vision (Teaching assistant 17')\nCOMPM080 Acquisition and Processing of 3D Geometry (Teaching assistant 18')\nCOMP102P Theory I (Teaching assistant 14' 15' 16' 17')\nCOMP204P Systems Engineering Project (Teaching assistant 16' 17')\nContact\nEmail: wytf123123 A|T gmail d\\o\\t com; tuanfeng.wang A|T cs d\\o\\t ucl d\\o\\t ac d\\o\\t uk; yangtwan A|T adobe d\\o\\t com"
