    "homepage_text": "Dongze Lian\nHome\nAbout me\nTeaching\nServices\nResearch\nPublications\nProjects\nDongze Lian\nResearch Scientist @ Huawei, Singapore\nEmail:\ndzlianx [at] gmail [dot] com\nliandz [at] shanghaitech [dot] edu [dot] cn\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]  [\nDBLP\n]\nAbout me\nNow I am a Research Scientist at Huawei, Singapore. I am interested in computer vision (e.g., multi-modal understanding and generation) and deep learning (e.g., efficient model/data/fine-tuning desgin).\nI was a Postdoc at\nNational University of Singapore (NUS)\n, working with\nProf. Xinchao Wang\nand\nDr. Jiashi Feng\n.\nI received my Ph.D. degree from\nSchool of Information Science and Technology\nat\nShanghaiTech University\n, advised by Prof.\nShenghua Gao\n(Now Associate Professor at the University of Hong Kong).\nI had an opportunity to work with\nDr. Yin Zheng\nand\nDr. Peilin Zhao\nin Tencent AI Lab, focusing on computer vision and deep learning.\nI received my Bachelor's Degree in\nDalian University of Technology (DUT)\n(\nwith Honor\n).\nWe are hiring!!!\nWe currently have several\nopennings\nfor both full-time researchers and interns. If you are interested, please feel free to contact me via email.\nNews\n[2025]\n[New!]\n🎉 I am awarded the\nWorld's Top 2% Scientist List\n, by Stanford/Elsevier (in category Artificial Intelligence & Image Processing) [\nlink\n].\n[2025]\nI am invited to serve as an\nArea Chair\nof ICLR 2026.\n[2024] 🎉 I am awarded the\nOutstanding R&D Contribution Individual Award\nof Huawei Singapore Research Center, Singpaore.\nWork Experience\nResearch Scientist @ Huawei Singapore, Singapore, Jun. 2024 - now\nResearch Fellow @ National University of Singapore, Singapore, Feb. 2022 - Jun. 2024\nResearch Intern @ Tencent Youtu Lab, Shanghai, China, Jul. 2021 - Nov. 2021\nResearch Intern @ Tencent AI Lab, Shenzhen, China, Dec. 2018 - May 2019\nAwards\nWorld's Top 2% Scientist List\n, by Stanford/Elsevier (in category Artificial Intelligence & Image Processing), 2025\nOutstanding R&D Contribution Individual Award of Huawei Singapore Research Center, 2024\nOutstanding Doctoral Graduates of Shanghai, 2021\nNational Scholarship for Doctoral Students, 2020\nOutstanding Student of ShanghaiTech University, 2018 - 2019 & 2019 - 2020\nOutstanding Graduates of Dalian University of Technology, 2016\nLast Updated: 2025-09-28"
  },
