    "homepage_text": "Yuan Lab  @ Purdue University | Davidson School of Chemical Engineering\nYuan Lab  @ Purdue University\nDavidson School of Chemical Engineering\nWelcome to the Yuan Lab\nOur Mission\nOur group focuses on understanding the molecular basis of human diseases and developing novel toolsets to detect early-stage disease markers.\nWhat’s New\nVirtual Lab Tour\nPurdue Campus Tour\nTweets by YuanLab1\nJob Openings\nWe are looking for self-motivated graduate and post-doctoral students to join our lab. Contact Prof. Yuan at\ncyuan@purdue.edu\nwith your CV if interested.\nYuan Lab  @ Purdue University\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions"
  },
