    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Zhipeng Zhou\nHome\nExperiences\nPublications\nServices\nZhipeng Zhou (å¨å¿é¹)\nZhipeng Zhou (å¨å¿é¹)\n, Ph.D.\nJoint WeBank-NTU Research Institute on Fintech\nNanyang Technological University\nEmail\n:\n[\nCV\n]  [\nGitHub\n]  [\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nAbout Me\nI am currently a postdoctoral researcher at Nanyang Technological University (NTU), working with Prof.\nChunyan Miao\n.\r\n\t Before that, I received my Ph.D. dgree from the\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\nunder the supervision of Prof.\nWei Gong\n. I received my B.Eng. degree in Electronic & Information Engineering from\nDonghua University (DHU)\nin 2017. Also I am appreciated to spend great three years with Prof.\nDong Yin\nduring 2017-2020.\nResearch Interests\nMy general research interests lie in distribution shifts, efficient learning, and their applications in large foundation models and mobile models, with a particular emphasis on the following topics:\nDistribution Shifts: Long-Tailed Recognition: [\nCC-SAM@CVPR'23\n,\nPLOT@ICLR'24\n,\nBOOST@ACM MM'25\n]\nEfficient Learning: Few-Shot & Multi-Task Learning: [\nGuidepost@CIKM'23\n,\nIMGrad@IJCAI'25\n,\nCOST@NeurIPS'25\n,\nEXTRA@NeurIPS'25\n]\nMobile Computing: [\nTOSS@INFOCOM'22\n,\ni-Sample@ToSN'23\n,\nMobiFi@GLOBECOM'20\n]\nI am always open to potential collaborations in the above-mentioned directions. Please feel free to contact me.\nSelected Awards\n[2024] Outstanding Graduate of USTC, ICLR 2024 Financial Assistance Awardees\n[2022] Student Travel Grant of IEEE INFOCOM 2022, Global Digital Technology Scholarship\n[2017] Outstanding graduate of Shanghai, Tongqi Scholarship\n[2016] National Scholarship, Donghua Scholarship\n[2015] Sangma Scholarship, Donghua Scholarship\n© Zhipeng Zhou | Last updated: May. 2025"
  },
