    "homepage_text": "Chuhan Wu\nChuhan Wu\nA researcher who is focused on large foundation models.\nChuhan Wu\nChuhan Wu\nis now a researcher with Wechat AI.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHis current research interests focus on large foundation models.\nEmail:\nwuchuhan15[at]gmail[dot]com\nGoogle Scholar\nSelected Publications\n2022\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Yongfeng Huang and Xing Xie: FedAttack: Effective and Covert Poisoning Attack on Federated Recommendation via Hard Sampling. KDD 2022 (ADS Track).\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu and Yongfeng Huang: Rethinking InfoNCE: How Many Negative Samples Do You Need?\r\nIJCAI 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu, Yongfeng Huang and Xing Xie: Personalized News Recommendation: Methods and Challenges. ACM TOIS.\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi and Yongfeng Huang: PUM: Pre-training User Model with Contrastive Self-supervision. SIGIR 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Chenliang Li and Yongfeng Huang: Is News Recommendation a Sequential Recommendation Task? SIGIR 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n,  Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Chao Zhang, Yongfeng Huang and Tong Xu: MM-Rec: Multimodal News Recommendation. SIGIR 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, and Yongfeng Huang:  NoisyTune: A Little Noise Can Help You Finetune Pretrained Language Models Better. ACL 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, and Yongfeng Huang:  Two Birds with One Stone: Unified Model Learning for Both Recall and Ranking in News Recommendation. Findings of ACL 2022.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Qi Liu, Xuan Tian, Jie Li, Wei He, Yongfeng Huang and Xing Xie:  FeedRec: News Feed Recommendation with Various User Feedbacks. WWW 2022.\n2021\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Lingjuan Lyu, Yongfeng Huang,  Xing Xie: FedCTR: Federated Native Ad CTR Prediction with Cross Platform User Behavior Data. ACM TIST.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Yang Yu, Tao Qi, Yongfeng Huang, Qi Liu: NewsBERT: Distilling Pre-trained Language Model for Intelligent News Application. EMNLP Findings 2021.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Yongfeng Huang: Hi-Transformer: Hierarchical Interactive Transformer for Efficient and Effective Long Document Modeling. ACL-IJCNLP 2021.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Yongfeng Huang: One Teacher is Enough? Language Model Distillation from Multiple Teachers. Findings of ACL-IJCNLP 2021.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie: User-as-Graph: User Modeling with Heterogeneous Graph Pooling for News Recommendation. IJCAI 2021.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Yongfeng Huang: Empowering News Recommendation with Pre-trained Language Models. SIGIR 2021.\n[Code]\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Yongfeng Huang: DA-Transformer: Distance-aware Transformer. NAACL 2021.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Xiting Wang, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie: Fairness-aware News Recommendation with Decomposed Adversarial Learning. AAAI 2021.\n[Code]\n2020\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Jianxun Lian, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie: PTUM: Pre-training User Model from Unlabeled User Behaviors via Self-supervision. Findings of EMNLP 2020.\n[Code]\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Yongfeng Huang: User Modeling with Click Preference and Reading Satisfaction for News Recommendation. IJCAI-PRICAI 2020.\n[Code]\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Xiaohui Cui, Yongfeng Huang: Attentive Pooling with Learnable Norms for Text Representation. ACL 2020.\nChuhan Wu\n, Fangzhao Wu, Tao Qi, Junxin Liu, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie: Detecting Entities of Works for Chinese Chatbot. TALLIP.\nServices\nConference Activities\nPC Member, Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2022\nPC Member, 31st International Joint  Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2022\nSenior PC Member, The 36th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2022\nPC Member, The Tenth International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2022\nReviewer,  ACL Rolling Review (ARR)\nPC Member,  CAAI International Conference on Artificial Intelligence (CICAI), 2021\nPC Member,  Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2021\nPC Member, Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP), 2021\nSession Chair, the 29th International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence and the 17th Pacific Rim International Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI-PRICAI), 2020\nPC Member, the 38th International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2021\nProgram Chair, 1st International Workshop on News Recommendation and Intelligence, collocated with WWW, 2021\nPC Member, International Conference on Database Systems for Advanced Applications (DASFAA), 2021\nPC Member, Annual Conference of the North American Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics (NAACL), 2021\nPC Member, The 35th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2021\nExternal Reviewer, The 1st Conference of the Asia-Pacific Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics and the 9th International Joint Conference on Natural Language Processing (AACL-IJCNLP), 2020\nPC Member, The Web Conference, 2021\nPC Member,  Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2020\nPC Member, Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP), 2020\nPC Member, 1st Joint Workshop on Narrative Understanding, Storylines, and Events, collocated with ACL, 2020\nPC Member, The 58th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL), 2020\nPC Member, The Web Conference, 2020\nPC Member, The 57th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL), 2019\nPC Member, The 9th WASSA workshop, collocated with EMNLP, 2018\nPC Member, The workshop on Figurative Language Processing workshop (Figlang), collocated with NAACL, 2018\nPC Member, The 12th International Workshop on Semantic Evaluation (SemEval), 2018\nReviewer, The International conference on Image, Video Processing and Artificial Intelligence (IVPAI), 2018\nReviewer, The 2nd International Conference on Computer Science and Application Engineering (CSAE), 2018\nJournal Services\nReviewer, IEEE Network Magazine\nReviewer, ACM Transactions on Intelligent Systems and Technology (TIST)\nReviewer, IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE)\nReviewer, ACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS)\nReviewer, ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (TKDD)\nReviewer, IEEE Transactions on Big Data\nReviewer, IEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\nReviewer, IEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering\nReviewer, ACM Transactions on Asian and Low-Resource Language Information Processing (TALLIP)\nAssociate Editor, Frontiers in Neuroinformatics\nReviewer, Computers & Security\nReviewer, Neurocomputing\nReviewer, Neural Processing Letters (NPL)\nReviewer, IEEE Access\nReviewer, Complexity\nReviewer, Concurrency and Computation: Practice and Experience\nInternship\nMicrosoft Research Asia, Social Computing (SC) group (Jan. 2018 - Aug. 2018)\nHonor & Award\n2021\n1. Top 100 Chinese Rising Stars in AI (Baidu)\n2020\n1. National Scholarship\n2. Finalist in the Bytedance Scholarship\n3. Post-graduate \"EE Star\" (5 out of all post-graduates at Department of Electronic Engineering, Tsinghua University)\n2019\n1. Microsoft Research Asia Fellowship\n2. Top 40 in the Baidu Scholarship\n3. Special Prize in National \"Challenge Cup\"\n4. Outstanding Graduates of Beijing\n5. Excellent Graduates of Tsinghua University\n6. Excellent Graduation Design\n2018\n1. National Scholarship\n2. Student \"Future Scholar\" (10/3300+ in Tsinghua University)\n3. \"Star of Tomorrow\" Award at Microsoft Research Asia\n4. Friends of Tsinghua University - Geru Zheng Scholarship\n5. Academic Excellence Scholarship\n6. Innovation Excellence Scholarship\n2017\n1. Nanxiang Jiang Scholarship (40/3300+ in Tsinghua University)\n2. Qualcomm Scholarship (50/3300+ in Tsinghua University)\n3. Academic Excellence Scholarship\n4. Innovation Excellence Scholarship\n5. Social Work Excellence Scholarship