    "homepage_text": "Zhiquan Qi\n      -  Beijing Institute of Technology\nBeijing Institute of Technology Home\nEnglish\n中文\nSearch content at Beijing Institute of Technology\nView Scopus Profile\nZhiquan Qi\nSchool of Mechanical Engineering\nh-index\n384\nCitations\n11\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2003\n2025\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Zhiquan Qi is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n12\nSimilar Profiles\nControl System\nEngineering\n100%\nRoad\nEngineering\n95%\nAnti-Lock Braking System\nEngineering\n52%\nKalman Filter\nEngineering\n51%\nDynamic Models\nEngineering\n45%\nBraking System\nEngineering\n43%\nAdaptive Cruise Control\nEngineering\n42%\nRoad Surface\nEngineering\n40%\nView full fingerprint\nResearch output\n42\nArticle\n8\nConference contribution\nNeural Network-Based Model Predictive Trajectory Tracking Control for Dual-Motor-Driven a Tracked Unmanned Vehicle\nZhai, L.\n, Yao, Y., Yan, J., Wang, C., Liu, C. &\nQi, Z.\n,\nNov 2025\n,\nIn:\nSensors.\n25\n,\n22\n, 6877.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nDynamic Models\n100%\nControl Scheme\n100%\nLstm\n100%\nModel-based predictive control\n100%\nNeural Network\n100%\nInteraction-Based Trajectory Prediction of Surrounding Vehicles with Driving Maneuvers Recognition\nRen, H.\n, Zhou, G., Zhang, H.,\nQi, Z.\n&\nZhao, Y.\n,\n2023\n,\nProceedings of 2022 International Conference on Autonomous Unmanned Systems, ICAUS 2022.\nFu, W., Gu, M. & Niu, Y. (eds.).\nSpringer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH\n,\np. 777-790\n14 p.\n(Lecture Notes in Electrical Engineering; vol. 1010 LNEE).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\npeer-review\nSelf-Attention Mechanism\n100%\nFeature Extraction Network\n100%\nLong Short-Term Memory Network\n50%\nAutonomous Vehicles\n50%\nExtracted Feature\n50%\n基于微分平坦的分层轨迹规划算法\nTranslated title of the contribution\n:\nHierarchical Trajectory Planning Algorithm based on Differential Flatness\nZhou, X.,\nRen, H.\n, Su, B.,\nQi, Z.\n& Wang, Y.,\nFeb 2023\n,\nIn:\nBinggong Xuebao/Acta Armamentarii.\n44\n,\n2\n,\np. 394-405\n12 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nTrajectory Planning\n100%\nFlatness\n100%\nPlanning Algorithm\n100%\nObjective Function\n66%\nRide Comfort\n66%\n3\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\n基于轮胎特征点的并行大型车辆朝向角计算\nTranslated title of the contribution\n:\nCalculation of Heading Angle of Parallel Large Vehicle Based on Tire Feature Points\nZhao, J.,\nQi, Z.\n, Qi, Z., Wang, H. & He, L.,\n2023\n,\nIn:\nQiche Gongcheng/Automotive Engineering.\n45\n,\n6\n,\np. 1031-1039 and 1021\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nFeature Point\n100%\n3D Object Detection\n66%\nTarget Vehicle\n33%\n自动泊车路径纯跟踪算法应用研究\nTranslated title of the contribution\n:\nApplication of Pure Pursuit Algorithm for Automatic Parking System\nQi, Z.\n, Wu, S., Zou, B., Wang, H. &\nRen, H.\n,\nMay 2023\n,\nIn:\nBeijing Ligong Daxue Xuebao/Transaction of Beijing Institute of Technology.\n43\n,\n5\n,\np. 510-516\n7 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nPursuit Algorithm\n100%\nAhead Distance\n60%\nSteering Wheel\n40%\nReal Vehicle\n20%\nSteering Wheel Angle\n20%\n4\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nView all 50 research outputs"
