    "homepage_text": "Kehai Chen\n      -  Harbin Institute of Technology\nHarbin Institute of Technology Home\nSearch content at Harbin Institute of Technology\nView Scopus Profile\nKehai Chen\nProfessor\nSchool of Computer Science and Technology\nh-index\n1465\nCitations\n22\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2016\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Kehai Chen is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n6\nSimilar Profiles\nMachine Translation\nComputer Science\n100%\nLarge Language Model\nComputer Science\n32%\nExperimental Result\nComputer Science\n24%\nTranslation System\nComputer Science\n21%\nDocument-Level Relation Extraction\nComputer Science\n12%\nAttention (Machine Learning)\nComputer Science\n9%\nWord Embedding\nComputer Science\n9%\nDomain Adaptation\nComputer Science\n9%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n47\nConference contribution\n30\nArticle\n5\nPaper\n1\nConference article\nLinguaLIFT: An Effective Two-stage Instruction Tuning Framework for Low-Resource Language Reasoning\nZhang, H.,\nChen, K.\n,\nBai, X.\n, Xiang, Y. &\nZhang, M.\n,\n2026\n, (Accepted/In press)\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Audio, Speech and Language Processing.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nEvaluation Bias\n100%\nLLM with Relation Classifier for Document-Level Relation Extraction\nLi, X.,\nChen, K.\n, Long, Y. &\nZhang, M.\n,\n2026\n, (Accepted/In press)\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Big Data.\nResearc