  "serper::Chen Jiang": {
    "homepage": "https://sites.google.com/site/chenjiangmath/",
    "emails": [
      "chenjiang@fudan.edu.cn"
    ],
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Homepage of Chen Jiang\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHomepage of Chen Jiang\nHome\nChen JIANG（江 辰）\nHere is my\nnew webpage\nat Fudan (github page).\nI am a Associate Professor at\nShanghai Center for Mathematical Sciences\n, Fudan Universit.\nI was a Postdoctoral Fellow at Mathematical Sciences Research Institute (MSRI), Berkeley from Jan. 2019 to May 2019. I was a Project Research Fellow at Kavli Institute for the Physics and Mathematics of the Universe (Kavli IPMU), University of Tokyo from Apr. 2016 to Jan. 2019. Prior to that, I was a JSPS Postdoctoral Research Fellow at Graduate School of Mathematical Sciences, University of Tokyo for one year.\nI got my Ph.D. in March 2015 under the supervision of Professor Yujiro Kawamata from Graduate School of Mathematical Sciences, University of Tokyo. I spent my undergraduate years at Fudan University.\nAddress\n: Room 421, Shanghai Center for Mathematical Sciences, Fudan University, Jiangwan Campus, 2005 Songhu Road, Shanghai 200438, China\nEmail\n: chenjiang [at] fudan.edu.cn\nResearch field\n: Algebraic geometry\nResearch interest\n: I have been working on birational geometry of algebraic varieties. The fundamental tool in this area is the minimal model program (MMP). I am interested in topics related to Minimal Model Program (e.g., existence of good minimal models, non-vanishing conjecture, abundance conjecture, minimal log discrepancies) and properties of minimal varieties and Fano varieties (e.g., boundedness, birationality, geography, positivities, derived categories). I am interested in both exploring general theory in arbitrary dimensions and investigating explicit geometry and classification theory in lower dimensions.\n(Photo taken by Lu Qi at BICMR, Sep. 2017)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
  "serper::Yinuo Guo": {
    "homepage": "https://yuguo-xjtu.github.io/",
    "emails": [
