    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/https://www.linkedin.com/in/xiaoyi-dong-a61015336/",
    "homepage_text": "Xiaoyi Dong - Homepage\nXiaoyi Dong\nResearcher.\nEmail\nLinkedIn\nGoogle Scholar\nShort Bio\nI am a Member of the Technical Staff at Microsoft AI Super Intelligence. We are working on OpenAI and Microsoft model training. I received my Ph.D. degree at\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\n(USTC) in 2023. Prior to that, I received my Bachelor degree from the University of Science and Technology of China in 2018.\nMy research interests focus on multi-model models and general representation learning.\n🔥 News\n2026.01\n:  🎉🎉 Beyond Fixed, CapRL, SeC, ScaleCap, Visual Self-Refine, SIM-CoT, and STAR-Bench were accepted by ICLR 2026.\n2025.09\n:  🎉🎉 Being selected as the\nWorld’s Top 2% Scientist\n.\n2025.09\n:  🎉🎉 HiFlow was accepted by NeurIPS 2025.\n2025.06\n:  🎉🎉 MIR, SAM2Long, Visual-RFT, MM-IFEngine, X-Prompt, Bootstrap3D, and Light-A-Video were accepted by ICCV 2025.\n2025.05\n:  🎉🎉 SongComposer was accepted by ACL 2025.\n2025.05\n:  🎉🎉 IXC-2.5-Reward and Light-ColPali were accepted by Findings of ACL 2025.\n2025.05\n:  🎉🎉 VideoRoPE (Oral) and SongGen were accepted by ICML 2025.\n2025.03\n:  🎉🎉 MMStar is selectd as\nNeurIPS 2024 top10 Influential paper\n.\n2025.02\n:  🎉🎉 Dispider, ViCo, OVO-Bench, and ByTheWay were accepted by CVPR 2025.\n2025.01\n:  🎉🎉 MIA-DPO and MotionClone were accepted by ICLR 2025.\n2024.11\n:  🎉🎉 ShareGPT4V is selectd as\nECCV 2024 top10 Influential paper\n.\n2024.11\n:  🎉🎉 InternLM-XComposer2 and InternVL is selectd as\nArxiv2024 CV top10 Influential paper\n.\n2024.09\n:  🎉🎉 ShareGPT4Video, MMDU, and MMLongBench-Doc are accepted by NeurIPS2024 D&B.\n2024.09\n:  🎉🎉 InternLM-XComposer2-4KHD, MMStar, and Video-Streaming are accepted by NeurIPS2024.\n2024.07\n:  🎉🎉 ShareGPT4V and Long-CLIP are accepted by ECCV2024.\n2024.05\n:  🎉🎉 PeCo is selectd as\nAAAI2023 top10 Influential paper\n.\n2024.02\n:  🎉🎉 OPERA is accepted by CVPR2024 as Highlight.\n2023.11\n:  🎉🎉 PointCAT is accepted by TIP.\n2023.07\n:  🎉🎉 ELP and RobustMAE are accepted by ICCV2023.\n2023.03\n:  🎉🎉 MaskCLIP and DAM-VP are accepted by CVPR2023.\n2023.01\n:  🎉🎉 CSWin is selectd as\nCVPR2022 top10 Influential paper\n.\n2022.12\n:  🎉🎉 PeCo is accepted by AAAI2023.\n2022.10\n:  🎉🎉 MaskCLIP won the\n1st place in ICinW Industry Track\n.\n2022.07\n:  🎉🎉 BootMAE and CD-Net are accepted by ECCV2022.\n2022.03\n:  🎉🎉 CSWin, ICT, Mobile-Former, SI-Adv are accepted by CVPR2022.\n2021.11\n:  🎉🎉 PeCo reaches the\nhighest ImageNet-1K accuracy\nw/o addition data.\n2021.08\n:  🎉🎉 Tacr-net is accepted by ACM MM.\n2020.09\n:  🎉🎉 GreedyFool is accepted by NeurIPS2020.\n2020.03\n:  🎉🎉 Sup-ADV, GVG and LG-GAN are accepted by CVPR2020.\n2019.07\n:  🎉🎉 MAN is accepted by ICCV2019.\n📝 Selected Publications\nCVPR 2023\nMaskCLIP: Masked Self-Distillation Advances Contrastive Language-Image Pretraining\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jianmin Bao, Yinglin Zheng, Ting Zhang, Dongdong Chen, Hao Yang, Ming Zeng, Weiming Zhang, Lu Yuan, Dong Chen, Fang Wen, Nenghai Yu\nCVPR 2023\n1st in ICinW Industry Track\nAAAI 2023\nPeco: Perceptual codebook for bert pre-training of vision transformers\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jianmin Bao, Ting Zhang, Dongdong Chen, Weiming Zhang, Lu Yuan, Dong Chen, Fang Wen, Nenghai Yu\nAAAI 2023\nSOTA ImageNet-1K accuracy\nECCV 2022\nBootstrapped Masked Autoencoders for Vision BERT Pretraining\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jianmin Bao, Ting Zhang, Dongdong Chen, Weiming Zhang, Lu Yuan, Dong Chen, Fang Wen, Nenghai Yu\nECCV 2022 |\nGithub\nCVPR 2022\nCSWin Transformer: A General Vision Transformer Backbone with Cross-Shaped Windows\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jianmin Bao, Dongdong Chen, Weiming Zhang, Nenghai Yu, Lu Yuan, Dong Chen, Baining Guo\nCVPR 2022\nCVPR2022 top10 Influential paper\n|\nGithub\nCVPR 2022\nProtecting Celebrities from DeepFake with Identity Consistency Transformer\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jianmin Bao, Dongdong Chen, Ting Zhang, Weiming Zhang, Nenghai Yu, Dong Chen, Fang Wen, Baining Guo\nCVPR 2022  |\nGithub\nNeurIPS 2020\nGreedyFool: Distortion-Aware Sparse Adversarial Attack\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Dongdong Chen, Jianmin Bao, Chuan Qin, Lu Yuan, Weiming Zhang, Nenghai Yu, Dong Chen\nNeurIPS 2020  |\nGithub\nCVPR 2020\nRobust Superpixel-Guided Attentional Adversarial Attack\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Jiangfan Han, Dongdong Chen, et al., Nenghai Yu\nCVPR 2020  |\nGithub\nCVPR 2020\nSelf-Robust 3D Point Recognition via Gather-vector Guidance\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Dongdong Chen, et al., Nenghai Yu\nCVPR 2020\nICCV 2019\nOnce a MAN: Towards Multi-Target Attack via Learning Multi-Target Adversarial Network Once\nJiangfan Han\n,\nXiaoyi Dong\n, Ruimao Zhang, Dongdong Chen, Weiming Zhang, Nenghai Yu, Ping Luo, Xiaogang Wang (* Equal Contribution)\nICCV 2019\n🎖 Honors and Awards\nOutstanding Reviewer of CVPR2023, ICCV2021\n2023.10\n, President Scholarship, Chinese Academy of Sciences.\n2023.05\n, Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award, USTC\n2023.05\n, Excellent award, Stars of Tomorrow Internship Program, Microsoft Research Asia (MSRA).\n2020.06\n, National Scholarship (The highest scholarship awarded by the Ministry of Education, China).\n2019.09\n, IJCAI-2019 Alibaba Adversarial AI Challenge(AAAC2019). 1st prize in Defense Track, 2nd prize in Non-Target Attack Track.\n2018.10\n, Competition on Adversarial Attacks and Defenses (CAAD2018). 2nd prize in Non-Target Attack Track.\n📖 Educations\n2018.06 - 2023.06\n, Ph.D., University of Science and Technology of China.\n2014.09 - 2018.06\n, Undergraduate, University of Science and Technology of China.\nProfessional Activities\nReviewer for CVPR 2021, 2022, 2023\nReviewer for ICCV 2021, 2023\nReviewer for ECCV 2022\nReviewer for NeurIPS 2023\nReviewer for AAAI 2020, 2021, 2022\nReviewer for IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence(TPAMI)\nReviewer for IEEE Transactions on Image Processing(TIP)"
  },
