    "homepage_text": "Yinhe Zheng (郑银河) Yinhe Zheng\nYinhe Zheng (郑银河)\nNLP Researcher\nFollow\nBeijing\nEmail\nResearchGate\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nYinhe Zheng (郑银河)\nWelcome to my site!\nI am currently building LLMs. I was a senior algorithm engineer at the Conversational AI Group of DAMO Academy, Alibaba. Prior to that, I finished my postdoctoral research in a joint program established on both Tsinghua University and Samsung Research. My research interests are in conversational AI, especially natural language understanding and controlled response generation.\nYou may also be interested in some of the Dialogue System datasets I have constructed. You can check them out in the\nDatasets\nsection.\nSelected Publications\n* indicates equal contribution, ** indicates corresponding author.\n2023\nA Survey on Out-of-Distribution Detection in NLP\nTransactions on Machine Learning Research\nHao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Yixuan Li, Jian Sun, Fei Huang, Yongbin Li\nPIPPA: A Partially Synthetic Conversational Dataset\nPre-print 2023\ndataset\nTear Gosling, Alpin Dale,\nYinhe Zheng\nThis paper is proudly coauthored with\nPygmalionAI\ndevs.\nLong-Tailed Question Answering in an Open World\nACL 2023 Main Conference (Long Paper)\nYi Dai, Hao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Fei Huang, Yongbin Li\nDomain Incremental Lifelong Learning in an Open World\nACL 2023 Fandings (Long Paper)\nYi Dai, Hao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Bowen Yu, Fei Huang, Yongbin Li\nA chatbot for mental health support: exploring the impact of Emohaa on reducing mental distress in China\nFrontiers in Digital Health\nSahand Sabour, Wen Zhang, Xiyao Xiao, Yuwei Zhang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Jiaxin Wen, Jialu Zhao, Minlie Huang\nEmpathetic Response Generation via Emotion Cause Transition Graph\nICASSP 2023\nYushan Qian, Bo Wang, Ting-En Lin,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Ying Zhu, Dongming Zhao, Yuexian Hou, Yuchuan Wu, Yongbin Li\nOut-of-Domain Intent Detection Considering Multi-turn Dialogue Contexts\nPre-print 2023\nHao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Binyuan Hui, Fei Huang, Yongbin Li\n2022\nPrompt Conditioned VAE: Enhancing Generative Replay for Lifelong Learning in Task-Oriented Dialogue\nEMNLP 2022 Main Conference (Long Paper)\n[code]\nYingxiu Zhao,\nYinhe Zheng**\n, Zhiliang Tian, Chang Gao, Jian Sun, Nevin L. Zhang\nEstimating Soft Labels for Out-of-Domain Intent Detection\nEMNLP 2022 Main Conference (Long Paper)\n(Oral)\nHao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng**\n, Jian Sun, Fei Huang, Luo Si, Yongbin Li\nCDConv: A Benchmark for Contradiction Detection in Chinese Conversations\nEMNLP 2022 Main Conference (Long Paper)\n(Oral)\n[code + dataset]\nChujie Zheng, Jinfeng Zhou,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Libiao Peng, Zhen Guo, Wenquan Wu, Zheng-Yu Niu, Hua Wu, Minlie Huang\nSemi-Supervised Lifelong Language Learning\nEMNLP 2022 Findings (Long Paper)\nYingxiu Zhao,\nYinhe Zheng**\n, Bowen Yu, Zhiliang Tian, Dongkyu Lee, Jian Sun, Yongbin Li, Nevin L. Zhang\nLayerConnect: Hypernetwork-Assisted Inter-Layer Connector to Enhance Parameter Efficiency\nCOLING 2022\nHaoxiang Shi, Rongsheng Zhang, Jiaan Wang, Cen Wang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Tetsuya Sakai\nLifelong Learning for Question Answering with Hierarchical Prompts\nPre-print 2022\nYi Dai, Hao Lang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Fei Huang, Luo Si, Yongbin Li\nChatbots for Mental Health Support: Exploring the Impact of Emohaa on Reducing Mental Distress in China\nPre-print 2022\nSahand Sabour, Wen Zhang, Xiyao Xiao, Yuwei Zhang,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Jiaxin Wen, Jialu Zhao, Minlie Huang\nMMChat: Multi-Modal Chat Dataset on Social Media\nLREC 2022\n(Oral)\n[code + dataset]\nYinhe Zheng\n, Guanyi Chen, Xin Liu, Jian Sun\nImproving Meta-learning for Low-resource Text Classification and Generation via Memory Imitation\nACL 2022 Main Conference (Long Paper)\nYingxiu Zhao, Zhiliang Tian, Huaxiu Yao,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Dongkyu Lee, Yiping Song, Jian SUN, Nevin Zhang\nRethinking and Refining the Distinct Metric\nACL 2022 Main Conference (Short Paper)\nSiyang Liu, Sahand Sabour,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Pei Ke, Xiaoyan Zhu, Minlie Huang\nGALAXY: A Generative Pre-trained Model for Task-Oriented Dialog with Semi-Supervised Learning and Explicit Policy Injection\nAAAI 2022 (Long Paper)\n(Oral)\n[code]\nWanwei He, Yinpei Dai,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Yuchuan Wu, Zheng Cao, Dermot Liu, Peng Jiang, Min Yang, Fei Huang, Luo Si, Jian Sun, Yongbin Li\n2021\nStylized dialogue response generation using stylized unpaired texts\nAAAI 2021 (Long Paper)\n[code]\nYinhe Zheng\n, Zikai Chen, Rongsheng Zhang, Shilei Huang, Xiaoxi Mao, Minlie Huang\nDiversifying Dialog Generation via Adaptive Label Smoothing\nACL 2021 Main Conference (Long Paper)\n(Oral)\n[code]\nYida Wang*,\nYinhe Zheng*\n, Yong Jiang, Minlie Huang\nTransferable Persona-Grounded Dialogues via Grounded Minimal Edits\nEMNLP 2021 Main Conference (Long Paper)\nChen Henry Wu,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Xiaoxi Mao, Minlie Huang\nUnsupervised Domain Adaptation with Adapter\nNeurIPS 2021 ENLSP Workshop\nRongsheng Zhang*,\nYinhe Zheng*\n, Xiaoxi Mao, Minlie Huang\nEVA: An Open-Domain Chinese Dialogue System with Large-Scale Generative Pre-Training\nPre-print 2021\nHao Zhou, Pei Ke, Zheng Zhang, Yuxian Gu,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Chujie Zheng, Yida Wang, Chen Henry Wu, Hao Sun, Xiaocong Yang, Bosi Wen, Xiaoyan Zhu, Minlie Huang, Jie Tang\nSemantic-Enhanced Explainable Finetuning for Open-Domain Dialogues\nPre-print 2021\nChen Henry Wu,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Yida Wang, Zhenyu Yang, Minlie Huang\n2020\nA pre-training based personalized dialogue generation model with persona-sparse data\nAAAI 2020 (Long Paper)\nYinhe Zheng\n, Rongsheng Zhang, Minlie Huang, Xiaoxi Mao\nDialogue distillation: Open-domain dialogue augmentation using unpaired data\nEMNLP 2020 Main Conference (Long Paper)\nRongsheng Zhang*,\nYinhe Zheng*\n, Jianzhi Shao, Xiaoxi Mao, Yadong Xi, Minlie Huang\nA large-scale chinese short-text conversation dataset\nNLPCC 2020\n(Best Student Paper)\n[code + dataset]\nYida Wang, Pei Ke,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Kaili Huang, Yong Jiang, Xiaoyan Zhu, Minlie Huang\nOut-of-domain detection for natural language understanding in dialog systems\nIEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and Language Processing\n[code]\nYinhe Zheng\n, Guanyi Chen, Minlie Huang </span>\nListener’s Social Identity Matters in Personalised Response Generation\nINLG 2020\nGuanyi Chen,\nYinhe Zheng\n, Yupei Du\n2019\nPersonalized dialogue generation with diversified traits\nPre-print\nYinhe Zheng\n, Guanyi Chen, Minlie Huang, Song Liu, Xuan Zhu\nPersona-aware Dialogue Generation with Enriched Profile\nNIPS2019 ConvAI Workshop\n(Best Paper Nominee)\nYinhe Zheng\n, Guanyi Chen, Minlie Huang, Song Liu, Xuan Zhu"
