    "homepage_text": "Jie Huang\nJie Huang\nAssociate Professor, Shanghai Jiao Tong University\nDr. Jie Huang\nAssociate Professor\nSchool of Oceanography\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nContact Information\njie-huang@sjtu.edu.cn\njhuang@whoi.edu\nMailing Address:\nNo. 1954 Huashan Road,\nXuhui District, Shanghai, China, 200052\nRESEARCH INTERESTS\nHigh Latitude Ocean Processes, e.g., Water Mass Transformation, Dense Water Pathways, Instability of Boundary Current and Air-Sea Interaction.\nPhysical-Biogeochemical Interaction in Ocean Mesoscale Eddies.\nEDUCATION\nPh.D., Physical Oceanography. 2020. Tsinghua University, Beijing, China.\nGuest student, 2017-2019. Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution, Woods Hole, USA.\nB.S., Oceanography. 2015. Xiamen University, Xiamen, China.\nGoogle Scholar\nResearchgate"
