    "homepage_text": "People - DMCV Lab\nGroup Leader\nProf. Lizhuang Ma\nLizhuang Ma, distinguished professor of SJTU and\n                            ECNU, director of \"Digital Media and Computer\n                            Vision Laboratory\", director of \"SenseTime-SJTU\n                            Deep Learning and Computer Vision Joint\n                            Laboratory\", vice president of the Institute of\n                            Artificial Intelligence in SJTU. He is the\n                            recipient of national outstanding Youth\n                            Foundation (å½å®¶æ°é), first class member of\n                            China National Hundred-Thousand-Ten thousand\n                            Talent Plan (åç¾ä¸äººæå·¥ç¨), vice chairman of\n                            the China Society of Image and Graphics\n                            \"Computer Animation and Digital Entertainment\n                            Committee\", director of Information Science and\n                            Technology Center at Shanghai University of\n                            Traditional Chinese Medicine.\nProfessor Ma has gotten the China Youth Science\n                            and Technology Award, the State Ministry of\n                            Education Science and Technology Progress Award,\n                            the Shanghai Science and Technology Progress\n                            Award, Zhejiang Century Academic and Technology\n                            Leaders; special allowance of the State Council,\n                            Shanghai Young Leading Scientists. He stayed in\n                            CAD & CG State Key laboratory 1992-2002, and was\n                            as a visiting professor at CAMTech Advanced\n                            Multimedia Center of Singapore's Nanyang\n                            Technological University in 1999-2000. Since\n                            2002, he has b