    "homepage_text": "Yuhan Wang\nSearch\nYuhan Wang\nSenior Researcher\nHunyuan, Tencent\nBiography\nI am Yuhan Wang (王宇晗), currently a Senior Researcher at\nHunyuan, Tencent\n, where I work on 3D generation foundation models for\nHunyuan3D\n. I am also completing my Ph.D. in\nCollege of Computing and Data Science\n,\nNanyang Technological University\n, affiliated with\nMMLab@NTU\n, advised by\nProf. Chen Change Loy\n. My current research interests are in 3D representation and generation.\nDuring my industry research internships, I am honored to have worked with\nZeyu Hu\n,\nWeikai Chen\n, and\nXin Wang\nat\nLightSpeed Studios\n, and with\nYing Tai\nand\nJunwei Zhu\nat\nTencent Youtu Lab\n. Before NTU, I earned my bachelor’s degree from Chu Kochen Honors College, Zhejiang University. I participated in six ACM ICPC/CCPC Asia Regional Contests, earning four gold medals and two silver medals.\nWe are hiring!\nHunyuan3D is looking for research interns, opportunities in both\nSingapore\nand\nChina\n. Feel free to reach out to me via\nemail\nor\nLinkedIn\n.\nInterests\n3D Generation\nHuman Generation\nImage and Video Generation\nFace Manipulation\nEducation\nPhD in Computer Science and Engineering, 2022 - Now\nNanyang Technological University\nBSc in Computer Science and Technology, 2017 - 2021\nZhejiang University\nPublications\nUltraShape 1.0: High-Fidelity 3D Shape Generation via Scalable Geometric Refinement\nTanghui Jia\n,\nDongyu Yan\n,\nDehao Hao\n,\nYang Li\n,\nKaiyi Zhang\n,\nXianyi He\n,\nLanjiong Li\n,\nYuhan Wang\n,\nJinnan Chen\n,\nLutao Jiang\n,\nQishen Yin\n,\nLong Quan\n,\nYing-Cong Chen\n,\nLi Yuan\narXiv, 2025\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject Page\nLight-SQ: Structure-aware Shape Abstraction with Superquadrics for Generated Meshes\nYuhan Wang\n,\nWeikai Chen\n,\nZeyu Hu\n,\nRunze Zhang\n,\nYingda Yin\n,\nRuoyu Wu\n,\nKeyang Luo\n,\nShengju Qian\n,\nYiyan Ma\n,\nHongyi Li\n,\nYuan Gao\n,\nYuhuan Zhou\n,\nHao Luo\n,\nWan Wang\n,\nXiaobin Shen\n,\nZhaowei Li\n,\nKuixin Zhu\n,\nChuanlang Hong\n,\nYueyue Wang\n,\nLijie Feng\n,\nXin Wang\n,\nChen Change Loy\nIn\n2025 ACM SIGGRAPH Asia Conference Proceedings (SIGGRAPH Asia 2025)\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject Page\nMEAT: Multiview Diffusion Model for Human Generation on Megapixels with Mesh Attention\nYuhan Wang\n,\nFangzhou Hong\n,\nShuai Yang\n,\nLiming Jiang\n,\nWayne Wu\n,\nChen Change Loy\nIn\n2025 Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR 2025)\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject Page\nTowards Dense and Accurate Radar Perception Via Efficient Cross-Modal Diffusion Model\nRuibin Zhang\n,\nDonglai Xue\n,\nYuhan Wang\n,\nRuixu Geng\n,\nFei Gao\nIn\nIEEE Robotics and Automation Letters. (RA-L)\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nVideo\nProject Page\nStyleInV: A Temporal Style Modulated Inversion Network for Unconditional Video Generation\nYuhan Wang\n,\nLiming Jiang\n,\nChen Change Loy\nIn\n2023 International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV 2023)\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nVideo\nProject Page\nHifiFace: 3D Shape and Semantic Prior Guided High Fidelity Face Swapping\nYuhan Wang\n,\nXu Chen\n,\nJunwei Zhu\n,\nWenqing Chu\n,\nYing Tai\n,\nChengjie Wang\n,\nJilin Li\n,\nYongjian Wu\n,\nFeiyue Huang\n,\nRongrong Ji\nIn\n2021 International Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI 2021)\nPDF\nCite\nDataset\nProject Page\nCurricularFace: Adaptive Curriculum Learning Loss for Deep Face Recognition\nYuge Huang\n,\nYuhan Wang\n,\nYing Tai\n,\nXiaoming Liu\n,\nPengcheng Shen\n,\nShaoxin Li\n,\nJilin Li\n,\nFeiyue Huang\nIn\n2020 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR 2020)\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nExperience\nSenior Researcher\nHunyuan, Tencent\nFeb 2026 –\n                \n                  Present\nSingapore\nResearch on 3D generation foundation model.\nLatest releases can be found at\nHunyuan3D Website\n.\nResearch Intern\nLightSpeed Studios, Tencent\nOct 2024 –\n                \n                  Aug 2025\nSingapore\nResearch on\n3D generation foundation model - Geometry generation\nPrimitive-decomposed 3D Generation\nResearch Intern\nTencent Youtu\nOct 2020 –\n                \n                  Nov 2021\nShanghai\nResearch on high fidelity face swapping algorithm.\nSummer Research Assistant\nARoS Lab, North Carolina State University\nJul 2020 –\n                \n                  Sep 2020\nRemote\nResearch on Tracking-by-Detection Based Pedestrian Recognition in Infrared Video.\nResearch Intern\nTencent Youtu\nJul 2019 –\n                \n                  Sep 2019\nShanghai\nResearch on\nNeural Architecture Search on Face Classification Backbone\nMargin-Mining Combined Deep Face Classification Loss\nHonors\nNVIDIA Hardware Grant Program, 2x A5000\nNVIDIA\nApr 2022\nAISG PhD Fellowship\nAISG\nJan 2022\nSenseTime Scholarship 2021\nSenseTime\nJan 2021\nNational Scholarship\nMinistry of Education\nNov 2020\nACM ICPC Asian Regional Contest Gold Medal\nACM ICPC\nSep 2017\n              \n              – Dec 2018\n2018 Shenyang, 2017 Xi’an, 2017 Nanning, 2017 Hangzhou\nProfessional Services\nConference Reviewer:\nAAAI\n2024\nECCV\n2024, 2026\nCVPR\n2025, 2026\nICCV\n2025\nSIGGRAPH Asia\n2025\nStudents Mentoring:\nNTU Final Year Project (FYP)\n:\nCecelia Soh Yan Pei\n,\nPearlina Tan Qinlin\nTeaching\nI am the teaching assistant of the following courses at NTU:\nSC1003\n:\nIntroduction to Computational Thinking and Programming\n, 2023 Fall\nSC4242/CZ3007\n:\nCompiler Techniques\n, 2023 Spring\nSC1003\n:\nIntroduction to Computational Thinking and Programming\n, 2022 Fall\nSkills\nLanguage\nPython, C, C++, Java\nResearch\nPyTorch, CUDA\nChills\nACM, Basketball, Badminton, Go Game\nContact\nyuhan004@e.ntu.edu.sg\n79 Robinson Rd, Singapore, 068897\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
