xuan Wu, Wenyan Yao, Lulu Zuo, Xinwei Li, Xuekang Yang, Yaling Liu, Zhiyong Tang, Flexible full-Inorganic ultrathin films with stable circularly polarized luminescence covering the visible to near-infrared region, ChemPhysChem, 2024, 25, 13, e202400138.\nYuheng Jiang, Siyang Li, Yingying Fan, Zhiyong Tang, Best practices for experiments and reports in photocatalytic methane conversion, Angewandte Chemie International Edition, 2024, 63, 24, e202404658.\nMunan Fang, Zhuang Yan, Yue Ying, Chun-kui Hu, Xiaoyi Xi, Guangjie Zhang, Xiaopeng Zhang, Xia-Chao Chen, Zhiyong Tang, Lianshan Li, Boosting osmotic energy harvesting from organic solutions by ultrathin covalent organic framework membranes, Nano Letters, 2024, 24, 15, 4618-4624.\nQing Feng, Caoyu Yang, Lin Chang, Guodong Li, Zhiyong Tang, Recent progress on the synthesis of defective UiO-66 for thermal catalysis, Nano Research, 2024, 17, 8653-8680.\nXiaoqing Gao, Xuekang Yang, Jiawei Lv, Luyang Zhao, Xinyu Sui, Xueyan Zhang, Yuyu Xie, Zhiyong Tang, Induced huge optical activity in nanoplatelet superlattice, Journal of the American Chemical Society, 2024, 146, 21, 14697-14704.\nFengbin Zheng, Zhouwen Cao, Tian Lin, Bin Tu, Shengxian Shao, Caoyu Yang, Pengfei An, Wenxing Chen, Qiaojun Fang, Yinglong Wang, Zhiyong Tang, Guodong Li, Nanocavity in hollow sandwiched catalysts as substrate regulator for boosting hydrodeoxygenation of biomass-derived carbonyl compounds, Science Advances, 2024, 10, eadn9896.\nXinwei Li, Caoyu Yang, Zhiyong Tang, Electrifying oxidation of ethylene and propylene, Chemical Communications, 2024, 60, 53, 6703-6716.\nYingying Fan, Yuheng Jiang, Haiting Lin, Jianan Li, Yuanjiang Xie, Anyi Chen, Siyang Li, Dongxue Han, Li Niu, Zhiyong Tang, Insight into selectivity of photocatalytic methane oxidation to formaldehyde on tungsten trioxide, Nature Communications, 2024, 15, 4679.\nYuheng Jiang, Yingying Fan, Xiaolong Liu, Jun Xie, Siyang Li, Kefu Huang, Xiaoyu Fan, Chang Long, Lulu Zuo, Wenshi Zhao, Xu Zh