work generative process. IEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computational Intelligence, 6(5):1044-1056, 2022.\nW Liang, Y Wang, H Tao, J Cao. Towards hour-level crime prediction: A neural attentive framework with spatial–temporal-categorical fusion. Neurocomputing, 486:286-297, 2022.\nJC Jiang, Y Li, Y Jiang, Z Bu, J Cao. An intermediary utility-based service search and structure organization approach in service-oriented MAS. Knowledge-Based Systems, 241:108154, 2022.\nL Chen, J Cao, Y Wang, W Liang, G Zhu. Multi-view graph attention network for travel recommendation. Expert Systems with Applications, 191:116234, 2022.\nJ Jiang, K Di, B An, Y Jiang, Z Bu, J Cao. Batch crowdsourcing for complex tasks based on distributed team formation in E-markets. IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed System, 33(12):3600-3615, 2022.\nK Xiong, Y Liu, L Zhang, B Gao, J Cao, P Fan, KB Letaief. Joint Optimization of Trajectory, Task Offloading, and CPU Control in UAV-Assisted Wireless Powered Fog Computing Networks. IEEE Transactions on Green Communications and Networking, 6(3):1833-1845, 2022.\nS Yang, S Tong, G Zhu, J Cao, Y Wang, Z Xue, H Sun, Y Wen. MVE-FLK: A multi-task legal judgment prediction via multi-view encoder fusing legal keywords. Knowledge-Based Systems, 239:107960, 2022.\nD Ma, S Li, JT Du, Z Bu, J Cao, J Sun. Engaging voluntary contributions in online review platforms: The effects of a hierarchical badges system. Computers in Human Behavior, 127:107042, 2022.\nG Gao, Z Bao, J Cao, AK Qin, T Sellis. Location-centered house price prediction: A multi-task learning approach. ACM Transactions on Intelligent Systems and Technology (TIST), 13(2):1-25, 2022.\nJ Tang, Y Wang, J Cao, H Tao, G Zhu. Inter-and Intra-Graph Attention Aggregation Learning for Multi-relational GNN Spam Detection. Procedia Computer Science, 214:1522-1530, 2022.\n2021\nL Chen, J Cao, G Zhu, Y Wang, W Liang. A multi-task learning approach for improving travel recommendation with keywords generation. Knowledge-Based Systems, 233:107521, 2021.\nX Ding, J Liu, F Yang, J Cao. Random radial basis function kernel-based support vector machine. Journal of the Franklin Institute, 358(18):10121-10140, 2021.\nR Jiang, K Xiong, HC Yang, J Cao, Z Zhong, B Ai. Coverage performance of UAV-assisted SWIPT networks with directional antennas. IEEE Internet of Things Journal 9 (13), 10600-10609, 2021.\nY Wang, J Cao, H Tao. Graph convolutional network with multi-similarity attribute matrices fusion for node classification. Neural Computing and Applications, 1-11, 2021.\nL Liu, K Xiong, J Cao, Y Lu, P Fan, KB Letaief. Average AoI minimization in UAV-assisted data collection with RF wireless power transfer: A deep reinforcement learning scheme. IEEE Internet of Things Journal 9 (7), 5216-5228, 2021.\nS Liu, S Xue, J Wu, C Zhou, J Yang, Z Li, J Cao. Online active learning for drifting data streams. IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems, 2021.\nHJ Li, L Wang, Z Bu, J Cao, Y Shi. Measuring the network vulnerability based on markov criticality. ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (TKDD). 16(2), 1-24, 2021.\nX Ding, F Yang, S Jin, J Cao. An efficient alpha seeding method for optimized extreme learning machine-based feature selection algorithm. Computers in Biology and Medicine, 134:104505, 2021.\nJ Jiang, B An, Y Jiang, C Zhang, Z Bu, J Cao. Fractional-Order PID Controller Synthesis for Bifurcation of Fractional-Order Small-World Networks. IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems, 51(7):4417-4432, 2021.\nL Chen, J Cao, H Chen, W Liang, H Tao, G Zhu. Attentive multi-task learning for group itinerary recommendation. Knowledge and Information Systems, 63(7):1687-1716, 2021.\nX Ding, J Liu, F Yang, J Cao. Random compact Gaussian kernel: Application to ELM classification and regression. Knowledge-Based Systems, 217:106848, 2021.\nX Ding, F Yang, Y Zhong, J Cao. A novel recursive gene selection method based on least square kernel ex