adient estimator for generic discrete random variables\nJoo, W., Kim, D., Shin, S. &\nMoon, I. C.\n,\nOct 2025\n,\nIn:\nPattern Recognition Letters.\n196\n,\np. 148-155\n8 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nStochastics\n100%\nDiscrete Random Variable\n100%\nDiscrete Distribution\n40%\nNeural Network\n20%\nNegative Binomial\n20%\n1\nScopus \n citations\nView all 128 Research outputs"
