    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-warde-farley-55a0825/",
    "homepage_text": "David Warde-Farley\nDavid Warde-Farley\nMachine Learning Researcher\nI am a Staff Research Scientist at\nDeepMind\nbased in London, England. I completed my PhD research in 2016 under\nYoshua Bengio\nat Université de Montréal as part of (what shortly thereafter became)\nMila\n. Prior to that, I completed Bachelor's and Master's degrees at\nthe Department of Computer Science\nat the University of Toronto, the latter supervised by\nQuaid Morris\n.\nYou can find out more about my research from\nGoogle Scholar\n, and find some code of varying vintages that I've written on\nGitHub\n. You can also find me on\nTwitter\nand\nLinkedIn\n."
  },
