    "homepage_text": "Jean-Benoit Delbrouck\nJean‑Benoit Delbrouck\nAI Researcher Engineer at HOPPR & Hugging Face\n|\nStanford‑trained AI Researcher\n|\nAdvancing Safe and Robust Medical AI\nLeading and Senior author in top‑tier AI conferences and journals (ACL, EMNLP, NeurIPS, ICLR, Nature Medicine, Nature Biomedical Engineering).\nI'm passionate about robust, open‑source medical foundation models and rigorous evaluations. As a lead and senior author, I have hands‑on experience building, fine‑tuning, and evaluating\nmedical\nlarge language models from the ground up."
