    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Haitao Wang's Homepage\nHaitao Wang (王海涛)\nAssociate Professor\nKahlert School of Computing\nUniversity of Utah\n50 Central Campus Dr., RM 3190\nSalt Lake City, UT 84112, USA\nOffice: 3418 MEB (Merril Engineering Building)\nEmail: haitao.wang (at) utah (dot) edu\nBrief Bio\nI am an Associate Professor in Kahlert School of Computing at the University of Utah. Before joining the school in 2022, I taught in the Department of Computer Science at Utah State University from 2012 to 2022. Prior to that,  I served as a research assistant professor in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at University of Notre Dame from 2010 to 2012. I received my Ph.D degree in Computer Science from University of Notre Dame, Indiana, USA, in 2010. I received my M.S. degree in Computer Science from Fudan University in 2006 and B.S. degree in Mathematics from East China University of Science and Technology in 2003, both in Shanghai, China.\nResearch Interests\nMy research interests include computational geometry, algorithms and data structures, theoretical computer science, etc.\nPublications\nCurriculum Vitae\nTeaching\nProfessional Activities"
  },
  "serper::Yunhao Tang": {
