    "homepage_text": "Mei-Hwa Chen\nMei-Hwa Chen\nAssociate Professor\nComputer Science Department\n, LI-96K\nUniversity at Albany\nState University of New York\nAlbany, NY 12222\n(518)442-4283, (518)442-5638(fax)\nmhc@cs.albany.edu\nResearch Projects & Publications\nSoftware Engineering Research Group\nMobile Computing  Research Group\nSoftware Reliability Engineering\nSoftware Fault Tolerance\nObject-Oriented Testing and Reliability Modeling\nSoftware Architecture Analysis\nSoftware Maintenance\nDesign Metrics\nSoftware\nJATO\nCourses\nCSI445R: Object-Oriented Programming in Java. (Spring 2001)\nCSI668: Topics in System Architecture. (Spring 2001)\nCSI518: Software Engineering. (Spring 2002)\nOther Links\nSTORM - Software Testing Online Resources\nLast Updated:"
