    "homepage_text": "Zaiyi Chen's Homepage | Home :: zaiyichen.github.io\nZaiyi Chen\nABOUT ME\nHi! I am Zaiyi Chen\n. I received my Ph.D (and B.E) degree in Computer Science from University of Science and Technology of China(\nUSTC\n) in 2019 (2012). My advisor is\nEnhong Chen\n, and my co-advisor is\nLinli Xu\n. I joined Prof.\nTianbao Yang\n's group as a visiting scholar, working on first-order stochastic optimization, from Oct. 2016 to Oct. 2017. In 2019, I joined\nCainiao Network\n. Now I am working on practical approximation algorithms in logistics and finance as an advanced algorithm expert.\nEmail\n:\nzaiyi.czy@alibaba-inc.com\n,\nzaiyi.chen@outlook.com\nWebsite\n:\nHomepage\n,\nGoogle Scholar\nResearch Interests\n: Machine Learning, Optimization, Sampling\nNews\n(\nNew!\n)\nNearly Optimal Competitive Ratio for Online Allocation Problems with Two-sided Resource Constraints and Finite Requests.\nZaiyi Chen\n*, Wenbing Ye*, Qixin Zhang*, Haoyuan Hu, Enhong Chen, Yu Yang\nAccepted by\nICML 2023\n(\nNew!\n)\nCommunication-Efficient Decentralized Online Continuous DR-Submodular Maximization\n.\nQixin Zhang, Zengde Deng, Xiangru Jian,\nZaiyi Chen\n, Haoyuan Hu, Yu Yang\narXiv preprint arXiv:2208.08681\n(\nNew!\n)\nAn Online Algorithm for Chance Constrained Resource Allocation\n.\nYuwei Chen, Zengde Deng, Yinzhi Zhou,\nZaiyi Chen\n, Yujie Chen, Haoyuan Hu\nAccepted by\nICASSP 2023\n(\nNew!\n):\nOnline Learning for Non-monotone Submodular Maximization: From Full Information to Bandit Feedback\n.\nQixin Zhang, Zengde Deng,\nZaiyi Chen\n, Kuangqi Zhou, Haoyuan Hu, Yu Yang\nAccepted by\nAISTATS 2023\nPublications\nNearly Optimal Competitive Ratio for Online Allocation Problems with Two-sided Resource Constraints and Finite Requests.\nZaiyi Chen\n*, Wenbing Ye*, Qixin Zhang*, Haoyuan Hu, Enhong Chen, Yu Yang (* equal contribution)\nICML 2023\nCommunication-Efficient Decentralized Online Continuous DR-Submodular Maximization\n.\nQixin Zhang, Zengde Deng, Xiangru Jian,\n