    "homepage_text": "Tianxiao  Shen\nTianxiao  Shen\n沈添笑\nGoogle Gradient Canopy\n2000 N Shoreline Blvd, Mountain View, CA 94043\nI am a research scientist at\nGoogle DeepMind\n.\nPreviously, I was a member of technical staff at\nCharacter.AI\n.\nBefore that, I was a postdoc scholar at the University of Washington.\nI received my PhD from MIT and my undergraduate degree from the Yao Class, Tsinghua University.\nMy research interests are in artificial intelligence and machine learning.\nIn particular, my research focuses on scaling up reinforcement learning to train Gemini to develop a\nthinking\nprocess that effectively uses more tokens to achieve superhuman performance on complex tasks."
