    "homepage_text": "Adobe Research » Zhengmian Hu\nAdobe Research\nPeople\nResearch\nPublications\nNews\nCareers\nPrograms\nVideos\nAbout\nSearch\nZhengmian Hu\nResearch Scientist/Engineer\nSan Jose\nAI & Machine Learning\nZhengmian Hu is a researcher at\nAdobe Research\n. He received his Ph.D. in Computer Science from the University of Maryland, College Park, where he was advised by Professor Heng Huang. His research interests include optimization, deep learning theory, and probabilistic methods in machine learning. His work has been published at top machine learning venues such as ICML, NeurIPS, and ICLR.\nPublications\nA Personalized Conversational Benchmark: Towards Simulating Personalized Conversations\nLi, Li., Cai, Peilin.,\nRossi, Ryan.\n,\nDernoncourt, Franck.\n,\nKveton, Branislav.\n, Wu, Junda.,\nYu, Tong.\n, Song, Linxin., Yang, Tiankai., Qin, Yuehan., Ahmed, Nesreen., Basu, Samyadeep.,\nMukherjee, Subhojyoti.\n,\nZhang, Ruiyi.\n,\nHu, Zhengmian.\n, Ni, Bo., Zhou, Yuxiao., Wang, Zichao., Huang, Yue., Wang, Yu., Zhang, Xiangliang., Yu, Philip., Hu, Xiyang., Zhao, Yue. (Dec. 7, 2025)\nSpotlight paper (top 5%)\nNeurIPS 2025 MTI-LLM workshop\nA Survey on Small Language Models\nVan Nguyen, Chien., Shen, Xuan., Aponte, Ryan., Xia, Yu., Basu, Samyadeep.,\nHu, Zhengmian.\n, Chen, Jian., Parmar, Mihir., Kunapuli, Sasidhar., Barrow, Joe., Wu, Junda., Singh, Ashish., Wang, Yu.,\nGu, Jiuxiang.\n, Ahmed, Nesreen.,\nLipka, Nedim.\n,\nZhang, Ruiyi.\n,\nChen, Xiang.\n, Yu, Tong.,\nKim, Sungchul.\n,\nDeilamsalehy, Hanieh.\n, Park, Namyong., Rimer, Michael., Zhang, Zhehao., Yang, Huanrui.,\nMathur, Puneet.\n, Wu, Gang.,\nDernoncourt, Franck.\n,\nRossi, Ryan.\n, Nguyen, Thien. (Sep. 10, 2025)\nRANLP 2025\nProducts\nDownloads\nLearn & Support\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy\nCookies\nCopyright © 2026 Adobe. All rights reserved."
