    "homepage_text": "Yuancheng Zhu's Homepage\nToggle navigation\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nYuancheng Zhu  （朱远骋）\nI was a Shepp Research Fellow and Lecturer in the Statistics Department, Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania from 2016 to 2018.\nI was fortunate to be advised by Prof. John Lafferty and received my Ph.D. degree in Statistics at the University of Chicago.\nBefore coming to Chicago, I received my BS in mathematics at Fudan University.\nI am broadly interested in the intersection of statistics, machine learning, and optimization.\nContact\nEmail: yuancheng dot zhu at gmail dot com"
