the\nInstitute of Automation\n,\nChinese Academy of Sciences\nDate: 2015.09 ~ 2020.07\nSupervisor: Prof.\nTieniu Tan\nand Prof.\nZhaoxiang Zhang (张兆翔)\n.\nB.E. in the\nDepartment of Computer Science and Technology\n,\nTsinghua University\nDate: 2011.09 ~ 2015.07"
