    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Zongsheng Yue\nZongsheng Yue (岳 宗胜)\n教授 (Full Professor)，博导，优青(海外)\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics, Xi'an Jiaotong University, Xi'an, China\nEmail: zsyzam@gmail.com; zsyue@xjtu.edu.cn\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\r\n[\nGithub\n]\r\n[\nResearchGate\n]\nBiography\nI am currently a full professor at School of Mathematics and Statistics, Xi'an Jiaotong University. Previously,\r\n    I was a postdoctoral researcher at MMLab@NTU of Nanyang Technological University and The University of Hong Kong, working with\r\n    Prof.\nChen Change Loy\nand \r\n    Prof.\nKenneth K.Y. Wong\n.\r\n    I received my Ph.D. degree from Xi'an Jiaotong University under the supervision of Prof.\nDeyu Meng\nin 2021.\nResearch Interest\nMy work focus on the noise modeling method in machine learning and the image restoration problem in low-level computer vision.\r\nSpecifically, I mainly investigate how to design more efficient and interpretable image restoration models by incorporating the more robust noise modeling\r\ntechnologies and the classical Bayesian methods. Recently, I focus on the following research topics:\nDiffusion model and its application\nNoise modeling\nBlind image restoration\nBayesian methods in image processing\nNews\n2025.08.27: I will serve as an area chair on CVPR 2026.\n2025.08.27:\nOmegance\nis accepted by ICCV 2025.\n2025.05.16: Our work\nMOWA\nhas been accepted by TPAMI 2025.\n2025.02.27: Our work\nInvSR\nhas been accepted by CVPR 2025.\n2025.02.05: Our work\nNoise-DA\nhas been accepted by ICLR 2025.\n2024.12.31: We have released a new image super-resolution work\nInvSR\n.\n2024.9.13: The exteneded journal version of\nResShift\nhas been accepted by TPAMI.\n2024.7.19:\nDifFace\nhas been accepted by TPAMI.\n2024.6.29:\nStableSR\nhas been accepted by IJCV.\nResearch Experiences\nMMLab@NTU\n, Nanyang Technological University, Singapore\nResearch Fellow, Apr. 2022 ~ present\nSupervisor: Prof.\nChen Change Loy\nComputer Vision Group\n, The University of Hong Kong, Hong Kong\nPostdoctoral Researcher, Sep. 2021 ~ Mar. 2022\nSupervisor: Assoc Prof.\nKenneth K.Y. Wong\nDAMO Academy\n, Alibaba Group, Shenzhen, China\nResearch Intern, Mar. 2021 ~ Sep. 2021\nSupervisor: Prof.\nLei Zhang\nDepartment of Computing\n, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, Hong Kong\nResearch Assistant, Oct. 2018 ~ Jun. 2019\nSupervisor: Prof.\nLei Zhang\nInstitute of Future Cities\n, The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Hong Kong\nResearch Assistant, Feb. 2017 ~ Sep. 2017\nSupervisor: Prof.\nLeung Yee\nPreprint\nDegradation-Guided One-Step Image Super-Resolution with Diffusion Priors\nAiping Zhang,\nZongsheng Yue\n, Renjing Pei, Weiqi Ren, Xiaochun Cao\narXiv:2409.17058, 2024\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n]\nSelected Publications\n[Full List]\nMOWA: Multiple-in-One Image Warping Model\nKang Liao,\nZongsheng Yue\n, Zhonghua Wu, Chen Change Loy\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n), 2025.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nProject\n]\nArbitrary-steps Image Super-resolution via Diffusion Inversion\nZongsheng Yue\n, Kang Liao, Chen Change Loy\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2025.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nHugging Face Demo\n]\r\n[\nReplicate Demo\n]\nDenoising as Adaptation: Noise-Space Domain Adaptation for Image Restoration\nKang Liao,\nZongsheng Yue\n, Zhouxia Wang, Chen Change Loy\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(\nICLR\n), 2025.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nProject\n]\nEfficient Diffusion Model for Image Restoration by Residual Shifting\nZongsheng Yue\n, Jianyi Wang, Chen Change Loy\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n), 2025.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nProject\n]\nBlind Image Deconvolution by Generative-based Kernel Prior and Initializer via Latent Encoding\nJiangtao Zhang,\nZongsheng Yue\n, Hui Wang, Qian Zhao, Deyu Meng\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(\nECCV\n), 2024.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n]\nDifFace: Blind Face Restoration via Diffused Error Contraction\nZongsheng Yue\n, Chen Change Loy\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n), 2024.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nDemo\n]\nExploiting Diffusion Prior for Real-World Image Super-resolution\nJianyi Wang,\nZongsheng Yue\n, Shangchen Zhou, Kelvin C.K. Chan, Chen Change Loy\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(\nIJCV\n), 2024.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nProject\n]\nVariational Image Restoration Network\nZongsheng Yue\n, Hongwei Yong, Qian Zhao, Lei Zhang, Deyu Meng, Kwan-Yee K. Wong\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n), 2024.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n]\nResShift: Efficient Diffusion Model for Image Super-resolution by Residual Shifting\nZongsheng Yue\n, Jianyi Wang, Chen Change Loy\nNeural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n),\nSpotlight\n, 2023.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nProject\n]\nBlind Image Super-resolution with Elaborate Degradation Modeling on Noise and Kernel\nZongsheng Yue\n, Qian Zhao, Jianwen Xie, Lei Zhang, Deyu Meng, K.-Y. K. Wong\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2022.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n]\nSemi-Supervised Video Deraining with Dynamical Rain Generator\nZongsheng Yue\n, Jianwen Xie, Qian Zhao, Deyu Meng\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2021.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nSupp\n]\nFrom Rain Generation to Rain Removal\nHong Wang*,\nZongsheng Yue*\n, Qi Xie, Qian Zhao, Yefeng Zheng, Deyu Meng (*Equal Contribution)\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2021.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n]\nDual Adversarial Network: Toward Real-World Noise Removal and Noise Generation\nZongsheng Yue\n, Qian Zhao, Lei Zhang, Deyu Meng\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(\nECCV\n), 2020.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nSupp\n]\nVariational Denoising Network: Toward Blind Noise Modeling and Removal\nZongsheng Yue\n, Hongwei Yong, Qian Zhao, Lei Zhang, Deyu Meng\nNeural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n), 2019.\n[\nPaper\n] \r\n[\nCode\n] \r\n[\nSupp\n]\nServices\nArea Chair:\nCVPR@2026\nGuest Editor:\nSpecial issue of Electronics (ISSN 2079-9292),\nMachine Learning and Computer Vision for Image Processing and Recognition\nJournal Reviewer:\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP)\nConference Reviewer:\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\nInternational Conference on Learning Representation (ICLR)\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recogntion (CVPR)\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)"
