    "homepage_text": "Jun Zhou\nJun Zhou\nComputer Graphics Researcher\nShow Contacts\nEmail\njun.zhou@yale.edu\nPhone\n+1 (2**) ***-****\nLocation\nNew Haven, Connecticut, USA\nAbout me\nI'm a Postdoc Associate at the Yale Graphics Group, beginning in June 2024. My research primarily\n                    focuses on the virtual try-on system for jewelry using machine learning methods, under the guidance\n                    of Prof. Holly Rushmeier. Before joining Yale, I earned my PhD in Computer Graphics from the\n                    University of Groningen in 2023, where I worked with Prof. Jiří Kosinka and Prof. Jos B.T.M.\n                    Roerdink.\nProjects\nJewelry Relighting: Relighting Jewelry via Fine-Tuned Diffusion Models\nFunded by TATA & Yale\nPublications\nNumerical quadrature for Gregory triangles\nJun Zhou, Pieter J. Barendrecht, Jiří Kosinka\nJournal of Computational and Applied Mathematics, Volume 453, 1 January 2025, 116149\nJournal\nNumerical quadrature for Gregory quads\nJun Zhou, Pieter J. Barendrecht, Michael Bartoň, Jiří Kosinka\nApplied Mathematics and Computation, Volume 453, 15 September 2023, 128051\nJournal\nFeature-Adaptive\n                                and Hierarchical Subdivision Gradient Meshes\nJun Zhou, Gerben J. Hettinga, Sietze Houwink, Jiří Kosinka\nComputer Graphics Forum, Volume41, Issue1, February 2022, Pages 389-401\nJournal\nPresented the full paper(30 mins) in\nEUROGRAPHICS 2022\nConference\nSemi-Sharp Subdivision Shading\nJun Zhou, Jan Boonstra, Jiří Kosinka\nComputer Graphics and Visual Computing (CGVC) 2022\nConference\nPresented the paper(15 mins) in\nComputer Graphics & Visual Computing Conference\n                                2022\nConference\nSubdivision Shading for Catmull-Clark and Loop Subdivision Surfaces with Semi-Sharp\n                                Creases\nJun Zhou, Jan Boonstra, Jiří Kosinka\nComputers 2023, 12(4), 85\nJournal\nPosters\nJun Zhou, Kuanhao He, Jiří Kosinka\nNWO ICT.OPEN2023\nConference\nDaniel lewis\n14 June, 2021\nRichard was hired to create a corporate identity. We were very pleased with the work\n                                done. She has a\n                                lot of experience\n                                and is very concerned about the needs of client. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, ullamcous\n                                cididt\n                                consectetur adipiscing\n                                elit, seds do et eiusmod tempor incididunt ut laborels dolore magnarels alia.\nResume\nEducation\nPhD of Science in Computer Graphics\nUniversity of Groningen, Groningen, the Netherlands\n11 2019-11 2023\nThesis title: Selected applications of subdivision surfaces and numerical quadratures for\n                            Gregory patches\nMaster of Science in Computer Science\nNortheastern University, Boston, MA, USA\n09 2011-05 2013\nTeaching Assistant of Object-Oriented Design\nProgramming Design Paradigm, Algorithm, Management of Software Engineering, Networks,\n                            Machine Learning, Artificial\n                            Intelligence, Computer Graphics, Mobile Development\nBachelor of Engineering in Software Engineering\nBeijing Jiaotong University, Beijing, China\n09 2007-06 2011\nCalculus, Further Mathematics, Data Structure, Database, Operating System, C (programming\n                            language), C++, J2EE, Distributed\n                            Systems, Software Architecture\nExperience\nPostdoc Associate\nYale University, New Haven, CT, USA\n6 2024-Present\nVirtual try-on system for jewelry using diffusion methods.\nBlogs\nAll\nWeb design\nApplications\nWeb development\nSelect category\nAll\nWeb design\nApplications\nWeb development\nFinance\nWeb development\nOrizon\nWeb development\nFundo\nWeb design\nBrawlhalla\nApplications\nDSM.\nWeb design\nMetaSpark\nWeb design\nSummary\nWeb development\nTask Manager\nApplications\nArrival\nWeb development\nBlog\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nGregory Patch\nVeritatis et quasi architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt, explicabo.\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nBest fonts every designer\nSed ut perspiciatis, nam libero tempore, cum soluta nobis est eligendi.\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nDesign digest #80\nExcepteur sint occaecat cupidatat no proident, quis nostrum exercitationem ullam\n                                    corporis suscipit.\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nUI interactions of the week\nEnim ad minim veniam, consectetur adipiscing elit, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco\n                                    laboris nisi.\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nThe forgotten art of spacing\nMaxime placeat, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.\nDesign\nFab 23, 2022\nDesign digest #79\nOptio cumque nihil impedit uo minus quod maxime placeat, velit esse cillum.\nContact\nContact Form\nSend Message"
