    "homepage_text": "JAEBEOM LEE, KRISS - Jaebeom Lee\nJAEBEOM LEE, KRISS\nJaebeom Lee\nMembers\nResearch Projects\nPublications\nResearch Interest\nInvited Talks\nJaebeom Lee, Ph.D.\nSenior Research Scientist\n(선임연구원)\n​Nondestructive Metrology Group\n(비파괴측정그룹),\nDivision of Physical Metrology\n(물리측정본부)\n,\nKorea Research Institute of Standards and Science\n(\nKRISS, 한국표준과학연구원\n)\n​\nAssistant Professor\n(조교수)\n​Measurement Engineering\n(계측공학전공),\nUniversity of Science and Technology\n(\nUST, 국가연구소대학교\n)\n​\nVisiting Professor\n(객원교수)\n​School of Mechanical Engineering\n(기계공학부),\nKorea University\n(\n고려대학교\n)\nE-mail:\n[email protected]\n,\n[email protected]\nTel:\n+82-42-868-5329\nCurriculum Vitae (CV)\nEducation\n​​\nPh.D. in Disaster Management Engineering\n(2015.08-2020.08)\n@ Ulsan National Institute of Science and Technology (\nUNIST\n)​\nDissertation: Probabilistic Assessment of Bridge Safety by Integrating Measurements with Computational Simulations.\nB.S. in Urban Infrastructure Engineering & Disaster Management Engineering\n(2011.03-2015.08)\n@ Ulsan National Institute of Science and Technology (\nUNIST\n)​\nHonors / Awards\nExcellent Paper Award\n(2025.11) (Advisee, Mr. Chanwon PARK)\n@ 2025 Academic Symposium of Computational Structural Engineering Institute of Korea\nBest Poster Award\n(2025.08) (Advisee, Mr. Jaehyeon KIM)\n@ 4th UST-KRISS School Conference (by University of Science and Technology)\nHEKI SHIBATA Early Career Award 2025\n(2025.08) (Advisee, Mr. Jingoo LEE)\n@ 28th International Conference on Structural Mechanics in Reactor Technology (by the International Scientific Committee of SMiRT-28; Toronto, Canada)\nBest Paper Winner\n(2024.01)\n@ The 3rd Young Engineers Colloquium in East Asia (by The International Association for Bridge and Structural Engineering; IABSE)\nExcellent Paper Award\n(2021.10)\n@ Korean Society of Civil Engineering 2021 Convention\nThird Prize\n(2021.01)\n@ 1st International Project Competition for Structural Health Monitoring (IPC-SHM 2020)\n\"Deep Learning-Based Anomaly Detection in Acceleration Data of Long-Span Cable-Stayed Bridges.\"\nBest Paper Award\n(2019.10)\n@ 2019 International Symposium on Sea-Crossing Bridges\nExcellent Paper Award\n(2015.10)\n@ Korean Society of Civil Engineering 2015 Convention\nSeismic Simulation Test Center Award\n(2015.07)\n@ The Seismic Structural Design Contest\nExcellence Award\n(2013.11)\n@ 2013 Ulsan Invention Contest\nExcellence Award\n(2013.03)\n@ App Development Contest for Technical Standards\n​\nFull Scholarship for Educational Expenses\n(2011.03-2015.02)\n@ Ulsan National Institute of Science and Technology (UNIST)\nExcellence Entrance Award\n(2011.03)\n@ Ulsan National Institute of Science and Technology (UNIST)\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started\nJaebeom Lee\nMembers\nResearch Projects\nPublications\nResearch Interest\nInvited Talks"
