    "homepage_text": "Zhihan Gao\nSearch\n高智涵\nPhD student\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\nBiography\nI’m currently a PhD candidate in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\n, under the supervision of\nProf. Dit-Yan Yeung\n. I obtained my Bachelor of Science degree in Physics from\nPeking University\n.\nInterests\nMachine Learning\nSpatiotemporal Modeling\nAI for Earth Science\nEducation\nPhD in Computer Science and Engineering, 2016 - 2024\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST)\nBSc in Physics, 2012 - 2016\nPeking University (PKU)\nFeatured Publications\nZhihan Gao\n,\nXingjian Shi\n,\nBoran Han\n,\nHao Wang\n,\nXiaoyong Jin\n,\nDanielle Robinson\n,\nYi Zhu\n,\nMu Li\n,\nYuyang Wang\nJuly, 2023\nIn NeurIPS 2023\nPreDiff: Precipitation Nowcasting with Latent Diffusion Models\nWe introduce a two-stage pipeline for probabilistic precipitation nowcasting. 1) We develop a latent diffusion model PreDiff. (2) We incorporate an auxiliary knowledge alignment mechanism, allowing the integration of domain expertise.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nPoster\nVideo\nZhihan Gao\n,\nXingjian Shi\n,\nHao Wang\n,\nYi Zhu\n,\nYuyang Wang\n,\nMu Li\n,\nDit-Yan Yeung\nDecember, 2022\nIn NeurIPS 2022\nEarthformer: Exploring Space-Time Transformers for Earth System Forecasting\nWe propose Earthformer with novel generic building blocks “Cuboid Attention” to explore the design of space-time attention for Earth system forecasting problems, and achieve SOTA performance on two synthetic datasets and two real-world benchmarks.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nPoster\nVideo\nRecent Publications\nQuickly discover relevant content by\nfiltering publications\n.\nVitus Benson\n,\nClaire Robin\n,\nChristian Requena-Mesa\n,\nLazaro Alonso\n,\nNuno Carvalhais\n,\nJosé Cortés\n,\nZhihan Gao\n,\nNora Linscheid\n,\nMélanie Weynants\n,\nMarkus Reichstein\n(2024).\nMulti-Modal Learning for Geospatial Vegetation Forecasting\n.\nIn CVPR 2024.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nDataset\nZhihan Gao\n,\nHao Wang\n,\nYuyang Wang\n,\nXingjian Shi\n,\nDit-Yan Yeung\n(2022).\nProbabilistic Continuous-Time Whole-Graph Forecasting\n.\nSIGKDD-MiLeTS 2022.\nPDF\nCite\nZhihan Gao\n,\nXingjian Shi\n,\nHao Wang\n,\nDit-Yan Yeung\n,\nWang-chun Woo\n,\nWai-Kin Wong\n(2021).\nDeep Learning and the Weather Forecasting Problem: Precipitation Nowcasting\n.\nDL4ES.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nTing Sun\n,\nLei Tai\n,\nZhihan Gao\n,\nMing Liu\n,\nDit-Yan Yeung\n(2019).\nFully Using Classifiers for Weakly Supervised Semantic Segmentation with Modified Cues\n.\narXiv 2019.\nPDF\nCite\nXingjian Shi\n,\nZhihan Gao\n,\nLeonard Lausen\n,\nHao Wang\n,\nDit-Yan Yeung\n,\nWai-Kin Wong\n,\nWang-chun Woo\n(2017).\nDeep Learning for Precipitation Nowcasting: A Benchmark and A New Model\n.\nIn NIPS 2017.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nPoster\nSee all publications\nContact\nzhihan.gao@connect.ust.hk\nGoogle Scholar\nGithub\nLinkedIn\nTwitter\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
