    "homepage_text": "Sitemap - Huangjie Zheng\nHuangjie Zheng\nResearch Scientist at Apple MLR\nFollow\nCupertino, CA, USA\nEmail\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nSemantic Scholar\nORCID\nSitemap\nA list of all the posts and pages found on the site. For you robots out there is an\nXML version\navailable for digesting as well.\nPages\nPage Not Found\nWelcome to Huangjie Zheng's Homepage\nArchive Layout with Content\nAwards & Honors\nPosts by Category\nPosts by Collection\nCV\nMarkdown\nPage not in menu\nPage Archive\nPortfolio\nPublications\nAcademic services\nSitemap\nPosts by Tags\nTalk map\nTalks and presentations\nTeaching\nTerms and Privacy Policy\nBlog posts\nJupyter notebook markdown generator\nPosts\nBlog Post number 4\nless than 1 minute read\nBlog Post number 3\nless than 1 minute read\nBlog Post number 2\nless than 1 minute read\nBlog Post number 1\nless than 1 minute read\nportfolio\nPortfolio item number 1\nPortfolio item number 2\npublications\nDescribing Geographical Characteristics with Social Images\nZheng H., Yao J., Zhang Y. (2017) Describing Geographical Characteristics with Social Images. In: Amsaleg L., Guðmundsson G., Gurrin C., Jónsson B., Satoh S. (eds) MultiMedia Modeling. MMM 2017. Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol 10132. Springer, Cham\nhttps://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-51811-4_10\nDegeneration in VAE: in the Light of Fisher Information Loss\nZheng, H., Yao, J., Zhang, Y., & Tsang, I. W. (2018). Degeneration in VAE: in the Light of Fisher Information Loss. arXiv preprint arXiv:1802.06677.\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1802.06677\nLearning and Applying Ontology for Machine Learning in Cyber Attack Detection\nZheng, H., Wang, Y., Han, C., Le, F., He, R., & Lu, J. (2018, August). Learning and Applying Ontology for Machine Learning in Cyber Attack Detection. In 2018 17th IEEE International Conference On Trust, Security And Privacy In Computing And Communications/12th IEEE International Conference On Big Data Science And Engineering (TrustCom/BigDataSE) (pp. 1309-1315). IEEE.\nhttps://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8456049\nUnderstanding VAEs in Fisher-Shannon Plane\nZheng, H., Yao, J., Zhang, Y., Tsang, I. W. & Wang, J. Understanding VAEs in Fisher-Shannon Plane. AAAI 2019.\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1807.03723\nPhase Collaborative Network for Multi-Phase Medical Imaging Segmentation\nZheng, H., Xie, L., Ni, T., Zhang, Y., Wang, Y. F., Tian, Q., Fishman E. K. & Yuille, A. L. (2018). Phase Collaborative Network for Multi-Phase Medical Imaging Segmentation. arXiv preprint arXiv:1811.11814.\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1811.11814\nElastic Boundary Projection for 3D Medical Imaging Segmentation\nNi, T., Xie, L., Zheng, H., Fishman, E. K., & Yuille, A. L. (2018). Elastic Boundary Projection for 3D Medical Imaging Segmentation. arXiv preprint arXiv:1812.00518.\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1812.00518\nNode Attribute Generation on Graphs\nChen, X., Chen, S., Zheng, H., Yao, J., Cui, K., Zhang, Y., & Tsang, I. W. (2019). Node Attribute Generation on Graphs. arXiv preprint arXiv:1907.09708.\nhttps://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/9229522\nMCMC-Interactive Variational Inference\nDownload\nhere\nExploiting Chain Rule and Bayes’ Theorem to Compare Probability Distributions\nDownload\nhere\nAlignment Attention by Matching Key and Query Distributions\nDownload\nhere\nA Prototype-Oriented Framework for Unsupervised Domain Adaptation\nDownload\nhere\nRepresenting Mixtures of Word Embeddings with Mixtures of Topic Embeddings\nDownload\nhere\nMixing and Shifting: Exploiting Global and Local Dependencies in Vision MLPs\nDownload\nhere\nCARD: Classification and Regression Diffusion Models\nDownload\nhere\nDiffusion-GAN: Training GANs with Diffusion\nDownload\nhere\nTruncated diffusion probabilistic models and diffusion-based adversarial auto-encoders\nDownload\nhere\nDR2: Diffusion-based Robust Degradation Remover for Blind Face Restoration\nDownload\nhere\nClass-Balancing Diffusion Models\nDownload