    "homepage_text": "Wuchen Li\nWuchen Li\nAssociate professor in Mathematics at\nUniversity of South Carolina.\nGoogle Scholar\nColloquia and RTG data science seminars\n.\nResearch news\nResearch Interests\nMathematical Data science; Numerical analysis; Scientific computing.\nOptimal transport/Mean field control/games; Information Geometry.\nResearch\nPublications\nSoftware\nTeaching\nTalks\nAbout\nHome\nTalks\nSoftware\nTeaching\nPeople\nAbout\n© 2020 Wuchen Li"
