    "homepage_text": "Yongrui Ma\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nYongrui Ma\nWelcoe to Yongrui Ma's Homepage\nFind me at:\nEmail\n|\nGoogle Scholar\nI am a second-year Ph.D. student at the Computer Science and Engineering Department of The Chinese University of Hong Kong, supervised by Prof. Jinwei Gu, and fortunately, I work with Prof. Tianfan Xue.\nI obtained my bachelor's degree from the\nNanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics\nin 2017 and my master's degree from McMaster University in 2019, supervised by Prof. Jun Chen. I then joined TETRAS.AI from the fall of 2019 to the fall of 2023 as a full-time computer vision researcher, proposing solutions for video quality enhancement. Our movie quality enhancement (video super-resolution and video frame interpolation) solution has been adopted by the China Film Group Corporation for high-quality movie production and has benefitted 100+ movies.\nPublications:\n*Ziran Zhang, *\nYongrui Ma\n, Feng Zhang, Jinwei Gu, Tianfan Xue, Shi Guo, \"\nFrom Sim-to-Real: Toward General Event-based Low-light Frame Interpolation with Per-scene Optimization\n\",\nSIGGRAPH Asia\n, 2024.\n* denotes equally contribution\n[\nPaper\n,\nProject\n,\n]\nYongrui\nMa\n, Shi Guo, Yutian Chen, Tianfan Xue, Jinwei Gu, \"TimeLens-XL: Real-time Event-based Video Frame Interpolation with Large Motion\",\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), 2024.\n[\nPaper\n,\nProject\n,\nVideo\n,\nDataSet\n]\nXiangyu Xu\n,\nYongrui Ma\n, Wenxiu Sun, \"Learning Factorized Weight Matrix for Joint Filtering\",\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2020.\n[\nPaper\n,\nProject\n]\nXiangyu Xu,\nYongrui Ma\n, Wenxiu Sun, and Ming-Hsuan Yang, \"Exploiting Raw Images for Real-Scene Super-Resolution\",\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n)\n, 2020.\n[\nPaper\n,\nProject\n]\n*Xiaohong Liu\n, *\nYongrui Ma\n, Zhihao Shi, Jun Chen\n, \"\nGridDehazeNet: Attention-Based Multi-Scale\n\",\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2019.\n* denotes equally contribution\n[\nPaper\n,\nCode\n]\nXiangyu Xu\n,\nYongrui Ma\n, Wenxiu Sun, \"Towards Real Scene Super-Resolution with Raw Images\",\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2019.\n[\nPaper\n,\nProject\n]\nProfessional Service\nConference Reviewer: CVPR, ECCV, WACV, ACCV\nJournal Reviewer: TPAMI\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
