    "homepage_text": "xujingwei | Profile | Xidian University Homepage\nXidian Meeting\nXidian Guide\nAbout\nHelp\nSearch\nHome\nLogin\nControl Panel\nAddBookMark\nxujingwei's MessageBoard\nxujingwei's Homepage:\nProfile\nChinese\nProfile\nProf. Jingwei Xu\nShool of Electronic Engineering\nAdd.:  No. 2 South Taibai Road,\nXi\\\\'an, 710071, Shaanxi,  China\nEmail: jwxu@xidian.edu.cn\nIntroduction\nHe received the B.S. degree and Ph.D. degree both from Xidian University, China, in 2010 and 2015, respectively.  He works in Xidian University after graduation. Now he is a professor in National Lab of Radar Signal Processing in Xidian University.\nHis research interests include radar system, array signal processing, space-time adaptive processing, multiple-input multiple-output radar, frequency diverse array.\nHe has published more than 200 journal and conference papers, with more than 40 papers published in IEEE Transactions.  The Google Scholar citation is 6000+.\nHe is leading  several national key research project with fund over 10 million.  Now in his group, there are one professor, one associate professor, one postdoc, and two research fellows.  He recruits Ph.D student and postdoc within electronical engineering, signal processing, and other relative disciplines.\n版权声明\n未经西安电子科技大学以及个人主页教师本人许可，不得复制、转载和传播本页内容，禁止用于任何商业用途。如需转载请征得主页所有者同意，并附上主页链接！\n更新\nCopyright © 2011-2026 Xidian University  ICP 021284(05016169)　Powered by\nXIDIANNIC\n&\nSEENIC"
  },
