    "homepage_text": "Guanzhi Wang | Research\nResearch Labs\nAll Research Labs\nSpatial Intelligence\nApplied Research\nAutonomous Vehicles\nDeep Imagination\nPublications\nAI Playground\nNew and Featured\nAI Art Gallery\nNGC Demos\nResearch Areas\nAI & Machine Learning\n3D Deep Learning\nComputer Vision\nRobotics\nAll Areas\nCareers\nAcademic Collaborations\nGovernment Collaborations\nGraduate Fellowship\nInternships\nResearch Openings\nResearch Scientists\nMeet the Team\nLicensing\nSkip to main content\nSearch\nSearch\nEnter the terms you wish to search for.\nPeople\nGuanzhi Wang\nResearch Area(s)\nArtificial Intelligence and Machine Learning\nGenerative AI\nRobotics\nMain Field of Interest\nArtificial Intelligence and Machine Learning\nGoogle Scholar\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=QDmEj4MAAAAJ&hl=en"
