    "homepage_text": "Si-Qi Liu's Homepage\nWelcome to\nSi-Qi Liu's Homepage\nI am a Professor at the Department of Mathematical Sciences, Tsinghua University,\n                        P. R. China.\n                        I work on classification of integrable evolutionary partial differential equations\n                        under the action of various coordinate transformations, and the applications of the\n                        corresponding classification theorems to other areas in mathematical physics, such\n                        as the Gromov-Witten invariants theory, singularity theory, and so on.\nAbout Me »\nResearch Papers »\nCourse Notes »\nMiscellaneous »"
  },
  "serper::Zijian Zhang": {
