    "homepage_text": "Publications | Homepage\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nResearcher & Entrepreneur\nRui Mao's Homepage\nPUBLICATIONS\n“My expedition is the sea of stars.”\nJournal Papers\nMao R.\n, Liu Q., He K., Li W., Cambria E. (2023). The Biases of Pre-trained Language Models: An Empirical\nStudy on Prompt-based Sentiment Analysis and Emotion Detection.\nIEEE Transactions on Affective Computing\n. [\npaper\n]\n​\nLiu Q.,\nMao R.\n, Geng X., Cambria E. (2023). Semantic Matching in Machine Reading Comprehension: An\nEmpirical Study.\nInformation Processing and Management.\n60(2):103145.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\nMa Y.,\nMao R.\n, Lin Q., Wu P., Cambria E. (2023). Multi-source Aggregated Classification for Stock PriceMovement Prediction.\nInformation Fusion.\n91:515-528.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\nLin Q.,\nMao R.\n, Liu J., Xu F., Cambria E. (2023\n). Fusing Topology Contexts and Logical Rules in Language\nModels for Knowledge Graph Completion.\nInformation Fusion.\n90:253-264.\n[\npap\ner\n]\n​\nHe K., Huang Y.,\nMao R.\n, Gong T., Li C., Cambria E. (2023\n). Virtual Prompt Pre-training for Prototype-based\nFew-shot Relation Extraction.\nExpert Systems with Applications.\n213:118927.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\nZhang X.,\nMao R.\n, Cambria E. (2023). A Survey on Syntactic Processing Techniques.\nArtificial Intelligence\nReview\n. 56:5645–5728. [\npaper\n]\n​\nLiu R.,\nMao R.\n, Luu A. T., Cambria E. (2023). A Brief Survey on Advances in Coreference Resolution.\nArtificial Intelligence Review\n.\n​\nHe K.,\nMao R.\n, Gong T., Cambria E., Li C. (2022). JCBIE: A Joint Continual Learning Neural Network for Biomedical Information Extraction.\nBMC Bioinformatics\n, 23:549.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\nMao R.\n, Li X., Ge M., Cambria E. (2022). MetaPro: A Computational Metaphor Processing System for Text\nPre-processing.\nInformation Fusion\n, 86-87:30-43.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\n​\n​\nHe K.,\nMao R.\n, Gong T., Li C., Cambria E. (2022). Meta-based Self-training and Re-weighting for Aspect-based\nSentiment Analysis.\nIEEE Transactions on Affective Computing.\n[\npaper\n]\n​​\n​\nConference Papers\nMao R.\n, Li X., He K., Ge M., Cambria E. (2023). MetaPro Online: A Computational Metaphor Processing Online System.\nIn Proceedings of ACL\n. (Demonstration Track)\n​\nNi J.,\nMao R.\n, Yang Z., Lei H. Cambria E. (2023). Finding the Pillars of Strength for Multi-Head Attention. In\nProceedings of ACL\n. (full)\n​\nLin Q., Liu J.,\nMao R.\n, Xu F., Cambria E. (2023). TECHS: Temporal Logical Graph Networks for Explainable Extrapolation Reasoning. In\nProceedings of ACL\n. (full)\n​\nZhu L., Li W.,\nMao R.\n, Pandelea V., Cambria E. (2023). PAED: Zero-Shot Persona Attribute Extraction in Dialogues. In\nProceedings of ACL\n. (full)\n​\nLi W., Zhu L.,\nMao R.\n, Cambria E. (2023). SKIER: A Symbolic Knowledge Integrated Model for Conversational Emotion Recognition. In\nProceedings of AAAI\n. (full)\n​\nLiu, R., Chen, G.,\nMao, R.\n, Cambria, E. (2023). A Multi-task Learning Model for Gold-two-mention Co-reference Resolution.\nProceedings of IJCNN\n. (full)\n​\nGe, M.*,\nMao, R.*\n, Cam\nbira, E. (2022). Explainable Metaphor Identification Inspired by Conceptual Metaphor Theory. In\nProceedings of AAAI.\n(full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nHan S.*,\nMao R.*\n, Cambria E. (2022). Hierarchical Attention Network for Explainable Depression Detection on Twitter Aided by Metaphor Concept Mappings.\nIn Proceedings of COLING.\n(full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nHuang Y., He K., Wang Y., Zhang X., Gong T.,\nMao R.\n, Li C. (2022). COPNER: Contrastive Learning with\nPrompt Guiding for Few-shot Named Entity Recognition.\nIn Proceedings of COLING\n. (full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nDuong C., Liu Q.,\nMao R.\n, Cambria E. (2022). Saving Earth One Tweet at a Time through the Lens of Artificial\nIntelligence.\nIn Proceedings of IJCNN\n. (full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nMao, R.\n, & Li, X. (2021). Bridging Towers of Multi-task Learning with a Gating Mechanism for Aspect-based Sentiment Analysis and Sequential Metaphor Identification. I\nn Proceedings of AAAI.\n(full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nMao, R.\n, Lin, C. & Guerin, F. (2019). End-to-End Sequential Metaphor Identification Inspired by Linguistic Theories. In\nProceedings of ACL\n. (full) [\npaper\n]\n​\nLi R., Li X., Lin C., Collinson M.,\nMao R.\n(2019) A Stable Variational Autoencoder for Text Modelling. In\nProceedings of INLG\n. (shot, best paper runner-up) [\npaper\n]\n​\nMao, R.\n, Lin, C. & Guerin, F. (2018). Word Embedding and WordNet Based Metaphor Identification and Interpretation. In\nProceedings of ACL\n. (full) [\npaper\n]\n​\n​​\n​\nWorkshop Papers\nCambria E.,\nMao R.\n, Liu Q., Han S. (2022). Sentic Parser: A Graph-Based Approach to Concept Extraction for Sentiment Analysis.\nIn Proceedings of ICDM Workshops.\n[\npaper\n]\n​\n​\nMao, R.\n, Chen, G., Li, R. & Lin, C. ABDN at SemEval-2018 Task 10: Recognising Discriminative Attributes using Context Embeddings and WordNet. In\nProceedings of SemEval-NAACL\n. [\npaper\n]\n​\n​​\n​\nbottom of page"
