    "homepage_text": "Xiu Su\nXiu Su 苏修\nMake it simple. Make it work.\nI am currently a full professor at Central South University. I obtained my PhD from the University of Sydney, majoring in artificial intelligence. My supervisers are\nChang Xu\nand\nShan You\n. Before that, I received my B.S and M.S degree at Tianjin University, advised by Prof. Xiaodong Chen. I also join a exchange program at Nankai University during 09/2012-09/2014.\nxiusu1994@csu.edu.cn\nGoogle Scholar\nResearch Interest\nMy primary research interests include Embodied Intelligence, Multimodal Large Models, AutoML, Computer Vision, and Machine Learning, covering topics such as Embodied AI, Multimodal Models, LLMs, detection, segmentation, transformers, diffusion models, and human-object interaction (HOI). I have published over 20 academic papers in top-tier AI journals and conferences, including TPAMI (Impact Factor: 26.7), CVPR, ICCV, NeurIPS, ICML, AAAI, SIGKDD, ECCV, ICLR, among others. I also serve as a long-term reviewer for leading conferences and journals in the field.\nI am actively recruiting motivated and diligent Ph.D./Master's students and Research Assistants. The lab is well-equipped with ample GPU resources and maintains deep research collaborations with prestigious universities worldwide, providing opportunities for students to pursue further studies at renowned international institutions. Please feel free to contact at xiusu1994@csu.edu.cn.\nNews\n[2026/02] One paper was accepted by Climate and Atmospheric Science(Nature Partner Journers, IF: 9.0)!\n[2026/01] Five papers were accepted by CVPR2026!\n[2025/11] One paper was accepted by Digital Medicine(Nature Partner Journers, IF: 15.1)!\n[2025/07] Three papers were accepted by AAAI2026, including two oral papers!\n[2025/07] Three papers were accepted by NIPs2025!\n[2025/07] Five papers were accepted by ACMMM2025!\n[2025/07] One paper was accepted by ICCV2025!\n[2025/07] Two papers were accepted by ICML2025!\n[2025/01] One paper was accepted by CVPR2025!\n[2024/12] Two papers were accepted by ICASSP 2025!\n[2024/11] Two papers were accepted by AAAI 2025!\n[2024/07] One paper was accepted by ACM MM 2024!\n[2024/06] One paper was accepted by ICML2024!\n[2024/05] One HOI and multimodal paper was accepted by NIPs2024!\n[Paper]\n[2024/01] Three papers were accepted by ICASSP2024!\n[2023/10] One GPT and diffusion paper was accepted by ICDM2023!\n[Paper]\n[2022/11] BCNetV2 was accepted by TPAMI!\n[Paper]\n,\n[Code]\n[2022/11] One paper worked on Adversarial Robustness was accepted by AAAI 2023!!\n[2022/09] We have published one paper worked on HOI and few-shot learning to NIPs2022!\n[Paper]\n[2022/08] One paper worked on corrupted images for boosting image inpainting is published to SIGKDD 2022!\n[Paper]\n,\n[Code]\n[2022/06] Vision Transformer Architecture Search was accepted by ECCV2022!\n[Paper]\n,\n[Code]\n[2022/06] ScaleNet was accepted by ECCV2022!\n[Paper]\n,\n[Code]\n[2021/07] We have relased a Channel Benchmark on the MobileNetV2 and ResNet space!\n[Github]\n[2021/07] We have relased the code for Vision Transformer Architecture Search!\n[Github]\n[2021/03] One paper about NAS were accepted to ICML 2021!\n[2021/03] We have released a NAS Benchmark on the one-shot MobileNetV2 space.\n[Github]\n[2021/03] Two papers about NAS were accepted to CVPR 2021!\n[2021/01] One paper about channel number search was accepted to ICLR 2021 as Spotlight!\nPublications\n2026\nA lightweight physics-aware framework for multi-scale marine heatwaves forecasting\nXiu Su\n, Yuemin Wu, Zhongze Wu, Yitian Long, Yichao Cao, Yue Liao, Xi Lin, Jun Long, Shuo Jiang, Shan You & Chang Xu\nXiu Su\n, Qinghua Mao, Zhongze Wu, Xi Lin, Shan You, Yue Liao, Chang Xu\nClimate and Atmospheric Science(Nature Partner Journers), 2026\n[PDF]\nUnlearning without Forgetting: Securely Removing Targeted Concepts from Large-Scale Vision-Language Open-Vocabulary Detectors\nZhongze Wu,\nXiu Su*\n, Feng Yang, Dan Niu, Shan You, Yueyi Luo, Jun Long\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2026\n[PDF]\nFedMOP: Achieving Enhanced Privacy and Performance in Federated Learning via Momentum Orthogonal Projection\nYunlong Zhao, Xiaoheng Deng, Hongyan Xu, Zhuohua Qiu, Xiaowen Hu, Shan You, Yi Chen, Chang Xu,\nXiu Su*\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2026\n[PDF]\nLocalizing, Structuring, and Rendering: Bridging 3D and 2D Vision-Language-Action Models for Robotic Manipulation\nYunlong Zhao, Xiaoheng Deng, Yichao Cao, Yi Chen, Xiangjian He, Shan You, Shuo Yang, Lei Fan, Fei Wang,\nXiu Su*\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2026\n[PDF]\nLearning Distribution-wise Foundation Prior Consistency and Instance-wise Style Calibration for Medical Image Generalization\nChuang LIU, Yichao Cao,\nXiu Su*\n, Haogang Zhu\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2026\n[PDF]\nAPEX: A Decoupled Memory-based Explorer for Asynchronous Aerial Object Goal Navigation\nDaoxuan Zhang, Ping Chen, Xiaobo Xia,\nXiu Su\n, Ruichen Zhen, Jianqiang Xiao, Shuo Yang\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2026\n[PDF]\nInjection without Distortion: Geometrically Constrained Knowledge Enhancement for Vision-Language Models\nZhongze Wu,\nXiu Su*\n, Feng Yang, Shan You, Yueyi Luo, Jun Long\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2026,\nOral\n[PDF]\nROVER: Robust Generative Continual Identity Unlearning against Relearning Attacks\nTairan Huang, Qiang Chen, Beibei HU, Yunlong Zhao, Hongyan Xu, Zhiyuan Chen, Yi Chen,\nXiu Su*\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2026,\nOral\n[PDF]\nMulti-Modal Style Transfer-based Prompt Tuning for Efficient Federated Domain Generalization\nYuliang Chen, Xi Lin, Jun Wu, Xiangrui Cai, Qiaolun Zhang, Xichun Fan, Jiapeng Xu,\nXiu Su*\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2026\n[PDF]\n2025\nLarge Language Models Driven Neural Architecture Search for Universal and Lightweight Disease Diagnosis on Histopathology Slide Images\nXiu Su\n, Qinghua Mao, Zhongze Wu, Xi Lin, Shan You, Yue Liao, Chang Xu\nDigital Medicine(Nature Partner Journers), 2025\n[PDF]\nUtilGen: Utility-Centric Generative Data Augmentation with Dual-Level Task Adaptation\nJiyu Guo, Shuo Yang, Yiming Huang, Yancheng Long, Xiaobo Xia,\nXiu Su\n, Bo Zhao, Zeke Xie, Liqiang Nie\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nL-MTP: Leap Multi-Token Prediction Beyond Adjacent Context for Large Language Models\nXiaohao Liu, Xiaobo Xia, Weixiang Zhao, Manyi Zhang, Xianzhi Yu,\nXiu Su\n, Shuo Yang, See-Kiong Ng, Tat-Seng Chua\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nOn the Stability and Generalization of Meta-Learning: the Impact of Inner-Levels\nWenjun Ding, Jingling Liu, Lixing Chen,\nXiu Su\n, Tao Sun, Fan Wu, Zhe Qu\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nCaDGS: Modeling Inter-Gaussian Mutual Information for Dynamic Novel View Synthesis\nYunlong Zhao, Xiaoheng Deng, Zhuohua Qiu, Feng Yang, Chang Xu, Shan You, Xiangjian He,\nXiu Su*\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (\nACMMM\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nGraph Unlearning Meets Influence-aware Negative Preference Optimization\nQiang Chen, Zhongze Wu, Ang He, Xi Lin, Shuo Jiang, Shan You, Chang Xu, Yi Chen,\nXiu Su*\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (\nACMMM\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nAddressing Granularity-induced Semantic Drift in OvOD via Graph-guided semantically consistent representation\nHongyan Xu, Zhongze Wu, Ang He, Xi Lin, Yi Chen,\nXiu Su*\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (\nACMMM\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nDualFPT: Handling Data Heterogeneity in Federated Prompt Tuning from both Generalized and Personalized Perspective\nYuliang Chen, Xi Lin, Chao Sang,\nXiu Su*\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (\nACMMM\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nIdentify, Isolate, and Purge: Mitigating Hallucinations in LVLMs via Self-Evolving Distillation\nWenhao Li,\nXiu Su*\n, Jingyi Wu, Feng Yang, Yang Liu, Yi Chen, Shan You, Chang Xu\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (\nACMMM\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nCounterPC: Counterfactual Feature Realignment for Unsupervised Domain Adaptation on Point Clouds\nFeng Yang, Yichao Cao,\nXiu Su\n, Dan Niu, Xuanpeng Li\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nTinyMIG: Transferring Generalization from Vision Foundation Models to Single-Domain Medical Imaging\nChuang LIU, Hongyan Xu, Yichao Cao,\nXiu Su*\n, Zhe Qu, Tianfa Li, Shan An, Haogang Zhu\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nStable Fair Graph Representation Learning with Lipschitz Constraint\nQiang Chen, Zhongze Wu,\nXiu Su*\n, Xi Lin, Zhe Qu, Shan You, Shuo Yang\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nVideoEspresso: A Large-Scale Chain-of-Thought Dataset for Fine-Grained Video Reasoning via Core Frame Selection\nSonghao Han, Wei Huang, Hairong Shi, Le Zhuo,\nXiu Su\n, Shifeng Zhang, Xu Zhou, Xiaojuan Qi, Yue Liao, Si Liu\nThe IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nHarmonizing for defect visibility with Fine-Grained Hierarchical Interaction Learning\nZhongze Wu, Yitian Long,\nXiu Su*\n, Yueyi Luo, Shan You, Jun Long\nInternational Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (\nICASSP\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nHieClip: Hierarchical CLIP with  Explicit Alignment for  Zero-Shot Anomaly Detection\nLiujie Hua,\nXiu Su*\n, Yueyi Luo, Shan You, Jun Long\nInternational Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (\nICASSP\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nPerturbating, Tuning, and Collaborating: Harnessing Vision Foundation Models for Single Domain Generalization on Medical Imaging\nChuang LIU, Yichao Cao, Yingying Zhang,\nXiu Su*\n, Haogang Zhu\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2025\n[PDF]\nSeeing Beyond Noise: Joint Grap