    "homepage_text": "Zhijie Deng's Homepage\nZhijie Deng (邓志杰)\nAssociate Professor, Ph.D. Advisor\nQing Yuan Research Institute\n&\nSchool of Computer Science\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nShanghai, China\nOffice: 剑川路930号A栋318C\nEmail:\nzhijied@sjtu[dot]edu[dot]cn\n,\ndengzhijiethu@gmail[dot]com\n[Google Scholar]\n[DENG Lab]\n[GitHub]\n[Zhihu]\n[X]\nBiography\nI am an Associate Professor at\nQing Yuan Research Institute\nand\nSchool of Computer Science\nat\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n. I obtained the Ph.D. degree from\nDepartment of Computer Science and Technology\n,\nTsinghua University\nin June 2022, under the supervision of\nProf. Bo Zhang\nand\nProf. Jun Zhu\n. Before that, I received the B.S. degree from\nDepartment of Computer Science and Technology\n,\nTsinghua University\nin 2017. I was a visiting scholar from July 2016 to September 2016 in\nMachine Learning Department\n,\nCarnegie Mellon University\n, advised by\nProf. Eric P. Xing\n.\nMy principal research interests lie in the development of machine learning and statistical methodology, spanning generative models, spectral methods, Bayesian inference, etc. The developed methods have been applied to scenarios such as image/language/video generation, Embodied AI, semi-/self-/un-supervised learning, PDE solving, uncertainty quantification, and trustworthy ML.\nOpenings\nI am looking for\ninterns\n,\nvisitors\n, and\npostdocs\nwho have a strong background in mathematics/physics/computer science and are eager to get involved in cutting-edge, fundamental AI research (especially in fields of\nmulti-modal generation\nand\nembodied AI\n). If you are interested, feel free to drop me an\nemail\n.\nSelected Publications\n[More]\n* equal contribution. † corresponding author.\nMulti-Modal Generation (with Applications in World Model and VLA)\nThink-Then-Generate: Reasoning-Aware Text-to-Image Diffusion with LLM Encoders\nSiqi Kou, Jiachun Jin, Zetong Zhou, Ye Ma, Yugang Wang, Quan Chen, Peng Jiang, Xiao Yang, Jun Zhu, Kai Yu, and\nZhijie Deng†\nMantis: A Versatile Vision-Language-Action Model with Disentangled Visual Foresight\nYi Yang, Xueqi Li, Yiyang Chen, Jin Song, Yihan Wang, Zipeng Xiao, Jiadi Su, You Qiaoben, Pengfei Liu, and\nZhijie Deng†\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, Denver CO, USA, 2026\nLoHoVLA: A Unified Vision-Language-Action Model for Long-Horizon Embodied Tasks\nYi Yang, Jiaxuan Sun, Siqi Kou, Yihan Wang, and\nZhijie Deng†\nThinking with Generated Images\nEthan Chern, Zhulin Hu, Steffi Chern, Siqi Kou, Jiadi Su, Yan Ma,\nZhijie Deng\n, and Pengfei Liu\nOrthus: Autoregressive Interleaved Image-Text Generation with Modality-Specific Heads\nSiqi Kou, Jiachun Jin, Zhihong Liu, Chang Liu, Ye Ma, Jian Jia, Quan Chen, Peng Jiang, and\nZhijie Deng†\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vancouver, Canada, 2025\nAdvancing Text-to-3D Generation with Linearized Lookahead Variational Score Distillation\nYu Lei, Bingde Liu, Qingsong Xie, Haonan Lu, and\nZhijie Deng†\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, Honolulu, Hawai'i, USA, 2025\nEfficient Language Generation\nDiffusion LLMs Can Do Faster-Than-AR Inference via Discrete Diffusion Forcing\nXu Wang, Chenkai Xu, Yijie Jin, Jiachun Jin, Hao Zhang, Kai Yu, and\nZhijie Deng†\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(ICLR)\n, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, 2026\nScaling Speculative Decoding with Lookahead Reasoning\nYichao Fu, Rui Ge, Zelei Shao,\nZhijie Deng†\n, and Hao Zhang†\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, San Diego, USA, 2025\nMatryoshkaKV: Adaptive KV Compression via Trainable Orthogonal Projection\nBokai Lin, Zihao Zeng, Zipeng Xiao, Siqi Kou, TianQi Hou, Xiaofeng Gao, Hao Zhang, and\nZhijie Deng†\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(ICLR)\n, Singapore, 2025\nAdaMOE: Token-Adaptive Routing with Null Experts for Mixture-of-Experts Language Models\nZihao Zeng, Yibo Miao, Hongcheng Gao, Hao Zhang, and\nZhijie Deng†\nFindings of\nEMNLP\n, Miami, USA, 2024\nCLLMs: Consistency Large Language Models\nSiqi Kou, Lanxiang Hu, Zhezhi He,\nZhijie Deng†\n, and Hao Zhang\nMLSys Young Professionals Symposium, Santa Clara, USA, 2024\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024\nOnline Speculative Decoding\nXiaoxuan Liu, Lanxiang Hu, Peter Bailis, Ion Stoica,\nZhijie Deng†\n, Alvin Cheung, and Hao Zhang†\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024\nDate-Efficient Learning\nWhich Data Attributes Stimulate Math and Code Reasoning? An Investigation via Influence Functions\nSiqi Kou, Qingyuan Tian, Hanwen Xu, Zihao Zeng, and\nZhijie Deng†\nAI for Math\n(AI4Math)\nWorkshop at ICML 2025\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, San Diego, USA, 2025\nNeural Eigenfunctions Are Structured Representation Learners\nZhijie Deng*\n, Jiaxin Shi*, Hao Zhang, Peng Cui, Cewu Lu, and Jun Zhu\nIEEE Transaction on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\n, 2025\nImproved Operator Learning by Orthogonal Attention\nZipeng Xiao, Zhongkai Hao, Bokai Lin,\nZhijie Deng†\n, and Hang Su†\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024 (\nSpotlight\n)\nTowards Accelerated Model Training via Bayesian Data Selection\nZhijie Deng*\n, Peng Cui*, and Jun Zhu\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, New Orleans, USA, 2023\nLearning Neural Eigenfunctions for Unsupervised Semantic Segmentation\nZhijie Deng\nand Yucen Luo\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, Paris, France, 2023\n[ArXiv]\n[code]\nNeuralEF: Deconstructing Kernels by Deep Neural Networks\nZhijie Deng\n, Jiaxin Shi, and Jun Zhu\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Baltimore, USA, 2022\n[ArXiv]\n[code]\n[slides]\nTalks\n自回归-扩散混合模型\n,\nAI TIME\n, 2025.11\n自回归-扩散混合模型\n,\nCSIG青年科学家会议2025扩散模型论坛\n, 2025.09\n自回归-扩散混合式大模型\n,\n机器学习与科学应用大会（CSML2025）\n, 20