    "homepage_text": "About me - Jianheng Tang’s Homepage\nJianheng Tang 唐鉴恒\nFollow\nHong Kong, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout me\n取法乎上, 仅得其中. Shoot for the moon, land among the stars.\nI am a final year PhD candidate at\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology(HKUST)\n, advised by\nProf. Jia Li\nand\nProf. Xiaofang Zhou\n.\nPreviously, I received my MPhil degree from the Sun Yat-sen University in 2021, where I was fortunate to be advised by\nProf. Xiaodan Liang\n. I obtained my bachelor degree in Mathematics from Soochow University in 2019. I interned at Tencent AI Lab, Tencent Jarvis Lab, and Deep Graph Library team from Amazon Web Services Shanghai AI Lab.\nI’m looking for full time opportunities: feel free to\ncontact me\n(sqrt3tjh AT gmail DOT com; or\nWeChat\n) if you have any job recommendations.\nMy Research\nPlease refer to my\nGoogle Scholar\nfor a complete pubilication list. Feel free to contact me if you have any questions about my research.\nLearning Similarities and Anomalies on Graphs\nGADBench: Revisiting and Benchmarking Supervised Graph Anomaly Detection\n[paper]\n[slides]\n[talk (Chinese)]\n[talk (English)]\nGADBench\nJianheng Tang\n, Fengrui Hua, Ziqi Gao, Peilin Zhao, Jia Li\nNeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks Track\nRethinking Graph Neural Networks for Anomaly Detection\n[paper]\n[slides]\n[media (Chinese)]\n[talk (Chinese)]\n[talk (English)]\nRethinking-Anomaly-Detection\nJianheng Tang\n, Jiajin Li, Ziqi Gao, Jia Li\nICML 2022\nA Fused Gromov-Wasserstein Framework for Unsupervised Knowledge Graph Entity Alignment\n[paper]\nFusedGW-Entity-Alignment\nJianheng Tang\n, Kangfei Zhao, Jia Li\nACL 2023 (Findings)\nRobust Attributed Graph Alignment via Joint Structure Learning and Optimal Transport\n[paper]\n[slides]\nSLOTAlign\nJianheng Tang\n, Weiqi Zhang, Jiajin Li, Kangfei Zhao, Fugee Tsung, Jia Li\nICDE 2023\nA Convergent Single-Loop Algorithm for Relaxation of Gromov-Wasserstein in Graph Data\n[paper]\nGromov-Wasserstein-for-Graph\nJiajin Li,\nJianheng Tang\n, Lemin Kong, Huikang Liu, Jia Li, Anthony Man-Cho So, Jose Blanchet\nICLR 2023\nLanguage Model for Graph & Knowledge & Mathematical & Multimodal Reasoning\nEvaluating and Exploring Large Language Models on Graph Computation\n[paper]\nGraphArena\nJianheng Tang\n, Qifan Zhang, Yuhan Zhang, Nuo Chen, Jia Li\nGraphWiz: An Instruction-Following Language Model for Graph Computational Problems\n[paper]\n[media (Chinese)]\nGraph Reasoning LLM\nNuo Chen^, Yuhan Li^,\nJianheng Tang\n^, Jia Li\nKDD 2024 (^: Equal Contribution)\nGeoQA: A Geometric Question Answering Benchmark Towards Multimodal Numerical Reasoning\n[paper]\n[media (Chinese)]\nGeoQA\nJiaqi Chen^,\nJianheng Tang^\n, Jinghui Qin, Xiaodan Liang, Lingbo Liu, Eric P. Xing, Liang Lin\nACL 2021 (Findings)\nTarget-guided Open-Domain Conversation\n[paper]\n[slides]\nTarget-Guided-Conversation\nJianheng Tang\n, Tiancheng Zhao, Chenyan Xiong, Xiaodan Liang, Eric P. Xing, Zhiting Hu\nACL 2019 (Oral)\nOther Publications\nUniGAD: Unifying Multi-level Graph Anomaly Detection\nYiqing Lin,\nJianheng Tang\n, Chenyi Zi, H. Vicky Zhao, Yuan Yao, Jia Li\nNeurIPS 2024\n4DBInfer: A 4D Benchmarking Toolbox for Graph-Centric Predictive Modeling on Relational DBs\n[paper]\nmulti-table-benchmark\nMinjie Wang, Quan Gan, David Wipf, Zhenkun Cai, Ning Li,\nJianheng Tang\n, and 14 authors\nNeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks Track\nGalaxybase: A High Performance Native Distributed Graph Database for HTAP\n[paper]\n[website]\nBing Tong, Yan Zhou, Chen Zhang,\nJianheng Tang\n, and 7 authors\nVLDB 2024 Industrial Track\nGCoder: Improving Large Language Model for Generalized Graph Problem Solving\n[paper]\nGCoder\nQifan Zhang, Xiaobin Hong,\nJianheng Tang\n, Nuo Chen, Yuhan Li, Wenzhong Li, Jing Tang, Jia Li\nPreprint\nDeepIC3: Guiding IC3 Algorithms by Graph Neural Network Clause Prediction\n[paper]\nAIG2INV\nGuangyu Hu,\nJianheng Tang\n, Changyuan Yu, Wei Zhang, Hongce Zhang\nASP-DAC 2024\nOutlier-Robust Gromov Wasserstein for Graph Data\n[paper]\nOutlier-Robust-GW\nLemin Kong, Jiajin Li,\nJianheng Tang\n, Anthony Man-Cho So*\nNeurIPS 2023 (Spotlight)\nMedDG: An Entity-Centric Medical Consultation Dataset for Entity-Aware Medical Dialogue Generation\n[paper]\nMedDG\nWenge Liu^,\nJianheng Tang^\n, Yi Cheng^, Wenjie Li, Yefeng Zheng, Xiaodan Liang\nNLPCC 2022\n“My nose is running.”“Are you also coughing?”: Building A Medical Diagnosis Agent with Interpretable Inquiry Logics\n[paper]\nBR-Agent\nWenge Liu, Yi Cheng, Hao Wang,\nJianheng Tang\n, Yafei Liu, Ruihui Zhao, Wenjie Li, Yefeng Zheng, Xiaodan Liang\nIJCAI 2022\nHeterogeneous graph reasoning for knowledge-grounded medical dialogue system\n[paper]\nWenge Liu,\nJianheng Tang\n, Xiaodan Liang, Qingling Cai\nNeuroComputing 2021\nNeural-Symbolic Solver for Math Word Problems with Auxiliary Tasks\n[paper]\nNS-Solver\nJinghui Qin, Xiaodan Liang, Yining Hong,\nJianheng Tang\n, Liang Lin\nACL 2021\nDynamic Knowledge Routing Network For Target-Guided Open-Domain Conversation\n[paper]\nTGODC-DKRN\nJinghui Qin, Zheng Ye,\nJianheng Tang\n, Xiaodan Liang\nAAAI 2020\nEnd-to-End Knowledge-Routed Relational Dialogue System for Automatic Diagnosis\n[paper]\nMedical_DS\nLin Xu, Qixian Zhou, Ke Gong, Xiaodan Liang,\nJianheng Tang\n, Liang Lin\nAAAI 2019 (Oral)"
