    "homepage_text": "Yang He Lab\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nYang He Lab\nLaboratory of Neural Regulation of Homeostasis\nAbout the lab\nThe research in the lab is primarily focused on understanding how the brain senses and integrates internal and external signals to maintain energy balance and physiological stability. Our research focuses on dissecting the neural circuits and molecular pathways that govern fundamental processes, such as feeding, thermoregulation, and immune function.\nBaylor College of Medicine\nJan and Dan Duncan Neurological Research Institute\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
