    "homepage_text": "Zhoutong Zhang\nZhoutong Zhang\nFollow\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nProjects\nProject Indigo: Experimental Camera App for iOS\nProject Indigo ranked #5 in top free video & photo apps in the US 1 week after\n                    launch, got 1M downloads in 4 weeks, without any marketing budget.\nI became a core full-stack dev for project indigo shortly after I joined Adobe, working on R&D, UI/UX,\n                  camera control, image processing pipeline, CI/CD, analytics, and more. In short, I worked on whatever\n                  is needed to ship given limited resources. Happy to share more stories over a drink in person ;)\nAppStore\n|\nThe\n                    Verge\n|\nPetaPixel\n|\nWaveform Clips\nResearch"
