    "homepage_text": "Guan'an Wang (王贯安) Homepage\nGuanan Wang (王贯安) Homepage\nGuan'an Wang (王贯安)\nPh.D.\n[Email]\n[DBLP]\n[Google Scholar]\n[Github]\n[Resume]\n[WeChat]\nAbout Me\nI received my Ph.D. degree from\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(CASIA) advised by Prof. Zengguang Hou (IEEE Fellow) and Prof.\nJian Cheng\nin 2021. Before that, I received my bachelor's degree from\nCentral South Unversity\n(CSU) in 2015. I visited to\nQueen Mary University of London\n(QMUL) and was advised by Prof.\nShaogang Gong\nfrom September 2019 to September 2020.\nMy research interest includes machine learning and pattern recognition, with focus on Person Re-Identification (Re-ID), Hashing, and Generative Adversarial Nets.\nI am looking for a Full-Time Job.\nNews\n09/2021: One paper accepted by\nTNNLS\n(JCR1, IF=8.793)\n03/2021: One paper accepted by\nICME 2021\n03/2021: One paper accepted by\nICRA 2021\n01/2021: One paper accepted by\nTNNLS\n(JCR1, IF=8.793)\n12/2020: We win 1st at NAIC2020 (ReIDTrack,\nHomePage\n,\nNews\n,\nSolution\n)\n09/2020: Our ReID ToolBox\nlight-reid\nhas been released\n09/2020: One paper accepted by\nACCV 2020\n07/2020: One paper accepted by\nECCV 2020\n04/2020: One paper accepted by\nIJCAI 2020\n03/2020: One paper accepted by\nNeural Network\n(SCI, IF=8.03)\n02/2020: One paper accepted by\nCVPR 2020\n11/2019: Two papers accepted by\nAAAI 2020\n10/2019: Visited to Prof.\nShaogang Gong\n, Queen Mary University of London, UK\n07/2019: One paper accepted by\nICCV 2019\n05/2019: One paper accepted by\nIJCAI 2019\n07/2018: One paper accepted by\nECCV 2018\nPublications(Confs.)\nFaster Person Re-Identification\nGuan’an Wang\n, Shaogang Gong, Jian Cheng, Zengguang Hou.\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), UK, 2020\n[PDF]\n[ArXiv]\n[Code]\nHigh-Order Information Matters: Learning Relation and Topology for Occluded Person Re-Identification\nGuan’an Wang\n*, Shuo Yang*, Huanyu Liu, Zhicheng Wang, Yang Yang, Shuliang Wang, Gang Yu, Erjin Zhou, Jian Sun.\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), Seattle, USA, June 2020\n[PDF]\n[ArXiv]\n[Code]\nCross-Modality Paired-Images Generation for RGB-Infrared Person Re-Identification\nGuan’an Wang\n, Tianzhu Zhang, Yang Yang, Jian Cheng, Jianlong Chang, Xu Liang, Zengguang Hou.\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), New York City, USA, February 2020\n[PDF]\n[ArXiv]\n[Code]\nRGB-Infrared Cross-Modality Person Re-Identification via Joint Pixel and Feature Alignment\nGuan’an Wang\n, Tianzhu Zhang, Jian Cheng, Si Liu, Yang Yang, Zengguang Hou.\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), Seoul, Korea, October 2019\n[PDF]\n[ArXiv]\n[Code]\nColor-Sensitive Person Re-Identification\nGuan’an Wang\n, Yang Yang, Jian Cheng, Jinqiao Wang, Zengguang Hou.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nIJCAI, Oral\n), Macao, China, August 2019\n[PDF]\nSemi-Supervised Generative Adversarial Hashing for Image Retrieval\nGuan’an Wang\n, Qinghao Hu, Jian Cheng, Zengguang Hou.\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), Munich, Germany, September 2018\n[PDF]\nEfficient Human Pose Estimation by Learning Deeply Aggregated Representations\nZhengxiong Luo, Zhicheng Wang, Yuanhao Cai,\nGuan'an Wang\n, Liang Wang, Yan Huang, Erjin Zhou, Tieniu Tan, Jian Sun.\nIEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo (\nICME, Oral\n), Shenzhen, China, May 2021\n[PDF]\nGroup Feature Learning and Domain Adversarial Neural Network for aMCI Diagnosis System Based on EEG\nChen-Chen Fan, Haiqun Xie, Hongjun Yang, ZhenLiang Ni, Zeng-Guang Hou,\nGuan'an Wang\n, Sheng Chen, Zhijie Fang, Shuyun Huang.\nIEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (\nICRA\n), Xi'an, China, May 2021\n[PDF]\nPyramid Attention Aggregation Network for Semantic Segmentation of Surgical Instruments\nZhen-Liang Ni, Gui-Bin Bian,\nGuan’an Wang\n, Xiaohu Zhou, Zeng-Guang Hou, Hua-Bin Chen, Xiao-Liang Xie.\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), New York City, USA, February 2020\n[PDF]\nBARNet: Bilinear Attention Network with Adaptive Receptive Field for Surgical Instrument Segmentation\nZhen-Liang Ni, Gui-Bin Bian,\nGuan’an Wang\n, Xiaohu Zhou, Zeng-Guang Hou, Xiao-Liang Xie, Zhen Li, Yu-Han Wang.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nIJCAI\n), Yokohama, Japan, July 2020\n[PDF]\nHorizontal Flipping Assisted Disentangled Feature Learning for Semi-Supervised Person Re-Identification\nGehan Hao, Yang Yang, Xue Zhou,\nGuan'an Wang\n, Zhen Lei.\nAsian Conference on Computer Vision (\nACCV\n), Kyoto, Japan, November 2020\n[PDF]\nPublications(Journals)\nAdversarial Binary Mutual Learning For Semi-Supervised Deep Hashing\nGuan’an Wang\n, Qinghao Hu, Yang Yang, Jian Cheng, Zengguang Hou\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\n2021, TNNLS, SCI, IF=8.793, JCR1\n)\n[PDF]\nCross-Modality Paired-Images Generation and Augmentation for RGB-Infrared Person Re-Identification\nGuan’an Wang\n*, Yang Yang*, Tianzhu Zhang, Jian Cheng, Zengguang Hou, Prayag Tiwari, Hari Mohan Pandey\nNeural Networks (\n2020, NN, SCI, IF=8.03, JCR2\n)\n[PDF]\nPixel and Feature Transfer Fusion for Unsupervised Cross-Dataset Person Re-Identification\nYang Yang*,\nGuan’an Wang\n*, Prayag Tiwari, Hari Mohan Pandey, Zhen Lei\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\n2021, TNNLS, SCI, IF=8.793, JCR1\n)\n[PDF]\nAcademic Services\nConference Reviewers:\nCVPR2021, ICCV2021, NeurIPS2021, MM2021, AAAI2021, IJCAI2021\nCVPR2020, NeurlPS2020, IJCAI2020, AAAI2020, MM2020, BMVC2020\nCVPR2019, AAAI2019, IJCAI2019\nJournal Reviewers:\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT)\nIEEE Transactions on MultiMedia (TMM)\nNeural Computing (NC)\nAwards\nFirst place\n(1/1500+) at 2020 National Artifical Intelligence Challgence (NAIC, ReIDTrack,\nHomePage\n,\nNews\n,\nSolution\n), 2020\nScholarship of State Scholarship Fund\nto the United Kingdom awarded by China Scholarship Council (CSC), 2019\nOutstanding Graduate\nof Hunan Province, China 2015\nOutstanding Graduate\nof Center South University, 2015\nMeritorious Winner\n(<10%) in American College Student Mathematical Modeling Contest, 2014\nFirst Prize\nin Intelligent Vehicle Contest of Hunan Province, 2014\nNational Scholarship\n(<5%), 2012，2014\nSchool Principal Scholarship\n(< 1%) in Center South University, 2012, 2013, 2014\nExperiences\nInvited Lecturer\nof\nthe GAN Theory and Practice\nin the online deep learning course"
