    "homepage_text": "MMT Lab\nJimin Xiao 肖继民\nProfessor,\nDepartment of Intelligent Science\nXi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University\nOffice:\nSD563 (SIP Campus-Science Building)\nEmail:\nJimin.Xiao@xjtlu.edu.cn\nPersonal pages:\nXJTLU Scholar\n,\nGoogle Scholar\nResearch Interests\nMy research interests primarily lie in the fields of computer vision and pattern recognition, with a specific focus on advancing technologies and methodologies in semantic segmentation,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpoint cloud analysis, referring expression grounding, and video object segmentation under various supervisory conditions, including weak, semi, unsupervised, and continual learning\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tenvironments, as well as domain-shifting and long-tailed scenarios. My comprehensive approach not only explores the theoretical underpinnings but also aims to enhance practical\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tapplications such as anomaly detection, person re-identification, and image super-resolution.\nNews\n11 papers are accepted to CVPR 2026, congrats to Bingfeng Zhang. Xiaolei Wang, Xianglin Qiu, Ziqian Yang, Yizheng Gong, Shuo Jin, Yuexin Wang, Yuhui Lin, Zhijin He.\n2 papers are accepted to NeurIPS 2025, congrats to Xiaolei Wang and Yuexin Wang.\n2 papers are accepted to ACMMM 2025, congrats to Qiyin Zhong and Siqi Song.\n4 papers are accepted to ICCV 2025, congrats to Jian Wang, Xianglin Qiu, Xiaolei Wang, and Shuo Jin.\n1 paper is accepted to TNNLS, congrats to Xinqiao Zhao.\n2 papers are accepted to CVPR 2025, congrats to Ziqian Yang and Jian Wang.\n1 paper is accepted to TPAMI, congrats to Bingfeng Zhang.\n1 paper is accepted to AAAI 2025, congrats to Xiaolei Wang and Xiaoyang Wang.\n4 papers are accepted to CVPR 2024, congrats to Bingfeng Zhang, Xiaoyang Wang, Xinqiao Zhao and Yizheng Gong.\n2 papers are accepted to AAAI 2024 and ICASSP 2024, congrats to Xinqiao Zhao and Wangyu Wu.\n1 paper is accepted to CVPR 2023, congrats to Xiaoyang Wang.\n2 papers are accepted to ICCV 2023, congrats to Xiaoyang Wang and Teli Ma.\n1 paper is accepted to IJCV in 2023, congrats to Bingfeng Zhang.\nCopyright© 2024 MMT Lab. All rights reserved."
  },
  "serper::Junchen Ye": {
