    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/junhao-zhang-70a600155/",
    "homepage_text": "Junhao Zhang's Homepage\nDavid Junhao Zhang\nPh.D. Student\nNational University of Singapore\njunhaozhang98 (at) gmail.com\nHello 👋!\nI am Junhao Zhang, a final year Ph.D. student at\nShow Lab\n,\nNational University of Singapore\n, working with\nProf. Mike Zheng Shou\n.  I obtained my Bachelor’s Degree of Engineering from Shandong University in June 2020.\nMy research interests now are video generative model and multimodal LLM , past synthetic data pretraining, network architecture and 3D point cloud processing.\nNews\n[Oct. 2023]\nCode and model weights of\nShow-1\nare released!\n[Apr. 2023]\nSearching for papers on video diffusion models? Check out our GitHub repo\nAwesome-Video-Diffusion\n.\nSelected Publications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nCVPR\nReCapture: Generative Video Camera Controls for User-Provided Videos using Masked Video Fine-Tuning\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Roni Paiss, Shiran Zada, Nikhil Karnad, David E. Jacobs, Yael Pritch, Inbar Mosseri, Mike Zheng Shou, Neal Wadhwa, Nataniel Ruiz\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2025.\nProject Page\narXiv\nICLR\nShow-o: One Single Transformer to Unify Multimodal Understanding and Generation\nJinheng Xie*, Weijia Mao*, Zechen Bai*,\nDavid Junhao Zhang*\n, Weihao Wang, Kevin Qinghong Lin, Yuchao Gu, Zhijie Chen, Zhenheng Yang, Mike Zheng Shou (* equal contribution)\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(ICLR)\n, 2025\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nICLR\nMixEval-X: Any-to-Any Evaluations from Real-World Data Mixtures\nRui Zhao, Hangjie Yuan, Yujie Wei, Shiwei Zhang, Yuchao Gu, Lingmin Ran, Xiang Wang, Jay Wu,\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Yingya Zhang, Mike Zheng Shou\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(ICLR)\n, 2025 (\nhighlight\n)\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nNeurIPS\nEvolveDirector: Approaching Advanced Text-to-Image Generation with Large Vision-Language Models\nRui Zhao, Hangjie Yuan, Yujie Wei, Shiwei Zhang, Yuchao Gu, Lingmin Ran, Xiang Wang, Jay Wu,\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Yingya Zhang, Mike Zheng Shou\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2024\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nIJCV\nMoonShot: Towards Controllable Video Generation and Editing with Motion-Aware Multimodal Conditions\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Dongxu Li, Hung Le, Mike Zheng Shou, Caiming Xiong, Doyen Sahoo\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\nProject Page\narXiv\nCVPR\nVideoSwap: Customized Video Subject Swapping with Interactive Semantic Point Correspondence\nYuchao Gu, Yipin Zhou, Bichen Wu, Licheng Yu, Jia-Wei Liu, Rui Zhao, Jay Zhangjie Wu,\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Mike Zheng Shou, Kevin Tang\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2024.\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nIJCV\nShow-1: Marrying Pixel and Latent Diffusion Models for Text-to-Video Generation\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Jay Zhangjie Wu, Jia-Wei Liu, Rui Zhao, Lingmin Ran, Yuchao Gu, Difei Gao, Mike Zheng Shou\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nECCV\nMotionDirector: Motion Customization of Text-to-Video Diffusion Models\nRui Zhao, Yuchao Gu, Jay Zhangjie Wu,\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Jiawei Liu, Weijia Wu, Jussi Keppo, Mike Zheng Shou\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2024 (\noral presentation\n)\nProject Page\narXiv\nCode\nECCV\nFree-Atm: Exploring Unsupervised Learning on Diffusion-generated Images with Free Attention Masks\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Mutian Xu, Jay Zhangjie Wu, Chuhui Xue, Wenqing Zhang, Xiaoguang Han, Song Bai, Mike Zheng Shou\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2024\narXiv\narxiv\nDataset Condensation via Generative Model\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Heng Wang, Chuhui Xue, Rui Yan, Wenqing Zhang, Song Bai, Mike Zheng Shou\narxiv, 2023.\narXiv\nICCV\nLabel-Efficient Online Continual Object Detection in Streaming Video\nJay Zhangjie Wu,\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Wynne Hsu, Mengmi Zhang, Mike Zheng Shou\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2023.\narXiv\nCode\nECCV\nMorphMLP: An Efficient MLP-Like Backbone for Spatial-Temporal Representation Learning\nDavid Junhao Zhang\n, Kunchang Li, Yali Wang, Yunpeng Chen, Shashwat Chandra, Yu Qiao, Luoqi Liu, Mike Zheng Shou\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n, 2022.\narXiv\nCode\nCVPR\nDual-AI: Dual-path Actor Interaction Learning for Group Activity Recognition\nMingfei Han*,\nDavid Junhao Zhang*\n, Yali Wang, Ruiyan, Lina Yao, Xiaojun Chang and Yu Qiao (* equal contribution)\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2022 (\noral presentation\n)\narXiv\nTIP\nLearning Dynamical Human-Joint Affinity for 3D Pose Estimation in Videos\nJunhao Zhang*\n, Yali Wang, Zhipeng Zhou, Tianyu Luan, Zhe Wang, Yu Qiao\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n(TIP)\n, 2023\narXiv\nAAAI\nLearning Geometric Disentangled Representation for Complementary Understanding of 3D Object Pointcloud\nMutian Xu*,\nJunhao Zhang*\n, Zhipeng Zhou, Mingye Xu, Xiaojuan Qi and Yu Qiao (* equal contribution)\nThe AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2021.\narXiv\nCode\nAAAI\nPC-HMR: Pose Calibration for Human Mesh Recovery\nTianyu Luan*, Yali Wang*,\nJunhao Zhang*\n, Zhe Wang, Zhipeng Zhou and Yu Qiao (* equal contribution)\nThe AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2021.\narXiv\nServices\nConference Reviewers\nCVPR, ICCV, ECCV, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, AAAI, SIGGRAPH\nJournal Reviewers\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\n© David Zhang, 2023"
