    "homepage_text": "Mingye Xu (徐名业)\nContact\nAssistants\nPapers\nNews\nHome\nMingye Xu （徐名业)\nPhD candidate\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences (UCAS)\nEmail:\nmy.xu@siat.ac.cn\nAbout Me (\nGoogle Scholar\n)\nI am currently a 5-th year PhD Candidate at University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, China, advised by Prof.\nYu Qiao\n. I will graduate in 2023. Now, I am fortunate to work with Prof.\nYu Qiao\nand Prof.\nYali Wang\nat\nMultimedia Lab\n(MMLAB) of\nShenzhen Institute of Advanced Technology\n(SIAT), Chinese Academy of Sciences.\nResearch Interests\nPoint cloud proccessing\n: point cloud classification, point cloud part segmentation, Large-scale point cloud semantic segmentation, unsupervised point cloud learning, point cloud completion, etc.\nNews\n2023.03: One paper was accepted by\nT-PAMI\n.\n2023.03: One paper was accepted by\nCVPR2023\n.\n2022.10: One paper was accepted by\nTII\n.\n2021.10: Rank\nSecond\nin the MVP completion track of the\nICCV 2021\n,  Workshop on\nSensing, Understanding and Synthesizing Humans. (Results: 1st:5.011 2nd:5.012 3rd:5.146)\n2020.12: Two papers were accepted by\nAAAI2021\n.\n2019.11: One paper was accepted by\nAAAI2020\n.\n2018.07: One paper was accepted by\nECCV2018\n.\nPublications\nCP3: Unifying Point Cloud Completion by Pretrain-Prompt-Predict Paradigm\nMingye Xu\n,  Yali Wang, Yihao Liu, Yu Qiao\nIEEE transactions on pattern analysis and machine intelligence(\nT-PAMI\n), 2023\n[PDF]\nMM-3DScene: 3D Scene Understanding by Customizing Masked Modeling with Informative-Preserved Reconstruction and Self-Distilled Consistency\nMingye Xu\n, Mutian Xu, Tong He, Wanli Ouyang, Yali Wang, Xiaoguang Han, Yu Qiao\nProceedings of the IEEE conference on computer vision and pattern recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2023\n[PDF]\nDual-Branch Deep Point Cloud Registration Framework for Unconstrained Rotation\nKexue Fu, Zhihao Li,\nMingye Xu\n, Xiaoyuan Luo, Manning Wang\nIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics(\nTII\n), 2022\n[PDF]\nInvestigate Indistinguishable Points in Semantic Segmentation of 3D Point Cloud\nMingye Xu\n*, Zhipeng Zhou*, Junhao Zhang, and Yu Qiao\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence(\nAAAI\n), 2021\n[PDF]\nLearning Geometry-Disentangled Representation for Complementary Understanding of 3D Object Point Cloud\nMutian Xu*, Junhao Zhang*, Zhipeng Zhou*,\nMingye Xu\n, Xiaojuan Qi, and Yu Qiao\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence(\nAAAI\n), 2021\n[PDF]\nGeometry Sharing Network for 3D Point Cloud Classification and Segmentation\nMingye Xu\n*, Zhipeng Zhou*, and Yu Qiao\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence(\nAAAI\n), 2020\n[PDF]\nSpiderCNN: Deep Learning on Point Sets with Parameterized Convolutional Filters\nYifan Xu*, Tianqi Fan*,\nMingye Xu\n, Long Zeng, and Yu Qiao\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), 2018\n[PDF]\nAwards\nScholarship of SIAT, Chinese Academy of Sciences, 2020/2021\nMerit student of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences (UCAS), 2019\nExcellent graduation Design of Chollege of Computer Science and Electronic Engineering, Hunan University, 2018\nScholarship of Chollege of Computer Science and Electronic Engineering, Hunan University, 2016/2017\nCCF software capability certification ranking Top 5% 2015\nResearch assistants\nLast Updated on 5th August, 2021"
