    "homepage_text": "Homepage - Pengfei Xu\nPengfei Xu\nAssociate Professor @ Shenzhen University\nI am currently an Associate Professor with the\nVCC group\nat Shenzhen University. Before joining SZU, I worked with Prof.\nChiew-Lan Tai\nas a Postdoctoral Research Fellow at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology, where I also obtained my Ph.D in Computer Science in 2015, under the guidance of Prof.\nChiew-Lan Tai\nand Prof.\nHongbo Fu\n. Before that, I received my Bachelor's degree in Mathematics from Zhejiang University in 2009. My research falls in Computer Graphics and Human-Computer Interaction, especially automatic or interactive visual content creation.\nI am currently looking for\nmaster\nand\nPhD\nstudents. Please feel free to contact me if you are interested in my research.\nL6-808-B, South Campus, Shenzhen University, China\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nAction required\nProblem:\nThe current root path of this site is \"\n\",\r\n            which does not match the\nbaseurl\n(\"\n\") configured in\n_config.yml\n.\nSolution:\nPlease set the\nbaseurl\nin\n_config.yml\nto \"\n\".\nEducation\nHKUST\nPhD in CSE\nFeb. 2012 - Jan. 2015\nHKUST\nMPhil in CSE\nFeb. 2010 - Jan. 2012\nZhejiang University\nB.S. in Mathmatics\nSep. 2005 - Jul. 2009\nExperience\nShenzhen University\nAssociate Professor\nAug. 2023 - Present\nShenzhen University\nAssitant Professor, Associate Researcher\nApr. 2016 - Jul. 2023\nHKUST\nPostdoctoral Research Fellow\nFeb. 2015 - Feb. 2016\nTsinghua University\nResearch Intern\nSep. 2009 - Jan. 2010\nNews\n2025\nOne paper has been conditionally accepted by IUI 2026\nDec 12\nTwo papers have been conditionally accepted by AAAI 2026\nNov 08\nJin Zhou's paper has been accepted by Pacific Graphics 2025\nAug 10\nHongliang's paper has been conditionally accepted by ISMAR 2025\nJul 28\nXin Hu's paper has been accepted by IEEE TVCG\nMay 16\nPublications\nMoGraphGPT: Creating Interactive Scenes Using Modular LLM and Graphical Control\nHui Ye,\nChufeng Xiao,\nJiaye Leng,\nPengfei Xu\n,\nHongbo FU\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2026\n[Paper]\nMoGraphGPT: Creating Interactive Scenes Using Modular LLM and Graphical Control\nHui Ye,\nChufeng Xiao,\nJiaye Leng,\nPengfei Xu\n,\nHongbo FU\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2026\n[Paper]\nAutoStructGUI: Bridging Design and Implementation of GUI through Structured Layout Generation\nJunquan Ren,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual ACM Conference on Intelligent User Interfaces\n2026\nAutoStructGUI: Bridging Design and Implementation of GUI through Structured Layout Generation\nJunquan Ren,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual ACM Conference on Intelligent User Interfaces\n2026\nStrokeFusion: Vector Sketch Generation via Joint Stroke-UDF Encoding and Latent Sequence Diffusion\nJin Zhou,\nYi Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n2026\n[Paper]\n[Project]\n[Code]\nStrokeFusion: Vector Sketch Generation via Joint Stroke-UDF Encoding and Latent Sequence Diffusion\nJin Zhou,\nYi Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n2026\n[Paper]\n[Project]\n[Code]\nSCORE: Semantic Collage by Optimizing Rendered Elements\nZefan Shao,\nJin Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n2026\nSCORE: Semantic Collage by Optimizing Rendered Elements\nZefan Shao,\nJin Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n2026\nGenFODrawing: Supporting Creative Found Object Drawing with Generative AI\nJiaye Leng,\nHui Ye,\nPengfei Xu\n,\nMiu-Ling Lam,\nHongbo Fu\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2025\n[Project]\nGenFODrawing: Supporting Creative Found Object Drawing with Generative AI\nJiaye Leng,\nHui Ye,\nPengfei Xu\n,\nMiu-Ling Lam,\nHongbo Fu\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2025\n[Project]\nSPLICE: Part-Level 3D Shape Editing from Local Semantic Extraction to Global Neural Mixing\nJin Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nProceedings of Pacific Graphics\n2025\n[Project]\nSPLICE: Part-Level 3D Shape Editing from Local Semantic Extraction to Global Neural Mixing\nJin Zhou,\nHongliang Yang,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nProceedings of Pacific Graphics\n2025\n[Project]\nMRPilot: A Mixed-Reality System for Responsive Navigation of General Procedural Tasks\nHongliang Yang,\nJin Zhou,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHongbo Fu,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nIEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality\n2025\n[Project]\nMRPilot: A Mixed-Reality System for Responsive Navigation of General Procedural Tasks\nHongliang Yang,\nJin Zhou,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHongbo Fu,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nIEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality\n2025\n[Project]\nStructLayoutFormer: Conditional Structured Layout Generation via Structure Serialization and Disentanglement\nXin Hu,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nJin Zhou,\nHongbo Fu,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2025\n[Paper]\n[Project]\n[Code]\nStructLayoutFormer: Conditional Structured Layout Generation via Structure Serialization and Disentanglement\nXin Hu,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nJin Zhou,\nHongbo Fu,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n2025\n[Paper]\n[Project]\n[Code]\nA General 2D Graphics Deformation Algorithm with Controllable Deformation Effects\nZhonghao Cao,\nPengfei Xu\n#\n,\nHui Huang\n(\n#\ncorresponding author\n)\nJournal of Computer-Aided Design and Computer Graphics (in Chinese)\n2025\n[Paper]\nA General 2D Gra