    "homepage_text": "Professor\nBIOMEDICAL CIRCUIT & SYSTEM LAB.\nHome\nLab News\nAwards & Etc\nPEOPLE\nProfessor\nResearcher\nRESEARCH\nResearch Details\nPUBLICATIONS\nJournal\nBook\nConference\nGallery\nPHOTO\nConference\nCONTACT\nHome\nLab News\nAwards & Etc\nPEOPLE\nProfessor\nResearcher\nRESEARCH\nResearch Details\nPUBLICATIONS\nJournal\nBook\nConference\nGallery\nPHOTO\nConference\nCONTACT\nBIOMEDICAL CIRCUIT & SYSTEM LAB.\nPeOple\nProfessor\nByunghun Lee (이병훈), Ph.D\nAssociate Professor,\nDepartment of Biomedical Engineering\nDepartment of\nElectronic Engineering\nDepartment of\nNanoscale Semiconductor Engineering\nDepartment of\nArtificial Intelligence Semiconductor\nEngineering\nHanyang University, Seoul, Korea\nOffice: +82-32-835-8766\nEmail: blee22 at hanyang.ac.kr\nGoogle:\nscholar.google.co.kr/citations?hl=ko&user=CQJzaI0AAAAJ\nProfessional Experiences\n​\n- Associate Professor, Hanyang University, Seoul, Korea (2025 - Present)\n- Assistant Professor, Hanyang University, Seoul, Korea (2021 - 2025)\n- Assistant Professor, Incheon National University, Incheon, Korea (2017 - 2021)\nEducation\n- Ph.D in Electrical and Computer Engineering, Georgia Institute of Technology, USA (2017)\n- M.S in Electrical Engineering, Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology (KAIST), Korea (2010)\n- B.S in Korea University, Korea (2008)\nResearch Interests\n- Brain Computer Interface (BCI) circuit and system\n- Low-power analog/mixed-signal IC design for IoT and biomedical/healthcare applications\n- Wireless power/data transfer, energy harvesting system design\nProfessional Activities\n-\nAssociate Editor,\nIEEE Transactions on Biomedical Circuits and Systems (TBCAS)\n-\nSpecial Session Chair,\nInternational Conference On Consumer Electronics (ICCE)/IEEE Asia\n, 2024\n- General Chair\n, IEEE PELS Workshop on Emerging Technologies: Wireless Power, 2020\n-\nGuest Editor\n, MDPI Sensors, Special Issue:\nRecent Advances in Wireless Power and Data Transfer System for Biomedical/Wearable/Healthcare Devices, 2022\n-\nGuest Editor\n, Frontiers in Human Neuroscience, Special Issue:\nMiniaturized Wireless Neural Interfaces and Their Assistive and Rehabilitative Approaches, 2020, 2021\n- Guest Editor\n, MDPI Electronics, Special Issue:\nWireless Power/Data Transfer, Energy Harvesting System Design, 2019-2021\n-\nReview Committee Member\n,\nIEEE Biomedical Circuits and Systems Conference (Bi\noCAS),\n2018, 2019\n-\n대한의용생체공학회 학술이사\n- 한국반도체학술대회 분과위원\n-\n대한\n전기공학회 무선전력전송 분과 운영위원\n- 대한 전자파학회 전파의료기기 연구회 간사\n-\n대한\n​\n정보통신설비학회 학술이사\n​\nAward\n-\n국가연구개발 우수성과 100선 부총리 겸 과학기술정보통신부 장관상 2025\n- 대한전기학회 하계학술대회 논문상 수상, 2025\n- Gold Prize in\nInternational Conference On Consumer Electronics (ICCE)/IEEE Asia\n, 2024\n- 한양대학교 신진연구자상(국제논문 우수 부문) 수상, 2023\n- BK21 3차년도 ENRICH IT AWARD 수상 - 글로벌 부분, 2023\n- 대한전기학회 제53회 하계학술대회 우수논문상, 2022\n- 한국정보통신설비 학회 우수논문상, 2021\n- Research Award from Incheon National University, 2020\n- Research Award from Incheon National University, 2019\n-\nThe 11th Samsung ElectroMechanics Best Paper Awards, Silver prize, Samsung ElectroMechanics, Oct. 2015\n- Honor for Academic Excellence from University of California, Davis. June 2007\n- Science and Engineering Scholarships for Outstanding Student, Korea Science and Engineering Foundation, Sept. 2006\nTechnical Transfer (기술이전)\n- KR10-2010-0019358: 발광 다이오드 구동장치\n- KR10-2010-0099802: 역률보상형 엘이디 조명장치\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started"
