      "wu_yuhuan@a-star.edu.sg"
    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/yuhuan-wu",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Hello, welcome to Yu-Huan Wu’s homepage! - Yu-Huan Wu\nYu-Huan Wu\nScientist at IHPC, A*STAR\nFollow\nSingapore\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nGitHub\nHello, welcome to Yu-Huan Wu’s homepage!\nYu-Huan Wu is a research scientist at Institute of High Performance Computing (IHPC), A*STAR, Singapore. Before that, he received his PhD from Nankai University in 2022. His research interests include object detection and segmentation, as well as related applications like medical imaging and autonomous driving. He published several research papers on top-tier journals and conferences like TPAMI/TIP/CVPR/ICCV.\n[New!] We are hiring! Currently, we welcome both short-term and long-term interns. Projects are related to, but not limited to, robust visual systems, efficient networks, and domain generalization. If you are interested in working with us and experiencing the top-tier research environment in Singapore, please send me an email with your CV.\n[Google Scholar]\n[Research Gate]\n[Email: wu_yuhuan [at] a-star.edu.sg]\nNews\n[2025/12] I received Singapore NRF Postdoctoral Award (NRF-PA) with 4-year full support\n[2025/11] We release\nRefOnce\nfor Ref-COD\n[2025/09]\nGAPNet\nis accepted by Machine Intelligence Research\n[2025/07]\nOffSeg\nis accepted by IEEE ICCV\n[2025/06]\nLRFormer\nis accepted by IEEE TPAMI\n[2025/02]\nRet3D\nis accepted by SCIENTIA SINICA Informationis\n[2025/01]\nSurvey of adversarial attacks\nis accepted by TNNLS\n[2024/12] I received Excellent PhD Dissertation Award (博士学位论文激励计划) from CSIG\n[2024/01]\nHATNet\nis accepted by Machine Intelligence Research\n[2023/12]\nSymFormer\n, the extension of our CVPR 2020 oral paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI\n[2023/03] I join IHPC A*STAR as a research scientist\n[2022/08]\nP2T\nis accepted by IEEE TPAMI\n[2022/08] We organized a\nWebinar\nat IEEE Signal Processing Society\n[2022/04]\nEDN\nis accepted by IEEE TIP\n[2022/03]\nBE-STI\nis accepted by IEEE CVPR\n[2021/12]\nMobileSal\nis accepted by IEEE TPAMI\n[2021/05] I join\nAlibaba DAMO Academy\nas a research intern\n[2021/03]\nDOTS\nis accepted by IEEE CVPR\n[2021/03]\nJCS\nand\nRDPNet\nare accepted by IEEE TIP\n[2020/09]\nLIID\nis accepted by IEEE TPAMI\n[2020/03]\nTBX11K\nis accepted by IEEE CVPR (Oral)\nProfessional Services\nJournal Reviewer: TPAMI, IJCV, TIP, Information Fusion, TCSVT, SCIS, JBHI, TCSS, Pattern Recognition, Neurocomputing, JVCI, MIR…\nConference Reviewer: CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, AAAI, IJCAI, PRCV…"
  },
