    "homepage_text": "LI XU - Homepage\nLI XU\nChairman & CEO, SenseTime Group Limited\nEmail: xuli[at]sensetime.com\nGoogle Scholar\nResearch Awards:\nTest-of-Time Award, SIGGRAPH ASIA 2024\nLi Xu\n, Qiong Yan, Yang Xia, Jiaya Jia, \"Structure Extraction\n            from Texture via Relative Total Variation\", SIGGRAPH ASIA 2012\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nmatlab code\n]\nTest-of-Time Award, SIGGRAPH AISA 2023\nLi Xu\n, Cewu Lu, Yi Xu, Jiaya Jia, \"Image Smoothing via L0\n            Gradient Minimization\", SIGGRAPH ASIA 2011\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nvideo\n]\n[\nsoftware (GPU enabled)\n][\nmatlab code\n][\nedge adjustment tool\n]\nBest Paper Award, NPAR 2012\nCewu Lu,\nLi Xu\n, Jiaya Jia, \"Combining Sketch and Tone for\n            Pencil Drawing Production\", NPAR 2012\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nslides\n]\nResearch work included in OpenCV Library\nvery fast\nweightedMedianFilter\n(CVPR'14, included in OpenCV since version 3.2.0 )\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\ncode\n]\nrollingGuidanceFilter\n(ECCV'14, included in OpenCV since version 3.1.0)\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nmatlab code\n]\nl0smooth\n(SIGGRAPH ASIA'11, included in OpenCV since version 3.1.0)\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nmatlab code\n]\ndecolor\n(ICCP'12, included in OpenCV since version 3.0.0)\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nmatlab code\n]\nOther topics\nDeep Learning for Complex Image Processing: \"Deep Edge-Aware\n            Filters\"  ICML'15\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\ncode\n]\nNatural Image Deblurring: \"Unnatural L0 Sparse Representation for\n            Natural Image Deblurring\", CVPR'13\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nsoftware\n]\nOptical Flow: \"Motion Detail Preserving Optical Flow Estimation\",\n            CVPR'10\n[\nproject\n][\npaper\n][\nsoftware\n]"
