    "homepage_text": "Longtian Qiu | PLUS\nSearch\nLongtian Qiu\nMaster Student\nShanghaiTech University\nI am the first-year Master student at ShanghaiTech PLUS Group, advised by\nXuming He\n. I received my undergraduate degree from ShanghaiTech University.\nInterests\nFew/Low-shot Learning\nVision Language Pretraining.\nPrompt Learning\nEducation\nMaster Program in Artificial Intelligence, 2022.9 - 2025.6\nShanghaiTech University\nBSc in Computer Science, 2018.9 - 2022.6\nShanghaiTech University\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
