      "zxsu@baai.ac.cn"
    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/kiwi12138",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Zixian Su's Homepage\nPublications\nNews\nBio\nZixian Su\nResearcher\nLife Simulation Research Center,\nBeijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence (BAAI)\nChengfu Road No.150, Beijing\nzxsu (at) baai.ac.cn\nzixian12138 (at) 163.com\nShort Bio\nI am a researcher at Life Simulation Research Center,\nBeijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence (BAAI)\n. I received my PhD degree from\nDepartment of Computer Science\n,\nUniversity of Liverpool\nunder the mentorship of Dr.\nXi Yang\n, Prof.\nKaizhu Huang\n, Prof.\nQiufeng Wang\nand Prof.\nFrans Coenen\n.\nMy research focuses on creating adaptable AI solutions that address real-world challenges, specializing in\ntransfer learning with applications in medical image analysis and autonomous driving systems\n.   To this end, I excel in devising algorithms that adeptly manage diverse datasets and unpredictable scenarios. Additionally, I thrive in collaborative environments, working with experts from multiple scientific disciplines to not only merge theoretical insights with practical implementations but also to significantly expand the reach and effectiveness of AI.\nResearch Interest\nTransfer Learning\nMedical Image Analysis\nAI4Science\nAutonomous Driving Systems\nTrustworthy AI\nNews\n[JAN. 2025]\nI join\nBeijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence (BAAI)\nas a researcher, working on medical image analysis and anatomical model construction for intelligent heart.\n[NOV. 2024]\nSuccessfully accomplished my PhD thesis defense!\n[JUN. 2024]\nHappy to join\nDuke Kunshan University\nto start my research intern.\n[DEC. 2023]\nOur paper\n\"Unraveling Batch Normalization for Realistic Test-Time Adaptation\"\nis accepted by\nAAAI2024\nas Oral (Top 10% among accepted papers).\n[AUG. 2023]\nOur collaborative paper\n\"Explore Epistemic Uncertainty in Domain Adaptive Semantic Segmentation\"\nis accepted by\nCIKM2023\nas Oral.\nPublications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nArxiv\nDecentralizing Test-time Adaptation under Heterogeneous Data Streams\nZixian Su*\n, Jingwei Guo*, Xi Yang, Qiufeng Wang, Kaizhu Huang\nPDF\nBibTex\nUnder Review\nArxiv\nNavigating Distribution Shifts in Medical Image Analysis - A Survey\nZixian Su*\n, Jingwei Guo*, Xi Yang, Qiufeng Wang, Frans Coenen, Kaizhu Huang\nPDF\nBibTex\nUnder Review\nAAAI2024\nUnraveling Batch Normalization for Realistic Test-Time Adaptation\nZixian Su\n, Jingwei Guo, Kai Yao, Xi Yang, Qiufeng Wang, Kaizhu Huang\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nPublished\nTNNLS\nSCMix:Stochastic Compound Mixing for Open Compound Domain Adaptation in Semantic Segmentation\nKai Yao, Zhaorui Tan,\nZixian Su\n, Xi Yang, Jie Sun, Kaizhu Huang\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished\nAAAI2023\nRethinking data augmentation for single-source domain generalization in medical image segmentation\nZixian Su*\n, Kai Yao*, Xi Yang, Kaizhu Huang, Qiufeng Wang, Jie Sun\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nPublished\nCIKM2023\nExplore Epistemic Uncertainty in Domain Adaptive Semantic Segmentation\nKai Yao,\nZixian Su\n, Xi Yang, Jie Sun, Kaizhu Huang\nProceedings of the 32nd ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished\nJBHI\nMind the gap:Alleviating local imbalance for unsupervised cross-modality medical image segmentation\nZixian Su\n, Kai Yao, Xi Yang, Qiufeng Wang, Yuyao Yan, Jie Sun, Kaizhu Huang\nIEEE Journal of Biomedical and Health Informatics\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished\nJBHI\nA novel 3D unsupervised domain adaptation framework for cross-modality medical image segmentation\nKai Yao*,\nZixian Su*\n, Kaizhu Huang, Xi Yang, Jie Sun, Amir Hussain, Frans Coenen\nIEEE Journal of Biomedical and Health Informatics\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nPublished\nMIA\nCrossMoDA 2021 challenge:Benchmark of cross-modality domain adaptation techniques for vestibular schwannoma and cochlea segmentation\nMedical Image Analysis\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished\nChin. Phys. B\nTopological Anderson insulator in two-dimensional non-Hermitian systems\nHongfang Liu,\nZixian Su\n, Zhi-Qiang Zhang, Hua Jiang\nChinese Physics B\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished\nChin. Phys. B\nDisorder induced phase transition in magnetic higher-order topological insulator:A machine learning study\nZixian Su\n, Yanzhuo Kang, Bofeng Zhang, Zhiqiang Zhang, Hua Jiang\nChinese Physics B\nPDF\nBibTex\nPublished"
  },
  "serper::Panqu Wang": {
    "homepage": "https://wpqmanu.github.io/",
