    "homepage_text": "Professor\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nMembers\nProf. Soohwan Song\n[\nCV\n] [\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nOffice\n:  Room No. 10108, New Engineering Building, Dongguk University\nE-mail\n:\nsongsh [at] dongguk.edu\nPhone\n: +82-\n2\n-\n2260\n-\n3765\nI am an assistant professor of the College of AI Convergence at Dongguk University.\nBefore joining Dongguk University, I was a senior researcher in Feild Robotics Lab. at Electronics and Telecommunications Research Institute (ETRI). Also, I was a postdoctoral researcher at KAIST. My research interests include Autonomous Robots, Motion Planning, Computer Vision, and Multi-Robot System.\nI received the B.S. degree in information and communication engineering from Dongguk University, Seoul, South Korea, in 2013, and the M.S. and Ph.D. degrees in computer science from the Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology (KAIST), Daejeon, South Korea, in 2015 and 2020, respectively.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
