    "homepage_text": "HE Zhiwei\nWelcome to the School of Ocean and Earth Science, Tongji University\nä¸­æ\nEnglish\nå¯¼èª\nHome\nAbout\nIntroduction\nHistory\nStructure\nAdministration\nContact Us\nPeople\nFaculty\nAdministrative Staff\nTechnical Staff\nAcademics\nBachelor Program\nMaster and PhD program\nPost-doctoral Program\nResearch\nStudents\nAdmission\ntju\n2021æ ç®\nTongji University\nAbout us\nPeople\nAcademics\nResearch\nContact\nNews\nMajor Programs\nResearch Highlights\nMedia\nPicture switching\nåèå±æµ\nä¸­æ\nEnglish\nnew people\nStudents\nAdmission\ntju\nbanner\nEvents\nQuicklinks\nåºé¨ä¿¡æ¯\näºç»´ç \nç½åé¾æ¥\nDISCOVER RESEARCH\nResearch Platform\nMajor Project\nAbout\nPeopleNew\nProfessor\nAssociate Professor\nAssistant Professor\nPostdoctoral researcher\nCHEN Lingdi\nTechnical Staff\nAdministrative Staff\nLocationï¼\nhomepage\n2021æ ç®\nPeopleNew\nPostdoctoral researcher\nHE Zhiwei\nHE Zhiwei\nQuicklinks\nImportant Reminder: 2020 Marine Scholarship of China opening for applications\nApplication for 2019 Marine Scholarship of China Begins\nAcademician Wang Pinxian Succeeded in Deep Submarine and Shared Important Scientific Findings\nAddress:1239 Siping Road, Shanghai 200092, P.R. China\nTel:+86-21-65981816\nÂ©2021 School of Ocean and Earth Science, Tongji University. All Rights Reserved."
