    "homepage_text": "Isabeau Prémont-Schwarz's Home Page\nIsabeau Prémont-Schwarz\nFaculty Lecturer\nSchool of Computer Science\nMcGill University\nOffice: 205N McConnell\nEmail: isabeau.premont-schwarz[at]mcgill.ca\n[expand]\n[expand all]\n[collapse all]\nTeaching\nApplied Machine Learning\nSyllabus for COMP 551 - Fall 2024\nSyllabus for COMP 551 - Winter 2024\nSyllabus for COMP 551 - Fall 2023\nReinforcement Learning\nSyllabus for COMP 579 - Winter 2025\nSyllabus for COMP 579 - Winter 2024\nComputer Programming for Physical Sciences and Engineering\nSyllabus for COMP 208 - Winter 2025\nSyllabus for COMP 208 - Fall 2024\nPublications\ngoogle scholar\n,\nsemantic scholar\nResearch Team\nMailing address:\nMcConnell Engineering Building, Room 318, 3480 Rue University, Montréal, Québec  H3A 0E9\nLast Modified:"
