    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/arash-ali-mahdavi-amiri-40319920/",
    "homepage_text": "Arash (Ali) Mahdavi-Amiri\nArash(Ali) Mahdavi-Amiri\n​I am an assistant professor in the\nSchool of Computing Science\n, Simon Fraser University, the director of\nMaster of Science in Professional Computer Science\n, and the Vice President Research at\nMARZ\n. \nI am also an associate editor of\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n.\nI lead and manage several industrial and research projects related to Computer Vision, Machine Learning, and Computational Fabrication. \nMy main research interest is Computer Graphics with specialty in Geometric Modeling, Digital Fabrication, Machine Learning, and Computer Vision. \nI have received several awards including\nNSERC Postdoctoral Fellowship\n,\n​J.B. Hyne Research Innovation Award\n,\nMichael A. J. Sweeney Award\n, and Teaching Excellence Award.\nPublications\nFor the complete list of papers, please check my\nDBLP\n.\nFor the complete list of patents, please check\nhere\n.\n2026\nArtiverse: A Diverse and Physically Grounded Dataset for Articulated Objects\nDenys Iliash\n,\nJiayi Liu\n,\n\t\t  Egor Fokin,\nQirui Wu\n, \n\t\t  Ali Mahdavi Amiri,\nManolis Savva\n,\nAngel X Chang\nCVPR, 2026\npaper\npage\nCREward: A Type-Specific Creativity Reward Model\nJiyeon Han\n,\n\t\t  Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\n,\nHaedong Jeong\nCVPR, 2026\npaper\npage\nAdvances in Neural 3D Mesh Texturing: A Survey\nSai Raj Kishore Perla\n,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\n,\n\t\t  Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nEurographics, STAR, 2026\npaper\npage\nMultiCOIN: Multi-Modal COntrollable Video INbetweening\nMaham Tanveer\n,\nYang Zhou\n,\nSimon Nicklaus\n, \n\t\t  Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\n,\nKrishna Kumara Singh\n,\nNanxuan Zhao\nEurographics, 2026\npaper\npage\n2025\nASIA: Adaptive 3D Segmentation using Few Image Annotations\nSai Raj Kishore Perla\n,\nAditya Vora\n,\nSauradip Nag\n,\n\t\t  \tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nSIGGRAPH Asia, 2025\npaper\npage\nIn-2-4D: Inbetweening from Two Single-View\nImages to 4D Generation\nSauradip Nag\n,\nDaniel Cohen-Or\n,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\n,\n\t\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri\nSIGGRAPH Asia, 2025\npaper\npage\nCora: Correspondence-aware image editing using few step diffusion\nAmir Alimohammadi\n,\nAryan Mikaeili\n,\nSauradip Nag\n,\n\t        Negar Hassanpour,\nAndrea Tagliasacchi\n,\n\t\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri\nSIGGRAPH, 2025\npaper\npage\n​pOps: Photo-Inspired Diffusion Operators\nElad Richardson\n,\nYuval Alaluf\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nDaniel Cohen-Or\nSIGGRAPH, 2025\npaper\npage\n​Survey on Modeling of Articulated Objects\nJiayi Liu\n,\nManolis Savva\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nEurographics, STAR, 2025\npaper\npage\n​SINGAPO: Single Image Controlled Generation of Articulated Parts in Object\nJiayi Liu\n,\nDenys Iliash\n,\nAngel X. Chang\n,\nManolis Savva\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nICLR, 2025\npaper\npage\n​GALA: Geometry-Aware Local Adaptive Grids for Detailed 3D Generation\nDingdong Yang\n,\nYizhi Wang\n,\nKonrad Schindler\n,\n\t\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nICLR, 2025\npaper\npage\n​SMITE: Segment Me In TimE\nAmir Alimohammadi\n,\nSauradip Nag\n,\nSaeid Asgari Taghanaki\n,\nAndrea Tagliasacchi\n,\nGhassan Hamarneh\n,\n\t\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri\nICLR, 2025\npaper\npage\n2024\n​EASI-Tex: ​Edge-Aware Mesh Texturing from Single Image\nSai Raj Kishore Perla\n,\nYizhi Wang\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nACM TOG, SIGGRAPH, 2024\npaper\npage\n​SweepNet: Unsupervised Learning Shape Abstraction via Neural Sweepers\nMingrui Zhao\n,\nYizhi Wang\n,\nFenggen Yu\n,\nChangqing Zou\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nECCV, 2024\npaper\npage\n​AFreeCA: Annotation-Free Counting for All\nAdriano D'Alessandro\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nGhassan Hamarneh\nECCV, 2024\npaper\npage\nCLiC: Concept Learning in Context\nMehdi Safaee\n,\nAryan Mikaeili\n,\nOr Patashnik\n,\nDaniel Cohen-Or\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nCVPR [Highlight], 2024\npaper\npage\nSlice3D: Multi-Slice, Occlusion-Revealing, Single View 3D Reconstruction\nYizhi Wang\n,\nWallace Lira\n,\nWenqi Wang\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nCVPR, 2024\npaper\npage\nCAGE: Controllable Articulation GEneration\nJiayi Liu\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nManolis Savva\nCVPR, 2024\npaper\npage\n​SLiMe: Segment Like Me\nAliasghar Khani\n,\nSaeid Asgari Taghanaki\n,\nAditya Sanghi\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nGhassan Hamarneh\nICLR, 2024\npaper\npage\n​​Learned Visual Features to Textual Explanations\nSaeid Asgari Taghanaki\n,\nAliasghar Khani\n,\nAmir Khasahmadi\n,\nAditya Sanghi\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nICLR,\nDPFM\n, 2024\npaper\npage\n2023\nBRICS: Bi-level feature Representation of Image CollectionS\nDingdong Yang\n,\nYizhi Wang\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\narXiv, 2023\npaper\npage\n​Counting Objects in Images using DeepLearning: Methods and Current Challenges\nAdriano D'Alessandro\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nGhassan Hamarneh\narXiv, 2023\npaper\npage\n​Cross-domain Compositing with Pretrained Diffusion Models\nRoy Hachnochi\n,\nMingrui Zhao\n,\n                Nadav Orzech,\nRinon Gal\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nDaniel Cohen-Or\n,\nAmit Haim Bermano\narXiv, 2023\npaper\npage\nD2CSG: Unsupervised Learning of Compact CSG Trees with Dual Complements and Dropouts\nFenggen Yu\n,\nQimin Chen\n,\nMaham Tanveer\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nNeurIPS, 2023\npaper\npage\n​Learning-to-Count by Learning-to-Rank\nAdriano D'Alessandro\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nGhassan Hamarneh\nCRV, 2023\npaper\npage\nDS-Fusion: Artistic Typography via Discriminated and Stylized Diffusion\nMaham Tanveer\n,\nYizhi Wang\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nICCV, 2023\npaper\npage\nSKED: Sketch-guided Text-based 3D Editing\nAryan Mikaeili\n,\nMehdi Safaee\n,\nOr Perel\n,\nDaniel Cohen-Or\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nICCV, 2023\npaper\npage\nPARIS: Part-level Reconstruction and Motion Analysis for Articulated Objects\nJiayi Liu\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nManolis Savva\nICCV, 2023\npaper\npage\nSAC-GAN: Structure-Aware Image Composition\nHang Zhou\n,\nRui Ma\n,\nLingxiao Zhang\n,\nLin Gao\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nTVCG, 2023\npaper\npage\nLarge-Scale Building Damage Assessment using a Novel Hierarchical Transformer Architecture on Satellite Images\nNavjot Kaur\n,\n\t        Cheng-Chun Lee\n,\nAli Mostafavi\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nComputer-Aided Civil and Infrastructure Engineering, 2023\npaper\npage\n2022\nMaskTune: Mitigating Spurious Correlations by Forcing to Explore\nSaeid Asgari Taghanaki\n,\nAliasghar Khani\n,\nFereshte Khani\n,\n\t      Ali Gholami,\nLinh Tran\n,\n\t      Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nGhassan Hamarneh\nNeurIPS, 2022\npaper\npage\nUNIST: Unpaired Neural Implicit Shape Translation Network\nQimin Chen\n,\nJohannes Merz\n,\nAditya Sanghi\n,\nHooman Shayani\n,\n\t         Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nCVPR, 2022\npaper\npage\nCAPRI-Net: Learning Compact CAD Shapes with Adaptive Primitive\nFenggen Yu\n,\nZhiqin Chen\n,\nManyi Li\n,\nAditya Sanghi\n,\nHooman Shayani\n,\n\t         Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nCVPR, 2022\npaper\npage\n​​Multimodal Shape Completion via IMLE\nHimanshu Arora\n,\nSaurabh Mishra\n,\nShichong Peng\n,\nKe Li\n,\n                Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nCVPR,\nDLGC\n, 2022\npaper\npage\n​​Method and System for Image Processing (Aging/Deaging)\nThomas Davies,\n\t      Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\n\t      Matthew Panousis,\n\t      Jonathan Bronfman,\n\t      Lon Molnar,\n\t      Paul Birulin,\n\t      Debjoy Chowdhury,\n\t      Ishrat Badami,\n\t      Anton Skourdies\nUS Patent, 2022\npatent\nvideo\n2021\n​​Data to Physicalization: A Survey of the Physical Rendering Process\nHessam Djavaherpour\n,\nFaramarz Samavati\n,\n\t        Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nFatemeh Yazdanbakhsh\n,\nSamuel Huron\n,\nYvonne Jansen\n,\nLora Oehlberg\nComputer Graphics Forum (EuroVis STAR), 2021\npaper\n​​RaidaR: A Rich Annotated Image Dataset of Rainy Street Scenes\nJiongchao Jin*\n,\nArezou Fatemi*\n,\nWallace Lira\n,\nFenggen Yu\n,\nBiao Leng\n,\nRui Ma\n,\n\t      \tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nICCV,\nAVVision\n, 2021\npaper\nWebsite\n​​RIAS: Repeated Invertible Averaging for SurfaceMultiresolution of Arbitrary Degree\nTroy Alderson\n,\n\t      \tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nFaramarz Samavati\n,\nTVCG, 2021\npaper\n2020\n​​VDAC: Volume Decompose-and-Carve for Subtractive Manufacturing\nAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nFenggen Yu\n,,\nWallace Lira\n,\nHaisen Zhao\n,\nAdriana Schulz\n,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nACM Transactions on Graphics, ​(SIGGRAPH Asia),2020\npaper\nvideo\n​​Portal: Design and Fabrication of Incidence-Driven Screens\nVahab Hosseini,\nUsman Alim\n,\n\t       Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nLora Oehlberg\n,\n\t      \t Joshua M. Taron\nShape Modeling International (SMI, FASE),2020\npaper\n​​PIE-NET: Parametric Inference of Point Cloud Edges\nXiaogang Wang,\n\t      Yuelang Xu,\nKai Xu\n,\nAndrea Tagliasacchi\n,\n\t       Bin Zhou,\n\t      Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nNeurIPS,2020\npaper\nproject\n2019\nGeospatail Data Organization Methods with Emphasis on Aperture 3 Hexagonal Discrete Global Grid Systems\nAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nTroy Alderson\n,\nFaramarz Samavati\n,\nCartographica, 2019\npaper\nGeospatail Data Organization Methods with Emphasis on Aperture 3 Hexagonal Discrete Global Grid Systems\nFaramarz Samavati\n,\n\t      Ali Mahdavi-Amiri\nUS Patent, 2019\npatent\n2018\nSemi-Supervised Co-Analysis of 3D Shape Styles from Projected Lines\nFenggen Yu\n,\nYan Zhang\n,\nKai Xu\n,\n\t      Ali Mahdavi-Amiri,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nACM Transactions on Graphics (TOG), 2018\npaper\npage\nhttps://github.com/FENGGENYU/proj_style\nConstruction and Fabrication of Reversible Shape Transforms\nShuhua Li, \n\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nRuizhen Hu\n,\n\tHan Liu,\nChangquing Zou\n,\nOliver Van Kaick\n, \n\tXiuping Liu,\nHui Huang\n,\nHao (Richard) Zhang\nACM Transactions on Graphics, SIGGRAPH, 2018\npaper\nvideo\nLandscaper: A Modeling System for 3D Printing Scale Models of Landscapes\nKamyar Allahverdi\n,\nHessam Djavaherpour\n,\n\tAli Mahdavi-Amiri,\nFaramarz Samavati\nComputer Graphics Forum (CGF), 2018\npaper\npage\nStudents\nCurrent Students\nJiyeon Han\n, Postdoc, co-supervised with Richard Zhang\nSauradip Nag\n, Postdoc, co-supervised with Richard Zhang\nJiayi Liu\n, PhD, co-supervised with Manolis Savva\nAmirhossein Alimohammadi\n, PhD\nCody Ning\n, PhD\nAmir Razlighi\n, PhD, co supervised with Yiorgos Chrysanthou at the University of Cyprus\nKian Izadpanah\n, PhD, co supervised with ...[truncated]"
