    "homepage_text": "Jun-Yi Hang @ PALM, SEU\nLinks\nGoogle Scholar\nJun-Yi Hang @ PALM, SEU\næ­åä¸\nJun-Yi Hang\nPh.D. Student\nPAttern Learning and Mining(PALM) Lab\nSchool of Computer Science and Engineering\nSoutheast University, Nanjing\nSupervisor\n: Professor\nMin-Ling Zhang\nEmail\n:\nhangjy@seu.edu.cn\nBiography\n2020.04 ~ Now\nPh.D,\nSoutheast University\n, China\n2017.09 ~ 2020.01\nM.Sc,\nBeihang University\n, China\n2013.09 ~ 2017.06\nB.Sc,\nBeihang University\n, China\nResearch Interests\nMachine Learning\nMulti-Label Learning\nPublications\nJun-Yi Hang\n, Min-Ling Zhang. Collaborative learning of label semantics and deep label-specific features for multi-label classification. IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, 2022, 44(12): 9860-9871. [\npaper\n] [\ncode\n]\nJun-Yi Hang\n, Min-Ling Zhang, Yanghe Feng, Xiaocheng Song. End-to-end probabilistic label-specific feature learning for multi-label classification. In: Proceedings of the 36th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI’22), Virtual Event, 2022, 6847-6855. [\npaper\n] [\nsupplement\n] [\ncode\n]\nJun-Yi Hang\n, Min-Ling Zhang. Dual perspective of label-specific feature learning for multi-label classification. In: Proceedings of the 39th International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML’22), Baltimore, MD, 2022, 8375-8386. [\npaper\n] [\ncode\n]\nAwards & Honors\n2020, Outstanding Graduates, Beihang University | åäº¬èªç©ºèªå¤©å¤§å­¦ä¼ç§æ¯ä¸ç\nTeaching Assistant\nPattern Recognition (For undergraduate students, fall, 2020)\nAcademic Services\nInvited Journal Reviewer for IEEE TPAMI, ACM TIST\nCorrespondence\nEmail\nhangjy@seu.edu.cn\nLaboratory\n439, Building of Computer Science and Engineering, Jiulonghu Campus, Southeast University."
