    ],
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Marie-José Huguet\n        \n        \n            \n            -\n                LAAS-CNRS\nMarie-José Huguet\nAbout\nResearch\nTeaching\nStudents\nPublications\nMisc\nPosition\n: Full Professor in Computer Science\nTeaching activities\n: INSA, department Electrical and Computer Engineering (\nGEI\n)\nResearch activities\n: LAAS-CNRS, team Operations Research, Combinatorial Optimization, Constraints (\nROC\n)\nContact\n: marie-jose.huguet@laas.fr or marie-jose.huguet@insa-toulouse.fr\nShort Bio\nI received an engineering degree in Computer Engineering in 1991 (from INSA), then, I defended my Ph. D. thesis in 1994 (INSA, LAAS). From 1995 to 2000, I was associate professor at \"Université de Pau et des Pays de l'Adour\", in the Computer Science Department. Afterward, in 2000, I joined INSA and LAAS with an associate professor position. In 2011, I achieved my\nHabilitation à Diriger des Recherches\nand obtained a Full Professor position in 2016.\nMy research activities focus on solving combinatorial optimization and machine learning problems through methods from the fields of Operations Research or Artificial Intelligence. I have more particularly worked on scheduling, routing, resource allocation or graph problems. I am currently interested in taking into account issues of fairness, privacy or explainability as well as environmental objectives for high stake decision support systems.\nen un clic\nProduction scientifique\nEmplois et stages\nMédiathèque\nAnnuaire\nScolaires\nLAAS-CNRS\n7, av. du colonel Roche\nBP 54200\n31031 Toulouse cedex 4\nFrance\nGPS : 43.563545, 1.476923\nTél :\n(+33) 5 61 33 62 00\ncommunication\nlaas\nfr\n+ Le laboratoire\n+ Recherche\n+ Plateformes\n+ Formation à la recherche\n+ Partenariats\n+ Actualités\nLe LAAS-CNRS\nest associé à 5 membres\nde l'Université de Toulouse\nSe connecter\nIntranet\nMentions légales"
  },
