    "homepage_text": "JLee Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJLee Home\nJaewook Lee\nJaewook Lee\nI am currently an Assistant Professor in the Department of Information and Communication Engineering, Pukyong National University, Busan, Korea.\nMy Lab (ION Lab) Homepage :\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/ionyw\nCV:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/15I0YlQM-IuzbYleJRCvv0ZJ91sk5itlQggaSf4MYTcc/edit?usp=sharing\nEducation and Expericence\nSenior Researcher, Electronics and Telecommunications Research Institute (2021.09 - 23.02)\nPh.D, School of Electrical Engineering, Korea University  (2021.08)\nBachelor of Engineering, School of Electrical Engineering, Korea University (2014.08)\nMilitary Service: Korean Army, Honorable Discharge (2008.12 - 2010.10)\nHonors and Awards\nBest Paper Award of Korea Software Congress 2022  (December 2022)\nKorea University Graduate Student Achievement Award (February 2021)\nGraduate Student Achievement Award of College of Engineering, Korea University (Februay 2021)\nEncouragement Award of 11th-etenew ICT paper competition (December 2019)\nScholarship Student of Korea Techono Complex (May 2016)\nBest ICT Paper of 7th IDIS-etenew ICT paper & Development PPT competition (December 2015)\nEncouragement Award of Undergraduate Student Paper Competition in Korea Computer Congress 2014 (June 2014)\nHonor Scholarship of Korea University  (March 2012)\nProfessor activity\nInvited Presentation\nKRnet 2022 (22.06.27)\nTitle:\n5G Core Network from Perspective of Standardization and Development\nITU Workshop on \"Future technology trends towards 2030\"\n(23.07.25)\nTitle:\n5G/5G-Advanced System for Supporting Deterministic Networking and Time-Sensitive Networks\nTPC member\nConference :\nVTC 2020-Fall,\nIEEE ICCCN 2024\nReviewer\nJournal :\n[2024]:\nIEEE TVT, IEEE TMLCN,\n[Before]\nIEEE Internet of  Things Jounral, IEEE Wireless Communication Letter\n,\nIEEE/ACM Transaction on Networking,\nTelecommunication Systems,\nICT Express\nConference/ workshop :\n[2024] :\nICTC 2018,\nAPNOMS 2019,\nVTC 2019-Spring,\nVTC 2019-Fall,\nCOMSNETS 2020,\nICCE-Asia 2020, IEEE WCNC 2021, IM 2021, IEEE/ACM CCGrid 2021, IEEE/ACM IWQoS 2021,\nIEEE PIMRC 2021, IEEE GLOBECOM 2021,\nIEEE INFOCOM 2022, IEEE WCNC 2023\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
