Analytic Estimate of the Optimal Reverse Variance in Diffusion Probabilistic Models\nFan Bao,\nChongxuan Li\n†, \n                          Jun Zhu†,\n                          Bo Zhang\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n), 2022\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOral, Outstanding Paper Award (7/3391)\nDPM-Solver: A Fast ODE Solver for Diffusion Probabilistic Model Sampling in Around 10 Steps\nCheng Lu, \n                          Yuhao Zhou, \n                          Fan Bao, \n                          Jianfei Chen,\nChongxuan Li\n,\n                          Jun Zhu\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2022\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOral,\nMost Influential Papers in NeurIPS 2022 (10/2905)\nPreprint\nReal-time Identity Defenses against Malicious Personalization of Diffusion Models\nHanZhong Guo, Shen Nie, Chao Du, Tianyu Pang, Hao Sun†,\nChongxuan Li\n†\n[Paper]\n[Code]\n2025\nLarge Language Diffusion Models\nShen Nie, Fengqi Zhu, Zebin You, Xiaolu Zhang, Jingyang Ou, Jun Hu, Jun Zhou, Yankai Lin, Ji-Rong Wen,\nChongxuan Li\n†\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\nOral, NeurIPS\nAn early version presented in DeLTa Workshop @\nICLR\n2025\nLong Paper Best Paper Award, DeLTa@ICLR\n[Paper]\n[Code]\n[Demo]\nMasked Diffusion Models as Energy Miminization\nSitong Chen, Shen Nie, Jiacheng Sun, Zijin Feng, Zhenguo Li, Ji-Rong Wen,\nChongxuan Li\n†\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\n[Paper]\nFlexWorld: Progressively Expanding 3D Scenes for Flexiable-View Synthesis\nLuxi Chen,\n                        Zihan Zhou,\n                        Min Zhao,\n                        Yikai Wang†,\n                        Ge Zhang,\n                        Wenhao Huang,\n                        Hao Sun,\n                        Ji-Rong Wen,\nChongxuan Li\n†\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\n[Dem