    "homepage_text": "Yuan YAO's Home Page\nto\nYuan YAO's Homepage\nSchool of Mathematical Sciences\nPeking University\nBeijing, 100871\nP. R. China\nAbout Me\nResearch\nTeaching\nSeminars\nPhotos&Music\nOld Friends\nOffice:\n1283E Science Building #1.\nEmail:\nyuany@math (remember to add \"DOT pku DOT edu DOT cn\" after this\naddress)\nWeb page:\n[\nold home at Berkeley\n] [\nold home at Stanford\n]\nResearch interests:\nTopological and geometric methods for high dimensional data analysis\n:\nTMSCSCS\nand\nGuibas Lab\nOnline learning and stochastic optimization:\nSteve Smale\nComputational Biomolecular Folding:\nPande Lab\nStatistical machine learning (esp. mathematical methods), computer vision and pattern recognition, convex optimization and control, etc.\nLast update in September 2009, Under Construction ..."
