cations\n(Chapman & Hall/CRC Data Mining and\r\nKnowledge Discovery Series\n), Taylor & Francis, 2011\nRecently Completed Research Projects\n·\nStructNet\n: Constructing and Mining\r\nStructure-Rich Information Networks for Scientific Research\n(NSF/IIS)\n·\nTaming Big Networks via\r\nEmbedding (NSF/IIS-BIGDATA)\n·\nDARPA/KAIROS:\r\nRESIN: Reasoning about Event Schemas for Induction of\nkNowledge\n\n·\nMining and Leveraging\r\nKnowledge Hypercubes for Complex Applications (NSF-IIS)\n·\nDARPA/INCAS:\r\nAnalytics of Information Influence: Effect Characterization\n·\nMining and Leveraging\r\nKnowledge Hypercubes for Complex Applications (NSF IIS)\nPublications\n(\npubs@DBLP\n)\nGoogle Scholar\r\nCitations\nBack to\nData\r\nand Information Systems Laboratory\n,\nSiebel\r\nSchool of Computing and Data Science\n,\nUniv.\r\nof Illinois at Urbana-Champaign"
