    "homepage_text": "Jiawei Zhang | Homepage\nJiawei Zhang\nAssociate Professor\nIFM Lab Director\nDepartment of Computer Science\nUniversity of California, Davis\nAbout Me (\nCV\n)\nI'm an Associate Professor in the Department of Computer Science at University of California, Davis. I founded\nIFM Lab\nin 2017, and have been working as the director since then. IFM Lab is a research oriented academic laboratory, providing the latest academic research works and application tools to both academia and industry.\nPublication\nProject\nIFM.py Toolkit\nTextbook\nCourse\nData\nAward (2012 - Present)\nBest Student Paper Runner Up Award, ASONAM (2016)\nSIGIR Student Travel Award, CIKM (2016)\nStudent Travel Award, KDD (2015)\nStudent Travel Award, IEEE CIC, 2016\nStudent Travel Award, ICDM (2015)\nStudent Travel Award, WSDM (2014)\nUIC Scholar Travel Grant (2014)\nService\nInformation Specialist\nInformation Director and Information Specialist, ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (TKDD)\nConferences Session Chair\nASONAM: IEEE/ACM International Conference on Advances in Social Networks Analysis\nand Mining, Session 7C: Adversarial/Trust 2, ASONAM (2016)\nConferences Program Committee\nACM SIGKDD Conference of Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining, KDD 2016\nACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management,\nCIKM 2015, CIKM 2016, CIKM 2017\nAsia Information Retrieval Societies Conferenc, AIRS 2016, AIRS 2017\nIEEE International Conference on Information Reuse and Integration, IRI 2017\nInternational Conference on Data Mining, ICDM 2017\nInternational World Wide Web Conference, WWW 2017\nInternational Conference on Data Analytics, DATA ANALYTICS 2016\nInternational Conference on Advanced Data Mining and Applications, ADMA\n2017\nJournals Reviewer\nTKDD: ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data, (2013, 2014, 2015)\nTKDE: ACM Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering, (2014)\nContact\nE-mail: jiwzhang [AT] ucdavis [dot] edu\nAddress\n2075 Academic Surge Building\n1124 Crocker Ln\nDepartment of Computer Science\nUniversity of California, Davis\nDavis, CA 95616\nUnited States"
  },
  "serper::Ming Li": {
    "homepage": "https://ming1993li.github.io/",
    "emails": [
