    "homepage_text": "About Me - Hao Chen’s Homepage\nHao Chen\nPh.D. student of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, interested in multi-agent reinforcement learning\nFollow\nBeijing, China\nEmail\nResearchGate\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nZhihu\nAbout Me\nI’m currently a Ph.D. student in Computer Science advised by\nProf. Jianbin Jiao\n, at\nPattern Recognition and Intelligent System Development Laboratory\n,\nSchool of Emergency Management Science and Engineering, University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n. My research interests include Reinforcement Learning, Multi-agent Learning, and Large Language Model (LLM) Agents. I am looking for cooperation opportunities. If you are interested with my experience or research, please feel free to contact me via Email.\nEducation\n2023.9 - 2024.8 : Visiting Scholar at\nSpaceTimeLab, University College London\n, advised by\nProf. Tao Cheng\n2022.9 - Present : Ph.D. in Computer Science,\nSchool of Emergency Management Science and Engineering, University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Jianbin Jiao\n2019.9 - 2022.6 : M.S. in Pattern Recognition and Intelligent System,\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Kaiqi Huang\n2015.9 - 2019.6 : B.E. in Computer Science,\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Yidong Gu\n2012.9 - 2015.6 :\nNortheast Yucai School\nExperiences\n2022.7 - Present : Joint PhD Training Program at\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n2019.2 - 2019.7 : Research internship at\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Junge Zhang\nand\nProf. Qiyue Yin\n2019.1 : Winter camp at\nXi’an Institute of Optics and Precision Mechanics, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n2018.3 - 2018.7 : Research internship at\nInstitute of Software, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Wensheng Dou\n2016.7 - 2016.9 : Research internship at\nTechnology and Engineering Center for Space Utilization, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by\nProf. Yidong Gu\n2014.7 : Summer camp at\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\nPublications\nConferences\nTC-RAG:Turing-Complete RAG’s Case study on Medical LLM Systems\nXinke Jiang, Yue Fang, Rihong Qiu, Haoyu Zhang, Yongxin Xu,\nHao Chen\n, Wentao Zhang, Ruizhe Zhang, Yuchen Fang, Xu Chu, Junfeng Zhao, Yasha Wang\nACL2025:\nthe 63rd Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics\n[\nPaper\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n] [\nbibTeX\n]\nTimeseries Suppliers Allocation Risk Optimization via Deep Black Litterman Model\nXinke Jiang, Wentao Zhang, Yuchen Fang, Xiaowei Gao,\nHao Chen\n, Haoyu Zhang, Dingyi Zhuang, Jiayuan Luo\nAAAI2025(Oral):\nthe 39th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n[\nPaper\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n] [\nSlides\n] [\nPoster\n] [\nbibTeX\n]\nPDiT: Interleaving Perception and Decision-making Transformers for Deep Reinforcement Learning\nHangyu Mao, Rui Zhao, Ziyue Li, Zhiwei Xu,\nHao Chen\n, Yiqun Chen, Bin Zhang, Zhen Xiao, Junge Zhang and Jiangjin Yin\nAAMAS2024(Oral):\nthe 23rd International Conference on Autonomous Agents and Multi-Agent Systems\n[\nPaper\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n] [\nbibTeX\n]\nUncertainty Quantification via Spatial-Temporal Tweedie Model for Zero-inflated and Long-tail Travel Demand Prediction\nXinke Jiang, Dingyi Zhuang, Xianghui Zhang,\nHao Chen\n, Jiayuan Luo, Xiaowei Gao\nCIKM2023(Poster):\nthe 32nd ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management\n[\nPaper\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n] [\nPoster\n] [\nbibTeX\n]\nConsensus Learning for Cooperative Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning\nZhiwei Xu, Bin Zhang, Dapeng Li, Zeren Zhang, Guangchong Zhou,\nHao Chen\n, Guoliang Fan\nAAAI2023(Oral):\nthe 37th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n[\nPaper\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n] [\nbibTeX\n]\nExplicitly Learning Policy Under Partial Observability in Multiagent Reinforcement Learning\nChen Yang, Guangkai Yang,\nHao Chen\n, Junge