Vidal\n, and\nYi Ma\nIn International Conference on Learning Representations\n, 2024\nPaper\nCode\nCite\n@inproceedings\n{\nchu2024image\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Image Clustering via the Principle of Rate Reduction in the Age of Pretrained Models}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Chu, Tianzhe and Tong, Shengbang and Ding, Tianjiao and Dai, Xili and Haeffele, Benjamin D. and Vidal, Ren{\\'e} and Ma, Yi}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{International Conference on Learning Representations}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\ntags\n=\n{unsupervised-ml;foundation-models;representation-learning}\n}\nHARD: Hyperplane ARrangement Descent\nTD\n*\n,\nLiangzu Peng\n*\n, and\nRené Vidal\nIn Conference on Parsimony and Learning\n, 2024\nOral\nPaper\nCode\nCite\nOral presentation\n@inproceedings\n{\nding2024hard\n,\ntitle\n=\n{HARD: Hyperplane ARrangement Descent}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Ding, Tianjiao and Peng, Liangzu and Vidal, Ren{\\'e}}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{Conference on Parsimony and Learning}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\ntags\n=\n{trustworthy-ml;unsupervised-ml;theory;optimization}\n}\nOutlier-Robust Orthogonal Regression on Manifolds\nTD\n*\n,\nLiangzu Peng\n*\n, and\nRené Vidal\nIn OpenReview\n, 2023\nPaper\nCite\n@inproceedings\n{\nding2023outlier\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Outlier-Robust Orthogonal Regression on Manifolds}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Ding, Tianjiao and Peng, Liangzu and Vidal, Ren{\\'e}}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{OpenReview}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2023}\n,\ntags\n=\n{trustworthy-ml;efficient-ml;unsupervised-ml;theory;geometric-vision;optimization}\n}\nUnsupervised Manifold Linearizing and Clustering\nTD\n,\nShengbang Tong\n,\nKwan Ho Ryan Chan\n,\nXili Dai\n,\nYi Ma\n, and\nBenjamin D. Haeffele\nIn International Conference on Computer Vision\n, 2023\nCPAL Spotlight\nPaper\nCite\nCPAL Spotlight\n@inproceedings\n{\nding2023unsupervised\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Unsupervised Manifold Linearizing and Clustering}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Ding, Tianjiao and Tong, Shengbang and Chan, Kwan Ho Ryan and Dai, Xili and Ma, Yi and Haeffele, Benjamin D.}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{International Conference on Computer Vision}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2023}\n,\ntags\n=\n{unsupervised-ml;representation-learning}\n}\nUnderstanding Doubly Stochastic Clustering\nTD\n,\nDerek Lim\n,\nRené Vidal\n, and\nBenjamin D. Haeffele\nIn International Conference on Machine Learning\n, 2022\nOral\nPaper\nCite\nOral presentation\n@inproceedings\n{\nding2022understanding\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Understanding Doubly Stochastic Clustering}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Ding, Tianjiao and Lim, Derek and Vidal, Ren{\\'e} and Haeffele, Benjamin D.}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{International Conference on Machine Learning}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2022}\n,\ntags\n=\n{unsupervised-ml;trustworthy-ml;optimization;theory}\n}\nEfficient Maximal Coding Rate Reduction by Variational Forms\nChristina Baek\n*\n,\nZiyang Wu\n*\n,\nKwan Ho Ryan Chan\n,\nTD\n,\nYi Ma\n, and\nBenjamin D. Haeffele\nIn IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n, 2022\nPaper\nCite\n@inproceedings\n{\nbaek2022efficient\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Efficient Maximal Coding Rate Reduction by Variational Forms}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Baek, Christina and Wu, Ziyang and Chan, Kwan Ho Ryan and Ding, Tianjiao and Ma, Yi and Haeffele, Benjamin D.}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2022}\n,\ntags\n=\n{efficient-ml;optimization;theory;representation-learning}\n}\nBoosting RANSAC via Dual Principal Component Pursuit\nYunchen Yang, Xinyue Zhang,\nTD\n,\nDaniel P. Robinson\n,\nRené Vidal\n, and\nManolis C. Tsakiris\narXiv preprint arXiv:2110.02918\n, 2021\nPaper\nCite\n@article\n{\nyang2021boosting\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Boosting RANSAC via Dual Principal Component Pursuit}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Yang, Yunchen and Zhang, Xinyue and Ding, Tianjiao and Robinson, Daniel P. and Vidal, Ren{\\'e} and Tsakiris, Manolis C.}\n,\njournal\n=\n{arXiv preprint arXiv:2110.02918}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2021}\n,\ntags\n=\n{trustworthy-ml;efficient-ml;geometric-vision}\n}\nRobust Homography Estimation via Dual Principal Component Pursuit\nTD\n, Yunchen Yang,\nZhihui Zhu\