    "homepage_text": "Jintai Chen - Homepage\nJintai Chen\nAssistant Professor at HKUST(GZ)/HKUST; Passionate about AI for Healthcare.\nNative speaker of Hokkien dialect :-)\nEmail\nLinkedIn\nGoogle Scholar\nHey, I’m Jintai Chen, a tenure-track assistant professor at HKUST (Guangzhou), also affiliated with the Clear Water Bay Campus.\nPrior to that, I am a postdoctoral researcher at the University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign, where I collaborated closely with Prof. Jimeng Sun. I obtained my Ph.D. from the College of Computer Science and Technology at Zhejiang University, under the supervision of Prof. Jian Wu. My research interests lie at the intersection of AI and healthcare, with a particular focus on developing generalizable foundation models and generative models to address real-world medical challenges, including clinical trial optimization, biomedical discovery, clinical predictive modeling, and health monitoring.\nI am actively seeking highly motivated Ph.D. students, research assistants, and postdoctoral researchers with strong backgrounds in computer science, statistics, or other related subjects. Proficiency in coding is required.\nFor Ph.D. applications, please fill out\nthe form\n.\nFor research assistant applications, please fill out\nthe form\n.\nFor postdoc applications, please email me directly at jtchen147[AT]gmail[DOT]com.\nFor MPhil students, please contact me after passing the interview with the school’s Red Bird MPhil committee.\n📄 Selected Publications\nThe full list can be accessed on\nGoogle Scholar\n.\n(*: Equal contribution; $\\dagger$: Corresponding author(s))\nAI for Medicine: Towards Multimodal and Individualized Diagnosis Support\n[Nat. Com.]\nCongenital Heart Disease Detection by Pediatric Electrocardiogram Based Deep Learning Integrated with Human Concepts\n[\nCode\n]\n,\nJintai Chen\n$^*$, Shuai Huang$^*$, Ying Zhang$^*$, Qing Chang$^*$, Yixiao Zhang, Dantong Li, Jia Qiu, Lianting Hu, Xiaoting Peng, Yunmei Du, Yunfei Gao, Danny Chen, Abdelouahab Bellou$^\\dagger$, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$, Huiying Liang$^\\dagger$,\nNature Communications\n,\n2024\n[IJCAI]\nElectrocardio panorama: Synthesizing new ECG views with self-supervision\n[\nCode and Data\n]\n,\nJintai Chen\n$^*$, Xiangshang Zheng$^*$, Hongyun Yu$^*$, Danny Z. Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n,\n2021\n[ICLR]\nNEF-NET v2: Adapting Electrocardio Panorama in the Wild\n, Zehui Zhan$^*$, Yaojun Hu$^*$, Jiajing Zhan, Wanchen Lian, Wanqing Wu$^\\dagger$, Jintai Chen$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n,\n2026\n[ICML]\nME-GAN: Learning panoptic electrocardio representations for multi-view ECG synthesis conditioned on heart diseases\n,\nJintai Chen\n$^*$, Kuanlun Liao$^*$, Kun Wei, Haochao Ying$^\\dagger$, Danny Z Chen, Jian Wu,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n,\n2022\n[ICCV]\nOrd2Seq: Regarding Ordinal Regression as Label Sequence Prediction\n[\nCode\n]\n, Jinhong Wang$^*$, Yi Cheng$^*$,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Tingting Chen, Danny Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision\n,\n2023\n[IJCAI]\nPersonalized Heart Disease Detection via ECG Digital Twin Generation\n, Yaojun Hu,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Lianting Hu, Dantong Li, Jiahuan Yan, Haochao Ying, Huiying Liang, Jian Wu,\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n,\n2024\n[MICCAI|Oral]\nTeleOR: Real-time Telemedicine System for Full-Scene Operating Room\n, Yixuan Wu$^*$, Kaiyuan Hu$^*$, Qian Shao,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Danny Z. Chen, and Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention\n,\n2024\n[MICCAI]\nLKM-UNet: Large Kernel Vision Mamba UNet for Medical Image Segmentation\n, Jinhong Wang,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Danny Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention\n,\n2024\n[MICCAI|Oral]\nDoctor Imitator: Hand-Radiography-based Bone Age Assessment by Imitating Scoring Methods\n,\nJintai Chen\n, Bohan Yu, Biwen Lei, Ruiwei Feng, Danny Z. Chen, and Jian Wu,\nInternational Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention\n,\n2020\n[Info. Fusion]\nFrom screens to scenes: A survey of embodied AI in healthcare\n, Yihao Liu, Xu Cao, Tingting Chen, Yankai Jiang, Junjie You, Minghua Wu, Xiaosong Wang, Mengling Feng, Yaochu Jin,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$,\nInformation Fusion\n,\n2025\n[ACM MM]\nGCL: Gradient-Guided Contrastive Learning for Medical Image Segmentation with Multi-Perspective Meta Labels\n, Yixuan Wu,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Jiahuan Yan, Yiheng Zhu, Danny Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nACM International Conference on Multimedia\n,\n2023\n[Info. Fusion]\nOmniFuse: A General Modality Fusion Framework for Multi-Modality Learning on Low-quality Medical Data\n, Yixuan Wua,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Lianting Hu, Hongxia Xu, Huiying Liang$^\\dagger$, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInformation Fusion\n,\n2024\n[ICLR]\nSynergy learning with Small Models Promotes LLM zero-shot Medical Tabular Prediction\n, Jiahuan Yan,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Chaowen Hu, Bo Zheng, Yaojun Hu, Jimeng Sun, Jian Wu,\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n,\n2025\nAI for Biomedical Science: Towards Drug Design and Therapeutic Science\n[Nature Scientific Data]\nTrialBench: Multi-modal artificial intelligence-ready clinical trial datasets\n,\nJintai Chen\n$^*$, Yaojun Hu$^*$, Mingchen Cai, Yue Wang, Yingzhou Lu, Xu Cao, Miao Lin, Hongxia Xu, Jian Wu, Cao Xiao, Jimeng Sun, Lucas Glass, Kexin Huang, Marinka Zitnik, Tianfan Fu$^\\dagger$,\nNature Scientific Data\n,\n2025\nRareAgent: Self-evolving Reasoning for Drug Repurposing in Rare Diseases\n, Lang Qin, Zijian Gan, Xu Cao, Pengcheng Jiang, Yankai Jiang, Jiawei Han, Kaishun Wu,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$,\n2025\n[AAAI|Oral]\nProtCLIP: Function-Informed Protein Multi-Modal Learning\n, Hanjing Zhou$^*$, Mingze Yin$^*$