      "sunyiming@seu.edu.cn"
    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/SunYM2020",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yiming Sun | Southeast University\nYiming Sun\nAssistant Professor\nSoutheast University\nsunyiming@seu.edu.cn（sunyiming1895@tju.edu.cn）\n孙一铭\n东南大学 助理研究员，至善博士后（合作导师：\n胡清华教授\n、\n朱鹏飞教授\n），隶属于东南大学自动化学院\n低空智能实验室\n，主要研究方向为无人机视觉感知、多模态图像融合、无人机具身智能，在IEEE Trans./ICML/ICCV/IJCAI/ACM MM/AAAI等SCI-1区期刊/CCF-A类国际顶级会议上发表论文10余篇，其中ESI高被引论文1篇、Google学术引用超100次论文2篇，主持国家自然科学基金青年科学基金项目（C类）、国家资助博士后研究人员计划（B档）、江苏省卓越博士后计划（B档）、复杂工程系统测量与控制教育部重点实验室开放课题、中央高校基本科研业务费专项资金资助等国家及省部级项目，参与国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金重点项目等国家级项目。低空多模态感知相关研究成果获得天津大学校级优秀博士学位论文、\n吴文俊人工智能科技进步一等奖\n（5/15）等荣誉。\nYiming Sun (孙一铭) has joined the Zhishan Postdoctoral Program (至善博士后) at Southeast University as an Assistant Professor (助理研究员). I received my Ph.D. and M.S. degrees from Tianjin University, Tianjin, China, in 2024 and 2020. I received my B.S. degree from Hefei University of Technology, Hefei, China, in 2017. My supervisors were Prof. Qinghua Hu (胡清华) and Prof. Pengfei Zhu (朱鹏飞). I work closely with Prof. Bing Cao (曹兵) at Tianjin University. My office is located in Room South-309, Li Wenzheng Building, Sipailou Campus, Southeast University, Nanjing. My research interests include\nMultimodal Learning and UAV（Unmanned Aerial Vehicles）Vision\n.\nResearch Interests\nMultimodal Image Fusion\nMultimodal Object Detection\nUAV (Unmanned Aerial Vehicles) Vision\nUAV (Unmanned Aerial Vehicles) Embodied Intelligence\n低空智能实验室正在寻找自驱力较强的学生（硕士2026年秋季，博士2026秋季），与朱鹏飞教授共同指导，目标是在低空无人机智能感知与具身智能等课题上做出有影响力的工作。请随时通过电子邮件与我联系。\nNews\n[Nov. 2025]\nOur paper about prompt-guided controllable image fusion is accepted to\nAAAI 2026\n[Jun. 2025]\nOur paper about task-driven image fusion is accepted to IEEE T-MM.\n[ JCR Q1 ]\n[Jun. 2025]\nOne co-author paper about multi-modal object detection is accepted to\nICCV 2025\n[May. 2025]\nOur paper about degraded multi-modal image fusion is accepted to\nICML 2025\n[Feb. 2025]\n“低空智能感知关键技术与应用”获得吴文俊人工智能科技进步一等奖\n[Dec. 2024]\nOne co-author about zero-shot learning is accepted to\nAAAI 2025\n[Aug. 2024]\nI joined the School of Automation at Southeast University as a Postdoctoral Associate (至善博士后) supervised by Prof. Qinghua Hu and Prof. Pengfei Zhu.\n[Jun. 2024]\nI got my Ph.D. degree in Computer Science and Technology from the College of Intelligence and Computing, Tianjin University.\n[Apr. 2024]\nOur paper about dynamic brightness adaptation robust image fusion is accepted to\nIJCAI 2024\n[Jul. 2023]\nOur paper about dynamic multimodal image fusion is accepted to\nICCV 2023\n[Aug. 2022]\nOur paper about intelligent retail container is accepted to IEEE T-IM.\n[ JCR Q1 ]\n[Jun. 2022]\nOur paper about detection-driven multimodal image fusion is accepted to\nACM Multimedia (MM) 2022\n[Apr. 2022]\nOur paper about multimodal object detection is accepted to IEEE T-CSVT.\n[ JCR Q1 ]\nSelected Publications\nICML\nTask-Gated Multi-Expert Collaboration Network for Degraded Multi-Modal Image Fusion\nYiming Sun\n, Xin Li, Pengfei Zhu, Qinghua Hu, Dongwei Ren, Huiying Xu, Xinzhong Zhu\nForty-Second International Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, 2025.\nPDF\nCode\nIEEE-Trans\nTEDFuse: Task-Driven Equivariant Consistency Decomposition Network for Multi-Modal Image Fusion\nYiming Sun\n, Xinyu Cui, Zhen Wang, Hao Cheng, Yongfeng Dong, Pengfei Zhu, Kai Li\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n(IEEE-T-MM)\n, 2025.\nPDF\nCode\nIJCAI\nDynamic Brightness Adaptation for Robust Multi-modal Image Fusion\nYiming Sun\n, Bing Cao, Pengfei Zhu, Qinghua Hu\nThe 33rd International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(IJCAI)\n, 2024.\nPDF\nCode\nACM MM\nDetFusion: A Detection-driven Infrared and Visible Image Fusion Network\nYiming Sun\n, Bing Cao, Pengfei Zhu, Qinghua Hu\nThe 30th ACM International Conference on Multimedia\n(ACM MM)\n, 2022.\nPDF\nCode\nICCV\nMulti-modal Gated Mixture of Local-to-Global Experts for Dynamic Image Fusion\nBing Cao*,\nYiming Sun*\n, Pengfei Zhu, Qinghua Hu (\n*Co-First authors\n)\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2023.\nPDF\nCode\nIEEE-Trans\nDrone-based RGB-Infrared Cross-Modality Vehicle Detection via Uncertainty-Aware Learning\nYiming Sun\n, Bing Cao, Pengfei Zhu, Qinghua Hu\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\n(IEEE T-CSVT)\n, 2022.\nPDF\nCode\nIEEE-Trans\nSelf-supervised Fully Automatic Learning Machine for Intelligent Retail Container\nPengfei Zhu,\nYiming Sun\n, Bing Cao, Xiaoyu Liu, Xin Liu, Qinghua Hu\nIEEE Transactions on Instrumentation & Measurement\n(IEEE T-IM)\n, 2022.\nPDF\nCode\nIEEE-Trans\nMulti-Drone-Based Single Object Tracking With Agent Sharing Network\nPengfei Zhu, Jiayu Zheng, Dawei Du, Longyin Wen,\nYiming Sun\n, Qinghua Hu\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\n(IEEE T-CSVT)\n, 2021.\nPDF\nCode\nPublications\n[1]\nSun Yiming\n, Cao Bing, Zhu Pengfei, Hu Qinghua. Drone-based RGB-infrared cross-modality vehicle detection via uncertainty-aware learning. IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, 2022, 32(10): 6700-6713.\n(JCR Q1; ESI高被引论文)\n[2]\nSun Yiming\n, Li Xin, Zhu Pengfei, Hu Qinghua, Ren Dongwei, Xu Huiying, Zhu Xinzhong. Task-Gated Multi-Expert Collaboration Network for Degraded Multi-Modal Image Fusion. Proceedings of the 42 nd International Conference on Machine Learning, Vancouver, Canada. PMLR 267, 2025.\n(CCF-A)\n[3]\nSun Yiming\n, Ruan Yuan, Hu Qinghua, Zhu Pengfei. CtrlFuse: Mask-Prompt Guided Controllable Infrared and Visible Image Fusion. Proceedings of the Fortieth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2026.\n(CCF-A)\n[4]\nSun Yiming\n, Cao Bing, Zhu Pengfei, Hu Qinghua. Detfusion: A detection-driven infrared and visible image fusion network. Proceedings of the 30th ACM international conference on multimedia (ACM MM). 2022: 4003-4011.\n(CCF-A)\n[5]\nSun Yiming\n, Cao Bing, Zhu Pengfei, Hu Qinghua. Dynamic brightness adaptation for robust multi-modal image fusion. Proceedings of the Thirty-Third International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI). 2024: 1317-1325.\n(CCF-A)\n[6]\nSun Yiming\n, Cui Xinyu, Wang Zhen, Cheng Hao, Dong Yongfeng, Zhu Pengfei, Li Kai. TEDFuse: Task-Driven Equivariant Consistency Decomposition Network for Multi-Modal Image Fusion. IEEE Transactions on Multimedia, 2025.\n(JCR Q1)\n[7] Cao Bing,\nSun Yiming (共同第一作者)\n, Zhu Pengfei, Hu Qinghua. Multi-modal gated mixture of local-to-global experts for dynamic image fusion. Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF international conference on computer vision (ICCV). 2023: 23555-23564.\n(CCF-A)\n[8] Zhu Pengfei,\nSun Yiming\n, Cao Bing, Liu Xiaoyu, Liu Xin, Hu Qinghua. Self-supervised fully automatic learning machine for intelligent retail container. IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement, 2022, 71: 1-15.\n(JCR Q1)\n[9] Yi Li, Huiying Xu,\nYiming Sun\n, Pengfei Zhu, Lingling Xu, Xinzhong Zhu. KSCNet: Exploring KAN and State Space Model Collaboration Network for Small Object Detection from UAV Imagery. Expert Systems with Applications, 2025: 130240.\n(JCR Q1)\n[10] Zhao Tianyi, Liu Boyang, Gao Yanglei,\nSun Yiming\n, Yuan Maoxun, Wei Xingxing. Rethinking Multi-modal Object Detection from the Perspective of Mono-Modality Feature Learning. Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF international conference on computer vision (ICCV). 2025.\n(CCF-A)\n[11] Zhang Zekai, Chen Qinghui, Xiong Maomao, Ding Shijiao, Su Zhanzhi, Yao Xinjie,\nSun Yiming\n, Bai Cong, Zhang Jinglin. Zero-Shot learning in industrial scenarios: New Large-Scale Benchmark, Challenges and Baseline. Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence. 2025: 1-9.\n(CCF-A)\n[12] Zhu Pengfei, Zheng Jiayu, Du Dawei, Wen Longyin,\nSun Yiming\n, Hu Qinghua. Multi-drone-based single object tracking with agent sharing network. IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, 2021, 31(10): 4058-4070.\n(JCR Q1)\n[13] Chongqing Huang, Huiying Xu,\nYiming Sun\n, Hongbo Li, Yang Liu, Yi Li, Xinzhong Zhu. FCADet: Dynamic context-aware fusion with attention-guided suppression for traffic detection under extreme weather. Digital Signal Processing, 2026: 1051-2004.\n(JCR Q2)\n[14] Yaolin Lei, Kai Jin, Zifeng Qiu,\nYiming Sun\n, Huihui Bai, Wenzhi He. MPA-Det: multi-path aggregation-based object detection framework for aerial visual computing. The Visual Computer, 2025: 1-14.\n(JCR Q2)\nServices\nConference Reviewers/Program Committee Member\nThe Thirty-Ninth Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS) 2025\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV) 2025\nThe 34rd International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI) 2025\nThe 32st ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM) 2024\nThe 33rd International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI) 2024\nThe 31st ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM) 2023\nJournal Reviewers\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (IEEE T-IP)\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (IEEE T-CSVT)\nIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems (IEEE T-ITS)\nISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing\nIEEE Geoscience and Remote Sensing Letters\nCAAI Transactions on Intelligence Technology\nHonors\n2025 吴文俊人工智能科学技术奖-科技进步一等奖\n2024 Excellent Ph.D. Thesis of Tianjin University 天津大学校级优秀博士毕业论文\n2023 National Scholarship 博士研究生国家奖学金\n2023 Tianjin University Merit Student\n2022 Tianjin University Merit Student\n2021 Tianjin University Merit Student\n2022 The First Prize Scholarship\n2020 The First Prize Scholarship\nPowered by Jekyll and\nMinimal Light\ntheme."
