    "homepage_text": "Kangqiao LIU 刘康桥 - Kangqiao LIU\nKangqiao LIU 刘康桥\nLecturer of Physics\nFollow\nChengdu, China\nXihua University\nEmail\narXiv\nGoogle Scholar\nSemantic Scholar\nORCID\nResearchGate\nLinkedIn\nKangqiao LIU 刘康桥\nLecturer\nof Physics\nSchool of Science\nKey Laboratory of High Performance Scientific Computation\nXihua University\nChengdu, Sichuan, China 610039\n物理学\n讲师\n西华大学\n理学院\n高性能科学计算四川省教育厅高校重点实验室\n四川成都　610039\nContact me at\n: (replace -AT- by @)\nkqliu-AT-xhu.edu.cn\nOffice\nat 6D416"
