    "homepage_text": "Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nYang Zhou\nPh.D. in Economics\nWelcome!\nI am an Assistant Professor of Economics and the Assistant Director of Economics Research Group at the University of North Texas. I received the Ph.D. in Economics from West Virginia University, and I also received my higher education in Spain and China.\nMy main research interest is applied microeconomics, with a focus on public economics, urban and regional economics, political economy\n,\nand applied machine learning. Please do not hesitate to email me if you are interested in or have any questions about my work.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
