e\n]\nImage2GIF: Generating Cinemagraphs using Recurrent Deep Q-Networks\nYipin Zhou\n, Yale Song,\nTamara L. Berg\nWACV 2018\n[\narxiv\n] [\nproject\n]\n2017\nLearning from Noisy Labels with Distillation\nYuncheng Li\n, Jianchao Yang, Yale Song,\nLiangliang Cao\n,\nJiebo Luo\n, Jia Li\nICCV 2017\n[\narxiv\n] [\nslides\n] [\nYFCC100M Entity Dataset\n]\nElasticPlay: Interactive Video Summarization with Dynamic Time Budget\nHaojian JIn\n, Yale Song,\nKoji Ya...[truncated]"
