    "homepage_text": "LIU Chenghao's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nLIU Chenghao's Homepage\nLIU Chenghao's Homepage\nResearch Scientist\nSchool of Information Systems\nSingapore Management University\n80 Stamford Road, Singapore 178902\nEmail:\nchliu@smu.edu.sg\n,\ntwinsken@gmail.com\n,\nOffice: SIS Research Center 4001\nAbout Me\nI'm currently a research scientist working with Prof\nSteven Hoi\nand\nYuan Fang\nin Singapore Management University.  Before that, I received Ph.D.  and B.S. from the School of Computer Science and Engineering at Zhejiang University in 2017 and 2011, respectively.  My research interests are broadly in fundamental  machine learning and data mining applications.  Recently, I have developed interest in meta learning.\nResearch Interests\nFundamental Machine Learning:\nDeep Learning\nMeta Learning\nOnline Learning\nData Mining Applications:\nRecommendation Systems\nWeb and Social Media Analytics\nAcademic Services\nProgram Committee for AAAI 2017~2019\nProgram Committee for IJCAI 2017~2019\nProgram Committee for ICDM 2018\nExternal Reviewer of AISTATS, NIPS, ICML, KDD\nReviewer of IEEE Transactions of Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE)\nReviewer of Data Mining and Knowledge Discovery (DMKD)\nReviewer of Neurocomputing\nReviewer of Multimedia Tools and Applications\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
