    "homepage_text": "A&DM\n-Cube\nHome\nResearch\nPeople\nBack\nHongke Zhao\nCube Director\nPOSITION\nTianjin University\nCollege of Management and Economics\nDistinguished Associate Professor,\nPh.D. Supervisor\nCONTACT\nTianjin University\nhongke@tju.edu.cn\n个人简历\n赵洪科 博士，天津大学管理与经济学部\n英才副教授、特聘研究员、博士生导师\n。2018 年毕业于中国科学技术大学，获计算机科学与技术专业博士学位，2013 年毕业于华南理工大学，获软件工程专业学士学位。曾分别于 2016 年 8 月至 2017 年 1 月在美国亚利桑那大学埃勒商学院管理信息系统系，2015 年 9 月至 2016 年 8 月在美国北卡罗来纳大学夏洛特分校计算与信息学院等知名高校留学。\n研究方向为数据挖掘与机器学习、算法分析与管理、商务智能与金融科技。在计算机、信息管理等领域的高水平学术期刊（如 JOC, TKDE, TEVC, TOIS, TM, TWEB, TIST, TSMC, Omega, IMM, DSS, IPM, JMSE, 软件学报, 管理科学学报, 管理工程学报等）和顶级国际学术会议（如 SIGKDD, ICML, AAAI, IJCAI, WWW, SIGIR, ACL, WSDM, CIKM, ICDM 等）上发表论文 120 余篇，并申请中/美发明专利 10 余项；资政研究成果被国家教育部等中央有关部门上报采用。入选\n2022 年百度学术全球 AI 华人青年学者榜单（AI+X 智能管理）\n，\n2022 年度社会计算青年学者新星\n。荣获\n中国智库索引 CTTI 年度（2019）优秀成果奖\n、\n中国人工智能学会（CAAI 2019）优秀博士学位论文提名奖\n、\n中国科学技术大学优秀博士学位论文奖\n、\n中国科学院院长奖\n、\n中国科学院朱李月华优秀博士生奖\n,\nICML 2024 Challenges on Automated Math Reasoning亚军\n,\nKDD-CUP 2019 季军\n等奖项。论文入选计算机研究与发展2019年论文\"高被引TOP10\"、中国机器学习会议（CCML 2019）最佳学生论文奖、WSDM2022 the Best-ranked Papers、\"ESI高被引论文\"。主持国家自然科学基金面上项目、青年项目、京津冀基础研究合作专项、天津市教委社科重大项目、联想科学家计划、CCF-联想蓝海基金以及多项具有良好社会效益的科技企业（如联想、百度、网易等）合作研究课题，参与国家自然科学基金重大项目、科技部重点研发项目等。担任中国信息经济学会理事，中国系统工程学会数据科学与知识系统工程专委会委员，SIGKDD、WWW、AAAI、IJCAI、WSDM 等多个顶级会议（高级）程序委员和系列重要期刊编委（IPM）、客座编辑（ECRA）。目前与国内外多所知名高校和科技企业（例如百度、网易、联想等）建立科研合作关系。欢迎对\n大数据\n、\n人工智能算法\n，\n金融商务应用\n等领域感兴趣并对编程有学习意愿的同学报考研究生（管理科学与工程、新媒体、金融），欢迎学界、业界同仁共同开展产学研合作。\nDr. Hongke Zhao is a Distinguished Associate Professor, Research Fellow and Ph.D. Supervisor at the College of Management and Economics, Tianjin University. He earned his Ph.D. in Computer Science and Technology from the University of Science and Technology of China in 2018, and a Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from South China University of Technology in 2013. His international academic experience includes studies at the Department of Management Information Systems, Eller College of Management, University of Arizona, from August 2016 to January 2017, and the School of Computing and Informatics at the University of North Carolina at Charlotte from September 2015 to August 2016.\nDr. Zhao's research interests lie in data mining and machine learning, algorithm analysis and management, business intelligence, and financial technology. He has published over 120 papers in high-level academic journals (such as\nJOC\n,\nTKDE\n,\nTEVC\n,\nTOIS\n,\nTM\n,\nTWEB\n,\nTIST\n,\nTSMC\n,\nOmega\n,\nIMM\n,\nDSS\n,\nIPM\n,\nJMSE\n,\nJournal of Software\n,\nJournal of Management Sciences in China\n,\nJournal of Industrial Engineering and Engineering Management\n, etc.) and top international academic conferences (such as\nSIGKDD\n,\nICML\n,\nAAAI\n,\nIJCAI\n,\nWWW\n,\nSIGIR\n,\nACL\n,\nWSDM\n,\nCIKM\n,\nICDM\n, etc.), and has applied for more than 10 China/US national invention patents; his policy research findings have been adopted by central government departments, including the\nMinistry of Education\n. He was selected for the\n2022 Baidu Academic Global AI Chinese Young Scholars List (AI+X Intelligent Management)\nand named a\n2022 Social Computing Young Scholars Rising Star\n. Dr. Zhao has received numerous awards, including the\nOutstanding Achievement Award of China Think Tank Index CTTI (2019)\n, the\nOutstanding Doctoral Dissertation Nomination Award of CAAI (2019)\n, the\nOutstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award of the University of Science and Technology of China\n, the\nPresident's Award of the Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, the\nZhu Liyuehua Outstanding Doctoral Student Award of the Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, the\nRunner-up in ICML 2024 Challenges on Automated Math Reasoning\n, and\nthird place in KDD-CUP 2019\n. His papers have been included in the \"Top 10 Highly Cited Papers\" of the\nJournal of Computer Research and Development\nin 2019, won the Best Student Paper Award at the\nChina Conference on Machine Learning (CCML 2019)\n,\nWSDM2022 the Best-ranked Papers\n, and were among the \"Highly Cited Papers in ESI\".\nHe leads projects funded by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (General Program and Youth Program), the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei Basic Research Cooperation Special Project, the Tianjin Municipal Education Commission Major Project for Humanities and Social Sciences, the Lenovo Scientist Program, the CCF-Lenovo Blue Ocean Fund, as well as collaborative research projects with companies like\nLenovo\n,\nBaidu\n, and\nNetEase\n. He also participates in major projects of the National Natural Science Foundation of China and key research and development projects of the\nMinistry of Science and Technology\n. Dr. Zhao serves as a Director of the China Information Economics Society, a member of the Data Science and Knowledge Systems Engineering Committee of the Systems Engineering Society of China, as well as a (senior) program committee member for several top-tier conferences (\nSIGKDD\n,\nWWW\n,\nAAAI\n,\nIJCAI\n,\nWSDM\n, etc.) and an Editorial Board Member (\nIPM\n) and Guest Editor (\nECRA\n). Currently, he has established research collaborations with renowned universities and technology enterprises both domestically and internationally, such as\nBaidu\n,\nNetEase\n, and\nLenovo\n. Graduate students interested in\nbig data\n,\nartificial intelligence algorithms\n, and\nfinancial business applications\nand eager to learn programming are encouraged to apply for graduate studies (Management Science and Engineering, New Media, Finance). He also welcomes collaboration from academic and industry peers for joint industry-academia research.\n研究方向\n(MA) 数据挖掘、管理智能 AI for Management：\n（1）领域适应知识发现\n（2）跨领域知识迁移\n（3）情境决策与设计、大模型知识注入\n(AM) 算法管理 Algorithm Management：\n（1）启发式算法设计\n（2）定量式算法分析与测度\n（3）智能产业分析研究\n(AP) 应用：\n（1）商务智能，（2）金融科技 FinTech，（3）区域产业经济\n教授课程\n（1）数据结构\n（2）Python 与金融数据分析\n教育与工作经历\n1. 2024/01-至今，天津大学，管理与经济学部，英才副教授、研究员\n2. 2022/07-至今，天津大学，管理与经济学部，副教授\n3. 2018/11-2022/06，天津大学，管理与经济学部，讲师\n4. 2020/08-2021/10，百度在线网络技术有限公司，战略组织与人才发展部，特聘顾问\n5. 2016/08-2017/01，亚利桑那大学，管理信息系统系，访问学者\n6. 2015/09-2016/07，北卡罗来纳大学夏洛特分校，信息与计算机系，访问学者\n7. 2013/09-2018/11，中国科学技术大学，计算机科学与技术，博士\n8. 2009/09-2013/06，华南理工大学，软件工程，学士\n9. 2009/09-2013/06，华南理工大学，国际经济与贸易，辅修\n研究成果\nNews\nOur Survey\n<\nA Comprehensive Survey of Large Language Models in Management: Applications, Challenges, and Opportunities\n>\nis now available at SSRN!\n期刊论文\n（* 通讯作者，1 Scientific Reports, 2JOC, 10 TKDE, 3 TEVC, 5 TOIS, 1 TPAMI, 2 TKDD, 3 TSMC, 1 TNNLS, 2 TWEB, 1TM, 2 JMSE, 1 TIST, 2TETCI, 1TITS, 4 TBD, 1 Omega, 1 IMM, 2DSS, 1 I&M, 1 TEM, 7 IPM, 1 Internet Research, 1 IJF, 1 CHB, 2 Scientometrics, 1 PR, 3 Information Sciences, 1FCS, 1ECRA, 3 ESWA, 1 IJSWIS, 2 JCST, 5计研发, 1软件学报，1管理科学学报，1管理工程学报, 2控制与决策，1大数据）\n[1] Yuhan Su,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)*\n, Chuan Qin, Dazhong Shen, Hengshu Zhu, AI-Driven Skill Keyword Suggestion for Multi-Round Interviews: A Graph-Based Topic Approach, Information Processing and Management (IPM), Accepted, 2026. (IF:7.46, JCR Q1, CCF/FMS B类期刊)\n[2] Jiahui Wang, Ning Jia, Likang Wu,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Le Wu, Align Sequential Collaborative Signals and Text Semantics for Citation Recommendation: A Hybrid Perspective, ACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (TKDD), Accepted, 2026. (IF4.16, JCR Q1, CCF/FMS B类期刊)\n[3] Cairui Yan, Xu Cheng, Likang Wu, Yingyuan Xiao,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Wenguang Zheng, Bridging the Gap in Cross-Domain Graph Anomaly Detection: Enhanced Source Utilization and Label Accuracy, Information Processing and Management (IPM), Accepted, 2026. (IF:7.46, JCR Q1, CCF/FMS B类期刊)\n[4] Nan Feng, Jiaqi Li,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)*\n, Longjun Zhao, Minqiang Li, Anomaly Detection in Industrial Internet of Things: A Graph Learning Approach with Spatio-temporal Interactions, IEEE Transactions on Engineering Management (IEEE TEM), Accepted, 2026. (IF:5.2, JCR Q2, ABS 3)\n[5] Meikai Bao, Kai Zhang, Xukai Liu, Qi Liu,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Enhong Chen, Learn to Understanding: Knowledge Exemplification via Multi-Agent Cooperation for Science Question Answering, IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE TKDE), Accepted, 2026. (IF:8.9, JCR Q1, CCF A类期刊).\n[6]\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Zhichen Xiang, Likang Wu, Beyond Popularity Bias in E-commerce: Aligning Collaborative Knowledge with Large Language Models via Causal Intervention for Robust Recommendations, Decision Support Systems (DSS), Accepted. 2026. (ABS 3, FMS B类期刊)\n[7] Jiayu Liu, Zhenya Huang, Enhong Chen, Qi Liu,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Xin Lin, Jing Sha, Shijin Wang, Enhancing Mathematical Reasoning through Autonomously Learning Knowledge, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE TPAMI), Accepted. (CCF A类期刊).\n[8]\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Chuang Zhao, Yong Ge, Runze Wu, Rational or Emotional? Next-item Recommendations in Virtual Games via Disentangling Players' Needs, INFORMS Journal on Computing (JOC), Accepted. (UTD24)\n[9] 金宗瀚，吴李康，刘玉祥，何明，\n赵洪科\n，基于知识增强的智能体复杂任务分解方法，控制与决策，录用待发表. (中文核心, FMS T1类期刊)\n[10] Kai Zhang, Zhihong Pan, Lei Yu, Qi Liu,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Chaochao Chen, Enhong Chen, SimCDR: Preserving Intra-Domain Similarities of Users for Cross-Domain Recommendation, ACM Transactions on Information Systems (ACM TOIS), Accepted. (CCF A类期刊).\n[11] Yaxian Wang，Minhao Gu, Baofeng Huo,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)*\n，How do crowdfunding models impact crowdfunding performance? The mediating role of backers' ambiguity and herding effects, Information & Management, 63:104265, 2026. (ABS 3)\n[12] Lei Zhang, Zihao Chen, Wuji Zhang,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Likang Wu, GDiffMAE: Guided Diffusion Enhanced Mask Graph AutoEncoder for Recommendation, IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE TKDE), 37(12): 7199-7212, 2025. (IF:8.9, JCR Q1, CCF A类期刊).\n[13] Xinyu Li, Chuang Zhao,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)*\n, Likang Wu, Ming He, Jianping Fan, GANPrompt: Improving LLM-Based Recommendations with GAN-Enhanced Diversity Prompts, ACM Transactions on Information Systems (ACM TOIS), Accepted. (CCF A类期刊)\n[14] Lei Zhang, Meng Zhu, Yuanyuan Ge, Haipeng Yang, Likang Wu,\nHongke Zhao(赵洪科)\n, Multi-Party Multi-Objective Optimization for Discrete Problems: A Case Study on Multi-Stakeholder Recommendation, IEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (IEEE TEVC), Accept,...[truncated]"
