    "homepage_text": "Tianfei Zhou - Home Page\nTianfei Zhou\nBeijing Institute of Technology\nI am a Professor at the Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT), China.\n            Prior to that, I was a researcher in the BMIC Group\n            at ETH Zurich (Swiss),\n            closely working with Prof.\nEnder\n                Konukoglu\n, and Inception Institute of Artificial Intelligence (UAE).\nMy primary research interests are in the fields of Computer Vision, Machine Learning, and Artificial\n            Intelligence,\n            with broader interests in Robotics and Digital Humanities. Currently, my work focuses on creating\n                intelligent models\n                capable of percepting, reasoning, and making decisions in real visual world, to address real-world\n                applications across\n                domains such as healthcare, industry, and scientific discovery.\nI have received 1 Best Paper and 1 Outstanding Paper Nomination Awards.\n            The research results in leading algorithms that won several international academic challenges\n            held in conjunction with CVPR, ICCV, and industry challenges held by Alibaba.\nProspective Students:\nI am always looking for highly-motivated students to join my group.\n                If you are interested to work with me (for intern, master, PhD, Postdoc),\n                please shoot me an email (tfzhou [at] bit.edu.cn)\nNews\n2025/09: VideoRFT is accepted to NeurIPS 2025!\n2025/08: DAPT is accepted to IEEE Trans. PAMI!\nPreprints\nImage Segmentation in Foundation Model Era: A Survey\nWang Xia, Fei Zhang, Boyu Chang, Wenguan Wang, Ye Yuan, Endor Konukoglu, Daniel Cremers,\nTianfei Zhou\narXiv, 2024\n[Paper]\n[Project]\nPrompt-Driven Continual Graph Learning\nQi Wang,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Ye Yuan, Rui Mao\narXiv, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nPublications\nVideoRFT: Incentivizing Video Reasoning Capability in MLLMs via Reinforced Fine-Tuning\nQi Wang, Yanrui Yu, Ye Yuan, Rui Mao,\nTianfei Zhou\nNeurIPS, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nDecouple before Align: Visual Disentanglement Enhances Prompt Tuning\nFei Zhang,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Jiangchao Yao, Ya Zhang, Ivor W Tsang, Yanfeng\n                                Wang\nIEEE Trans. on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nLAVA: Language Driven Scalable and Versatile Traffic Video Analytics\nYanrui Yu,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Jiaxin Sun, Lianpeng Qiao, Lizhong Ding, Ye\n                                Yuan, Guoren Wang\nACM MM, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOral\nSeeing What Matters: Empowering CLIP with Patch Generation-to-Selection\nGensheng Pei, Tao Chen, Yujia Wang, Xinhao Cai, Xiangbo Shu,\nTianfei\n                                    Zhou\n, Yazhou Yao\nCVPR, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nPrompt Tuning In a Compact Attribute Space\nShiyu Hou,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Shuai Zhang, Ye Yuan, Guoren Wang\nAAAI, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nNonverbal Interaction Detection\nJianan Wei,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Yi Yang, Wenguan Wang\nECCV, 2024\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOn-Road Object Importance Estimation: A New Dataset and A Model with Multi-Fold Top-Down\n                        Guidance\nZhixiong Nan, Yilong Chen,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Tao Xiang\nNeurIPS, 2024\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nnsDB: Architecting the Next Generation Database by Integrating Neural and Symbolic Systems (Vision)\nYe Yuan, Bo Tang,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Zhiwei Zhang, Jianbin Qin\nVLDB, 2024\n[Paper]\nGeneSegNet: a deep learning framework for cell segmentation by integrating gene expression and\n                        imaging\nYuxing Wang, Wenguan Wang, Dongfang Liu, Wenpin Hou,\nTianfei Zhou\n,\n                                Zhicheng Ji\nGenome biology, 2023\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nUncovering Prototypical Knowledge for Weakly Open-Vocabulary Semantic Segmentation\nFei Zhang,\nTianfei Zhou\n, Boyang Li, Hao He, Ya Zhang, Yanfeng Wang\nNeurIPS, 2023\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nFedFA: Federated Feature Augmentation\nTianfei Zhou\n, Ender Konukoglu\nICLR, 2023\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nCascaded Parsing of Human-Object Interaction Recognition\nTianfei Zhou\n, Siyuan Qi, Wenguan Wang, Jianbing Shen, and Song-Chun\n                                Zhu\nIEEE Trans. on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 2021\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nWAIC Youth Outstanding Paper Nomination Award, 2021.\nChampions on two tracks\n                                        (\n[HOI]\n[PIC]\n)\n                                        in ICCV 2019 Person-in-Context challenge.\nA Survey on Deep Learning Technique for Video Segmentation\nTianfei Zhou\n, Faith Porikli, David Crandall, Luc Van Gool, Wenguan\n                                Wang\nIEEE Trans. on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 2022\n[Paper]\n[Project]\nVolumetric Memory Network for Interactive Medical Image Segmentation\nTianfei Zhou\n, Liulei Li, Gustav Bredell, Jianwu Li, Jan Unkelbach and\n                                Ender Konukoglu\nMedical Image Analysis (MedIA), 2022\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nMedIA-MICCAI Best Paper Award, 2022.\nRethinking Semantic Segmentation: A Prototype View\nTianfei Zhou\n, Wenguan Wang, Ender Konukoglu, and Luc Van Gool\nCVPR, 2022\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOral\nExploring Cross-Image Pixel Contrast for Semantic Segmentation\nWenguan Wang*,\nTianfei Zhou*\n,\n                                Jifeng Dai, Ender Konukoglu, and Luc Van Gool (*equal contribution)\nICCV, 2021\n[Paper]\n[Code]\n[机器之心]\nOral\nDifferentiable Multi-Granularity Human Representation Learning for Instance-Aware Human Semantic\n                        Parsing\nTianfei Zhou\n, Wenguan Wang, Si Liu, Yi Yang, and Luc Van Gool\nCVPR, 2021\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nOral"
