    "homepage_text": "Jingwei Chen's Homepage\nJingwei Chen （\n陈经纬\n）\nAssociate Professor\nMember of\nChongqing Key Laboratory of Secure Computing for Biology\n,\nChongqing Institute of Green\n\t\t\tand Intelligent Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n266, Fangzheng Ave., Beibei, Chongqing 400714, China\nchenjingwei AT cigit.ac.cn\n00 86 23 65 93 56 58\norcid.org/0000-0003-3768-3135\nResearch Interests\nComputer Algebra\nSymbolic-Numeric Computation\nComputational Number Theory\nLattice-based Cryptography\nHomomorphic Encryption\nPrivacy-preserving Computation\nPublications  (see also  at\n)\nCopyright Notice:\nAll of the following material are for non-commercial use only except that a specific permission is authorized from the author(s) or the corresponding copyright holder !!!\nXiangyu Hu, Jingwei Chen, Wenyuan Wu, and Yong Feng. SecureHDC-FL: Addressing data heterogeneity in encrypted federated hyperdimensional computing. In:\nICASSP '26\n,  IEEE,  2026.\nHaonan Yuan, Wenyuan Wu and Jingwei Chen. Privacy-preserving, efficient and accurate dimensionality reduction. IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, 21:2191 - 2206,  2026.\nChen Yang, Jingwei Chen, Wenyuan Wu, and Yong Feng. Optimized privacy-preserving clustering with fully homomorphic encryption. In:\nSecureComm '24\n, LNICST 627, pages 76-96, Springer, Cham, 2026.\nYang Liu, Shuai Wang, Jingwei Chen, Wenyuan Wu, and Yong Feng. Efficient privacy-preserving linear system solving based on homomorphic encryption. In: ICAICE '25, pages 723-727, IEEE,  2025.\nXiaokang Dai, Jingwei Chen, Wenyuan Wu, and Yong Feng. Lattice-based, LWE-leakage model for Gaussian and uniform secret and its application in decentralization. Cybersecurity 8, 105:1-18, 2025.\nHaonan Yuan, Wenyuan Wu, Jingwei Chen. SEF-UQR: Scalable and efficient privacy-preserving federated updating QR factorization. In:\nCIKM '25\n, pages 3983-3992, ACM, New York, 2025.\nJingwei Chen, Chen Yang, Yuwen Chen, Kunhua Zhong, Wenqiang Yang, Jiang Liu, Wenyuan Wu, and Bin Yi. Secure multicenter medical model inference from homomorphic encryption. In:  ICIC 2025, LNCS 15868, pages 135-147, Springer, Singapore, 2025.\nJingwei Chen, Linhan Yang, Wenyuan Wu, Yang Liu, and Yong Feng. Homomorphic matrix operations under bicyclic encoding. IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security,   20: 1390-1404, 2025.\nYang Liu, Jiaojiao He, Jingwei Chen, Bo Mi, Ling Zhao, Xinyu Liu, Linhan Yang. Adaptive intelligent sensing control method for traffic lights under real-time vehicle conditions based on logic rules. KSII Transactions on Internet and Information Systems, 18(12): 3390-3413, 2024.\nJingwei Chen, Linhan Yang, Chen Yang, Shuai Wang, Rui Li, Weijie Miao, Wenyuan Wu, Li Yang, Kang Wu, and Lizhong Dai. Secure transformer-based neural network inference for protein sequence classification,  2024.\nJingwei Chen, Weijie Miao, Wenyuan Wu, Linhan Yang and Haonan Yuan. Secure relative detection in (forensic) database with homomorphic encryption. In:\nISBRA '24\n, LNCS 14955, pages 410-422. Springer, Singapore, 2024.\nXiaokang Dai, Jingwei Chen, Wenyuan Wu, and Yong Feng. Lattice-based, more general anti-leakage model and its application in decentralization. In:\nACISP '24\n, LNCS 14896, pages 44-63. Springer, Singapore, 2024.\n张金斗, 陈经纬, 吴文渊, 冯勇. 基于同态加密的隐私保护主成分分析方法. 计算机科学, 51(8):387-395, 2024.\nJingwei Chen, Yong Feng, Yang Liu and Wenyuan Wu. On the probability of generating a primitive matrix. Journal of Systems Science and Complexity, 37(4):1755-1771, 2024.\n刘洋, 杨林翰, 陈经纬, 吴文渊, 冯勇. 同态明文-密文矩阵运算及其应用. 通信学报, 45(2):150-161, 2024.\n陆星缘, 陈经纬, 冯勇, 吴文渊. 基于同态加密的隐私保护数据分类协议. 计算机科学, 50(8): 321-332, 2023.\n杨文强, 吴文渊, 陈经纬, 冯勇. 仿真系统中 DAE 求解技术现状. 包装工程, 48(8):18-27, 2022.\nJingwei Chen, Yong Feng, Yang Liu, Wenyuan Wu and Guanci Yang. Non-interactive privacy-preserving naive Bayes classifier using homomorphic encryption. In:\nSPNCE '21\n, pages 192-203. Springer, Cham, 2022.\n冯勇, 陈经纬. 零误差计算. 中国科学: 数学, 51(1):3-16, 2021.\nYang Liu, Liyuan Huang and Jingwei Chen. Formal verification on the safety of internet of vehicles based on TPN and Z. Mathematical Problems in Engineering, 2020:6618168, 2020.\nYanan Bai, Xiaoyu Shi, Wenyuan Wu, Jingwei Chen, and Yong Feng. seIMC: A GSW-based secure and\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tefficient integer matrix computation scheme with implementation. IEEE Access, 8(1):98383–98394, 2020.\n刘洋, 陈经纬, 冯勇, 吴文渊. 并行 LLL 算法研究综述. 计算机工程与应用, 55(16):36-41, 2019.\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen,\nWenyuan Wu\n. The PSLQ algorithm for empirical data. Mathematics of Computation, 88(317):1479-1501, 2019.\nJingwei Chen,\nDamien Stehlé\nand\nGilles Villard\n. Computing an LLL-reduced basis of the orthogonal lattice. In:\nISSAC '18\n, pages 127-133. ACM, New York, 2018.\n王永恒, 徐晨, 陈经纬,\n吴文渊\n. 基于 HElib 的安全电子投票方案. 计算机应用研究, 34(7):2167-2171, 2017.\nJingwei Chen,\nYong Feng\n, Yang Liu and\nWenyuan Wu\n. Faster binary arithmetic operations on encrypted integers. In Y. Chen, editor, Proc.\nWCSE '17\n, Part III, pages 956-960. The Science and Engineering Institute, Rowland Heights, CA, 2017.\nJingwei Chen,\nYong Feng\n, and\nWenyuan Wu\n. Reducing lattice bases with Bergman exchange. In Y. Xiao and M. Ma, editors, Proc.\nICCSN '17\n, Part II, pages 630-634. IEEE, Piscataway, 2017.\nChen Xu, Jingwei Chen,\nWenyuan Wu\n, and\nYong Feng\n. Homomorphically encrypted arithmetic operations over the integer ring. In F. Bao, et al., editors, Proc.\nISPEC '16\n, LNCS 10060, pages 167-181. Springer, Cham, 2016.\nJingwei Chen,\nYong Feng\n, Yang Liu, Bing Tang, and\nWenyuan Wu\n. Sparse non-negative matrix factorization with generalized Kullback-Leibler divergence. In H.  Yin, et al., editors, Proc.\nIDEAL '16\n, LNCS 9937, pages 353-360. Springer, Cham,  2016.\nYong Feng\n,\nWenyuan Wu\n, Jingzhong Zhang, and Jingwei Chen. Exact bivariate polynomial factorization over ℚ by approximation of roots. Journal of Systems Science and Complexity, 28(1):243-260, 2015.\nWenyuan Wu\n, Jingwei Chen, and\nYong Feng\n. Sparse bivariate polynomial factorization. Science China Mathematics, 57(10):2123-2142, 2014.\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen, and\nWenyuan Wu\n. Two variants of HJLS-PSLQ with applications. In Proc.\nSNC '14\n, pages 88-96. ACM, New York, 2014.\nJingwei Chen,\nDamien Stehlé\nand\nGilles Villard\n. A new view on HJLS and PSLQ: Sums and projections of lattices. In Proc.\nISSAC '13\n, pages 149-156. ACM, New York, 2013.\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen, and\nWenyuan Wu\n. Incremental PSLQ with application to algebraic number reconstruction. ACM Communications in Computer Algebra, 47(3):112-113, 2013.  (\nISSAC '13\nposter)\nXiaolin Qin\n,\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen, and Jingzhong Zhang. Parallel compuatation of real solving bivariate polynomial systems by zero-matching method. Applied Mathematics and Computation, 219(14):7533-7541, 2013.\nWenyuan Wu\n, Jingwei Chen, and\nYong Feng\n. An efficient algorithm to factorize sparse bivariate polynomials over the rationals. ACM Communications in Computer Algebra, 46(3):125-126, 2012. (\nISSAC '12\nposter)\nXiaolin Qin\n,\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen, and Jingzhong Zhang. A complete algorithm to find exact minimal polynomial by approximations. International Journal of Computer Mathematics, 89(17):2333-2344, 2012.\n陈经纬,\n冯勇\n,\n秦小林\n, 张景中. 代数数极小多项式的近似重构. 系统科学与数学, 31(8):903-912, 2011.\n陈经纬,\n冯勇\n,\n秦小林\n, 张景中. SIRD: 一个同步整数关系探测算法. 四川大学学报（工程科学版）, 43(6):127-132, 2011.\n秦小林\n,\n冯勇\n, 陈经纬, 李骏. 采用近似方法的实代数数准确表示及其应用. 四川大学学报（工程科学版）, 42(2):126-131, 2010.\nJingwei Chen,\nYong Feng\n,\nXiaolin Qin\n, and Jingzhong Zhang. Exact polynomial factorization by approximate high degree algebraic numbers. In Proc.\nSNC '09\n, pages 21-28. ACM, New York, 2009.\nXiaolin Qin\n,\nYong Feng\n, Jingwei Chen, and Jingzhong Zhang. Finding exact minimal polynomial by approximations. In Proc.\nSNC '09\n, pages 125-131. ACM, New York, 2009.\n陈经纬. 矩阵特征值的分布. 西南大学学报（自然科学版）, 29