    "homepage_text": "Xiaolong Zouâs Computational Physics and Materials Science group | Home\nWelcome to Xiaolong Zouâs Computational Physics and Materials Science Group in\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTsinghua Shenzhen International Graduate School. We apply state-of-art computational methods to\n\t\t\t\t\t\tunderstand optical, magnetic, and their coupling, as well as catalytic properties of\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlow-dimensional materials. Please refer to\nResearch\nfor more\n\t\t\t\t\t\tinformation.\nCongratulations to Erqing for the acceptance of cooperative bP work to Nat. Commun.\nJun 10, 2021\nCongratulations to Wang Dan for the acceptance of BEC work to JPCL.\nJun 10, 2021\nFunding support for Dr. Dashuai Wang from China Postdoctoral Science Foundation\nDec 22, 2020\nSucessful Ph.D thesis defense of Dr. Runzhang Xu\nDec 18, 2020\nAcceptance of Dr. Shuqing Zhang's review article by Nanoscale\nNov 27, 2020"
  },
  "serper::Hongyuan Zhu": {
    "homepage": "https://hongyuanzhu.github.io/",
    "emails": [
