    "homepage_text": "Fangda Guo\nProfessor (Associate),\nICT CAS\nORCID:\n0000-0003-2401-6499\nScopus ID:\n56427426700\nResearchGate:\nOverview\nWeChat: 476657148\nE-mail: guofangda@ict.ac.cn; gfdyes@gmail.com\nEducation\nReceived the B.E. degree in Software Engineering from Northeastern University, in Jun 2013.\nReceived the M.S. degree in Software Engineering (Supervisor:\nProf. Zhiliang Zhu\n) from Northeastern University, in Jul 2015.\nReceived double M.S. degree in Computer Engineering (Supervisor:\nProf. Virginio Cantoni\n) from\nUniversità degli Studi di Pavia\n, Italy, in May 2016.\nReceived the Ph.D. degree in Computer Science (Supervisor:\nProf. Guoren Wang\n) from\nNortheastern University\n, in Oct 2021.\nQualification\nJoint Ph.D. of\nProf. Wenfei Fan\nin the School of Informatics,\nUniversity of Edinburgh\n, UK, from Oct 2016 to Oct 2017.\nResearch Filed\nSocial Computing\nData Mining\nGraph Management\nDatabases\nQuery Processing and Indexing\nAI Safety\nPublications\nYou can also see\nDBLP\n.\nInternational Journal\nCohesive Group Nearest Neighbor Queries on Road-Social Networks under Multi-Criteria\nFangda Guo\n, Ye Yuan, Guoren Wang, Lei Chen, Xiang Lian, Zimeng Wang.\nIEEE Trans. Knowl. Data Eng. (TKDE)\n, vol. 33, no. 11, pp. 3520-3536, Nov 2021. (\nCCF-A, JCR-Q1, IF 10.4\n)\nUsing reliability risk analysis to prioritize test cases\nYing Wang, Zhiliang Zhu, Bo Yang,\nFangda Guo\n, Hai Yu.\nJournal of Systems and Software (JSS)\n, vol. 139, pp. 14-31, May 2018. (\nCCF-B, JCR-Q1, IF 3.514\n)\nImproving the multimodal probabilistic semantic model by ELM classifiers\nYu Zhang, Ye Yuan,\nFangda Guo\n, Yishu Wang, Guoren Wang.\nJournal of the Franklin Institute\n, vol. 355, no. 4, pp. 1967-1990, Mar 2018. (\nJCR-Q1, IF 4.246\n)\nFast Single Image Super-Resolution via Self-Example Learning and Sparse Representation\nZhiliang Zhu,\nFangda Guo*\n, Hai Yu, Chen Chen.\nIEEE Trans. Multim. (TMM)\n, vol. 16, no. 8, pp. 2178-2190, Dec 2014. (\n中科院一区TOP, CCF-B,