    "homepage_text": "Ser-Nam Lim, PhD\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nSer-Nam Lim, PhD\nAssociate Professor, CS Dept, UCF\nCEO,\nEverlyn AI\n,\n@Everlyn_AI\nLinkedIn\n|\nDBLP\n|\nARXIV\n|\nGS\n#computervision, #language, #neurosymbolic, #AI\nsernam AT gmail\nNote:\nI am always looking for highly motivated, self-driving and creative PhD students. If you are interested in joining my lab, we will however have to work together first that leads to tier-1 conference publications. This is done in the format of independent study if you are already in UCF or external collaborations otherwise.\nStudents whom I have never met before, DO NOT cold email me about getting you a grader/TA job. Please ping the department.\nPublications\nPengjun Fang, Yingqing He, Yazhou Xing, Qifeng Chen, Ser-Nam Lim, Harry Yang, \"AC-Foley: Reference-Audio-Guided Video-to-Audio Synthesis with Acoustic Transfer\",\nICLR 2026\n, Apr 23-27\nXuanming Cui, Jianpeng Cheng, Hong-You Chen, Satya Narayan Shukla, Abhijeet Awasthi, Xichen Pan, Chaitanya Ahuja, Shlok Kumar Mishra, Taipeng Tian, Qi Guo, Ser-Nam Lim, Aashu Singh, Xiangjun Fan, \"Think Then Embed: Generative Context Improves Multimodal Embedding\",\nICLR 2026\n, Apr 23-27\nXianzu Wu, Zhenxin Ai, Harry Yang, Ser-Nam Lim, Jun Liu, Huan Wang, \"Niagara: Normal-Integrated Geometric Affine Field for Scene Reconstruction from a Single View\", IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, doi: 10.1109/TCSVT.2025.3643728\nYatian Pang, Peng Jin, Shuo Yang, Bin Zhu, Bin Lin, Chaoran Feng, Zhenyu Tang, Liuhan Chen, Francis E. H. Tay, Ser-Nam Lim, Harry Yang, Li Yuan, \"Next Patch Prediction for AutoRegressive Visual Generation\",\nAAAI 2026\n, Jan 20-27\nHarold Haodong Chen\n,\nHaojian Huang\n,\nQifeng Chen\n,\nHarry Yang\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\n\"Hierarchical Fine-grained Preference Optimization for Physically Plausible Video Generation\",\nNeuRIPS\n2025\n,\nDec\n2\n-\n7\nJiani Huang\n,\nMayank Keoliya\n,\nMatthew Kuo\n,\nNeelay Velingker\n,\nAmish Sethi\n,\nJungHo Jung\n,\nZiyang Li\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nMayur Naik,\n\"ESCA: Contextualizing Embodied Agents via Scene-Graph Generation\",\nNeuRIPS 2025\n, Dec 2-7\nYan Shu\n,\nHangui Lin\n,\nYexin Liu\n,\nYan Zhang\n,\nGangyan Zeng\n,\nYan Li\n,\nYu ZHOU\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nHarry Yang\n,\nNicu Sebe,\n\"When Semantics Mislead Vision: Mitigating Large Multimodal Models Hallucinations in Scene Text Spotting and Understanding\",\nNeuRIPS 2025\n, Dec 2-7\nTyler King, Ser-Nam Lim, \"Augmented Normalization: Differentiating the Generalized Geometric Median\", NeuRIPS Workshop on Optimization for Machine Learning 2025, Dec 2-7\nZhiqiu Xu, Amish Sethi, Mayur Naik, Ser-Nam Lim, \"Delta Activations: A Representation for Fine-tuned Large Language Models\", NeuRIPS Workshop on Efficient Reasoning 2025, Dec 2-7\nMingzhe Zheng, Yongqi Xu, Haojian Huang, Xuran Ma, Yexin Liu, Wen-Jie Shu, Yatian Pang, Feilong Tang, Qifeng Chen, Harry Yang, Ser-Nam Lim, \"VideoGen-of-Thought: Step-by-step generating multi-shot video with minimal manual intervention\", NeuRIPS NextVid Workshop, Dec 2-7\nAoming Li\nu,\nKevin Miller\n,\nVenkatesh Saligrama\n,\nKate Saenko\n,\nBoqing Gong\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nBryan A. Plummer, \"\nTemporal Experts Averaging for Large-scale Temporal Domain Generalization\",\nEMNLP\n2025\n,\nNov\n5\n-\n9\nYoung Kyun Jang, Ser-Nam Lim, \"Towards Cross-modal Backward-compatible Representation Learning for Vision-Language Models\",\nICCV 2025\n, Oct 19-23\nXuran Ma\n,\nYe xin Liu\n,\nLIU Yaofu\n,\nXianfeng Wu\n,\nMingzhe Zheng\n,\nZihao Wang\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nHarry Yang\n, \"\nModel Reveals What to Cache: Profiling-Based Feature Reuse for Video Diffusion Models\",\nICCV 2025\n, Oct 19-23\nYatian Pang\n,\nBin Zhu\n,\nBin Lin\n,\nMingzhe Zheng\n,\nFrancis E. H. Tay\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nHarry Yang\n,\nLi Yuan\n, \"\nDreamDance: Animating Human Images by Enriching 3D Geometry Cues from 2D Poses\",\nICCV 2025\n,\nOct 19-23\nAhmad Mohammadshirazi\n,\nPinaki Prasad Guha Neogi\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nRajiv Ramnath\n, \"\nDLaVA: Document Language and Vision Assistant for Answer Localization with Enhanced Interpretability and Trustworthiness\n\",\nICML\n3rd Workshop on Efficient Systems for Foundation Models 2025, Jul 13-19\nZhuoling Li\n,\nXiaogang Xu\n,\nSerNam Lim\n,\nHengshuang Zhao\n, \"\nTowards Unified 3D Object Detection via Algorithm and Data Unification\",\nTPAMI\n,\n2024-09-2374.R1\nYuanpeng Tu\n,\nXi Chen\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nHengshuang Zhao\n, \"\nDreamMask: Boosting Open-vocabulary Panoptic Segmentation with Synthetic Data\",\nSIGGRAPH\n2025\n,\nAug\n1\n0\n-1\n4\nXuanming Cui, Wei Peng Chionh, Adriel Kuek, Ser-Nam Lim, \" Improving Soft Unification with Knowledge Graph Embedding Methods\",\nICML\n202\n5\n,\nJul 13\n-19\nZhuoling Li\n,\nXiaogang Xu\n,\nZhenhua Xu\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n,\nHengshuang Zhao\n, \"\nLARM: Large Auto-Regressive Model for Long-Horizon Embodied Intelligence\",\nICML\n2025\n, Jul 13-19\nLan Wang, Wei Ao, Vishnu Boddeti, Ser-Nam Lim, \"Generative Zero-Shot Composed Image Retrieval\",\nCVPR\n202\n5\n,\nJun\n11\n-\nJun\n15\nYe xin Liu,\nZhengyang Liang\n,\nYueze Wang\n,\nXianfeng Wu\n,\nFeilong Tang\n,\nMuyang He\n,\nJian Li\n,\nZheng Liu\n,\nHarry Yang\n,\nSer-Nam Lim\n, Bo Zhao, \"Unveiling the Ignorance of MLLMs: Seeing Clearly, Answering Incorrectly\",\nCVPR\n2025\n, Jun 11-Jun 15\nAmin Karimi Monsefi, Kishore Prakash Sailaja, Ali Alilooee, Ser-Nam Lim,\nRajiv Ramnath\n, \"D\netail\nCLIP: D\netail\n-\nOriented CLIP for Fine-grained Tasks\", ICLR Workshop on SSI-FM 2025, Apr 24-Apr28\nAmin Karimi Monsefi, Mengxi Zhou, Nastaran Karimi Monsefi, Ser-Nam Lim, Wei-Lun Chao, Rajiv Ramnath, \"\nFrequency-Guided Masking for Enhanced Vision Self-Supervised Learning\",\nICLR\n202\n5\n,\nApr 24\n-\nApr\n28\nJiani Huang, Ziyang Li, Mayur Nail, Ser-Nam Lim, \"\nLASER: A Neuro-Symbolic Framework for Learning Spatio-Temporal Scene Graphs with Weak Supervision\",\nICLR\n202\n5\n,\nA