    "homepage_text": "Jisu Cao - Research\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJisu Cao\nResearch\nPublished Papers\n1.\nCao, J., & Yang, S. (2024).\nUnderstanding the impact of reviews on consumer product choices under negotiated pricing\n.\nManagement Science\n.\nMedia Coverage:\nW. P. Carey professor finds consumer reviews can help buyers' bargaining power.\n2.\nZheng, X., Cao, J., Hong, Y., Yang, S., & Ren, X.\n(2023),\nDifferential effects of multi-dimensional review evaluations on product sales for mainstream vs. niche products.\nMIS Quarterly\n, 47(2),\n833-856\n.\nRunner-up, Best Theme Paper, ICIS 2018\nWorking\nPapers\n1. Guidance Beats Compassionate Language in AI Support: Verbal Response Modes in Human-and AI-Mediated Mental Wellness Support.\nJisu Cao,\nKseniia Biriukova\n,\nHan Gong\n,\nPei-yu Chen\n, and\nXuan Zhao\n, available at\nSSRN\n, submitted.\n2.\nBalancing Compliance, Creativity, and Engagement: Evaluating the Impact of NSFW Governance on User Behaviors for Gen AI Platforms.\nJisu Cao, Keran Zhao, Xiaowei Liu, Che-Wei Liu, and Jiang Duan\n, available at\nSSRN\n, submitted.\nRunner-up, ISS Best\nCluster\nPaper, I\nNFORMS\n20\n25\n3.\nTethered Wings: Understanding the Impact of Drone Usage Restrictions on Deviant User Behavior\nVictor Benjamin, Jisu Cao, Pei-yu Chen, Hongyi Zhu, available at\nSSRN\n, submitted.\n4. Bytes and Bets: How Online Forums Shape Risk Attitudes and Returns\nJisu Cao, Jiding Zhang,\nPei-yu Chen, available at\nSSRN\n, submitted.\nBest\nAccepted\nPaper,\nAOM\n2025\n5.\nUnderstanding How Competing Products of Different Quality Tiers Affect Consumer Purchase and Return Decisions and the Implications to E-commerce Platform Growth\nJisu Cao, Sha Yang, and Chunmian Ge\n,\navailable at\nSSRN\n.\n6.\nThe Impact of Logistics Service Time on Customer Product Returns and Repurchases:\nA Holistic and Dynamic Perspective\nJisu Cao, Sha Yang, Chunmian Ge, and Yi Yang\n,\navailable at\nSSRN\n.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
