    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Liu, Hongrui | People | San Jose State University\nSkip to Main Content\nLiu, Hongrui\nSan José State University\nSite Navigation\nSJSU Home\n>\nPeople\n>\nLiu, Hongrui\nLiu, Hongrui\none.SJSU\nCanvas\nAthletics\nGive to SJSU\nAssociate Professor, Industrial and Systems Engineering\nEmail\nPreferred:\nhongrui.liu@sjsu.edu\nTelephone\nPreferred:\n4089243989\nBio\nHongrui Liu is currently an associate professor in Industrial and Systems Engineering\n                           at San Jose State University (SJSU). Her primary research interests are optimization\n                           modeling, computing algorithms, data analytics, machine learning and artificial intelligence,\n                           and their applications in\nsupply chain and energy industry.\nDr. Liu\nhas over 10\nyears\nof experience in the energy management industry, where she\nworks\nclosely\nwith independent regional transmission organizations (ISO) in the design, development,\n                              and analysis of advanced optimization tools for electricity scheduling, pricing, and\n                              dispatch.\nShe received her Ph.D. degree from Industrial and Systems Engineering at the University\n                           of Washington, USA in 2010.\nSJSU Links and Resources\nLast Modified: Feb 5, 2025"
  },
