    "homepage_text": "Dr. Chao Yu\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nDr. Chao Yu\nChao Yu\nAssistant Professor\nIntegrated Marketing Communication\nThe Medill School, Northwestern University\nMy name is Chao Yu. I am currently an assistant professor in the Department of\nIntegrated Marketing Communications\nat\nNorthwestern\nUniversity. I received my PhD in Communication from Cornell University.\nMy research focuses on social impacts of new media. I use big data studies to uncover hidden patterns on new media platforms that can create inequalities or biases, as well as identifying policies and strategies to improve them.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
