    "homepage_text": "Yi-Feng Wang research group\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nThe Wang Group\n@USTC\nThe Wang Group @USTC\nWelcome to the official website of The Wang Group, an organic chemistry research lab at the University of Science and Technology of China (USTC). Our research focuses on radical and organoboron chemistry.\nNews & Events\nOur paper on boryl radical-catalysed intra- and intermolecular cyclizations has been accepted by ACIE. Congrats Jie and Eleen.\nApr 10, 2024\nOur paper on asymmetric boryl radical catalysis has been accepted by Science. Congrats Changling, Jie, and Jikang.\nDec 1, 2023\nEleen joined the group.\nDec 20, 2022\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\nUp\nbottom of page"
  },
