    "homepage_text": "Ziming Miao at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nZiming Miao\nResearcher\nAbout\nZiming Miao is a researcher at MSR-Asia. He joined Microsoft in 2018 and focuses on deep learning frameworks and infrastructure optimization.\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nResearch groups\nIntelligent Cloud and Edge Group\nSystems and Networking Research Group (Asia)\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit"
