    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Wanquan Feng\nWanquan Feng (冯万泉)\nResearcher @ ByteDance Seed Team\nMultimodal AI / Video Generation / World Model\nEmail: wanquan0322@gmail.com\nWechat(微信): lcfwqq\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n                    [\nGitHub\n] \n                    [\n知乎\n]\nShort Bio\nI am currently a researcher at the\nByteDance Seed Team\n, focusing on multimodal AI, especially video generation.\nFrom July 2022 to November 2023, I served as a researcher at the\nKling Team\n, Y-tech, Kuaishou Technology (Kwai Inc.). I earned my Ph.D. degree in 2022 from School of Mathematical Sciences at\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n, under the guidance of\nProf. Juyong Zhang\n. Prior to my doctorate, I obtained my bachelor's degree from USTC in 2016.\nNOTE: As of 2026, my research interests primarily focus on VIDEO GENERATION (follow-up version of\nSeedance\n) and WORLD MODEL. I welcome discussions on related topics; let's collaborate and strive for progress together (✿◠‿◠)\nNews\n[2026-02]\nTwo papers accepted to CVPR 2026.\n[2025-06]\nOne paper accepted to ICCV 2025.\n[2025-04] Code of\nHyperLoRA\nreleased.\n[2025-02] Code of\nAR-Diffusion\nreleased.\n[2025-02]\nFour papers accepted to CVPR 2025.\n[2025-01] Code of\nDeTeCtive\nreleased.\n[2024-12]\nOne paper accepted to ICLR 2025.\n[2024-11] Received the 'Breakthrough in New Areas' award of ByteDance Intelligent Creation in 2024-Q3.\n[2024-09]\nOne paper accepted to NeurIPS 2024.\n[2023-12] Joined Intelligent Creation, ByteDance.\n▼ Show More\n[2023-07]\nOne paper accepted to SIGGRAPH Asia 2023.\n[2023-02]\nOne paper accepted to CIMS 2023.\n[2022-09]\nOne paper accepted to NeurIPS 2022.\n[2022-07] Joined Y-tech, Kuaishou Technology.\n[2022-06] Earned Ph.D. degree from USTC.\n[2022-04]\nOne paper accepted to CVM 2022.\n[2022-03]\nOne paper accepted to CVPR 2022.\n[2021-09]\nOne paper accepted to TVCG 2021.\n[2021-03]\nOne paper accepted to CVPR 2021.\nPublications & Preprints\n(* equal contribution,\n†\ncorresponding author)\n2026\nScaling4D: Pushing the Frontier of Video Novel View Synthesis through Large-Scale Monocular Videos\nHongrui Cai, Junjie Luo, Zhihong Fu, Shengnan Zhu, Jiawei Wen,\nWanquan Feng\n†\n, Songtao Zhao, Qian He\nCVPR 2026.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n]\nDreamStyle: A Unified Framework for Video Stylization\nMengtian Li, Jinshu Chen, Songtao Zhao,\nWanquan Feng\n, Pengqi Tu, Qian He\nCVPR 2026.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n]\n2025\nI2VControl: Disentangled and Unified Video Motion Synthesis Control\nWanquan Feng\n†\n, Tianhao Qi, Jiawei Liu, Mingzhen Sun, Pengqi Tu, Tianxiang Ma, Fei Dai, Songtao Zhao, Siyu Zhou, Qian He\nICCV 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n]\nHyperLoRA: Parameter-Efficient Adaptive Generation for Portrait Synthesis\nMengtian Li\n*\n, Jinshu Chen\n*\n,\nWanquan Feng\n*†\n, Bingchuan Li, Fei Dai, Songtao Zhao, Qian He\nCVPR 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nMask²DiT: Dual Mask-based Diffusion Transformer for Multi-Scene Long Video Generation\nTianhao Qi, Jianlong Yuan,\nWanquan Feng\n, Shancheng Fang, Jiawei Liu, SiYu Zhou, Qian He, Hongtao Xie, Yongdong Zhang\nCVPR 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nAR-Diffusion: Asynchronous Video Generation with Auto-Regressive Diffusion\nMingzhen Sun, Weining Wang, Gen Li, Jiawei Liu, Jiahui Sun,\nWanquan Feng\n, Shanshan Lao, SiYu Zhou, Qian He, Jing Liu\nCVPR 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nAnyDressing: Customizable Multi-Garment Virtual Dressing via Latent Diffusion Models\nXinghui Li, Qichao Sun, Pengze Zhang, Fulong Ye, Zhichao Liao,\nWanquan Feng\n†\n, Songtao Zhao\n†\n, Qian He\nCVPR 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nStyleBrush: Style Extraction and Transfer from a Single Image\nWancheng Feng,\nWanquan Feng\n, Dawei Huang, Jiaming Pei, Guangliang Cheng, Lukun Wang\n†\nPreprint.\n[\nPaper\n]\nI2VControl-Camera: Precise Video Camera Control with Adjustable Motion Strength\nWanquan Feng\n†\n, Jiawei Liu, Pengqi Tu, Tianhao Qi, Mingzhen Sun, Tianxiang Ma, Songtao Zhao, Siyu Zhou, Qian He\nICLR 2025.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\n2024\nDeTeCtive: Detecting AI-generated Text via Multi-Level Contrastive Learning\nXun Guo, Shan Zhang, Yongxin He, Ting Zhang,\nWanquan Feng\n, Haibin Huang\n†\n, Chongyang Ma\nNeurIPS 2024.\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n][\nCode\n]\n2023\nTowards Practical Capture of High-Fidelity Relightable Avatars\nHaotian Yang, Mingwu Zheng,\nWanquan Feng\n, Haibin Huang, Yu-Kun Lai, Pengfei Wan, Zhongyuan Wang, Chongyang Ma\n†\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n]\nDifferentiable Deformation Graph based Neural Non-rigid Registration\nWanquan Feng\n, Hongrui Cai, Junhui Hou, Bailin Deng, Juyong Zhang\n†\nCIMS 2023.\n[\nPaper\n][\nVideo\n]\n2022\nResearch on Geometric Shape Representation for Deep Geometric Learning\nWanquan Feng\nPh.D. Thesis.\n[\nPaper (Full text in Chinese)\n]\nNeural Surface Reconstruction of Dynamic Scenes with Monocular RGB-D Camera\nHongrui Cai,\nWanquan Feng\n, Xuetao Feng, Yan Wang, Juyong Zhang\n†\nNeurIPS 2022.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nFacial optical flow estimation via neural non-rigid registration\nZhuang Peng, Boyi Jiang, Haofei Xu,\nWanquan Feng\n, Juyong Zhang\n†\nCVM 2022.\n[\nPaper\n]\nNeural Points: Point Cloud Representation with Neural Fields for Arbitrary Upsampling\nWanquan Feng\n, Jin Li, Hongrui Cai, Xiaonan Luo, Juyong Zhang\n†\nCVPR 2022.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\n2021\nGDR-Net: A Geometric Detail Recovering Network for 3D Scanned Objects\nWanquan Feng\n, Juyong Zhang\n†\n, Yuanfeng Zhou, Shiqing Xin\nTVCG 2021.\n[\nPaper\n]\nRecurrent Multi-view Alignment Network for Unsupervised Surface Registration\nWanquan Feng\n, Juyong Zhang\n†\n, Hongrui Cai, Haofei Xu, Junhui Hou, Hujun Bao\nCVPR 2021.\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]"
