    "homepage_text": "ï»¿\nä¸æµ·äº¤éå¤§å­¦-çµå­ä¿¡æ¯ä¸çµæ°å·¥ç¨å­¦é¢-English\nä¸­æ\nHome\nAbout Us\nDean's Message\nOverview\nLeadership\nHistory\nGlobalization\nVisit SEIEE\nAdministration\nContact Us\nStudents\nFuture Students\nPrograms\nGraduate Students\nUndergraduate Students\nExchange Students\nMore Information\nAcademics\nDepartments\nDiscipline Structure\nCooperation\nResearch Direction\nKey Laboratories\nResearch Achievements\nFaculty\nElectrical Engineering\nAutomation\nComputer Science & Engineering\nElectronic Engineering\nInstrument Science and Engineering\nMicro-Nano Electronics\nSchool of Software\nAcademy of Information Technology and Electrical Engineering\nSchool of Cyber Security\nElectrical and Electronic Experimental Teaching Center\nCenter for Advanced Electronic Materials and Devices\nCooperative Medianet Innovation Center\nAlumni\nEvents\nAnnouncement\nPublications\nNotable Alumni\nGive to SEIEE\nNetworks and Connections\nPositions\nForum\nFaculty\nElectrical Enginee...\nAutomation\nComputer Science &...\nElectronic Enginee...\nInstrument Science...\nMicro-Nano Electro...\nSchool of Software\nAcademy of Informa...\nSchool of Cyber Se...\nElectrical and Ele...\nCenter for Advance...\nCooperative Median...\nElectronic Engineering\nNameï¼\nYang Xiaokang\nTitleï¼\nProfessor\nOfficeï¼\n5-407\nOffice Phoneï¼\nEmailï¼\nxkyang@sjtu.edu.cn\nWebsiteï¼\nResearch Field\nImage Processing, Video Coding, Information Retrieval\nPattern Recognition\nEducation\nPh.D., Pattern Recognition, 2000, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, China.\nM.S., Signal Processing, 1997, Chinese Academy of Sciences.\nB.S., Physics, 1994, Xiamen University, China\nWork experience\nProfessor and Deputy Director, Institute of Image Communication and Information Processing, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, China, 08/2006-Present.\nAlexander von Humboldt Research Fellow, Institute for Computer Science, University of Freiburg, Germany, 08/2007-07/2008.\nAssociate professor, Institute of Image Communication and Information Processing, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, China, 11/2004-08/2006.\nSenior Research Scientist, Institute for Infocomm Research, Singapore, 04/2002-10/2004.\nResearch Fellow, Centre for Signal Processing, Nanyang Technical University, Singapore, 09/2000 â 04/2002.\nResearch\nAwards and Honors\nHe received National Science Fund for Distinguished Young Scholars, 2010, Professorship Award of Shanghai Special Appointment (Eastern Scholar), 2008, the Microsoft Young Professorship Award 2006, the Best Young Investigator Paper Award at IS&T/SPIE International Conference on Video Communication and Image Processing (VCIP2003) and awards from A-STAR and Tan Kah Kee foundations.\nTeaching\nVideo Signal Processing and Coding\nPublications\nHe has published over 150 refereed papers, and has filed 20 patents.\nOthers\nStudents\nAvailable Programs\nUndergraduate Application\nGraduate Application\nExchange Application\nCurrent Graduates\nCurrent Undergraduates\nCurrent Exchange\nSJTU Intl' Students\nSJTU Exchange Students\nAcademic Calendar\nFaculty/Staff\nResearch\nSelf-Development\nGo Abroad\nJob Oppotunities\nApplication Procesure\nSEIEE Faculty\nSJTU Life\nDownloads\nSEIEE HR Department\nSJTU HR Department\nAlumni\nEvents\nGroups\nImages\nHistory\nOverseas\nSourvenir\nCelebrities\nPulication\nHomecoming\nFind Connection\nVistors\nGetting Here\nCampus-bus Schedule\nBookstores\nLodging\nCampus Map\nFood Services\nHospitals\nAbout SJTU\nAbout Shanghai\nTravel Around\nQuick Links\nSJTU\nSIE\nGraduate School\nUndergraduate School\nInt'l Coop.Division\nLibrary\nMuseum\nSJTU Alumni Association\nZizhu Hi-Tech Park\nU.S. Consulate\nWeibo\näººäººç½\nWechat"
