    "homepage_text": "Pengfei Guo's Homepage\nSearch\nPengfei Guo\nSenior Applied Research Scientist\nNVIDIA\nBiography\nI am a Senior Applied Research Scientist at NVIDIA. I received my PhD degree at Department of Computer Science, Johns Hopkins University and was a member of the\nVision and Image Understanding (VIU) Lab\n, advised by\nDr. Vishal M Patel\n. I worked closely with\nMR Research Division\n, Johns Hopkins Medicine to develop clinical applications.\nMy research interest lies at the intersection of medical image analysis, computer vision and machine learning. I fortunately interned at NVIDIA (Summer 2021), Hyperfine (Summer 2022), and Google (Fall 2022) during doctoral study.\nInterests\nMedical Image Analysis\nComputer Vision\nMachine Learning\nEducation\nPhD in Computer Science, 2020-2023\nJohns Hopkins University\nMSE in Computer Science, 2018-2019\nJohns Hopkins University\nBSc in Computational Mathematics (With Honors), 2015-2018\nMichigan State University\nRecent News\nMarch, 2023 - Joined\nNVIDIA\nas Applied Research Scientist.\nMarch, 2023 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nMIDL 2023\n.\nMarch, 2023 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nPML4DC@ICLR 2023\n.\nFeb, 2023 - Received Trainee (Educational) Stipend from\nISMRM\n.\nFeb, 2023 - I successfully defended my Ph.D. thesis!!!\n.\nSep, 2022 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nNeurIPS 2022\n.\nSep, 2022 - Joined\nGoogle\nas Research Intern.\nJul, 2022 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nNeuroImage: Clinical\n.\nJul, 2022 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nECCV 2022\n.\nJun, 2022 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nMICCAI 2022\n.\nMay, 2022 - Joined\nHyperfine Research\nas Machine Learning Intern.\nMar, 2022 -\n2 papers\naccepted at\nCVPR 2022\n.\nFeb, 2022 - Received Trainee (Educational) Stipend from\nISMRM\n.\nFeb, 2022 - Gave a talk at WSDM'22 WORKSHOP\nFL4P-WSDM\n: Federated Learning for Private Web Search and Data Mining.\nJun, 2021 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nMICCAI 2021\n.\nMay, 2021 - Joined\nNVIDIA\nas Applied Research Intern.\nMar, 2021 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nCVPR 2021\n.\nDec, 2020 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nIEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging\n.\nJul, 2020 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nECCV 2020\n.\nJul, 2020 -\n1 paper\naccepted at\nBiomedical Optics Express\n.\nJun, 2020 -\n2 papers\naccepted at\nMICCAI 2020\n.\nJan, 2020 - Joined\nVIU\nfor my PhD.\nContact\nPengfei Guo (郭鹏飞)，guopengfei37425[at]gmail[dot]com\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
  },
