    "homepage_text": "Hong Yao's website\nHong Yao\nProfessor, Institute for Advanced\nStudy,\nTsinghua University\nHome\nNews\nPeople\nResearch\nPublications\nAs\na\ncondensed\n    matter theorist, I am mainly interested in identifying, characterizing, and\n    classifying new states of matter. My research is currently focused on quantum\n    systems where strong correlation effect or topological character plays an\n    important role in understanding their low energy and long wave-length\n    physics. These kinds of quantum systems include quantum spin liquids, high\n    temperature superconductors, quantum Hall systems, topological insulators\n    and superconductors.\nIn August of 2012, I\nmov\ned\n    t\no\nthe\nInstitute for\n    Advanced Study at Tsinghua University\nin Beijing as a faculty member.\nSince December of 2017, I have been a\n    Professor of Institute for Advanced Study at Tsinghua University.\nHere is my\nwebsite\nat Tsinghua University.\nUpdated\nin\nApril\n201\n8\n."
  },
