    "github": "https://github.com/cjeen",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Chenjian Gao\nChenjian Gao\nPh.D. student at MMLab, The Chinese University of Hong Kong\nEmail: gaochenjian At gmail Dot com\nAbout\nHi, I am Chenjian Gao (高宸健). I am a first-year Ph.D. student at Multimedia Laboratory (MMLab), The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK). I am supervised by Prof.\nTianfan Xue\n. Before that, I worked as a research assistant there for one year, collaborating closely with Zhanpeng Huang. I am also a research intern supervised by\nLinning Xu\n.\nPrior to that, I received my M.Eng. from Beihang University (BUAA) in 2024, supervised by Prof.\nQian Yu\n, and my B.Eng. from the same university in 2021. During my master's study, I worked closely with Prof.\nLu Sheng\nand Prof.\nDong Xu\n. I also had internship experiences at SenseTime (ISP & Codec, worked with\nSock Xu\n), Tencent (IEG, worked with Yingpeng Zhang), and ByteDance.\nMy current research interest lies in\n3D-aware image and video editing\n. Feel free to reach out if you are interested in collaboration!\nSelected Publications\n* indicates equal contribution, † indicates corresponding author\nLoRA-Edit: Controllable First-Frame-Guided Video Editing via Mask-Aware LoRA Fine-Tuning\nChenjian Gao\n, \n                                    Lihe Ding,\n                                    Xin Cai,\n                                    Zhanpeng Huang,\n                                    Zibin Wang,\n                                    Tianfan Xue\nICLR 2026\n[Paper]\n[Project Page]\n[Code]\nFrom Gallery to Wrist: Realistic 3D Bracelet Insertion in Videos\nChenjian Gao\n, \n                                    Lihe Ding,\n                                    Rui Han,\n                                    Zhanpeng Huang\n†\n,\n                                    Zibin Wang,\n                                    Tianfan Xue\n†\nICCV 2025\n[Paper]\n[Project Page]\n3D Reconstruction From a Single Sketch via View-Dependent Depth Sampling\nChenjian Gao\n*\n, \n                                    Xilin Wang\n*\n,\n                                    Qian Yu\n†\n,\n                                    Lu Sheng, \n                                    Jing Zhang, \n                                    Xiaoguang Han, \n                                    Yi-Zhe Song, \n                                    Dong Xu\nT-PAMI 2024\n[Paper]\nGenesisTex: Adapting Image Denoising Diffusion to Texture Space\nChenjian Gao\n*\n, \n                                    Boyan Jiang,\n                                    Xinghui Li,\n                                    Yingpeng Zhang\n*\n,\n                                    Qian Yu\n†\nCVPR 2024\n[Paper]\nFlexible Neural Image Compression via Code Editing\nChenjian Gao\n*\n,\n                                    Tongda Xu\n*\n, \n                                    Dailan He, \n                                    Yan Wang\n†\n, \n                                    Hongwei Qin\nNeurIPS 2022\n[Paper]\nSketchSampler: Sketch-based 3D Reconstruction via View-dependent Depth Sampling\nChenjian Gao\n, \n                                    Qian Yu\n†\n, \n                                    Lu Sheng, \n                                    Yi-Zhe Song, \n                                    Dong Xu\nECCV 2022\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nService\nReviewer for AAAI'2026, CVPR'2025, CVPR'2024, ACM MM'2024\nSpecial thanks to Yumeng\nThe website template was borrowed from\n[1]\n."
  },
