    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yuhao Zhou\n[click image for domain randomization]\nEmail\n: zhou1437 [at] purdue.edu\nzhou [at] race.t.u-tokyo.ac.jp\nzhou.yuha [at] northeastern.edu\nyzhou035 [at] e.ntu.edu.sg\nPh.D. student working with\nProf. Yu She\n.\nMaster's training at\nMobile Robotics Laboratory\n,\nThe University of Tokyo\n, fortunate to be supervised by\nProf. Jun Ota\n. Previously attended\nNanyang Technological University\n, Singapore. Middle and high school at Chengdu Shude High School.\nHis current research interests include tactile sensing and dexterous manipulation.\nCurriculum Vitae\n/\nGitHub\n/\nGoogle Scholar\nNews\n[see more]\n[06/2025]: Presented a poster in\nMWRW\n@ TTIC.\n[08/2024]: Our IROS'24 paper is covered by\nTechXplore\n.\n[04/2024]: Presented a poster in\nMWRW\n@ TTIC.\n[09/2023]: Won the Outstanding Master Thesis Award (修士論文優秀賞).\n[07/2023]: Presented a paper in AIM'23 @ Seattle, USA.\n[03/2022]: Received Google Travel Grant.\n[10/2021]: Received JASSO Scholarship from MEXT, Japan.\n[08/2021]: Our robot Jet-HR2 is covered by IEEE Spectrum.\n[06/2020]: Won the Outstanding Undergraduate Thesis Award. (top 3%)\nPublications\n(* denotes equal contribution)\nFirst Author:\nYuhao Zhou\n,\nSheeraz Athar\n*,\nZhixian Hu\n*,\nBinghao Huang\n,\nYunzhu Li\n,\nJuan Wachs\n, and\nYu She\nVTAP Gripper: Synergizing Fingertip Sensing and a Visuo-Tactile Active Palm for Dexterous In-Hand Manipulation\nUnder Review\nYuhao Zhou\n,\nWon Suk Lee\n,\nYan Gu\n, and\nYu She\nTactile-Reactive Gripper with an Active Palm for Dexterous Manipulation\nNature Portfolio Journal Robotics\n[Paper]\n[Video]\nYuhao Zhou\n*,\nPokuang Zhou\n*,\nShaoxiong Wang\n, and\nYu She\nIn-Hand Singulation, Scooping, and Cable Untangling with a 5-DOF Tactile-Reactive Gripper\nAdvanced Robotics Research\n[Paper]\n[Video]\n[Website]\nCover Feature\n[link]\nYuhao Zhou\n,\nPokuang Zhou\n,\nShaoxiong Wang\n, and\nYu She\nIn-Hand Singulation and Scooping Manipulation with a 5 DOF Tactile Gripper\nIROS 2024\n[Preprint]\n[Paper]\n[Poster]\n[Video]\nCovered by:\n[TechXplore]\n[机器人大讲堂]\nYuhao Zhou\n, Ryota Takamido, Masako Kanai-Pak, Jukai Maeda, Yasuko Kitajima, Mitsuhiro Nakamura, Noriaki Kuwahara, Taiki Ogata, and\nJun Ota\nDevelopment of a Nursing Skill Training System Based on Manipulator Variable Admittance Control\nAIM 2023\n[Paper]\nYuhang Li*,\nYuhao Zhou\n*, Junbing Huang, Zijun Wang, Shunjie Zhu,\nKairong Wu\n, Li Zheng, Jiajin Luo, Rui Cao,\nYun Zhang\n,\nZhifeng Huang\nJet-HR2: A Flying Bipedal Robot Based on Thrust Vector Control\nRA-L\nwith\nICRA 2022\noption\n[Preprint]\n[Paper]\n[Video]\nCovered by:\n[IEEE Spectrum Column]\n[IEEE Spectrum Video Friday]\n[GDUT News]\n[机器之心]\nCo-Authored:\nMd Rakibul Islam Prince\n, Jaeeun Kim,\nYuhao Zhou\n, Mason Vrshek, Shivani Reddy Sama, Adyaa Khera,\nSheeraz Athar\n, Zijie Xu, Jiabin Liu, Shaoting Lin, Wei Li, and\nYu She\nMVP-Tac: A Miniaturized Dual-Modal Vision and Photoelastic Tactile Sensor for Robot-Assisted Minimally Invasive Surgery\nUnder Review\nKaidi Zhang\n*,\nHeng Zhang\n*, Zhengtong Xu, Zhiyuan Zhang, MD Rakibul Islam Prince, Li Xiang, Xiaojing Han,\nYuhao Zhou\n,\nArash Ajoudani\n, and\nYu She\nTacVLA: Contact-Aware Tactile Fusion for Robust Vision-Language-Action Manipulation\nUnder Review\n[Preprint]\n[Website]\nPokuang Zhou\n,\nYuhao Zhou\n,\nQuan Luu\n, Seungho Han,\nHeng Zhang\n,\nBinghao Huang\n,\nYunzhu Li\n,\nArash Ajoudani\n, Zhengtong Xu, and\nYu She\nLearning Tactile-Aware Quadrupedal Loco-Manipulation Policies\nUnder Review\nRyota Takamido\n,\nYuhao Zhou\n, Masako Kanai-Pak, Jukai Maeda, Yasuko Kitajima, Mitsuhiro Nakamura, Noriaki Kuwahara, Taiki Ogata, and\nJun Ota\nImmersive and Manipulator-Based Robot Patient System for Learning Wheelchair Transfers in Nursing Education\nRevision in Progress at\nT-LT\nZhifeng Huang\n, Zijun Wang, Jiapeng Wei, Jingtao Yu,\nYuhao Zhou\n, Pihao Lao, Xiaoliang Huang,\nXuexi Zhang\n, and\nYun Zhang\nThree-Dimensional Posture Optimization for Biped Robot Stepping over Large Ditch Based on a Ducted-Fan Propulsion System\nIROS 2020\n[Paper]\n[Video]\nTeaching\n[08/2024 - 12/2024]: \r\n                Teaching Assistant,\nIE474 Industrial Control Systems\n, Fall 2024, Purdue University.\n[01/2024 - 05/2024]: \r\n                Teaching Assistant,\nIE574 Industrial Robotics And Flexible Assembly\n, Spring 2024, Purdue University.\nReviewer Service\nIEEE RoboSoft 2026\nIEEE RA-L 2025\nJ-FR 2025\nIEEE T-IE 2025\nIEEE/RSJ IROS 2024, 2026\nExperience\n[07/2019 - 08/2019]: \r\n                Summer Intern @\nCloudMinds Robotics (Beijing) Co., Ltd.\n-->"
