    "homepage_text": "Shaoheng Fang\n(Bryant) Shaoheng Fang\nI am a Ph.D. student at the\nDepartment of Computer Science\nat\nUT Austin\n, advised by\nQixing Huang\nand with the support of\nNSF Graduate Research Fellowship\nand UT College of Natural Science Dean’s Prestigious Fellowship. \n                I am broadly interested in 3D computer vision, with a recent focus on 3D/4D content generation.\nPreviously, I was a master's student in the Department of Computer Science at\nUT Austin\n, advised by\nQixing Huang\nand\nRaymond Mooney\n. \n                I received my Bachelor's degree in Computer Science from\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n, where I worked with\nSiheng Chen\n. \n                I am fortunate to have worked with\nChaohui Yu\nand Fan Wang at DAMO Academy. \n                I visited\nSGP Group\nat UCL this summer, advised by\nNiloy Mitra\n.\nEmail: bshang [at] gmail [dot] com\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nLinkedIn\nNews\n[25/06]\nHonored to receive the\nNSF Graduate Research Fellowship\n!\nResearch\nWorldReel: 4D Video Generation with Consistent Geometry and Motion Modeling\nShaoheng Fang\n, Hanwen Jiang, Yunpeng Bai, Niloy J. Mitra, Qixing Huang\nArxiv\n, 2025\npaper\n/\nwebsite\n/\nGeoVideo: Introducing Geometric Regularization into Video Generation Model\nYunpeng Bai,\nShaoheng Fang\n, Chaohui Yu, Fan Wang, Qixing Huang\nAdvances in neural information processing systems\n, 2025\npaper\n/\nwebsite\n/\nMVRoom: Controllable 3D Indoor Scene Generation with Multi-View Diffusion Models\nShaoheng Fang\n, Chaohui Yu, Fan Wang, Qixing Huang\nArxiv\n, 2025\npaper\n/\nConstant-Potential Machine Learning Force Field for Electrochemical Interface\nRuoyu Wang,\nShaoheng Fang\n, Qixing Huang, Yuanyue Liu\nJournal of Chemical Theory and Computation & NIPS AI4Science Workshop\n, 2025\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nText‐Guided Interactive Scene Synthesis with Scene Prior Guidance\nShaoheng Fang\n, Haitao Yang, Raymond Mooney, Qixing Huang\nComputer Graphics Forum 44(2) (Special Issue of Eurographics)\n, 2025\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nSelf-Supervised Bird's Eye View Motion Prediction with Cross-Modality Signals\nShaoheng Fang\n, Zuhong Liu, Mingyu Wang, Chenxin Xu, Yiqi Zhong, Siheng Chen\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n, 2024\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nFedrsu: Federated learning for scene flow estimation on roadside units\nShaoheng Fang\n*, Rui Ye*, Wenhao Wang*, Zuhong Liu, Yuxiao Wang, Yafei Wang, Siheng Chen, Yanfeng Wang\nIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems\n, 2024\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nAerial monocular 3d object detection\nYue Hu,\nShaoheng Fang\n, Weidi Xie, Siheng Chen\nIEEE Robotics and Automation Letters (RAL)\n, 2023\npaper\n/\ndataset\n/\nTbp-former: Learning temporal bird's-eye-view pyramid for joint perception and prediction in vision-centric autonomous driving\nShaoheng Fang\n*, Zi Wang*, Yiqi Zhong, Junhao Ge, Siheng Chen\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF conference on computer vision and pattern recognition\n, 2023\npaper\n/\nWhere2comm: Communication-efficient collaborative perception via spatial confidence maps\nYue Hu,\nShaoheng Fang\n, Zixing Lei, Yiqi Zhong, Siheng Chen\nAdvances in neural information processing systems, spotlight\n, 2022\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nWebsite template from\nhere\nand\nhere"
  },
