    "homepage_text": "Zhuokai Zhao -- Personal Webpage\nZhuokai Zhao\nResearch Scientist, Meta AI\nPhD in Computer Science, University of Chicago\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nSemantic Scholar\n/\nGithub\n/\nLinkedIn\n/\nX (Twitter)\nBiography\nI am currently a Research Scientist at Meta AI. I got my PhD in Computer Science from the\nUniversity of Chicago\n, where I was fortunate to be advised by\nProf. Yuxin Chen\n.\nPrior to that, I received my Master's degree in Robotics from\nthe Johns Hopkins University\n,\n  under the supervision of\nProf. Nassir Navab\n, and my Bachelor's degree with Honors in Electrical Engineering from\nUniversity of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign\n, where I was working on robotics with\nProf. Seth Hutchinson\n.\nMy research focuses on developing novel training recipes (both data and algorithms) to enhance (multimodal) large language models reasoning, as well as multi-agent systems that leverage them.\nNews & Updates\nOne paper,\nDreamGym\n, is accepted to\nICLR 2026\n.\n01/26/2026\nOne paper,\nRLMesh\n, is accepted to\nAISTATS 2026\n.\n01/23/2026\nFour papers,\nThoughtCommunication\n(\nSpotlight\n),\nDropout Decoding\n,\nS'MoRE\n, and\nMJ-Bench\n, are accepted to\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\n09/18/2025\nOne paper,\nDISCO\n, is accepted to\nEMNLP 2025\n.\n08/20/2025\nOne paper,\nSPOC\n, is accepted to\nCOLM 2025\n.\n07/07/2025\nTwo papers,\nRankCLIP\nand\nDyTo\n, are accepted to\nICCV 2025\n.\n06/25/2025\nOne paper,\nICoV\n, is accepted to\nCVPR 2025 MAR Workshop\nwith\noral\npresentation.\n02/26/2025\nOne paper,\nHumanMM\n, is accepted to\nCVPR 2025\n.\n02/26/2025\nOne paper,\nSCYLLA\n, is accepted to\nICLR 2025\n.\n01/22/2025\nOne paper,\nDAO\n, is accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024 BDU Workshop\nwith\noral\npresentation.\n10/09/2024\nOne paper,\nNERO\n, is accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024 Workshop on Interpretable AI\n.\n10/09/2024\nOne paper,\nEscIRL\n, is accepted to\nCoRL 2024\n.\n09/05/2024\nStarted a new position as Research Scientist at Meta.\n06/24/2024\nOne paper,\nACS\n, is accepted to\nIROS 2024\n.\n06/30/2024\nOne paper,\nHALC\n, is accepted to\nICML 2024\n.\n05/01/2024\nOne paper is accepted to\nICME 2024\n.\n04/27/2024\nOne paper,\nAutoPRM\n, is accepted to\nNAACL 2024\n.\n03/13/2024\nOne paper,\nUser-Centric Ranking\n, is accepted to\nKDD 2023\n.\n05/16/2023\nPublications\n(* indicates co-first authorship, † means joint last author)\n2026\nTARo: Token-level Adaptive Routing for LLM Test-time Alignment\nArushi Rai, Qiang Zhang,\nHanqing Zeng\n, Yunkai Zhang, Dipesh Tamboli, Xiangjun Fan, and\nZhuokai Zhao†\n,\nLizhu Zhang†\nIn submission\n,\n2026\nPDF\nCircuitProbe: Tracing Visual Temporal Evidence Flow in Video Language Models\nYiming Zhang*,\nZhuokai Zhao*\n, Chengzhang Yu,\nKun Wang\n, Zhendong Chu, Qiankun Li, Zihan Chen,\nYang Liu\n, Zenghui Ding, Yining Sun, and\nQingsong Wen\nIn submission\n,\n2026\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\n/\nCode\nAccelerating PDE Surrogates via RL-Guided Mesh Optimization\nYang Meng,\nRuoxi Jiang\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nChong Liu\n,\nRebecca Willett\n, and\nYuxin Chen\nThe 29th International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Statistics (AISTATS)\n,\n2026\nPDF\nScaling Agent Learning via Experience Synthesis\nZhaorun Chen\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n, Kai Zhang, Bo Liu, Qi Qi, Yifan Wu, Tarun Kalluri, Sara Cao, Yuanhao Xiong, Haibo Tong, Huaxiu Yao, Hengduo Li, Jiacheng Zhu, Xian Li, Dawn Song, Bo Li, and Jason Weston†, Dat Huynh†\nThe Fourteenth International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n,\n2026\nPDF\nToken-Level LLM Collaboration via FusionRoute\nNuoya Xiong\n,\nYuhang Zhou\n,\nHanqing Zeng\n,\nZhaorun Chen\n,\nFurong Huang\n,\nShuchao Bi\n,\nLizhu Zhang†\n, and\nZhuokai Zhao†\nIn submission\n,\n2026\nPDF\n/\nCode\n2025\nMixture-of-Minds: Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning for Table Understanding\nYuhang Zhou\n,\nMingrui Zhang\n, Ke Li, Mingyi Wang, Qiao Liu, Qifei Wang, Jiayi Liu, Fei Liu, Serena Li, Weiwei Li, Mingze Gao, Abhishek Kumar, Xiangjun Fan, and\nZhuokai Zhao†\n,\nLizhu Zhang†\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\nLILO: Bayesian Optimization with Interactive Natural Language Feedback\nKatarzyna Kobalczyk\n,\nZhiyuan Jerry Lin\n,\nBenjamin Letham\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n, Maximilian Balandat, and\nEytan Bakshy\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\nLet it Calm: Exploratory Annealed Decoding for Verifiable Reinforcement Learning\nChenghao Yang\n,\nLin Gui\n,\nChenxiao Yang\n,\nVictor Veitch\n,\nLizhu Zhang\n, and\nZhuokai Zhao\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\n/\nCode\nExploring System 1 and 2 Communication for Latent Reasoning in LLMs\nJulian Coda-Forno\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n, Qiang Zhang, Dipesh Tamboli, Weiwei Li, Xiangjun Fan, Lizhu Zhang,\nEric Schulz\n, and Hsiao-Ping Tseng\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\nThought Communication in Multiagent Collaboration\nYujia Zheng\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nZijian Li\n,\nYaqi Xie\n, Mingze Gao, and\nLizhu Zhang†\n,\nKun Zhang†\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\nSpotlight\n,\n2025\nPDF\nS'MoRE: Structural Mixture of Residual Experts for LLM Fine-tuning\nHanqing Zeng\n,\nYinglong Xia\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n, Gilbert Jiang, Qiang Zhang, Jiayi Liu, Lizhu Zhang, Xiangjun Fan, and\nBenyu Zhang\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2025\nPDF\nMJ-BENCH: Is Your Multimodal Reward Model Really a Good Judge for Text-to-Image Generation?\nZhaorun Chen*, Yichao Du*, Zichen Wen*, Yiyang Zhou*, Chenhang Cui, Zhenzhen Weng, Haoqin Tu,\nChaoqi Wang, Zhengwei Tong, Qinglan Huang, Canyu Chen, Qinghao Ye, Zhihong Zhu, Yuqing Zhang, Jiawei Zhou,\nZhuokai Zhao\n, Rafael Rafailov, Chelsea Finn, and Huaxiu Yao\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\n/\nCode\nEnhancing Vision-Language Model Reliability with Uncertainty-Guided Dropout Decoding\nYixiong Fang,\nZiran Yang\n,\nZhaorun Chen\n,\nZhuokai Zhao†\n, and\nJiawei Zhou†\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nCode\nStreamMem: Query-Agnostic KV Cache Memory for Streaming Video Understanding\nYanlai Yang\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nSatya Narayan Shukla\n, Aashu Singh,\nShlok Mishra\n, Lizhu Zhang, and\nMengye Ren\n,\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\nDISCO Balances the Scales: Adaptive Domain- and Difficulty-Aware Reinforcement Learning on Imbalanced Data\nYuhang Zhou*\n,\nJing Zhu*\n,\nShengyi Qian\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nXiyao Wang\n,\nXiaoyu Liu\n,\nMing Li\n,\nPaiheng Xu\n,\nWei Ai\n, and\nFurong Huang\n,\nEmpirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP\n)\n,\n2025\nPDF\nBoosting LLM Reasoning via Spontaneous Self-Correction\nXutong Zhao\n,\nTengyu Xu\n,\nXuewei Wang\n,\nZhengxing Chen\n,\nDi Jin\n,\nLiang Tan\n,\nYen-Ting Lin\n,\nZishun Yu\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nYun He\n,\nSinong Wang\n,\nHan Fang\n,\nSarath Chandar\n, and\nChen Zhu\nConference on Language Modeling (\nCOLM\n)\n,\n2025\nPDF\nRankCLIP: Ranking-Consistent Language-Image Pretraining\nYiming Zhang*,\nZhuokai Zhao*\n,\nZhaorun Chen\n,\nZhili Feng\n, Zenghui Ding, and Yining Sun\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n)\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nCode\nBeyond Training: Dynamic Token Merging for Zero-Shot Video Understanding\nYiming Zhang,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nZhaorun Chen\n, Zenghui Ding, Xianjun Yang, and Yining Sun\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n)\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nCode\nTransfer between Modalities with MetaQueries\nXichen Pan\n,\nSatya Narayan Shukla\n,\nAashu Singh\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nShlok Kumar Mishra\n,\nJialiang Wang\n,\nZhiyang Xu\n,\nJiuhai Chen\n,\nKunpeng Li\n,\nFelix Juefei-Xu\n,\nJi Hou\n, and\nSaining Xie\nIn submission\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\nCAFe: Unifying Representation and Generation with Contrastive-Autoregressive Finetuning\nHao Yu\n,\nZhuokai Zhao\n,\nShen Yan\n,\nLukasz Korycki\n, Jianyu Wang, Baosheng He, Jiayi Liu, Lizhu Zhang, Xiangjun Fan, and Hanchao Yu\nICCV Findings\n,\n2025\nPDF\n/\nProject Page\n/\nCode\nHumanMM: Global Human Motion Recovery from Multi-shot Video