    "homepage_text": "Xiting Wang\nXiting Wang\nTENURE-TRACK ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR\nXiting Wang obtained her Bachelor's degree and Ph.D. from Tsinghua University and was previously a principal researcher at Microsoft Research Asia. Her research interest is explainable and trustworthy AI. She has published around 50 papers on top conferences or journals. Two of her papers were selected as the spotlight article by IEEE TVCG (one spotlight each issue). The technologies developed by Xiting have been applied in multiple products like Microsoft Bing and Microsoft News. Xiting is an area chair of IJCAI and AAAI. She was the archive chair of IEEE VIS, joined the editorial board of Visual Informatics, and was awarded Best SPC by AAAI 2021. She was invited to give a keynote speech in the SIGIR Workshop on explainable recommendation on 2022 and 2020, and is an IEEE senior member.\nEnter Personal Website\nEDUCATION\n2011-2017 Tsinghua University. PhD in Computer Science.\n2007-2011 Tsinghua University. B.E. in Electronic Engineering.\nWORK EXPERIENCE\n2024-Present Renmin University of China, Associate Professor.\n2023-2024 Renmin University of China, Assistant Professor.\n2022-2023 Microsoft Research Asia. Principal Researcher.\n2018-2022 Microsoft Research Asia. Senior Researcher.\n2017-2018 Microsoft Research Asia. Researcher.\nRESEARCH INTERESTS\nExplaining, aligning, and evaluating general-purpose AI, especially large language models\nPUBLICATIONS\n2025\nNeural Recommendation Reasoning with Logic Rules\nJing Yao, Xiting Wang, Jianxun Lian, Xiaoyuan Yi, Xing Xie\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS) 2025\nOptimal Transport-Based Token Weighting Scheme for Enhanced Preference Optimization\nMeng Li, Guangda Huzhang, Haibo Zhang, Xiting Wang, Anxiang Zeng\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Main Conference) 2025\nInternal Value Alignment in Large Language Models through Controlled Value Vector Activation\nHaoran Jin, Meng Li, Xiting Wang, Zhihao Xu, Minlie Huang, Yantao Jia, Defu Lian\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Main Conference) 2025\nEntropy-based Exploration Conduction for Multi-step Reasoning\nJinghan Zhang, Xiting Wang, Fengran Mo, Yeyang Zhou, Wanfu Gao, Kunpeng Liu\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Findings) 2025\nSelect, Read, and Write: A Multi-Agent Framework of Full-Text-based Related Work Generation\nXiaochuan Liu, Ruihua Song, Xiting Wang, Xu Chen\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Findings 2025)\nControlling Large Language Models Through Concept Activation Vectors\nHanyu Zhang, Xiting Wang, Chengao Li, Xiang Ao, Qing He\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI) 2025\nRATT: A Thought Structure for Coherent and Correct LLM Reasoning\nJinghan Zhang, Xiting Wang, Weijieying Ren, Lu Jiang, Dongjie Wang, Kunpeng Liu\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI) 2025\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2406.02746\n2024\nUncovering Safety Risks of Large Language Models through Concept Activation Vector\nZhihao Xu, Ruixuan Huang, Changyu Chen, Xiting Wang\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS) 2024\nhttps://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.12038\nEvaluating Readability and Faithfulness of Concept-based Explanations\nMeng Li, Haoran Jin, Ruixuan Huang, Zhihao Xu, Defu Lian, Zijia Lin, Di Zhang, Xiting Wang\nConference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP Main Conference) 2024\nhttps://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.18533\nBSharedRAG: Backbone Shared Retrieval-Augmented Generation for the E-commerce Domain\nKaisi Guan, Qian Cao, Yuchong Sun, Xiting Wang, Ruihua Song\nConference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP Findings) 2024\nhttps://bsharedrag.github.io/index.html#:~:text=We%20propose%20a%20novel%20Backbone%20Shared\nSee or Guess: Counterfactually Regularized Image Captioning\nQian Cao, Xu Chen, Ruihua Song, Xiting Wang, Xinting Huang, Yuchen Ren\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM) 2024\nhttps://arxiv.org/pdf/2408.16809\nPrototypical Reward Network for Data Efficient Model Alignment\nJinghan Zhang, Xiting Wang, Yiqiao Jin, Changyu Chen, Xinhao Zhang, Kunpeng Liu\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Main Conference, Oral) 2024\nhttps://aclanthology.org/2024.acl-long.748/\nMasked Thought: Simply Masking Partial Reasoning Steps Can Improve Mathematical Reasoning Learning of Language Models\nChangyu Chen, Xiting Wang, Ting-En Lin, Ang Lv, Yuchuan Wu, Xin Gao, Ji-Rong Wen, Rui Yan, Yongbin Li\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Main Conference) 2024\nhttps://aclanthology.org/2024.acl-long.320/\nPersuading across Diverse Domains: a Dataset and Persuasion Large Language Model\nChuhao Jin, Kening Ren, Lingzhen Kong, Xiting Wang, Ruihua Song, Huan Chen\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL Main Conference) 2024\nhttps://aclanthology.org/2024.acl-long.92/\nDistillation with Explanations from Large Language Models\nHanyu Zhang, Xiting Wang, Xiang Ao, Qing He\nJoint International Conference on Computational Linguistics, Language Resources and Evaluation (COLING) 2024\nhttps://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.449/\n2023\nA Causality Inspired Framework for Model Interpretation\nChenwang Wu, Xiting Wang, Defu Lian, Xing Xie, Enhong Chen\nACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (ACM SIGKDD) | August 2023\nSemi-Offline Reinforcement Learning for Optimized Text Generation\nChangyu Chen, Xiting Wang, Yiqiao Jin, Victor Ye Dong, Li Dong, Jim Cao, Yi Liu, Rui Yan\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML) | July 2023\nTowards Explainable Collaborative Filtering with Taste Clusters Learning\nYuntao Du, Jianxun Lian, Jing Yao, Xiting Wang, Mingqi Wu, Lu Chen, Yunjun Gao, Xing Xie\nthe Web Conference 2023 | April 2023\nPrototypical Fine-tuning: Towards Robust Performance Under Varying Data Sizes\nYiqiao Jin, Xiting Wang, Yaru Hao, Yizhou Sun, Xing Xie\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI) | April 2023\nPut Your Voice on Stage: Personalized Headline Generation for News Articles\nXiang Ao, Ling Luo, Xiting Wang, Zhao Yang, Jiun-hung Chen, Ying Qiao, Qing He, Xing Xie.\nACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (TKDD) 2023\n2022\nA Unified Understanding of Deep NLP Models for Text Classification\nZhen Li, Xiting Wang, Weikai Yang, Jing Wu, Zhengyan Zhang, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun, Hui Zhang, Shixia Liu\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics (IEEE TVCG) | December 2022, Vol 28(12)\nSelf-explaining deep models with logic rule reasoning\nSeungeon Lee, Xiting Wang, Sungwon Han, Xiaoyuan Yi, Xing Xie, Meeyoung Cha\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS) | November 2022\nGenerating Multiple-Length Summaries via Reinforcement Learning for Unsupervised Sentence Summarization\nDongmin Hyun, Xiting Wang, Chanyoung Park, Xing Xie, Hwanjo Yu\nConference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP Findings) | October 2022\nReinforcement Subgraph Reasoning for Fake News Detection\nRuichao Yang, Xiting Wang, Yiqiao Jin, Chaozhuo Li, Jianxun Lian, Xing Xie\nACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (ACM SIGKDD) | June 2022\nPersonalized Chit-Chat Generation for Recommendation Using External Chat Corpora\nChangyu Chen, Xiting Wang, Xiaoyuan Yi, Fangzhao Wu, Xing Xie, Rui Yan\nACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (ACM SIGKDD) | May 2022 (Applied Data Science Track)\nMulti-level Recommendation Reasoning over Knowledge Graphs with Reinforcement Learning\nXiting Wang, Kunpeng Liu, Dongjie Wang, Le Wu, Yanjie Fu, Xing Xie\nThe Web Conference 2022 | April 2022\nClickbait Detection via Contrastive Variational Modelling of Text and Label\nXiaoyuan Yi, Jiarui Zhang, Wenhao Li, Xiting Wang, Xing Xie\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI) | March 2022\nReinforcement Routing on Proximity Graph for Efficient Recommendation\nChao Feng, Defu Lian, Xiting Wang, Zheng Liu, Xing Xie, Enhong Chen\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS) | February 2022\nProFairRec: Provider Fairness-aware News Recommendation\nTao Q, Fangzhao Wu, Chuhan Wu, Peijie Sun, Le Wu, Xiting Wang, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie\nACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval [SIGIR] | January 2022\n2021\nTowards Fine-Grained Reasoning for Fake News Detection\nYiqiao Jin, Xiting Wang, Ruichao Yang, Yizhou Sun, Wei Wang, Hao Liao, Xing Xie\nAAAI 2022 | December 2021\nLearning Groupwise Explanations for Black-Box Models\nJingyue Gao, Xiting Wang, Yasha Wang, Yulan Yan, Xing Xie\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI) | August 2021\nPENS: A Dataset and Generic Framework for Personalized News Headline Generation\nXiang Ao, Xiting Wang, Ling Luo, Ying Qiao, Qing He, Xing Xie\nThe Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL) | August 2021\nReinforcing Pretrained Models for Generating Attractive Text Advertisements\nXiting Wang, Xinwei Gu, Jie Cao, Zihua Zhao, Yulan Yan, Bhuvan Middha, Xing Xie\nACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (ACM SIGKDD) | August 2021 (Applied Data Science Track)\nReinforced Anchor Knowledge Graph Generation for News Recommendation Reasoning\nDanyang Liu, Jianxun Lian, Zheng Liu, Xiting Wang, Guangzhong Sun, Xing Xie\nKDD 2021 | August 2021\nFairness-aware News Recommendation with Decomposed Adversarial Learning\nChuhan Wu, Fangzhao Wu, Xiting Wang, Yongfeng Huang, Xing Xie\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI) | June 2021\nLearning Fair Representations for Recommendation: A Graph-based Perspective\nLe Wu, Lei Chen, Pengyang Shao, Richang Hong, Xiting Wang, Meng Wang\nThe Web Conference | June 2021\nInteractive Graph Construction for Graph-Based Semi-Supervised