    "github": "https://github.com/leeyadong",
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yadong-li-737b4032a/",
    "homepage_text": "Yadong Li\nYadong Li\nSecond-year ECE Ph.D. Student@University of Washington, yadongli@uw.edu\nI am a 2nd year Ph.D. student in the Department of Electrical & Computer Engineering at the\nUniversity of Washington (UW)\n, advised by\nProf. Akshay Gadre\n. Previously, my research journey began at the\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n, working with\nProf. Qibin Sun\nand\nProf. Yan Chen\n.\nMy research aims to bring ambient intelligence to everyday wireless and wearable devices through cutting-edge AI, multimodal sensing, and physics-driven modeling.\nmmWave and NLoS Imaging:\ndeveloping compact, mobile imaging systems that achieve 3D, high-resolution non-line-of-sight imaging via low-cost mmWave platforms.:\nIFNet\n(TMC’24),\nPSF-SAR\n(CommsEng’24),\nmmHide\n(TIFS’25),\nDREAM-PCD\n(TIP’24).\nWireless and Wearable Sensing:\ndesigning intelligent, human-centric sensing systems that leverage wireless and wearable sensors for health monitoring, motion tracking, and interactive applications:\nUltraPoser\n(UIST’25),\nRF-Mamba\n(ICLR’25),\nRF-HRV\n(NatureComms’24),\nRLoc\n(UbiComp’24).\nMotivated by the lack of benchmarks in wireless AI, my co-authors and I have released datasets and code for diverse signals and applications, which have been accessed by researchers from\nover 100 institutions across 12 countries\n:\nIFNet\n: Handheld mmWave SAR imaging dataset (10400 samples from 26 objects and 200 handheld scanning trajectories).\nMCD-Gesture\n: Cross-domain mmWave gesture dataset (24050 instances from 25 users, 6 rooms, and 5 locations).\nH-WILD\n: Human-held device WiFi localization dataset (120,000 frames from 10 volunteers across 4 rooms).\nRadarEyes\n: Multi-modal point cloud dataset (1,000,000 frames of radar and LiDAR data from 300 rooms).\nNews\nMar 19, 2026\nTwinFocus\ngot conditionally accepted to\nMobiSys’26\n;\nVRCLIP\ngot accepted to\nCVPR’26\n;\nAutoCalib\nand\nSniFi\ngot accepted to\nIEEE TMC\n.\nJul 25, 2025\nUltraPoser\nhas been accepted to\nACM UIST\n. The\ncode and dataset\nwill be released soon. Huge thanks to all the amazing collaborating advisors and students!\nDec 30, 2024\nCode for all my first-authored papers has been released!\nCheck out\nmy github page\nfor more information.\nNov 20, 2024\nRF-HRV has been accepted by\nNature Communications\n. Press Coverage:\nMIT Technology Review\n,\nChina News (中国新闻网)\n,\nChina Science Daily (中国科学报)\n,\nChina National Radio News (央广网)\n,\nGuangming Daily (光明日报)\n.\nOct 30, 2024\nIFNet has been accepted by IEEE TMC.\nCode and dataset of IFNet\nwill be available soon.\nSep 27, 2024\nWe have released the code of\nDI-Gesture (TMC’22)\nand\nPSF handheld SAR imaging (CommsEng’24)\n.\nSelected Publications\nUIST’25\nUltraPoser: Pushing the Limits of IMU-based Full-Body Pose Estimation with Ultrasound Sensing on Consumer Wearables\nYadong Li\n*\n, Shuning Wang\n*\n, Yongjian Fu, Justin Chen, Xingyu Chen, Ju Ren, Xinyu Zhang, Akshay Gadre, and Ke Sun\nIn ACM Symposium on User Interface Software and Technology\n, 2025\nBib\nPDF\nVideo\nCode\nDataset\n@inproceedings\n{\nultraposer\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yadong and Wang, Shuning and Fu, Yongjian and Chen, Justin and Chen, Xingyu and Ren, Ju and <br> Zhang, Xinyu and Gadre, Akshay and Sun, Ke}\n,\ntitle\n=\n{UltraPoser: Pushing the Limits of IMU-based Full-Body Pose Estimation with Ultrasound Sensing on Consumer Wearables}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2025}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{ACM Symposium on User Interface Software and Technology}\n,\n}\nIEEE TIFS’25\nAttacking mmWave Imaging with Neural Meta-Material Rendering\nRuixu Geng, Dongheng Zhang,\nYadong Li\n, Zhi Wu, Jiamu Li, Qi Chen, Yang Hu, and Yan Chen\nIEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security\n, 2025\nBib\nHTML\n@article\n{\ngeng2025mmattack\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Geng, Ruixu and Zhang, Dongheng and Li, Yadong and Wu, Zhi and Li, Jiamu and Chen, Qi and Hu, Yang and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security}\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Attacking mmWave Imaging with Neural Meta-Material Rendering}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2025}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{}\n,\n}\nICLR’25\nRFMamba: Frequency-Aware State Space Model for RF-Based Human-Centric Perception\nRui Zhang, Ruixu Geng,\nYadong Li\n, Ruiyuan Song, Hanqin Gong, Dongheng Zhang, Yang Hu, and Yan Chen\nIn International Conference on Learning Representations\n, 2025\nBib\nHTML\n@inproceedings\n{\nzhang2025rfmamba\n,\ntitle\n=\n{RFMamba: Frequency-Aware State Space Model for RF-Based Human-Centric Perception}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Zhang, Rui and Geng, Ruixu and Li, Yadong and Song, Ruiyuan and Gong, Hanqin and Zhang, Dongheng and Hu, Yang and Chen, Yan}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2025}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{International Conference on Learning Representations}\n,\n}\nNatCommun’24\nMonitoring Long-term Cardiac Activity with Contactless Radio Frequency Signals\nBin-Bin Zhang, Dongheng Zhang,\nYadong Li\n, Zhi Lu, Jinbo Chen, Haoyu Wang, Fang Zhou, Yu Pu, Yang Hu, Likun Ma, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nNature Communications\n, 2024 (\nImpact Factor: 14.7\n)\nBib\nHTML\nCode\n@article\n{\nzhang2024monitoring\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Monitoring Long-term Cardiac Activity with Contactless Radio Frequency Signals}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Zhang, Bin-Bin and Zhang, Dongheng and Li, Yadong and Lu, Zhi and Chen, Jinbo and Wang, Haoyu and Zhou, Fang and Pu, Yu and Hu, Yang and Ma, Likun and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{Nature Communications}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\nimpact_factor\n=\n{14.7}\n,\n}\nIEEE TMC’24\nIFNet: Deep Imaging and Focusing for Handheld SAR with Millimeter-wave Signals\nYadong Li\n, Dongheng Zhang, Ruixu Geng, Jincheng Wu, Yang Hu, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nIEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing\n, 2024\nBib\nHTML\nCode\nDataset\n@article\n{\nli2024ifnet\n,\ntitle\n=\n{IFNet: Deep Imaging and Focusing for Handheld SAR with Millimeter-wave Signals}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yadong and Zhang, Dongheng and Geng, Ruixu and Wu, Jincheng and Hu, Yang and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\n}\nCommsEng’24\nA High-resolution Handheld millimeter-wave Imaging System with Phase Error Estimation and Compensation\nYadong Li\n, Dongheng Zhang, Ruixu Geng, Zhi Lu, Zhi Wu, Yang Hu, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nCommunications Engineering\n, 2024 (\nTop 15% downloaded papers of 2024\n)\nBib\nHTML\nCode\n@article\n{\nli2024high\n,\ntitle\n=\n{A High-resolution Handheld millimeter-wave Imaging System with Phase Error Estimation and Compensation}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yadong and Zhang, Dongheng and Geng, Ruixu and Lu, Zhi and Wu, Zhi and Hu, Yang and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{Communications Engineering}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{3}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{1}\n,\npages\n=\n{4}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{Nature Publishing Group UK London}\n,\nhighlight\n=\n{Top 15% downloaded papers of 2024}\n,\n}\nIEEE TIP’24\nDREAM-PCD: Deep Reconstruction and Enhancement of mmWave Radar Pointcloud\nRuixu Geng,\nYadong Li\n, Dongheng Zhang, Jincheng Wu, Yating Gao, Yang Hu, and Yan Chen\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n, 2024\nBib\nHTML\nDataset\n@article\n{\ngeng2024dream\n,\ntitle\n=\n{DREAM-PCD: Deep Reconstruction and Enhancement of mmWave Radar Pointcloud}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Geng, Ruixu and Li, Yadong and Zhang, Dongheng and Wu, Jincheng and Gao, Yating and Hu, Yang and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{IEEE Transactions on Image Processing}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{IEEE}\n,\n}\nIJCAI’24\nLearning-Based Tracking-before-Detect for RF-Based Unconstrained Indoor Human Tracking\nZhi Wu, Dongheng Zhang, Zixin Shang, Yuqin Yuan, Hanqin Gong, Binquan Wang, Zhi Lu,\nYadong Li\n, Yang Hu, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nIn International Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence\n, 2024\nBib\nHTML\n@inproceedings\n{\nwu2024learning\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Learning-Based Tracking-before-Detect for RF-Based Unconstrained Indoor Human Tracking}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Wu, Zhi and Zhang, Dongheng and Shang, Zixin and Yuan, Yuqin and Gong, Hanqin and Wang, Binquan and Lu, Zhi and Li, Yadong and Hu, Yang and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\nbooktitle\n=\n{International Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\n}\nUbiComp’24\nRloc: Towards Robust Indoor Localization by Quantifying Uncertainty\nTianyu Zhang, Dongheng Zhang, Guanzhong Wang,\nYadong Li\n, Yang Hu, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nProceedings of the ACM on Interactive, Mobile, Wearable, and Ubiquitous Technologies\n, 2024\nBib\nHTML\nDataset\n@article\n{\nzhang2024rloc\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Rloc: Towards Robust Indoor Localization by Quantifying Uncertainty}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Zhang, Tianyu and Zhang, Dongheng and Wang, Guanzhong and Li, Yadong and Hu, Yang and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{Proceedings of the ACM on Interactive, Mobile, Wearable, and Ubiquitous Technologies}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{7}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{4}\n,\npages\n=\n{1--28}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{ACM New York, NY, USA}\n,\n}\nIEEE TMC’22\nTowards Domain-independent and Real-time Gesture Recognition using mmWave Signal\nYadong Li\n, Dongheng Zhang, Jinbo Chen, Jinwei Wan, Dong Zhang, Yang Hu, Qibin Sun, and Yan Chen\nIEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing\n, 2022\nBib\nHTML\nCode\nDataset\n@article\n{\nli2022towards\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Towards Domain-independent and Real-time Gesture Recognition using mmWave Signal}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yadong and Zhang, Dongheng and Chen, Jinbo and Wan, Jinwei and Zhang, Dong and Hu, Yang and Sun, Qibin and Chen, Yan}\n,\njournal\n=\n{IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{22}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{12}\n,\npages\n=\n{7355--7369}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2022}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{IEEE}\n,\n}"
