    "homepage_text": "Jinyang Huang's Homepage\nJinyang Huang\nAssociate Professor\nSchool of Computer Science and Information Engineering\nHefei University of Technology\nHefei\nOffice:\nEmerald Science Building A808\nEmail:\nhjy at hfut dot edu dot cn\nOpenings\n|\nBiography\n|\nNews\n|\nPublications\n|\nPatents\n|\nProjects\n|\nTeaching\n|\nProfessional Activities\n|\nAwards\nOpenings:\nI am looking for prospective master students and visiting scholars. If you are interested in working with me, feel free to send me your CV. Graduate admission information can be found\nhere\n.\nBiography\nI am an Associate Professor at the School of Computer Science and Information Engineering, Hefei University of Technology (HFUT). I received my Ph.D. in the\nSchool of Cyber Science and Technology\n,\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n, supervised by Prof.\nNenghai Yu\n, Prof.\nHonggang Hu\n, and Prof.\nBin Liu\n. During my doctoral period, I receive a CSC scholarship, and I am guided by Prof.\nLu Su\nfrom Purdue University and\nChang Wen Chen\nfrom University at Buffalo to conduct scientific research. Before starting my Ph.D. study, I received my Bachelor's degree from\nAnhui University (AHU)\nin 2017, supervised by Prof.\nLinsheng Huang\n. Since 2022, I also conduct research as an exchange scholar under the guidance of Prof.\nZhi Liu\nin The University of Electro-Communications and Prof.\nYusheng Ji\nin National Institute of Informatics. I am broadly interested in Human-computer interaction, Wireless sensing, Wireless communication, Computer Vision, Cyber security, and Internet of Things. I have published 50+ papers\nat top international conferences and journals, including ACM MobiCom, ACM IMWUT/Ubicomp, INFOCOM, IEEE S&P, USENIX Security, NeurIPS, ACM MM, ECCV, ToN, TMC, TDSC, TIFS,TAFFC, and THMS. I’m the recipient of the\nYoung Scientist of Anhui Computer Federation\n, the\nIEEE HITC Distinguished PhD Dissertation Award\n, and served as the\nLead Supervisor (Ranked 1st)\nfor the\nGold Medal\nwinning team in the China International College Students' Innovation Competition, achieving a\nTop 120\nfinish among 6.7 million participating teams.\nNews\n2026.3   One Paper about Low-Light Image Super-Resolution accepted by ICME (CCF B)\n2026.3   One Paper about Handwriting Style-based User Identification accepted by\nIEEE TDSC\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2026.3   One Paper about Multimodal Health Sensing via Speech-Evoked Signals accepted by IEEE INFOCOM WKSHPS (EI)\n2026.2   One Paper about 3D Motion Magnification via Gaussian Splatting accepted by IEEE TCSVT  (CCF B, Trans)\n2026.2   One Paper about 3D Indoor Object Detection accepted by ICASSP (CCF B)\n2026.1   It's an honor to receive the\nGold Award (National Level)\nin\nChina International College Students' Innovation Competition\nas the First Supervisor\n2026.1   It's an honor to receive the\nSILVER Award\nin\nIEEE ComSoc MMTC 2025\nTechnology Competition\n2026.1   One Paper about Robust WiFi-based Gesture Recognition accepted by\nIMWUT (Ubicomp)\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2026.1   One Paper about Sleep Apnea Prediction with Graph Contrastive Clustering accepted by Pattern Recognition (CCF B, SCI Q1)\n2025.12   One Paper about Adversarial Attacks on Wireless Indoor Localization accepted by\nIEEE TIFS\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.12   One Paper about Micron-Level Vibrations accepted by\nIEEE TMC\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.11   One Main Paper about WiFi Sensing for Cross-Domain 3D Pose Estimation accepted by\nMobicom\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.11   Invited to serve as the Area Chair for IEEE ICME 2026 (Bangkok, Thailand)\n2025.10   One Paper about Generalizing WiFi Gesture Recognition via Large-Model-Aware accepted by ICPADS (CCF C)\n2025.10   One Paper about Astronomical Star Fields Super-Resolution accepted by\nNeurIPS\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.8   One Paper about Federated Learning accepted by\nIEEE ToN\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.7   One Paper about Dynamic Facial Expression Recognition accepted by\nACM MM\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.6   Invited to serve as the\nPublication Chair\nfor IEEE ISPA 2025\n2025.6   One Paper about RFID-based Gesture Recognition accepted by ACM TOSN  (CCF B, Trans)\n2025.5   Invited to serve as the Program Co-Chair for the 1st NSSS-2025 Workshop in conjunction with IEEE TrustCom-2025\n2025.5   Invited to serve as a guest Editor for\nSensors\n(SCI Q1) on \"Multimodal Sensing, Computing and Their Monitoring Application\"\n2025.5   One Paper about Malicious Camera Auto Detection accepted by\nUSENIX Security\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.4   Invited to serve as a guest Editor for Applied Sciences (SCI Q2) on \"Advanced Human-Computer Interaction Technologies and Their Applications\"\n2025.4   One Paper about WiFi-based Cross-Domain Gesture Recognition accepted by IEEE IOTJ  (SCI Q1)\n2025.3   One Paper about Malicious Camera Detection accepted by\nIEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy\n(\nCCF A\n)\n2025.3   One Paper about Reliable Label Noise Suppression for Facial Expression Recognition accepted by IEEE TAFFC (CCF B, CAAI A, Trans)\n2025.2 One Paper about Federated Graph Learning accepted by DASFAA    (CCF B)\n2025.1   One Paper about Open-set WiFi-based Activity Recognition accepted by IEEE THMS (CCF B, Trans)\nPublications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nJournal Papers\n[TDSC'26]\nJinyang Huang\n, Yuanhao Feng, Feng-Qi Cui, Xiang Zhang, Zhi Liu, Xin Liu, Jianchun Liu, Fusang Zhang, and Meng Li,\n\t\t\t\t        \"Identifying Who You Are No Matter What You Write through Abstracting Handwriting Style.\",\nIEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing\n, 2026.\n\t\t\t\t        (\nCCF Rank A\n, SCI Q2, JCR Q1)\n\t\t\t\t        [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[PR'26]\nXin Liu, Xinke Wang,\nJinyang Huang\n, Dan Guo, and Meng Wang,\n\t\t\t\t        \"Class-imbalanced Graph Contrastive Clustering for Sleep Apnea Prediction in Mental Health.\",\nPattern Recognition\n, Elsevier, 2026.\n\t\t\t\t        (CCF Rank B, SCI Q1, JCR Q1)\n\t\t\t\t        [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[TCSVT'26]\nZheng Zhang, Jiabao Guo, Fei Wang,\nJinyang Huang\n, Zhi Liu, and Dan Guo,\n\t\t\t\t        \"TG4MM: Time-Varying Gaussian Splatting for 3D Motion Magnification.\",\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\n, 2026.\n\t\t\t\t        (CCF Rank B, SCI Q1, JCR Q1)\n\t\t\t\t        [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[TIFS'25]\nXueqiang Han,\nJinyang Huang\n, Meng Li, Chao Cai, Tianyue Zheng,\n                \"Loki: Physical-World Adversarial Attacks on Wireless Indoor Localization via Differentiable Object Placement\",\nIEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security\n, 2025.\n                (\nCCF Rank A\n, SCI Q1, JCR Q1)\n                [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[TMC'25]\nYuanhao Feng, Donghui Dai,\nJinyang Huang\n, Panlong Yang, Xiang-Yang Li, Feiyu Han, Lei Yang,\n                \"Battery-Free Monitoring of Micron-Level Vibrations with Sub-Hertz Frequency Accuracy: Toward\nRobust and Accurate Industrial Sensing\n\",\nIEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing\n, 2025.\n                (\nCCF Rank A\n, SCI Q1, JCR Q1)\n                [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[TON'25]\nJianchun Liu, Jiaming Yan, Hongli Xu, Lun Wang, Zhiyuan Wang,\nJinyang Huang\n, Chunming Qiao\n                        \"Accelerating Decentralized Federated Learning with Probabilistic Communication in Heterogeneous Edge Computing \",\nIEEE/ACM Transactions on Networking\n, 2025. (\nCCF Rank A\n, SCI Q2, JCR Q1, IF=3.56)\n                        [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[TOSN'25]\nYuanhao Feng\n1\n,\nJinyang Huang\n1*\n, Youwei Zhang, Xiang Zhang, Meng Li, Fusang Zhang, Tianyue Zheng, Anran Li, Mianxiong Dong, Zhi Liu\n                        \"RF-Eye: Commodity RFID Can Know What You Write and Who You Are Wherever You Are \",\nACM Transactions on Sensor Networks\n, 2025. (CCF Rank B, SCI Q1, JCR Q1, IF=4.7)\n                        [\nPDF\n,\nCite\n]\n[IOTJ'25]\nHuan Yan, Xiang Zhang,\nJinyang Huang\n, Yuanhao Feng, Meng Li, Anzhi Wang, Weihua Ou, Hongbing Wang, Zhi Liu,\n                        \"Wi-SFDAGR: WiFi-based Cross-Domain 