rnal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nLearning Scheme\n100%\nDistributed Learning\n100%\nKernel Ridge Regression\n100%\nDecision-Making\n12%\nLearning Algorithm\n12%\nGeneralization Performance of Empirical Risk Minimization on Over-Parameterized Deep ReLU Nets\nLin, S. B.\n, Wang, Y. & Zhou, D. X.,\n2025\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Information Theory.\n71\n,\n3\n,\np. 1978-1993\n16 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nEmpirical Risk Minimization\n100%\nDeep Learning Method\n100%\nStochastics\n33%\nError Rate\n33%\n1\nScopus \n citations\nAdaptive parameter selection for kernel ridge regression\nLin, S. B.\n,\nNov 2024\n,\nIn:\nApplied and Computational Harmonic Analysis.\n73\n, 101671.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nAdaptive Parameter\n100%\nKernel Ridge Regression\n100%\nRidge Regression\n100%\nSelection Strategy\n33%\nKernel Method\n16%\n6\nScopus \n citations\nKERNEL INTERPOLATION OF HIGH DIMENSIONAL SCATTERED DATA\nLin, S. B.\n,\nChang, X.\n& Sun, X.,\nJun 2024\n,\nIn:\nSIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis.\n62\n,\n3\n,\np. 1098-1118\n21 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nMatrix (Mathematics)\n100%\nDimensional Data\n100%\nStochastics\n50%\nApproximation Error\n50%\nDimensional Problem\n50%\n3\nScopus \n citations\nView all 83 Research outputs"
