Hub\n.\nJQL\n: Jump Q-Learning for Individualized Interval-Valued Dose Rule. Available on\nCRAN\n.\nAPtool\n: Average Positive Predictive Values (AP) for Binary Outcomes and Censored Event Times. Available on\nCRAN\n.\nAPRL\n: Assets Portfolio Model by Reinforcement Learning. Available on\nGitHub\n.\nContact\nName\nEmail\nMessage\nDo not fill this field unless you are a bot:\nSend\nhengrc1@uci.edu\nBren...[truncated]"
