    "homepage_text": "Homepage of Mengxue Zhang\nHomepage of Mengxue\r\n                Zhang\n(\nEnglish\n,\nä¸­æ\n)\nGraduate Student\nDepartment of Electronic Science\n,\nSchool of Electronic Science and Engineering\n(National Model Microelectronics\r\n            College), Xiamen University.\nEmail:\nzhangmengxue@stu.xmu.edu.cn\nComputational Sensing Group at Xiamen University.\nBiosketch\nResearch interests\nEducation\nResearch and Teaching Experiences\nSelected\r\n                  Awards\nProfessional Skills\nRecent Publications\nPatents\nBiosketch\nMengxue Zhang is a graduate student of Department of Electronic Science at Xiamen\r\n            University in China.\nResearch Interests\nMagnetic resonance imaging\nMachine learning, Deep learning\nEducation\nGraduate Student\n(Sept. 2023-Current)\nAdvisor:\nXiaobo Qu\nDepartment of Electronic Science, Xiamen University, China\nB.S.\n(Sept. 2019-June. 2023)\nMathematics and Applied Mathematics, Xiamen University of Mathematical Sciences, China\nResearch and Teaching\r\n          Experiences\nSelected Wards\n10/2020,10/2022, Excellent Academic Scholarship, Xiamen University.\n12/2021,National Mathematical Modeling Contest for College Students, Provincial second prize.\n10/2022, College-level Volunteering Scholarship, Xiamen University.\n12/2020, Best Practice Team, Xiamen University.\n2020-2021, âSudoku learningâ, Provincial College Students Innovation and Entrepreneurship Training Program,\r\n            Xiamen University.\n2022-2023, âDevelopment and innovation of graded diagnosis and treatmentâ, Provincial College Students\r\n            Innovation and Entrepreneurship Training Program, Xiamen University.\nProfessional Skills\nMastered programming languages: Matlab\nRecent Publications"
