    "homepage_text": "Shitao Tang\nShitao Tang\nPh.D. candidate at Simon Fraser University\nFollow\n8888 University Dr, Burnaby, BC\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nI am a research scientist at NVIDIA Research,\nDeep Imagination Group\n. I receive my Ph.D. from Simon Fraser University, supervised by\nProf. Yasutaka Furukawa\n. I also, fortunately, complete my master’s study under the supervision of\nProf. Ping Tan\n. My current research interest is world models."
