    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/kangrui-wang-8b9a37257/",
    "homepage_text": "Kangrui Wang - Academic Website\nKangrui Wang 王康睿\n📧 Email: kangruiwang[dot]cs[at]gmail[dot]com\nHi! I'm Kangrui, a Ph.D. student at\nNorthwestern University\n🏛️ since 2024, working with Prof.\nManling Li\n. Prior to this, I completed my master's degree at\nUChicago\nunder the guidance of Prof.\nHongyuan Mei\n, and received my bachelor's degree from\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n, where I worked with Prof.\nQuanshi Zhang\n.\nResearch 🔬\nI am driven by a vision to develop advanced agents that can efficiently perform complex real-world tasks. In pursuit of this, my current research focuses on:\nReasoning:\n🧠 Exploring methods to enable machines to perform logical and commonsense reasoning, allowing them to make informed decisions in dynamic environments.\nMultimodal Learning:\n👁️ Integrating information from multiple modalities such as vision, language, and audio to create models that understand the physical world.\nEmbodied Agents:\n🤖 Developing agents that can interact with and learn from their environments through physical embodiment, enhancing their ability to perform tasks in real-world settings.\nNews 📢\nLoading news…\nPublications 📚\n* means equal contribution, † means co-corresponding author\nLoading publications…"
