    "homepage_text": "Personal Portfolio\n2025 Google PhD Fellowship\nUniversity of Tokyo\nUniversity of Melbourne\nHi I'm\nYichuan\n— I'm a\nPhD Candidate in Human-AI Collaboration | 2025 Google PhD Fellow\nat\nThe University of Tokyo\n.\nPreviously at\nUniversity of Melbourne\n.\nAvailable for Work\nI build intelligent systems to enhance human decision-making through multimodal behavioral analysis and cognitive state modeling.\nExperience\nDoctoral Research\n@\nIntelligent System Design Laboratory, The University of Tokyo\n2023 - Present\nResearch Assistant\n@\nUTokyo X Prudential Research Project, The University of Tokyo\n2023 - 2023\nTeaching Assistant\n@\nThe University of Tokyo\n2022 - 2023\nResearch Intern\n@\nSony Group Corporation, China R&D Team\n2022 - 2022\nView Full Timeline\nCurrent Research\nHuman-AI Collaboration in Forecasting Systems\nDeveloping frameworks that enhance expert decision-making through synergistic human-AI interaction in time-series forecasting\nActive\nView All Research\nWhat I'm Reading\n穷查理宝典\nCharlie Munger\n自私的基因\nRichard Dawkins\nSoftware\nPython\nDAILY\nPyTorch\nDAILY\nTensorFlow\nWEEKLY\nJupyter\nDAILY\nVS Code\nDAILY\nGit\nDAILY\nProjects\nC\nCruise Business Digital Transformation\nEnd‑to‑end workflow with OCR, LLM validation, and React + Python stack\n2024–Present\nFull‑stack Engineer\nY\nYujian Community: Book Club & Talks\nA place for growth, value sharing, and meaningful conversations\n2022–2025\nFounder & Organizer\nCompleted\nア\nアフターコロナにおける京都府の観光業の政策方針の提案\nPost‑COVID tourism policy proposal with data analysis and forecasting\n2023–2024\nResearch Lead\nCompleted\nR\nRealityAI\nLLM-powered real estate analysis platform\n2024–2024\nProduct Designer & Technical Contributor\nCompleted\nI\nInterdisciplinary Fusion Project\nBreaking down academic silos through cross-disciplinary collaboration\n2025–2025\nLead Organizer\nCompleted\nProfiles\nGitHub\nLinkedIn\nGoogle Scholar\nEmail"
