    "homepage_text": "Qixuan Yu | SIMS Lab @ Rice University\nSearch\nQixuan Yu\nClass of 2022\nRice University\nQixuan Yu is a senior undergraduate student pursuing B.S. degrees in electrical engineering and in computer science at Rice University. Qixuan is interested in machine learning systems and machine learning for systems.\nConference Papers\nLingkun Kong\n,\nQixuan Yu\n,\nAgnishom Chattopadhyay\n,\nAlexis Le Glaunec\n,\nYi Huang\n,\nKonstantinos Mamouras\n,\nKaiyuan Yang\n.\nSoftware-hardware codesign for efficient in-memory regular pattern matching\n.\nACM SIGPLAN International Conference on Programming Language Design and Implementation (PLDI)\n,\n2022.\nPDF\nCite\nProject\nDOI\nYan He\n,\nQixuan Yu\n,\nKaiyuan Yang\n.\nA Lossless and Modeling Attack-Resistant Strong PUF with <4E-8 Bit Error Rate\n.\nIEEE Custom Integrated Circuits Conference (CICC)\n,\n2022.\nPDF\nCite\nProject\nDOI\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
