    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/zhenhuan-neyo-yang-86722b115/",
    "homepage_text": "About me - zhenhuan-yang.github.io\nPhoto credit: Brian Busher\nDr. Zhenhuan Yang\nApplied scientist interested in machine learning\nFollow\nNew York, NY, USA\nEmail\nWebsite\nGitHub\nLinkedIn\nStackoverflow\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout me\nI am an applied scientist at\nAmazon\n. I finish my Ph.D. from\nUniversity at Albany, SUNY\n, under the supervision of\nProf. Yiming Ying\n. Before that I got my B.S. from\nSun Yat-sen University\n, under the supervision of\nProf. Yuesheng Xu\n. My research interests span broadly in deep learning, mathematical optimization and their applications.\nEnter your search term..."
