    "homepage_text": "Dongeun Lee, Ph.D., Associate Professor | East Texas A&M University, ETAMU\nSkip to content\nMenu\nHome\nMenu\nHome\nAbout\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nCost and Financial Aid\nStudent Life\nAthletics\nNews\nGive\nEvents\nMaps\nAcademics\nServices\nColleges\nDegree Programs and Majors\nResearch\nColleges\nAgricultural Sciences and Natural Resources\nBusiness\nEducation and Human Services\nHumanities, Social Sciences and Arts\nInnovation and Design\nScience and Engineering\nGraduate School\nHonors College\nScience and Engineering\nBiological and Environmental Science\nChemistry\nComputer Science and Information Systems\nEngineering and Technology\nMathematics\nPhysics and Astronomy\nJimmy and Sherroll Shirley Makerspace\nSTEM Education Alliance\nComputer Science and Information Systems\nStudent, Faculty and Staff Internal Resources\nDongeun Lee, Ph.D.\nHome\nPeople\nDongeun Lee, Ph.D.\nProfile for\nDongeun Lee, Ph.D.\nFaculty\nAssociate Professor\nDepartment of Computer Science and Information Systems\nContact Dongeun\nemail\n[email protected]\nphone\n903.886.5409\nOffice\nJournalism 122\nRelated Department\nDepartment of Computer Science and Information Systems\nCurriculum Vitae\nOffice Hours\nWednesday at 11 a.m. – 4 p.m.\nNavigate This Page\nClose Search\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nMenu\nGoogle\nNews\nPrograms\nEvents\nPeople\nCatalog\nSearch with Google"
