    "homepage_text": "Weimin Li's Team\nTeacher's Homepage\nTeam's Homepage\nIntroduction\nActivities\nMore Activities\nMembers\nPhD Students\nMaster Students\nUndergraduate\nApply to Join Us\n中文页面\nIntroduction\nThe laboratory has 6 doctoral students (including 2 international students) and 17 master students. The main research directions of the laboratory are big data analysis, bioinformatics technology, wise information technology of medical, social network analysis, etc. The laboratory has a strong academic atmosphere, solidarity and mutual assistance, and a number of high-level academic achievements are mass-produced every year. Two of the graduate students trained in the past five years have won national scholarships, and the team students have the opportunity to visit abroad.\nActivities\nGroup building activities\nWeimin Li organized the team members of the laboratory to carry out the group building activities in Shanghai Disneyland.\nParticipated in NDBC 2019\n2019.10.11~2019.10.13: Teacher Weimin Li led the team members to participate in the 36th CCF National DataBase Conference in Jinan.\nParticipated in CNCC 2019\n2019.10.17~2019.10.19: Teacher Weimin Li led the team members to participate in the 2019 China National Computer Conference in Suzhou.\nDiscussion with China University of Petroleum\n2019.12.21: The team members arrived in Beijing to have relevant academic discussions with the team of China University of Petroleum.\n2019 year-end dinner\n2019.12.31: The laboratory held a 2019 year-end dinner in Shanghai to review the research work in 2019 and look forward to the new goals for 2020.\nParticipated in WISA 2020\n9.13~9.25: Teacher Weimin Li led the team members to participate in the 17th international Conference of Web Information Systems and Application in Guangzhou.\nParticipated in CCF BIGDATA 2020\n2020.10.22~2020.10.24: Teacher Weimin Li led the team members to participate in the 8th CCF BIGDATA and CNCC 2020 BIGDATA session in Chongqing.\nParticipated in ChineseCSCW 2020\n2020.11.7~2020.11.9: Teacher Weimin Li led the team members to participate in the Chinese Conference on Computer Supported Cooperative Work and Social Computing, 2020 in Shenzhen.\nDiscuss projects with Japanese experts\n2020.11.27: Due to the COVID-19 epidemic, Teacher Weimin Li held an online consultation meeting in Shanghai to discuss key national planned projects with Japanese experts.\n》More Activities...\nMembers\nPhD Students\nShaohua Li [李少华]\nDirection: Fake News Detection\nTime period in school: 2018 -\nVisiting Experience: 2019.9~2019.10 R-CCS, Japan\nAlex L.Munyole\nDirection: Fake News Detection\nTime period in school: 2019 -\nTsigabu Teame Bezabih\nDirection: Plant Disease Detection\nTime period in school: 2019 -\nExperience: Ex- Mekelle University Lecturer\nXiao Yu [于晓]\nDirection: Biological Network\nTime period in school: 2020 -\nJingchao Wang [王静超]\nDirection: Knowledge Graph Reasoning\nTime period in school: 2018 -\nXiao Liu[刘笑]\nDirection: Multimodal segmentation\nTime period in school: 2021 -\nMaster Students\nXiaohua Zhao [赵晓华]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2010 - 2013\nGraduation destination: SAP China Research Institute\nShu Jiang [蒋署]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2014 - 2017\nGraduation destination: ZTO Express\nJun Xie [谢俊]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2015 - 2018\nGraduation destination: Little Red Book\nJun Mo [莫俊]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2016 - 2019\nGraduation destination: Industrial and Commercial Bank of China\nZheng Li [李郑]\nDirection: Maximize Influence\nTime period in school: 2018 - 2021\nGraduation destination: Little Red Book\nKexin Zhong [钟克欣]\nDirection: Maximize Influence\nTime period in school: 2018 - 2021\nGraduation destination: Oriental Cambridge Education Group\nZhibin Deng [邓志斌]\nDirection: Group Behavior in Social Networks\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nExperience: 2019.11, Discussion with the team of China University of Petroleum\nShasha Hu [胡莎莎]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2021\nGraduation destination: CSSC Sea Boat System Technology Co., LTD\nJiamian Li [李嘉冕]\nDirection: Social Network Group Behavior Modeling\nTime period in school: 2019 -\nYaqiong Li [李亚琼]\nDirection: Group Emotion Analysis\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Further study in Fudan University\nYanxia Liu [刘艳霞]\nDirection: Rumor Source Detection in Social Networks\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Bytedance\nDingmei Wei [危丁梅]\nDirection: Modeling and Analysis of Rumor Propagating Mechanism\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Shanghai Lianying Medical Technology Co., LTD\nZhao Wang [王钊]\nDirection: Dynamic Evolution Analysis of Community\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Bytedance\nCai Zhang [张财]\nDirection: Modeling and Prediction of Social Network Group Behavior\nTime period in school: 2019 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Oriental Wealth\nYixing Guo [郭易兴]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2024\nWenya Hu [胡文娅]\nDirection: Financial Data Analysis\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2022\nGraduation destination: Further study in Shanghai University\nFangyu Liu [刘芳宇]\nDirection: Medical image analysis\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2023\nGraduation destination: Further study in University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\nShang Miao [缪赏]\nDirection: Medical image analysis\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2023\nLin Ni [倪琳]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2023\nGraduation destination: Baoarmed intelligent technology Co., LTD\nValerie Wang [王婕]\nDirection: Bioinformatics Technology\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2023\nGraduation destination: Bank of Communications Corporation Limited\nJiajie Zhu [朱嘉洁]\nDirection: Bioinformatics Technology\nTime period in school: 2020 - 2023\nGraduation destination: Bank of Communications Corporation Limited\nChenghong Li [程鸿莉]\nDirection: Medical image analysis\nTime period in school: 2021 - 2024\nChang Guo [郭畅]\nDirection: Maximize Influence\nTime period in school: 2021 - 2024\nMaoxin Shen [沈茂新]\nDirection: Medical image analysis\nTime period in school: 2021 -\nMengying Wang [王梦莹]\nDirection: Bioinformatics Technology\nTime period in school: 2021 - 2024\nYan Zhao [赵岩]\nDirection: Social Network Analysis\nTime period in school: 2021 - 2024\nNan Chen [陈楠]\nTime period in school: 2022 -\nMengying Dai [戴梦颖]\nTime period in school: 2022 -\nYifan Feng [冯亦凡]\nTime period in school: 2022 -\nXiaoyang Li [李晓杨]\nTime period in school: 2022 -\nYue Wang [王月]\nTime period in school: 2022 -\nQunpeng Hu [胡群鹏]\nTime period in school: 2023 -\nYue Jiang [姜悦]\nTime period in school: 2023 -\nYuxue Yang [杨雨雪]\nTime period in school: 2023 -\nUndergraduate students under the guidance of Mr.Li\nName\nTime period in school\nTheme of graduation thesis\nSituation after graduation\n...\n...\n...\n...\n*Note: The order of the above students is arranged according to the year of matriculate and name dictionary\nApply to Join Us\nWe have always been interested in recruiting diligent, motivated, and hard-working postgraduate and undergraduate students. If you are interested in big data analysis, bioinformatics technology, wise information technology of medical, and social network analysis related directions, and want to join the research team or learn more about the team, please email ：wmli@shu.edu.cn contact me and send your resume."
