    "homepage_text": "Jiayi  Wang\nJiayi\nWang\nResearch Fellow, School of Computing, National University of Singapore\nI am now a research fellow working with Prof.\nXiaokui Xiao\nat the Department of Computer Science, National University of Singapore (NUS).\nPreviously, I obtained my PhD degree in 2025 from DBGroup at Department of Computer Science and Technology, Tsinghua University, under the supervision of\nGuoliang Li\n.\nMy current research focuses on data analytics with LLMs.\nnews\nMay 27, 2025\nOne demo got accepted at VLDB 2025!\nMar 26, 2025\nTwo papers got accepted at ICDE 2025!\nFeb 4, 2025\nOur Tutorial got accepted at SIGMOD 2025!\nOct 4, 2024\nOne paper got accepted at CIDR 2025!\nMar 10, 2024\nOrganizing the\nSIGMOD programming contest\nthis year!  Hope participants enjoy!\nSep 1, 2023\nInvited to present\nRECON\nat\nTaDA Workshop @ VLDB 2023\n. Hope to contribute!\nApr 15, 2023\nWon the championship  of\nSIGMOD 2023 programming contest\n!\nMar 13, 2023\nOne paper got accepted at SIGMOD 2023!\nSep 22, 2022\nReceived\nSiebel Scholar\n! Many thanks to\nSiebel Scholars Foundation\n!\nAug 16, 2022\nOne paper got accepted at VLDB 2023!\nselected publications\nCIDR’25\nAOP: Automated and Interactive LLM Pipeline Orchestration for Answering Complex Queries\nJiayi Wang\n, and Guoliang Li\nCIDR\n, 2025\nPDF\nCode\nICDE’25\nUnify: An Unstructured Data Analytics System\nJiayi Wang\n, and Jianhua Feng\nICDE\n, 2025\nPDF\nCode\nICDE’25\nFederated Data Analytics with Differentially Private Density Estimation Model\nJiayi Wang\n, Lei Cao, Chengliang Chai, and Guoliang Li\nICDE\n, 2025\nPDF\nCode\nVLDBJ’24\nCardinality estimation using normalizing flow\nJiayi Wang\n, Chengliang Chai, Jiabin Liu, and Guoliang Li\nVLDB J.\n, 2024\nPDF\nCode\nVLDB’23\nCoresets over Multiple Tables for Feature-rich and Data-efficient\n                  Machine Learning\nJiayi Wang\n, Chengliang Chai, Nan Tang, Jiabin Liu, and Guoliang Li\nProc. VLDB Endow.\n, 2023\nPDF\nCode\nVLDB’22\