    "homepage_text": "Home | Naiyu Yin\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nNAIYU YIN\nHELLO! I’M NAIYU YIN\nWelcome to My Site\nHome: Welcome\nPERSONAL DESCRIPTION\nI am a first-year Ph.D. student in Electrical, Computer and System Engineering Department of Rensselaer Polytechnic I\nnstitute\nContact\nHome: About Me\nEDUCATION\nMy Studies\nMay 2019 - Current\nPH.D.\nRENSSELAER POLYTECHNIC INSTITUTE\nI am currently a first-year Ph.D. student in the Electrical, Computer and System Engineering Department. I am a research assistant at the Intelligent System Lab.\nSeptember 2017 - May 2019\nI receive my Master's Degree in Electrical and Computer Engineering at Duke University.\nMS\nDUKE UNIVERSITY\nHome: Education\nMY RESEARCH INTERESTS\nPROBABILISTIC GRAPHIC MODEL\nCOMPUTER VISION\nDEEP LEARNING\nHome: Skills\n\"Each has his past shut in him like the leaves of a book known to him by heart and his friends can only read the title\"\nVirginia Woolf\nHome: Quote\nLET’S CONNECT\nDepartment of Electrical, Computer and System Engineering\nRensselaer Polytechnic Institute\nyinn2@rpi.edu\nHome: Contact\nbottom of page"
  },
  "serper::Kang Li": {
