    "homepage_text": "Jinwei Gu\nJinwei Gu\nPrincipal Research Scientist\nNVIDIA\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nI am currently a principal research scientist at NVIDIA, working on \n\t\t\t\t  deep generative models, vision foundation models, world models, \n\t\t\t\t  and the general fields of computer vision, computer graphics, and machine learning. \n\t\t\t\t  I am also an adjunct associate professor at the Chinese\n                  University of Hong Kong. I received my Ph.D.\n                  from Columbia University, and B.S. and M.S. from\n                  Tsinghua University.\nRecent Research (to be updated ...)\nLearning Image-Adaptive Codebooks for Class-Agnostic Image Restoration [\nPaper\n]\nKechun, Yitong, Inchang, Jinwei\nICCV 2023\nReal-time Controllable Denoising for Image and Video [\nPaper\n]\nZhaoyang, Yitong, Wenqi, Xiaogang, Ping, Kaimo, Jinwei.\nCVPR 2023 (to appear)\nGenerating Aligned Pseudo-Supervision from Non-Aligned Data for Image Restoration\n\t\t\t\t\t\tin Under-Display Camera[\nPaper\n]\nRuicheng, Chongyi, Huaijin, Shuai, Jinwei, and Cavan.\nCVPR 2023 (to appear)\nDeep Fouier Up-Sampling[\nPaper\n]\nMan, Yu, Jie, Feng, Jinwei, Cavan, Deyu, Chongyi.\nNeurIPS 2022\nDeep Camera Obscura: An Image Restoration Pipeline\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfor Lenless Pinhole Photography[\nPaper\n]\nJoshua, Huaijin, Shuai, Jinwei, and Suren.\nOptics Express, 2022\nLow-light Image and Video Enhancement Using Deep\n                      Learning: A Survey[\nPaper\n][\nData+Code\n]\nChongyi, Chunle, Linghao, Jun, Ming-Ming, Jinwei and Chen Change.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine\n                    Intelligence, 2021. (to appear)\niToF2dToF: A Robust and Flexible Representation\n                      for Data-driven Time-of-Flight Imaging[\nProject(Paper+Data+Code)\n]\nFelipe, Huaijin, Mohit, Andreas, and Jinwei.\nIEEE Transactions on Computational Imaging, 2021. (to appear)\nReconfigISP: Reconfigurable Camera Image\n                      Processing Pipeline[\nProject\n                                                  (Paper+Code)\n]\nKe, Zexian, Yue, Cavan, and Jinwei.\nICCV, 2021.\nSTAR: A Structure-Aware Lightweight Transformer for Real-time\n                      Image Enhancement [\nPaper\n]\nZhaoyang, Yitong, Jun, Xiaogang, Ping, and Jinwei\nICCV, 2021.\nDynamic Quantization with Mixed Precision and\n                      Adaptive Resolution\n[Paper]\nZhaoyang, Wenqi, Jinwei, Xiaogang, and Ping\nICML, 2021. (spotlight)\nRemoving Diffraction Image Artifacts in\n                      Under-Display Camera via Dynamic Skip Connection\n                      Network\n[Project/Code]\nRuicheng, Chongyi, Huaijin, Shuai, Cavan, and Jinwei\nCVPR, 2021.\nGLEAN: Generative Latent Bank for Large-Factor\n                      Image Super-Resolution\n[Project/Code]\nKelvin, Xintao, Xiangyu, Jinwei, and Cavan\nCVPR, 2021. (Oral)\nVideo Stitching for Linear Camera Arrays\n[Project]\nWei-Sheng, Orazio, Jinwei, Deqing, Ming-hsuan, and Jan.\nBMVC, 2019. (to appear)\nNRMVS: Non-Rigid Multi-View Stereo [\nArxiv\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n][Project (coming soon)]\nMatthias, Kihwan, Jinwei, Matthias, Charles, Marc, and Jan.\nArxiv, 2019.\nNeural RGB->D Sensing: Depth and Uncertainty from\n                      a Video Camera [\nArxiv\n][\nCode\n]\nChao, Jinwei, Kihwan, Srinivas, and Jan.\nCVPR 2019 (Oral, Best Paper Finalist).\nPlaneRCNN: 3D Plane Detection and Reconstruction\n                      from a Single Image[\nArxiv\n]\n                                          [\nCode\n]\nChen, Kihwan, Jinwei, Yasutaka, and Jan.\nCVPR 2019 (Oral).\nNeural Inverse Rendering of an Indoor Scene from a\n                      Single Image[\nArxiv\n]\n[Project and Dataset]\nSoumyadip, Jinwei, Kihwan, Guilin, David, and Jan.\nArxiv 2019. ICCV 2019 (to appear)\nVery Power Efficient Neural Time-of-Flight[\nArxiv\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n][Project (coming soon)]\nYan, Jimmy, Xuanye, Keyuan, and Jinwei.\nArxiv 2019.\nContext-Aware Synthesis and Placement of Object Instances[\nArxiv\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\n[Code]\nDonghoon, Sifei, Jinwei, Ming-Yu, Ming-Hsuan, and Jan.\nNIPS 2018.\nSwitchable Temporal Propagation Network [\nArxiv\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\n[Applications]\nSifei, Jinwei, Shalini, Guangyu, Varun, Ming-Hsuan, and Jan.\nECCV 2018.\nSeparating Reflection and Transmission Images in the Wild [\nArxiv\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\n[Code]\nPatrick, Orazio, Jinwei, and Jan.\nECCV 2018.\nMapNet: Geometry-Aware Learning of Maps for Camera Localization[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n][\nProject\n]\nSamarth, Jinwei, Kihwan, James, and Jan.\nCVPR 2018 (spotlight).\nSpace-Time-Brightness Sampling Using an Adaptive Pixel-Wise Coded Exposure \n                    [\nPDF\n]\nHajime, Toshiki, Dengyu, and Jinwei.\nCVPR 2018, Computational Camera and Display Workshop.\nReblur2Deblur: Deblurring Videos via Self-Supervised Learning[\nPDF\n][\nProject\n]\nHuaijin, Jinwei, Orazio, Ming-Yu, Ashok, and Jan.\nICCP 2018.\nLearning Affinity via Spatial Propagation Networks [\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\nSifei, Shalini, Jinwei, Guangyu, Ming-Hsuan,and Jan.\nNIPS 2017 (Accepted).\nA Lightweight Approach for On-the-Fly Reflectance\n                    Estimation[\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\nKihwan, Jinwei, Stephen, Pavlo, Matthias, and Jan.\nICCV 2017 Oral. arXiv:1705.07162\nDynamic Facial Analysis: From Bayesian Filtering to\n                    Recurrent Neural Networks [\nProject\n][\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Video\n]\nJinwei, Xiaodong, Shalini and Jan.\nCVPR 2017\nPolarimetric Multi-view Stereo [\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Document\n][\nVideo\n]\nZhaopeng, Jinwei, Boxin, Ping and Jan.\nCVPR 2017\nReconstructing Intensity Images from Binary Spatial\n                    Gradient Cameras [\nPDF\n][\nSupplementary Document\n][\nVideo\n]\nSuren, Orazio, Jinwei, Timo and Jan.\nCVPR EVW \n                    2017 (Oral)\nDeep Learning with Energy-efficient Binary Gradient\n                    Cameras [\nPDF\n]\nSuren, Orazio, and Jinwei.\narXiv:1612.00986\n, 2016\nVideo Stitching with Spatial-Temporal Content-Preserving Warping[\nPDF\n][\nVideo Results\n]\nWei and Jinwei.\nCVPR 2015 Workshop on Computational Cameras and\n\t\t\t\t\tDisplays\ntop\nPrevious Research\nExemplar-Based Method for Automatic Visual Editing\n\t\t\t\t\tand Retouching of Fine Art Reproduction [\nproject\n]\nJun and Jinwei.\nCIC 2013\nLearning Discriminative Illumination and Filters for BTF\n\t\t\t\t\tClassification[\nproject\n]\n\t\t\t\t\t[\ndatabase](with code)\nChao, Jinwei, and Gefei.\nCVPR 2013\nWhat is the Space of Camera Spectral Sensitivities?[\nproject\n]\n\t\t\t\t\t[\ndatabase\n](with code)\nJun, Dengyu, Jinwei, and Sabine.\nIEEE WACV 2013\nClassifying Raw Materials with Discriminative Illumination [\nproject\n]\n\t\t\t\t\t[\ndatabase\n]\nChao and Jinwei.\nCVPR 2012 (Oral)\nSpectral Imaging Under Commonly Available Lighting \n\t\t\t\t\t  [\nproject\n]\nJun and Jinwei.\nCVPR 2012 Workshop on Computational Camera\n\t\t\t\tand Displays\nMultiplexed Illumination for Scene Recovery in the\n\t\t\t\t\tPresence of Global Illumination[\nproject\n]\nToshi, Jinwei, Mohit, and\nShree\n.\nICCV 2011 (Oral)\nVideo from a Single Exposure Coded Photograph using\n\t\t\t\t\ta Learned Over-Complete Dictionary[\nproject\n]\nYas, Jinwei, Mohit, Tomoo, and\nShree\n.\nICCV 2011\nCoded Rolling Shutter Photography: Flexible\n\t\t\t\t\tSpace-Time Sampling [\nproject\n]\nYas, Jinwei, Tomoo, and\nShree\n.\nICCP 2010\nMeasurement, Modeling, and Synthesis of Time-Varying\n\t\t\t\t\tAppearance of Natural Phenomena [\nPDF\n]\nJinwei Gu. PhD Thesis. Columbia University\n. March 2010\nRemoving Image Artifacts Due to Dirty Camera Lenses\n\t\t\t\t\tand Thin Occluders[\nproject\n]\nJinwei,\nRavi\n,\nPeter\n, and\nShree\n.\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2009\nPrinting Spatially-Varying Reflectance \n\t\t\t\t  [\nproject\n]\nJinwei,\nWojciech Matusik\n,\nBoris Ajdin\n,\nJason Lawrence\n,\nHendrik P. A. Lensch\n,\nFabio Pellacini\n, \n\t\t\tand\nSzymon Rusinkiewicz\n.\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2009\nCompressive Structured Light for Recovering Inhomogenous\n\t\t\t\t\tParticipating Media [\nproject\n](with\n                    code)\nJinwei,\nRavi\n,\nPeter\n,\nShree\n, and\nEitan\n.\nECCV 2008 (Oral)\nDirty Glass: Modeling and Rendering Contamination on Transparent\n\t\t\t\tSurfaces [\nproject\n] [\ndatabase\n]\n\t\t\t(with code)\nJinwei,\nRavi\n,\nPeter\n, and\nShree\n.\nEGSR 2007\nTime-Varying Surface Appearance [\nproject\n][\ndatabase\n]\n\t\t\t(with code)\nJinwei, Chien-i Tu,\nRavi\n,\nPeter\n,\nWojciech\n, and\nShree\n.\nSIGGRAPH 2006\nRadiometric Calibration from a Single Image\n\t\t\t\t[\nproject\n]\nJinwei,\nStephen\n\t\t\t\tLin\n,\nShuntaro\n\t\t\t\tYamazaki\n, and\nHarry Shum\n,\nCVPR 2004 (Oral)\nFingerprint Orientation Field Modeling and Its\n\t\t\t\tApplications [\nproject\n]\nwith Jie Zhou, Chunyu Yang.\nCVPR\n\t\t\t\t2003\ntop\nSelected Publications (to be updated ...)\nComputer Vision and Machine Learning\nKihwan Kim, Jinwei Gu, Stephen Tyree, Pavlo\n                        Molchanov, Matthias Niebner, and Jan Kautz. \"\nA Lightweight\n             Approach for On-the-Fly Reflectance Estimation\n\",\narXiv\n             1705.07162\n, 2017\nJinwei Gu, Xiaodong Yang, Shalini Gupta and Jan\n                        Kautz. \"\nDynamic Facial\n                            Analysis: From Bayesian Filterings to\n                            Recurrent Neural Networks\n\".\nCVPR\n,\n                        2017.\nZhaopeng Cui, Jinwei Gu, Boxin Shi, Ping Tan and\n                        Jan Kautz. \n                        \"\nPolarimetric Multi-view\n                            Stereo\n\".\nCVPR\n, 2017.\nSuren Jayasuriya, Orazio Gallo, Jinwei Gu, Timo\n                        Aila, and Jan Kautz. \"\nReconstructing Intensity\n                         Images from Binary Spatial Gradient Cameras\n\",\nCVPR Embedded Vision Workshop (Oral)\n, 2017\nSuren Jayasuriya, Orazio Gallo, Jinwei Gu and\n    