    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Zenan Li - Academic Homepage\nZenan Li\nPostdoctoral Researcher\nETH Zürich\nResearch Interests\nNeuro-Symbolic AI\nTheorem Proving\nMathematical Reasoning\nFormal Verification\nAbout Me\nI am a postdoctoral researcher in the\nDepartment of Computer Science\nat\nETH Zürich\n, working with\nProf. Zhendong Su\n. I obtained my Ph.D. from\nNanjing University\nunder the supervision of Prof. Xiaoxing Ma and Prof. Jian Lü, and hold a B.Sc. in Mathematics from Southwest Jiaotong University.\n🚀 Research Thrust\nBefore the advent of large language models (LLMs), my research primarily focused on the integration of deep learning and software engineering, particularly quality assurance for deep learning models and software engineering automation via deep learning. Additionally, I worked on mathematical optimization, developing fast algorithms and theoretical analysis for minimax/bilevel optimization in large-scale machine learning.\nIn the LLM era, my research has shifted to\nneuro-symbolic AI\n. Beyond exploring the theoretical foundations of neuro-symbolic learning, I am particularly focused on its applications, including\ntheorem proving\n,\nmathematical reasoning\n, and\nformal verification\n.\n🔥 News\nView All →\n📄 Publications\n(* equal contribution, † project leader)\n🏆 Honors & Awards\nView All →\n💼 Academic Service\nProgram Committee / Reviewer\nNeurIPS 2023-2025, ICML 2024-2025, ICLR 2023-2025\nTeaching Assistant\nDiscrete Mathematics (2020, 2021, 2022), Nanjing University\n🎓 Education & Experience\nPostdoctoral Researcher\nETH Zürich, Switzerland\nSep 2025 - Present\nSupervisor: Prof. Zhendong Su\nResearch Intern, Systems Research Group\nMicrosoft Research Asia, Beijing, China\nJul 2023 - Dec 2024\nMentor: Dr. Fan Yang\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nNanjing University, Nanjing, China\nSep 2020 - Jun 2025\nAdvisors: Prof. Xiaoxing Ma and Prof. Jian Lü\nM.Sc. in Software Engineering\nNanjing University, Nanjing, China\nSep 2017 - Jun 2020\nAdvisor: Prof. Xiaoxing Ma\nB.Sc. in Mathematics and Applied Mathematics\nSouthwest Jiaotong University, Chengdu, China\nSep 2013 - Jun 2017\nAdvisor: Prof. Chengjing Wang\n📬 Contact\nContact Information\nzenan.li@inf.ethz.ch\nCNB H 105\nETH Zürich\nZürich, Switzerland\n📌 Useful Links\nTheorem Proving\nThe official Zulip channel for Lean 4\nThe tutorial for Verus\nDeep Learning\nTheoretical Machine Learning: A Handbook for Everyone (in Chinese)"
  },
