    "homepage_text": "Forensic Linguistics/Language and Law - LIU Weiming's Home Page\nã\nã\nThis picture was taken at Leiden, a charming little city of Netherlands,                                                     \r\n          during the days\nwhen IAFL 09 Conference was held.\nNew\nAn Overview of Forensic Linguistics Research in China\n(\nPDF                                                \r\n                              File\n)\n\"\nIllocutionary and Perlocutionary Acts in Chinese Judge's Attached                                         \r\n                              Discourse\n\". Lodz Papers in Pragmatics LPP3, 2007.\nMyself\nCurriculum Vitae\nPublications\nChinese\nPhoto Gallery\n/\nPhotography\nGuestBook\nBlog\n/\nDictionary                                \r\n                              on Line\nDatabase\nF. L. Research\nF. L. in China\nF. L. Journals\nF. L. Education\nForensic Linguists\nAcademic Information\nF. L. Websites\nNEW\nLinks to Linguistics and Law\nContact Information\nLIU Weiming,                                             \r\n              Professor in Forensic Linguistics, Language and the Law,\nVice-Chairman                                                          \r\n              of  CAFL (China Association of Forensic Linguistics),\nNorthwest University of Political        \r\n                              Science & Law, Xian, Shaanxi, P. R. China\nUpdated on 06 January, 2021\nThis website was created by LIU Weiming on 6 May, 2002."
