    "homepage_text": "Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nKatelyn Gao\nI am a staff AI research scientist at Intel Labs working on novel algorithms for 3D generation. Previously, I worked on meta-learning and reinforcement learning.\nI received a\nPhD in Statistics from Stanford\n, advised by\nArt Owen\n, during which I was partly funded by a\nNSF Graduate Research Fellowship\n. My undergraduate degree is in Math and Economics from\nMIT\n.\nTo contact me, please send an email to kxgao at alumni dot stanford dot edu.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
