    "homepage_text": "Yuetian Luo Research\nYuetian Luo\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nPreprints\nAbhinav Chakraborty*, Yuetian Luo*, Rina Foygel Barber, \"\nStability and Accuracy Trade-offs in Statistical Estimation\n\", 2026.\nMinjun Cho, Yuetian Luo, Chao Gao, \"\nRobust Confidence Intervals for a Binomial Proportion: Local Optimality and Adaptivity\n\", 2025.\nYuetian Luo, Rina Foygel Barber, \"\nIs Algorithmic Stability Testable? A Unified Framework under Computational Constraints\n\", 2024.\nYuetian Luo, Nicolás García Trillos, \"\nNonconvex Matrix Factorization is Geodesically Convex: Global Landscape Analysis for Fixed-rank Matrix Optimization From a Riemannian Perspective\n\", 2022.\nPublications\nYuetian Luo, Rina Foygel Barber, \"\nThe Limits of Assumption-free Tests for Algorithm Performance\n\",\nBernoulli\n, to appear.\nYuetian Luo, Chao Gao, \"\nAdaptive Robust Confidence Intervals\n\",\nAnnals of Statistics\n, to appear.\nManuel Müller, Yuetian Luo, Rina Foygel Barber, \"\nAre all models wrong? Fundamental limits in distribution-free empirical model falsification\n\",\nConference of Learning Theory (COLT)\n, 2025.\nYuetian Luo, Chao Gao, \"\nComputational Lower Bounds for Graphon Estimation via\r\n      Low-degree Polynomials\n\",\nAnnals of Statistics\n, 2024.\nYuetian Luo, Xudong Li, Anru Zhang, \"\nNonconvex Factorization and Manifold Formulations are Almost Equivalent in Low-rank Matrix Optimization\n\",\nINFORMS Journal on Optimization\n, 2024.\nYuetian Luo, Anru Zhang, \"\nTensor-on-Tensor Regression: Riemannian Optimization, Over-parameterization, Statistical-computational Gap, and Their Interplay\n\",\nAnnals of Statistics\n, 2024. [\nCode\n]\nYuetian Luo, Zhimei Ren, Rina Foygel Barber, \"\nIterative Approximate Cross-Validation\n\",\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\n, 2023. [\nCode\n]\nIlias Diakonicolas*, Daniel Kane*, Yuetian Luo*, Anru Zhang* \"\nStatistical and Computational Limits for Tensor-on-Tensor Association Detection\n\",\nConference of Learning Theory (COLT)\n, 2023.\nYuetian Luo, Anru Zhang, \"\nLow-rank Tensor Estimation via Riemannian Gauss-Newton: Statistical Optimality and Second-Order Convergence\n\",\nJournal of Machine Learning Research\n, 2023. [\nCode\n]\nYuetian Luo, Xudong Li, Anru Zhang, \"\nOn Geometric Connections of Embedded and Quotient Geometries in Riemannian Fixed-rank Matrix Optimization\n\",\nMathematics of Operations Research\n, 2023.\nYuetian Luo, Wen Huang, Xudong Li, Anru Zhang, \"\nRecursive Importance Sketching for Rank Constrained Least Squares\n\",\nOperations Research\n, 2023. [\nCode\n]\nRungang Han, Yuetian Luo, Miaoyan Wang, Anru Zhang, \"\nExact clustering in tensor block model: Statistical optimality and computational limit\n\",\nJournal of the Royal Statistical Society, Series B\n, 2022. [\nR Package\n]\n(This paper received the\nBest Student's Paper Award\nfrom the Statistical Learning and Data Science Section of the American Statistical Association, 2021 JSM)\nYuetian Luo, Anru Zhang, \"\nTensor Clustering with Planted Structures: Statistical Optimality and Computational Limits\n\",\nAnnals of Statistics\n, 2021.\nYuetian Luo, Rungang Han, Anru Zhang, \"\nA Schatten-q matrix perturbation theory via Perturbation Projection Error Bound\n\",\nLinear Algebra and its Applications\n, 2021.\nYuetian Luo, Garvesh Raskutti, Ming Yuan, Anru Zhang,  \"\nA Sharp Blockwise Tensor Perturbation Bound for Orthogonal Iteration\n\",\nJournal of Machine Learning Research\n, 2021.\nAnru Zhang, Yuetian Luo, Garvesh Raskutti, Ming Yuan, \"\nISLET: fast and optimal low-rank tensor regression via importance sketchings\n\",\nSIAM Journal on Mathematics of Data Science\n, 2020.\nYuetian Luo, Anru Zhang, \"\nOpen problem: Average-case hardness of hypergraphic planted clique detection\n\",\nConference of Learning Theory (COLT)\n, 2020.\nYang Li, Yuetian Luo, Davide Ferrari, Xiaonan Hu, Yichen Qin. \"\nModel confidence bounds for variable selection\n\"\nBiometrics, 2019 (with discussion).\nYang Li, Yuetian Luo, Davide Ferrari, Xiaonan Hu, Yichen Qin, \"\n\"Rejoinder to Discussions on: Model confidence bounds for variable selection.\n\",\nBiometrics, 2019.\nYuetian Luo, Zachary A Pardos, \"\nDiagnosing university student subject proficiency and predicting degree completion in vector space\n\",\nIn Thirty-Second AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2018.\n(* = alphabetical ordering or equal contribution)\nCopyright © black & white |\nHTML5\n|\nCSS\n|\nHTML5 Web Templates"
