    "homepage_text": "Qinyuan Zheng | Department of Physics\nSkip to main content\nYale University\nOpen Main Navigation\nClose Main Navigation\nContact Us!\nVideos\nVisit\nDONATE\nDepartment of Physics\nDiscover Physics at Yale\nYou are here\nHome\n»\nPeople\n»\nQinyuan Zheng\nQinyuan Zheng\nGraduate School Student\nqinyuan.zheng@yale.edu\nResearch Areas:\nAstrophysics & Cosmology\nAdvisor:\nChiara Mingarelli"
