    "homepage_text": "PMLC lab - Members\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nPMLC lab\nMembers\nProfessor\nEunsang Lee is an assistant professor in the Department of Software at Sejong University. His research interests are in privacy-preserving machine learning (PPML) and cryptography. Recently, he has been working on deep learning using fully homomorphic encryption. He is also interested in post-quantum cryptography (PQC), multi-party computation (MPC), and other advanced lattice-based cryptography primitives.\nBefore joining Sejong University, he was postdoctoral researcher at Seoul National University\n.\nHe obtained PhD in department of Electrical and Computer Engineering at Seoul National University in August 2020. His advisor was Jong-Seon No.\nPhD Student\n강도경 (Dokyeong Kang)\nM.S Department of Semiconductor Systems Engineering in Sejong University\n2024.02 ~ present\nB.S Department of Electronic Information and Communication Engineering in Sejong University, 2024\ne-mail:\ndokyeong@itsoc.sejong.ac.kr\nMaster's Student\n최윤제 (\nYunje Choi)\nMaster's\nStudent, Sejong University\n2025.9 ~ present\ne-mail:\nchldbswp123@gmail.com\nResearcher\n국지형 (Jihyung Kook)\nM.S. in Computer Science, Georgia Institute of Technology, 2024 (Online)\nB.S. in Statistics, Sookmyung Women’s University, 2017\n2025.7 ~ present\ne-mail:\nthepawgrammer@gmail.com\nhomepage:\nhttps://thepawgrammer.github.io/\nInternship\n김수민 (Soomin Kim)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2024.10 ~ present\ne-mail:\nsm717503@gmail.com\n장호성 (Hosung Jang)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2025.9 ~ present\ne-mail:\ndndud0995@naver.com\nPast Internship\n김연우 (\nYeonwoo Kim)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2024.10 ~ 2025.8\ne-mail:\nkkyanwoo@gmail.com\n임우진 (Woojin Lim)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2023.6 ~ 2025.8\ne-mail:\nhailcryptic@naver.com\n박수민 (Sumin Park)\nBachelor Student (graduated in 2024), Sejong University\n2023.1 ~ 2025.2\n한정환 (Junghwan Han)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2023.12 ~ 2024.6\n오창묵 (Changmook Oh)\nBachelor Student (graduated in 2023), Sejong University\n2023.8 ~ 2024.2\n김용현 (Yonghyun Kim)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2023.6 ~ 2024.7\n김예진 (Yejin Kim)\nBachelor Student, Sejong University\n2023.1 ~ 2024.2\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
