    "homepage_text": "International Pacific Research Center | People | Xiaojun Guo\nHome\nAbout\nNews\nResearch\nMeetings\nPublications\nPeople\nData Center (APDRC)\nXiaojun Guo\nPostdoctoral Researcher\n[Past Staff]\nInternational Pacific Research Center\nSchool\n     of Ocean and Earth Science and Technology\nUniversity of Hawaii\nHonolulu, Hawaii 96822\nEmail:\nEmail Hidden\nRefereed Publications\nGuo, X., N. Zhao, T. Nasuno, K. Kikuchi, M. Nakano, and H. Annamalai, 2023: Distinct features of atmospheric rivers over the western North Pacific in post–El Niño and non-post–El Niño summers.\nJ. Climate\n,\n36\n(24), 8313-8330, doi:\n10.1175/JCLI-D-23-0244.1\n. IPRC-1609.\nGuo, X., N. Zhao, K. Kikuchi, T. Nasuno, M. Nakano, and H. Annamalai, 2021: Atmospheric Rivers over the Indo-Pacific and its Associations with Boreal Summer Intraseasonal Oscillation.\nJ. Climate\n,\n, 1-46, doi:\n10.1175/JCLI-D-21-0290.1\n. IPRC-1533.\nGuo, X., J. Huang, Y. Luo, Z. Zhao, and Y. Xu, 2017: Projection of heat waves over China for eight different global warming targets using 12 CMIP5 models.\nTheor. Appl. Climatol.\n,\n128\n, 507-522, doi:\n10.1007/s00704-015-1718-1\n.\nGuo, X., J. Huang, Y. Luo, Z. Zhao, and Y. Xu, 2016: Projection of precipitation extremes for eight global warming targets by 17 CMIP5 models.\nNat. Hazards\n,\n84\n, 2299-2319, doi:\n10.1007/s11069-016-2553-0\n.\nQuestions, Comments?\nContact Us\nThe IPRC welcomes private donations to support its activities\nSCHOOL OF OCEAN AND EARTH SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY\nAT THE UNIVERSITY OF HAWAI‘I AT MĀNOA\nGET INVOLVED!"
