    "github": "https://github.com/934546",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Liu Yuanyuan  - Homepage\nYUANYUAN LIU\nProfessor\r\n                School of Information and Engineering\r\n                China University of Geosciences (Wuhan)\nIEEE/CSIG/CAAI/ACM Member\nCCF Senior Member\nNo.\n68\nJincheng Road,Wuhan, P.R. China Postcode:\n430074.\nGoogle Scholar\ndblp\nTelephone:\n86-013349830890\nEmail:\nliuyy@cug.edu.cn\nResearch Area\nMy research interests fall into the areas of\ncomputer vision, emotion computing, image and video understanding,\netc. More specifically, I am interested in the following topics:\nEmotion  Computing\nincluding facial expression recognition, human-centric emotion analysis, emotion captioning, multimodal emotion recognition\nImage/Video understanding\nincluding scene segmentation, cross-domain object detection, and temporal action localization\nDeep Learning Methods and Application\nincluding open-set learning, zero-shot/few-shot learning, and domain adaptation etc.\nRencent News:\nAttended\nChinaMM 2025\n, 22 - 24 August 2025 • Weihai, Shandong, China • Awarded Best Student Paper Award\nAttended the 32nd\nACM Multimedia\nConference, 28 October - 1 November 2024 • Melbourne, Australia\nTaking part in\nValse\n2023, 10-12 June 2023 • WuXi, China\nFive papers from our group accepted, February 2023 • One accepted by\nCVPR 2023\nPresented at\nACM Multimedia\n2022, 10-14 October 2022 • Lisbon, Portugal\nTaking part in\nValse\n2021, 8-10 October 2021 • Hangzhou, China\nPresentation at\nICIP\n2021, 19-22 September 2021 • Anchorage, Alaska, USA\nPublished Datesets:\nMAFW\nA large-scale, multi-modal, compound affective database for dynamic facial expression recognition in the wild.\nContains 10,045 video clips from global regions (China, Japan, Korea, Europe, America, India) across various themes. Each clip was annotated 11 times by trained annotators, featuring:\n• 11-dimensional expression distribution vectors\n• Single/multiple expression labels & bilingual descriptions\n• 11 single-emotion classes and 32 compound-emotion classes\n• Automatic annotations (68 facial landmarks, face bounding boxes)\nDataset Details：\nhttps://mafw-database.github.io/MAFW/\nEMER\nan eye-behavior-assisted multimodal affective database dedicated to bridging the \"emotion gap\" between facial expression recognition (FER) and genuine emotion recognition (ER).\n• Contains 1,303 multimodal samples of 121 participants, annotated via a dual-perspective system, featuring:\n• Three core modalities: facial videos, eye movement sequences, eye fixation heatmaps\n• Discrete (7-class/3-class) & continuous (valence-arousal) emotion labels (ER/FER dual-perspective)\n• FER intensity ratings (0-3) via Active Learning-based Annotation (ALA)\nDataset Details：\nhttps://qyqyqyi.github.io/EMER/\nRecent Publications:\n2025\nYunjiao Liu,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Kejun Liu, Yuxuan Huang, Chang Tang, Wujie Zhou, Zhe Chen, Wei Xiang, and Hongyan Zhang. \"MASDG: Multiview Augmented Single-Source Domain Generalization Method for Robust Remote Sensing Building Extraction.\"\nIEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing\n,vol. 63, pp. 1-15, 2025.\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1109/TGRS.2025.3640112\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Lin Wei, Kejun Liu, Zijing Chen, Zhe Chen*, Chang Tang, Jingying Chen, Shiguang Shan*. \"Leveraging Eye Movement for Instructing Robust Video-based Facial Expression Recognition.\"\nIEEE Transactions on Affective Computing\n(2025). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1109/TAFFC.2025.3599859\n]\r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nKe Wang,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Chang Tang, Kun Sun, Yibing Zhan, Zhe Chen. \"Degradation-adaptive attack-robust self-supervised facial representation learning.\"\nNeurocomputing\n655: 131356 (2025). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.neucom.2025.131356\n]\r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nKejun Liu, Xuesong Yan,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Chang Tang, Yibing Zhan, Wei Luo, Wujie Zhou, Hongyan Zhang. \"PMTSeg: Prompt-Driven Multimodal Transformer for Task-Adapted Remote Sensing Image Segmentation.\"\nIEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing\n63: 1-15 (2025)\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI:10.1109/TGRS.2025.3586620\n]\r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYu Wang,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Shunping Zhou, Yuxuan Huang, Chang Tang, Wujie Zhou, Zhe Chen. \"Emotion-oriented Cross-modal Prompting and Alignment for Human-centric Emotional Video Captioning.\"\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n27: 3766-3780 (2025).\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1109/TMM.2025.3535292\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\n刘袁缘\n,  刘树阳,  刘云娇,  袁雨晨,  唐厂,  罗威.  提示学习在计算机视觉中的分类、应用及展望.\n自动化学报\n,  2025, 51(5): 1021−1040\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.16383/j.aas.c240177\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Ning Zhou, Yuxuan Huang, Shuyang Liu, Leyuan Liu, Wujie Zhou, Chang Tang, Ke Wang*. \"Beyond boundaries: Hierarchical-contrast unsupervised temporal action localization with high-coupling feature learning.\nPattern Recognition\n162: 111421 (2025)\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.patcog.2025.111421\n]\r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Shaoze Feng, Shuyang Liu, Yibing Zhan, Dapeng Tao, Zijing Chen, Zhe Chen*. \"Sample-Cohesive Pose-Aware Contrastive Facial Representation Learning.\"\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n133(6): 3727-3745 (2025). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1007/s11263-025-02348-z\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Haoyu Zhang*, Yibing Zhan, Zijing Chen, Guanghao Yin, Lin Wei, Zhe Chen. \"Noise-Resistant Multimodal Transformer for Emotion Recognition.\"\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n133(5): 3020-3040 (2025). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1007/s11263-024-02304-3\n]\nLin Wei,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Kejun Liu, Yuxuan Huang, Shaozhe Feng. \"Emotion-Aware Text Generation for Instructing Audio-Visual Emotion Recognition.\"\nIEEE IJCNN.\n(2025).\n2024\nGuanghao Yin,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Tengfei Liu, Haoyu Zhang, Fang Fang, Chang Tang, Liangxiao Jiang. \"Token-disentangling Mutual Transformer for Multimodal Emotion Recognition.\"\nEngineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence\n, Volume 133, Part D, July 2024, Page 108348. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.engappai.2024.108348\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nFayong Zhang, Kejun Liu,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Chaofan Wang, Wujie Zhou, Hongyan Zhang, Lizhe Wang. \"Multi-target Domain Adaptation Building Instance Extraction of Remote Sensing Imagery with Domain-common Approximation Learning.\"\nIEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing\n62: 1-16 (2024). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1109/TGRS.2024.3376719\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\n刘袁缘\n, 王超凡, 王文斌, 张浩宇, 罗忠文*. 面向多种天气场景下目标检测的多域动态平均教师模型.\n计算机辅助设计与图形学学报\n, 2024, 36(3): 388-398.\r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.3724/SP.J.1089.2024.19820\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Yuxuan Huang*, Shuyang Liu, Yibing Zhan, Zijing Chen, Zhe Chen. \"Open-Set Video-based Facial Expression Recognition with Human Expression-sensitive Prompting.\" In\nProceedings of the 32nd ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM 2024)\n, Melbourne, Australia, October 2024. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n] \r\n                [\nSupplementary\n]\n2023\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Ning Zhou, Fayong Zhang, Wenbin Wang, Yu Wang, Kejun Liu, Ziyuan Liu. \"APSL: Action-positive Separation Learning for Unsupervised Temporal Action Localization.\"\nInformation Sciences\n, Volume 630, 2023, Pages 206-221. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.ins.2023.02.047\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Wenbin Wang, Chuanxu Feng, Haoyu Zhang, Zhe Chen, Yibing Zhan. \"Expression Snippet Transformer for Robust Video-based Facial Expression Recognition.\"\nPattern Recognition\n, Volume 138, 2023, Page 109368. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.patcog.2023.109368\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Wenbin Wang, Yibing Zhan, Shaoze Feng, Kejun Liu, Zhe Chen. \"Pose-disentangled Contrastive Learning for Self-supervised Facial Representation.\" In\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR 2023)\n, Vancouver, Canada, June 2023. \r\n                [\nPDF\n]\nHaoyu Zhang, Yu Wang, Guanghao Yin, Kejun Liu,\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Tianshu Yu*.\nEMNLP\n2023: 756-767.\r\n                [\nPDF\n]\n2022\nYu Wang, Shunping Zhou,\nYuanyuan Liu*\n, Kunpeng Wang, Fang Fang, Haoyue Qian. \"ConGNN: Context-consistent Cross-graph Neural Network for Group Emotion Recognition in the Wild.\"\nInformation Sciences\n610: 707-724 (2022). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.ins.2022.08.003\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n] \r\n                [\nSiteGroEmo Dataset\n]\nNote\n: The data are passcode protected. Please download and send the signed [\nEULA\n] to\nqianying@cug.edu.cn\nfor access request.\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Chuanxu Feng, Xiaohui Yuan*, Lin Zhou, Wenbin Wang, Jie Qin, Zhongwen Luo. \"Clip-aware Expressive Feature Learning for Video-based Facial Expression Recognition.\"\nInformation Sciences\n598: 182-195 (2022). \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.ins.2022.03.062\n] \r\n                [\nCode (GitHub)\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Wei Dai, Chuanxu Feng, Wenbin Wang, Guanghao Yin, Jiabei Zeng, Shiguang Shan*. \"MAFW: A Large-scale, Multi-modal, Compound Affective Database for Dynamic Facial Expression Recognition in the Wild.\" In\nProceedings of the 30th ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM 2022)\n(Oral Presentation), Lisbon, Portugal, October 2022. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nMAFW Database URL\n] \r\n                [\nSupplementary\n]\n2021\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Wei Dai, Fang Fang, Yongquan Chen*, Rui Huang, et al. \"Dynamic Multi-channel Metric Network for Joint Pose-aware and Identity-invariant Facial Expression Recognition.\"\nInformation Sciences\n, Volume 578, 2021. \r\n                [\nPDF\n] \r\n                [\nDOI: 10.1016/j.ins.2021.07.034\n]\nYuanyuan Liu\n, Wenbin Wang, Fang Fang, Lin Zhou, Chen...[truncated]"
