    "homepage_text": "Jiawei Ren\nJiawei Ren | Jiawei Ren’s Homepage\nJiawei Ren\njiawei011 AT e.ntu.edu.sg\nI am a Research Scientist at\nNVIDIA Spatial Intelligence Lab\nled by\nProf. Sanja Fidler\n. I received my bachelor's and PhD from Nanyang Technological University. My PhD advisor is\nProf. Ziwei Liu\n.\nMy current research interest is in scalable dynamic 3D synthesis.\nGithub\n/\nGoogle Scholar\nSelected Publications\nGeneralizable 4D Reconstruction\nLyra: Generative 3D Scene Reconstruction via Video Diffusion Model Self-Distillation\nSherwin Bahmani, Tianchang Shen,\nJiawei Ren\n, Jiahui Huang, Yifeng Jiang, Haithem Turki, Andrea Tagliasacchi, David B. Lindell, Zan Gojcic, Sanja Fidler, Huan Ling, Jun Gao, Xuanchi Ren\narXiv\n, 2025\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\nBTimer: Feed-Forward Bullet-Time Reconstruction of Dynamic Scenes from Monocular Videos\nHanxue Liang*,\nJiawei Ren*\n, Ashkan Mirzaei*, Antonio Torralba, Ziwei Liu, Igor Gilitschenski, Sanja Fidler, Sanja Fidler, Cengiz Oztireli, Huan Ling, Zan Gojcic, Jiahui Huang\nNeurIPS\n, 2025\nArxiv\n/\nProject Page\nL4GM: Large 4D Gaussian Reconstruction Model\nJiawei Ren\n, Kevin Xie, Ashkan Mirzaei, Hanxue Liang, Xiaohui Zeng, Karsten Kreis, Ziwei Liu, Antonio Torralba, Sanja Fidler, Seung Wook Kim, Huan Ling\nNeurIPS\n, 2024\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\nSimulated Motion Synthesis\nInsActor: Instruction-driven Physics-based Characters\nJiawei Ren*\n, \n        Mingyuan Zhang*,\n        Cunjun Yu*, \n        Xiao Ma, \n        Liang Pan, \n        Ziwei Liu\nNeurIPS\n, 2023\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\n/\nVideo\nDiffMimic: Efficient Motion Mimicking with Differentiable Physics\nJiawei Ren*\n, \n        Cunjun Yu*, \n        Siwei Chen, \n        Xiao Ma, \n        Liang Pan, \n        Ziwei Liu\nICLR\n, 2023\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\n/\nDemo\n/\nVideo\nScalable 3D Perception\nLaserMix for Semi-Supervised LiDAR Semantic Segmentation\nLingdong Kong*,\nJiawei Ren*\n, \n        Liang Pan, \n        Ziwei Liu\nCVPR\n, 2023\n(Highlight)\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\nBenchmarking and Analyzing Point Cloud Classification under Corruptions\nJiawei Ren\n, \n        Liang Pan, \n        Ziwei Liu\nICML\n, 2022\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\n/\nTalk\n/\nDemo\n/\nChallenge\nBalanced MSE for Imbalanced Visual Regression\nJiawei Ren\n, \n        Mingyuan Zhang,\n        Cunjun Yu, \n        Ziwei Liu\nCVPR\n, 2022\n(Oral)\nArxiv\n/\nCode\n/\nProject Page\n/\nTalk\n/\nDemo\n/\nTutorial"
