    "homepage_text": "Jianfeng Wang’s Homepage | Principal Researcher\nJianfeng Wang\nResearch Scientist\nOpenAI, Redmond, WA\njianfengwang@outlook.com\nI am a research sicentist at OpenAI, focusing on image generation, image understanding, and multimodal reasoning.\nBefore, I was a Principal Researcher at Microsoft Cloud and AI and focused on\nlarge-scale multimodal representation learning.\nReceived the B.Eng. degree and PhD degree\nfrom the University of Science and Technology of China (USTC).\nGithub\n,\nGoogle Scholar\n,\nLinkedIn"
