    "homepage_text": "Zengde DENG's Homepage\nZengde DENG\nMachine Learning Engineer @ ByteDance\ndengzengde@gmail.com\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nGitHub\nResearch Interests\nGenerative AI\nMachine Learning\nOptimization\nOperations Research\nAbout Me\nI am a machine learning engineer at\nByteDance\n, where I work on generative AI, machine learning, optimization, etc.\nI received my Ph.D. degree in the Department of Systems Engineering and Engineering Management from\nChinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)\n, supervised by\nProf. Anthony Man-Cho So\nand\nProf. Shiqian Ma\n. \n                        Before joining CUHK, I obtained my bachelor degree in Statistics from\nNankai University\n.\nEducation\nPh.D. in Operations Research\nDepartment of Systems Engineering and Engineering Management (SEEM)\nThe Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)\nAdvisor:\nProf. Anthony Man-Cho So\n&\nProf. Shiqian Ma\n.\nB.S. in Statistics\nDepartment of Mathematics\nNankai University\nPublications\nPreprints & Tech Reports\nDreaMontage: Arbitrary Frame-Guided One-Shot Video Generation\nJiawei Liu, Junqiao Li, Jiangfan Deng, Gen Li, Siyu Zhou, Zetao Fang, Shanshan Lao,\nZengde Deng\n, Jianing Zhu, Tingting Ma, Jiayi Li, Yunqiu Wang, Qian He, Xinglong Wu\nTech Report\narXiv:2512.21252\nBoosting Gradient Ascent for Continuous DR-submodular Maximization\nQixin Zhang\n*\n, Zongqi Wan\n*\n,\nZengde Deng\n, Zaiyi Chen, Xiaoming Sun, Jialin Zhang, Yu Yang.\nPreprint\narXiv:2401.08330\nJournals\nAn Online Dual Consensus Algorithm for Distributed Resource Allocation over Networks\nYuwei Chen,\nZengde Deng\n, Biao Yuan, Zaiyi Chen, Yujie Chen, Haoyuan Hu.\nIISE\nIISE Transactions, 57(10), 1155–1166, 2024.\nPractice Summary: Cainiao Optimizes the Fulfillment Routes of Parcels\nBiao Yuan,\nZengde Deng\n, Na Geng, Yujie Chen, Haoyuan Hu.\nIJAA\nINFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics 53 (6), 446-450, 2023\nNeighbor Enhanced Graph Convolutional Networks for Node Classification and\n                      