    "homepage_text": "Dawei Zhang\nDawei Zhang\norcid.org/0000-0002-7593-1593\nPh.D, Assistant Professor\nMachine Learning and Vision Laboratory (MLV Lab)\nDepartment of Computer Science, Zhejiang Normal University\ndavidzhang@zjnu.edu.cn\ndavidzhang@ieee.org\nAbout Me (\nGitHub\n) (\nDBLP\n) (\nResearchGate\n) (\nGoogleScholar\n)\nI'm currently an Assistant Professor with the School of Computer Science and Technology (School of Artifical Intelligence),\nZhejiang Normal University\n. \n\t\tBefore that,  I received my Ph.D degree in 2022, supervised by Prof.\nZhonglong Zheng\nand\nXiaoqin Zhang\n.\n                During the spring of 2021, I worked with Prof.\nYanwei Fu\nas an intern at\nInstitute of Science and Technology for Brain-inspired Intelligence (ISTBI)\n,\nFudan University\n.\nMy research interests include computer vision, deep learning, and multimedia computing.\nTo prospective students:\nI am looking for self-motivated and well-trained students. Please read\nHERE\n.\nIf you are highly creative, have good grades/coding skill and interested in computer vision research, please do not hesitate to send me your CV and transcripts of grades.\nEducation\nZhejiang Normal University\nSeptember 2017 - June 2022. Ph.D. of Computer Science.\nResearch on Visual Object Tracking Algorithms Based on Deep Learning.\nHuaiyin Institute of Technology\nSeptember 2013 - June 2017. Bachelor of Engineering.\nRank 5/34. With \"Outstanding Graduate Award\" (58 out of about 420 graduates).\nNews\n[05/03/2024] One paper is accepted by\nJCADCG\n(CCF-A类中文期刊).\n[12/02/2024] One paper is accepted by\nIEEE TCSVT\n(SCI-I区Top).\n[18/01/2024] Serve as Youth Editorial Board for\nELSP\n.\n[09/01/2024] One paper is accepted by\nApplied Soft Computing\n(SCI-I区Top).\n[05/01/2024] Serve as a Program Committee Member for\nIJCAI 2024\n.\n[13/12/2023] One paper is accepted by\nImage and Vision Computing\n.\n[15/11/2023] Serve as Editorial Board for\nWJIT\n.\n[25/09/2023] Serve as Youth Editorial Board for\nAIAS\n.\n[24/07/2023] Serve as a Technical Committee Member for\nICRCV 2023\n.\n[12/07/2023] Two papers are accepted by\nACAIT 2023\n.\n[26/06/2023] Congradulations! Yiting gets Zhejiang \"Xinmiao\" project.\n[21/04/2023] Serve as a Program Committee Member for\nACAIT 2023\n.\n[13/12/2022] I get the Youth Project Funding from Zhejiang Provincial NSFC.\n[20/05/2022] Congradulations! I successfully defensed my Ph.D. thesis.\n[15/05/2022] One paper is accepted by\nICML 2022\n(CCF-A类会议).\n[06/01/2022] One paper is accepted by\nJMLC\n(SCI-III区).\n[30/12/2021] We submit one paper to\nIJCAI 2022\n(CCF-A类会议).\n[05/07/2021] Start my visiting internship at ISTBI of Fudan University.\n[02/12/2020] One paper is accepted by\nAAAI 2021\n(CCF-A类会议).\n[22/11/2020] One paper is accepted by\nNeurocomputing\n(SCI-II区Top).\n[18/10/2020] Our VSR work of win the Outstanding Paper Award of CCF 35th NCCA.\n[26/07/2020] One paper is accepted by\nACM MM 2020\n(CCF-A类会议) as Oral.\n[09/03/2020] One paper is accepted by\nACM ICMR 2020\n(CCF-B类会议).\nPublications (\nWOS\n)  (\nAIConf\n) (\nAcceptRate\n)\n2024\nTowards Universal and Sparse Adversarial Examples for Visual Object Tracking\nJingjing Sheng,\nDawei Zhang*\n, Jianxin Chen, Xin Xiao, Zhonglong Zheng\nApplied Soft Computing (ASOC), 2024\n[Paper]\n2023\nImproved SiamCAR with Ranking-based Pruning and Optimization for Efficient UAV Tracking\nXiaoqiang Jin,\nDawei Zhang*\n, Qiner Wu, Xin Xiao, Pengsen Zhao, Zhonglong Zheng\nImage and Vision Computing (IVC), 2023\n[Paper]\nLearning Local-Global Feature Representation for Pedestrian Detection and Re-identification\nTingyi Cai,\nDawei Zhang*\n, Yiting Wang, Zhonglong Zheng\nAsian Conference on Artificial Intelligence Technology (ACAIT), 2023\n[Paper]\n2022\nUAST: Uncertainty-Aware Siamese Tracking\nDawei Zhang\n, Yanwei Fu, Zhonglong Zheng\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2022\n[Paper]\nCross Channel Aggregation Similarity Network for Salient Object Detection\nLiyuan Chen, Huawen Liu, Jiashuaizi Mo,\nDawei Zhang\n, Jie Yang, Feilong Lin, Zhonglong Zheng, Riheng Jia\nInternational Journal of Machine Learning and Cybernetics, 2022\n[Paper]\n2021\nVisual Tracking via Hierarchical Deep Reinforcement Learning\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng, Riheng Jia, Minglu Li\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2021\n[Paper]\nCSART: Channel and Spatial Attention-Guided Residual Learning for Real-Time Object Tracking\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng, Minglu Li, Rixian Liu\nNeurocomputing, 2021\n[Paper]\n2020\nReinforced Similarity Learning: Siamese Relation Networks for Robust Object Tracking\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng, Minglu Li, Xiaowei He, Tianxiang Wang, Liyuan Chen, Riheng Jia, Feilong Lin\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (MM), 2020\n(Oral)\n[Paper]\nHigh Performance Visual Tracking with Siamese Actor-Critic Network\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng\nIEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP), 2020\n[Paper]\nJoint Representation Learning with Deep Quadruplet Network for Real-Time Visual Tracking\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng\nIEEE International Joint Conference on Neural Networks (IJCNN), 2020\n(Oral)\n[Paper]\nLearning Fine-Grained Similarity Matching Networks for Visual Tracking\nDawei Zhang\n, Zhonglong Zheng*, Xiaowei He, Liu Su, Liyuan Chen\nACM International Conference on Multimedia Retrieval (ICMR), 2020\n[Paper]\nChinese Patents (\nSooPat\n) (\nPatentStar\n) (\nUSPat\n)\n一种基于层次化决策网络的鲁棒目标跟踪方法及系统，申请号：2021102997607，申请日：2021.03.22，已授权\n一种使用轻量化多通道聚合网络重建超分辨率图像的方法，申请号：2021105382144，申请日：2021.05.18\n基于动态标签分配的孪生网络目标跟踪方法及移动设备，申请号：202110754387X，申请日：2021.07.05，已授权\n一种使用图注意力网络融合目标跟踪特征的方法，申请号：2022105697929，申请日：2022.05.24\n一种基于深度学习的吸烟监测方法及装置，申请号：2022109159893，申请日：2022.08.01\n一种无人机目标跟踪方法、系统、介质、设备及终端，申请号：2022113847044，申请日：2022.11.07\n基于机器学习的道路裂纹检测系统V1.0，登记号：2023SR1278459，开发完成时间：2023.08.17\n一种基于深度学习的行人检测与重识别方法、系统及终端，申请号：2023110938366，申请日：2023.08.28\nScientific Research Projects\n面向高效无人机目标跟踪的孪生网络轻量化研究，ZJNSF探索青年项目，No.Q23F020010，主持\n智慧校园中智能视频监控系统关键算法研究，金华市公益性技术应用研究项目，No.2023-4-016，主持\n面向时序网络模型的信息异步传播溯源理论与方法，ZJNSF探索一般项目，No.Y23F030003，参与\n面向复杂场景的视觉目标跟踪算法研究，Key project of Zhejiang Provincial NSF，No.Z22F020010，参与\n智能视频分析中基于深度学习的可信目标跟踪研究，NSFC面上项目，No.62272419，参与\n稀疏与低秩表征的关键理论及其在大数据中的应用研究，NSFC，No.61672467，参与\n大规模无线传感器网络面向缺损多模态采样场景的压缩数据收集基础理论与应用研究，NSFC，No.62171413，参与\n异构耦合下信息物理融合系统的风险评估与控制策略研究，NSFC，No.62072412，参与\n基于大数据分析的视频监控智能算法研究，Provincial Department of Education，No.Y201840725，参与\n智能结算系统关键技术研发，Enterprise Commissioned Project of Cloudpeng Technology，参与\nProfessional Activities\nInstitute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE), Member.\nIEEE Signal Processing Society (SPS), Member.\nAssociation of Computing Machinery (ACM), Member.\nChina Computer Federation (CCF), Member.\nChinese Association for Artificial Intelligence (CAAI), Member.\nChina Society of Image and Graphics (CSIG), Member.\nCSIG Technical Committee on Machine Vision (CSIG-MV), Member.\nHong Kong Society of Robotics and Automation (HKSRA), Member.\nZhejiang Association of Automation (ZJAA), Member.\nResearch Assistant of Zhejiang Cloudpeng Technology.\nIntern supervisor of Big Data AI Joint Research Institute.\nPC Member\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2023-2024.\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2024.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2024.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2022.\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2024.\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition (ICPR), 2022.\nInternational Joint Conference on Neural Networks (IJCNN), 2022.\nInternational Conference on Neural Information Processing (ICONIP), 2023.\nIEEE Conference on Artificial Intelligence (CAI), 2024.\nAsian Conference on Artificial Intelligence Technology (ACAIT), 2023.\nInternational Conference on Robotics and Computer Vision (ICRCV), 2023.\nInternational Joint Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 2023.\nJournal Reviewer\nComputer Vision and Image Understanding (CVIU)\nJournal of Artificial Intelligence Research (JAIR)\nExpert Systems With Applications (ESWA)\nKnowledge-Based Systems (KBS)\nPattern Recognition (PR)\nNeural Networks (NN)\nNeurocomputing (NEUCOM)\nApplied Soft Computing (ASOC)\nNeural Computing and Applications (NCAA)\nSignal Processing: Image Communication (SPIC)\nEngineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence (EAAI)\nInternational Journal of Machine Learning and Cybernetics\nCAAI Transactions on Intelligence Technology (TRIT)\nKnowledge and Information Systems (KAIS)\nThe Visual Computer (TVCJ)\nMultimedia Systems (MMSJ)\nCluster Computing (CLUS)\nPattern Recognition Letters (PRL)\nIET Computer Vision, IET Electronics Letters\nRemote Sensing, Mathematics, Robotics, Sustainability\nInternational Journal of Computational Intelligence Systems\nIntelligent Automation & Soft Computing (IASC)\nHuman-Centric Intelligent Systems (HCIN)\n计算机科学与探索 (CCF-B类中文期刊, 计算机领域高质量科技期刊T2类)\n计算机工程与应用 (CCF-C类中文期刊, 计算机领域高质量科技期刊T2类)\n计算机工程 (CCF-C类中文期刊, 计算机领域高质量科技期刊T2类)\n计算机应用研究 (CCF-C类中文期刊, 计算机领域高质量科技期刊T3类)\nHonors and Awards\nThe 2nd \"Chengtai Gonghao\" Qihang Teaching Scholarship of Zhejiang Normal University, 2023\nTalent Ambassador of Wucheng District, Jinhua City, Zhejiang Province, 2022\nOutstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award of Zhejiang Normal University, 2022\nOutstanding Graduate Students of Zhejiang Province in Zhejiang Normal University, 2022\n\"Top-10 Students\" of GREENTOWN Group in Zhejiang Normal University, 2022\nNational Scholarship for Postgraduate Students in Zhejiang Normal University, 2021\nFirst class Academic Scholarship of Zhejiang Normal University, 2018-2021\n\"Top-10 Academic Stars\" of Postgraduate Students in Zhejiang Normal University, 2021\nAcademic Innovation Scholarship of Zhejiang Normal University, 2020\nOutstanding Paper Award of National Conference of Computer Application of CCF, 2020\n\"Top-10 Learning Pacesetters\" of College of 