    "homepage_text": "Jiyuan Tan's site  – Me in a Nutshell\nJiyuan Tan's site\nJiyuan Tan\nI am currently a PhD student in Management Science and Engineering at Stanford University.\nG. Scholar\nGithub\ne-Mail\nMe in a Nutshell\nI am a second-year PhD student in Management Science and Engineering, Stanford University, co-advised by Prof.\nVasilis Syrgkanis\nand\nJose Blanchet\n.\nMy research interest lies in causal inference, stochastic optimization and machine learning.\nDuring my undergraduate, I was fortunate to work with Prof.\nYinyu Ye\nto develop a derivative-free solver for general nonlinear optimization problems. Our code is available\nhere\n. Prior to this, I study the Zero-sum Markov game with Prof.\nZhaoran Wang\nand\nZhuoran Yang\n."
  },
