    "homepage_text": "Zhu Research Group - Team\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZhu Research Group\nOur Team\nOur research laboratory stands out for its strong collaboration, mutual respect, and clear communication. We foster innovation by finding individual strengths, aligning personal and scientific goals, and promoting open idea exchange. With a supportive and dynamic environment, we aim to drive groundbreaking research and meaningful discoveries.\nLearn more about our\nPI\n,\ncurrent\n, and\npast\nindividual members!\nSOT 2025\nOrlando, Florida\nSee list of awards received by our lab\nin\nNews\n!\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
