Melbourne, Australia, 2019. [\npaper\n]\nRuirui Li\n, Jyun-Yu Jiang, Chelsea J.-T, Cheryl Flynn, Wen-ling Hsu, Jia Wang, Wei Wang, and Tan Xu, Enhancing Response Generation Using Chat Flow Identification. (\nKDD'18 Workshop\n), London, Aug. 2018.\nZijun Xue, Mingda Li, and\nRuirui Li\n, Recent Progress in Conversational AI. (\nKDD'18 Workshop\n), London, Aug. 2018.\nChelsea J.-T. Ju,\nRuirui Li\n, Zhengliang Wu, Jyun-Yu Jiang, Zhao Yang, and Wei Wang, Fleximer: Accurate Quatification of RNA-Seq via Variable-Length k-mers. (\nACM BCB'17\n), Boston, 2017\nRuirui Li\n, Xinxin Huang, Shuo Song, Jia Wang, and Wei Wang, Towards customer trouble tickets resolution automation in large cellular services. (\nMobicom'16\n), New York, 2016.\nLiuli Chen, Jennifer Zhang, Chelsea J.-T. Ju,\nRuirui Li\n, Wenchao Yu, and Wei Wang, Skimdiff: Transcript-level differential analysis of RNA-Seq data. (\nHitSeq'15\n), Dublin, Ireland. 2015.\nRuirui Li\n, and Wei Wang, REAFUM: Representative Approximate Frequent Subgraph Mining. (\nSDM'15\n), Vancouver, Apr. 2015. [\npaper\n]\nRuirui Li\n, Ben Kao, Bin Bi, Reynold Cheung, and Eric Lo, DQR: A probabilistic approach to diversified query recommendation. (\nCIKM'12\n), Hawaii, Oct. 2012. [\npaper\n]\nSelected Awards\nWSDM Travel Grant\n, SIGIR, 2019, 2020\nYahoo! FREP Award\n, advisor: Wei Wang, 2019\nYelp Dataset Challenge Winner\n, Round 9, 2017\nDepartment Fellowship\n, UCLA, 2013\nFull Postgraduate Fellowship\n, University of Hong Kong, 2010\nResearch Conference Grant\n, University of Hong Kong, 2012\nOutstanding Undergraduates\n, Nanjing University, 2010"
