    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Dr. Lirong He's Homepage\nLirong He (贺丽荣)\nSchool of Computer Science and Engineering\nUniversity of Electronic Science and Technology of China\nChengdu Suchuan, China\nOffice\n: Room B1-201, Main Building, UESTC (Qingshuihe)\nEmail: lirong_huo@163.com\nShort Biography\nI am currently a Ph.D. candidate at School of Computer Science and Engineering,\nUniversity of Electronic Science and Technology of China\n(UESTC), under the supervisor of Prof.\nZenglin Xu\n.\nPrior to that, I received my dual Bachelor's Degree both in Computer Science and Technology and Mathematics from\nShanxi Normal University\nfrom 2011 and 2015.\nMy current research interest lies in Bayesian deep learning, that is, combining Bayesian learning with deep learning for the sake of their respect and complementary strengths in the nonlinear representation learning and effective learning of model uncertainty and robustness. More specifically, the goal of my research is to provide a probabilistic interpretation of deep learning models by inferring the distribution of model weights and to improve the robustness of deep learning models in terms of adversarial attacks.\nCheck out my up-to-date CV for more details.\nRecent News\n[Jan 2020] One paper is accepted by ICLR-2020.\nSee More\n[Jul 2019] I am invited to be a Program Committee (PC) member for ICONIP 2019.\nOrganizations"
  },
