    "homepage_text": "Wenjing Yang\nDepartment of Microbiology and Immunology\nThe University of Texas Medical Branch\nClose Search Screen\nSearch\nUTMB\nGoogle\nUTMB Health\nMenu\nWenjing Yang\nEmail:\nwenyang@utmb.edu\nDegree(s):\nPhD, Gastroenterology\nMD, Medicine\nResearch Focus:\nIntestinal immunology\nMentor:\nYingzi Cong\nResearch Statement:\nI am interested in the fields that how gut microbiota metabolites regulate intestinal homeostasis. Specifically, my work focus on how gut microbiota-derived metabolites affect on immune cells, thereby controlling the pathogenesis of inflammatory bowel diseases.\nClose Off-Canvas Mobile Menu\nSearch\nSubmit Search Query\nUTMB\nGoogle\nNavigate\nExplore UTMB\nHealth Care\nEducation\nResearch\nUTMB Support Areas\nGiving\nContacts\nAlerts"
