    "github": "https://github.com/wowchemy",
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/xin-li-a085254a",
    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Xin's Homepage\nSearch\nXin Li\nSenior Machine Learning Engineer\nQualcomm AI Research, USA\nBiography\nI am a Senior Machine Learning Engineer at Qualcomm AI Research, USA. Before joining Qualcomm, I worked at\nWins Lab, Lehigh University\nunder the advisement of\nProfessor Mooi Choo Chuah\n.\nInterests\nDeep Learning\nComputer Vision\nAutonomous Driving\nSoftware Engineering\nEducation\nPh.D. in Computer Science, [2015 - 2020]\nLehigh University\nMEng in Software Engineering, [2012 - 2015]\nPeking University\nBEng in Software Engineering, [2008 - 2012]\nQingdao Technological University\nAwards\n🥈\nSilver Medal\nin the Peking University/Baidu - Autonomous Driving competition. 01/2020.\n🎖\nQualstar Award\nfor the excellent work in driver monitoring system development (demoed on\nCES2020\nand\nCVPR2020\n), Qualcomm. 01/2020.\n🥇\nNo.1\nin the Unrestricted Adversarial Example Challenge (hosted by Google). 01/2019-12/2019.\n🥇\nNo.1\nin the ApolloScape Trajectory Prediction competition. 10/2019.\n🏆\nStudent Travel Grant\nfrom US National Science Foundation (NSF) to the IEEE INFOCOM 2017. 02/2017.\n🏆\nGotshall Fellowship\n, Lehigh University. 09/2015 - 05/2016.\n🥇\nFirst Prize\nin the Shandong (China) Division of the “Challenge Cup” National College Student Curricular Academic Science and Technology Works Competition. 07/2011.\n🥉\nThird Prize\nin the National Finals (China) of the National Collegiate Programming Contest (C Programming Language Track). 07/2011.\n🥇\nFirst Prize\nin the Shandong (China) Division of the National Collegiate Programming Contest (C Programming Language Track). 05/2011.\n🥉\nBronze Medal\nin the Shandong (China) Division of the ACM International Collegiate Programming Contest. 05/2011.\nPatents & Publications\nXiaowen Ying\n,\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2021).\nSRNet: Spatial Relation Network for Efficient Single Stage Instance Segmentation in Videos\n.\n  2021 ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACMMM).\nPDF\nCite\nPoster\nAppendix\nXin Li\n,\nDawei Li\n(2021).\nGPFS: A Graph-based Human Pose Forecasting System for Smart Home with Online Learning\n.\n  2021 ACM Transactions on Sensor Networks (TOSN).\nPDF\nCite\nXiaowen Ying\n,\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2021).\nWeakly-supervised Object Representation Learning for Few-shot Semantic Segmentation\n.\n  2021 IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV).\nPDF\nCite\nSlides\nVideo\nXin Li\n,\nXiaowen Ying\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2020).\nGRIP++: Enhanced Graph-based Interaction-aware Trajectory Prediction for Autonomous Driving\n.\n  arXiv preprint.\nPDF\nCite\nBolan Jiang\n,\nXin Li\n,\nShuxue Quan\n,\nYunke Pan\n(2020).\nCombining convolution and deconvolution for object detection\n.\n  U.S. Patent.\nCite\nXin Li\n,\nXiaowen Ying\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2019).\nGRIP: Graph-based Interaction-aware Trajectory Prediction\n.\n  2019 IEEE Intelligent Transportation Systems Conference (ITSC).\nPDF\nCite\nXin Li\n,\nShuai Zhang\n,\nBolan Jiang\n,\nYingyong Qi\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n,\nNing Bi\n(2019).\nDAC: Data-free Automatic Acceleration of Convolutional Networks\n.\n  2019 IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV).\nPDF\nCite\nPoster\nAppendix\nXiaowen Ying\n,\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2018).\nLiveFace: A Multi-Task CNN for Fast Face-Authentication\n.\n  2018 IEEE International Conference on Machine Learning and Applications (ICMLA).\nPDF\nCite\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2018).\nReHAR: Robust and Efficient Human Activity Recognition\n.\n  2018 IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV).\nPDF\nCite\nPoster\nSlides\nAppendix\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2017).\nSBGAR: Semantics based group activity recognition\n.\n  Proceedings of the IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (ICCV).\nPDF\nCite\nPoster\nSlides\nXin Li\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n,\nSubhrajit Bhattacharya\n(2017).\nUAV assisted smart parking solution\n.\n  International Conference on Unmanned Aircraft Systems (ICUAS).\nPDF\nCite\nXin Li\n,\nQinghan Xue\n,\nMooi Choo Chuah\n(2017).\nCASHEIRS: Cloud assisted scalable hierarchical encrypted based image retrieval system\n.\n  INFOCOM 2017-IEEE Conference on Computer Communications (INFOCOM).\nPDF\nCite\nSlides\nInternship\nResearch Intern\nSamsung Research America Inc. (SRA)\nMay 2019 –\n                \n                  Aug 2019\nMountain View, CA, USA\nMentor:\nDr. Hongxia Jin\nDr. Dawei Li\nResearch Topic:\nHuman Action Prediction\n[Paper Published]\nResponsibilities include:\nDesign new deep learning models to predict human actions from videos in the near future.\nInterim Engineering Intern\nQualcomm Technologies, Inc.\nMay 2018 –\n                \n                  Aug 2018\nSan Diego, CA, USA\nMentor:\nDr. Bolan Jiang\nDr. Shuai Zhang\nResearch Topic:\nConvolutional Network Decomposition\n[Paper Published]\nResponsibilities include:\nDesign new CNN models to detect and classify object in Snapdragon phone.\nWork for CNN in low complexity and high efficiency.\nInterim Engineering Intern\nQualcomm Technologies, Inc.\nMay 2017 –\n                \n                  Aug 2017\nSan Diego, CA, USA\nMentor:\nDr. Bolan Jiang\nResearch Topic:\nFast Object Detection on Mobile Platform\n[Patent Granted]\nResponsibilities include:\nImage Object detection\nDesign and develop deep learning algorithms for image detection\nWork on computer vision and deep learning research\nTeaching\nArtificial Intelligence Theory and Practice (CSE327)\n, Lehigh University\nInstructor:\nProf. Jeff Heflin\nTeaching Assistant\nSpring 2018\nData Analytics Smart Cities (CSE498)\n, Lehigh University\nInstructor:\nProfessor Mooi Choo Chuah\nGave a\nTutorial\nabout Deep Learning.\nFall 2017\nComputer Organization and Architecture (CSE202)\n, Lehigh University\nInstructor:\nProf. Jason Loew\nTeaching Assistant\nSpring 2017\nProjects\n*\nAll\nResearch Project\nSelf Driving\nAndroid\nOthers\nPython\nC++\nSQL\nNov 5, 2018\nData-free CNN acceleration [Research]\nThis is demo of our DAC paper.\nSep 2, 2018\nVehicle Detection[Self Driving]\nDetect vehicles on road from images.\nAug 20, 2018\nDetect Lane [Self Driving]\nDetect lane pixels and find the lane boundary from images.\nAug 3, 2018\nDrive in An Emulator [Self Driving]\nTrain a model to predict steering angles.\nJul 16, 2018\nTraffic Sign Recognition [Self Driving]\nTrain a CNN model to recognize traffic signs.\nJun 12, 2018\nFind Lane Lines [Self Driving]\nDesign a pipeline that finds lane lines on the road from videos.\nMay 1, 2017\nCASHEIRS Demo [Research]\nThis is prototype of our CASHEIRS image retrieval system.\nNov 5, 2015\nFive-in-a-Row Game [Others]\nThis is a demo of my very simple AI for Five-in-a-Row Game.\nJun 1, 2015\nVehicles and Pedestrians Detection [Research]\nA prototype system.\nSep 1, 2013\nFamily Video Surveillance System [Others]\nA prototype system for our surveillance system.\nAug 1, 2013\nAugmented Reality Cinema [Others]\nA demo of our Augmented Reality Cinema Project.\nContact\nNote: This is a personal webpage and any views or information reflect solely the author and are not the views of the Qualcomm.\nxincoder AT gmail dot com\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
