    "homepage_text": "PeerJ  - Profile - Yilun Shang\nWANT A PROFILE LIKE THIS?\nCreate my FREE Plan\nOr learn about other options\nJavascript is disabled in your browser. Please\nenable Javascript\nto view\n                    PeerJ.\nGold\nContributor\n20,020 Points\nContributions by role\nReviewer\n30\nEditor\n19,990\nContributions by subject area\nEpidemiology\nGlobal Health\nHealth Policy\nInfectious Diseases\nPublic Health\nMathematical Biology\nComputational Science\nEnvironmental Impacts\nBioinformatics\nAlgorithms and Analysis of Algorithms\nData Mining and Machine Learning\nArtificial Intelligence\nData Science\nDatabases\nAgents and Multi-Agent Systems\nNetwork Science and Online Social Networks\nScientific Computing and Simulation\nMobile and Ubiquitous Computing\nSecurity and Privacy\nTheory and Formal Methods\nDigital Libraries\nSocial Computing\nWorld Wide Web and Web Science\nComputer Networks and Communications\nCryptography\nDistributed and Parallel Computing\nDrugs and Devices\nKinesiology\nOrthopedics\nPsychiatry and Psychology\nStatistics\nMultimedia\nOptimization Theory and Computation\nComputational Linguistics\nNatural Language and Speech\nAdaptive and Self-Organizing Systems\nEvolutionary Studies\nMarine Biology\nZoology\nPopulation Biology\nAnimal Behavior\nBiodiversity\nComputational Biology\nEcology\nGraphics\nComputer Vision\nSoftware Engineering\nEmerging Technologies\nAutonomous Systems\nHuman-Computer Interaction\nVisual Analytics\nComputer Education\nComputer Architecture\nProgramming Languages\nNatural Resource Management\nOperating Systems\nSpatial and Geographic Information Systems\nRobotics\nNeural Networks\nInternet of Things\nEcohydrology\nVeterinary Medicine\nFood, Water and Energy Nexus\nEmbedded Computing\nBrain-Computer Interface\nPlant Science\nSentiment Analysis\nComputer Aided Design\nText Mining\nClimate Change Biology\nMolecular Biology\nScience and Medical Education\nMental Health\nCOVID-19\nRehabilitation\nAgricultural Science\nEntomology\nCryptocurrency\nGold\nContributor\nYilun Shang\nPeerJ Editor, Author & Reviewer\nSummary\nI am an Associate Professor in Computer and Information Sciences at Northumbria. I received my PhD degree in Mathematics from Shanghai Jiao Tong University. My research interest is in complex networks and systems.\nAdaptive & Self-Organizing Systems\nAgents & Multi-Agent Systems\nAlgorithms & Analysis of Algorithms\nArtificial Intelligence\nAutonomous Systems\nComputational Science\nData Mining & Machine Learning\nData Science\nMathematical Biology\nNetwork Science & Online Social Networks\nOptimization Theory & Computation\nPopulation Biology\nRobotics\nScientific Computing & Simulation\nSocial Computing\nStatistics\nTheoretical & Computational Chemistry\nThermodynamics & Statistical Mechanics\nSection Editor\nSystems, Networks and Communication\nEditorial Board Member\nPeerJ - the multidisciplinary STM open access journal\nPeerJ Computer Science\nPast or current institution affiliations\nNorthumbria University\nWork details\nAssociate Professor\nUniversity of Northumbria at Newcastle\nOctober 2018\nComputer and Information Sciences\nWebsites\nGoogle Scholar\nPeerJ Contributions\nArticles\n1\nEdited\n128\nNovember 6, 2025\nA decision support framework for optimizing career path prediction and vocational mobility of college graduates\nMunazza Amin\n,\nMuhammad Safdar Nazeer\n,\nKifayat Ullah\n,\nYilun Shang\n,\nDragan Pamucar\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.3345\nAcademic Editor on\nMarch 20, 2026\nA secure and energy-efficient cluster-based data collection scheme using mobile sink in wireless sensor networks\nSarah M. Alhammad\n,\nHassan Al-Mahdi\n,\nM. Elshrkawey\n,\nShymaa Saad\n,\nSafa Abdelaziz\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.3731\nSeptember 5, 2025\nQuality of experience-aware application deployment in fog computing environments using machine learning\nP. Jenifer\n,\nJ. Angela Jennifa Sujana\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.3143\nJuly 29, 2025