.7717/peerj-cs.1227\nFebruary 6, 2023\nMachine learning and deep learning approaches in IoT\nAbqa Javed\n,\nMuhammad Awais\n,\nMuhammad Shoaib\n,\nKhaldoon S. Khurshid\n,\nMahmoud Othman\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1204\nJanuary 10, 2023\nSolving optimization problems simultaneously: the variants of the traveling salesman problem with time windows using multifactorial evolutionary algorithm\nHa-Bang Ban\n,\nDang-Hai Pham\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1192\nDecember 13, 2022\nDigital society social interactions and trust analysis model\nAseem Kumar\n,\nArun Malik\n,\nIsha Batra\n,\nNaveed Ahmad\n,\nSumaira Johar\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1129\nNovember 30, 2022\nSegmentation of biventricle in cardiac cine MRI via nested capsule dense network\nJilong Zhang\n,\nYajuan Zhang\n,\nHongyang Zhang\n,\nQuan Zhang\n,\nWeihua Su\n,\nShijie Guo\n,\nYuanquan Wang\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1146\nNovember 28, 2022\nSABMIS: sparse approximation based blind multi-image steganography scheme\nRohit Agrawal\n,\nKapil Ahuja\n,\nMarc C. Steinbach\n,\nThomas Wick\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1080\nNovember 25, 2022\nAn efficient approach to identifying anti-government sentiment on Twitter during Michigan protests\nHieu Nguyen\n,\nSwapna Gokhale\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1127\nNovember 11, 2022\nWeather and nest cavity characteristics influence fecundity in mountain chickadees\nAndrea R. Norris\n,\nKathy Martin\n,\nKristina L. Cockle\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj.14327\nPubMed 36389406\nOctober 14, 2022\nEfficient anomaly recognition using surveillance videos\nGulshan Saleem\n,\nUsama Ijaz Bajwa\n,\nRana Hammad Raza\n,\nFayez Hussain Alqahtani\n,\nAmr Tolba\n,\nFeng Xia\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1117\nOctober 12, 2022\nPhysical human locomotion prediction using manifold regularization\nMadiha Javeed\n,\nMohammad Shorfuzzaman\n,\nNawal Alsufyani\n,\nSamia Allaoua Chelloug\n,\nAhmad Jalal\n,\nJeongmin Park\nhttps://doi.org/10.7717/peerj-cs.1105