    "homepage_text": "Academic\nSearch\nHuiqi Deng\nPostdoctoral fellow\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nBiography\nI am a postdoctoral fellow at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, under the supervision of\nProf. Quanshi Zhang\n. I received my PH.D. degree from Sun Yat-Sen University.\nMy research interest mainly focuses on explainable AI, which involves two perspectives: (1) Semantic explanation, to make human understand why a DNN makes a certain prediction; (2) Mathematical explanation, to investigate and explain the representation capacity of DNN. Our ultimate goal is to bulid an explainable, safe, and controllable AI.\nDownload my\nresumé\n.\nInterests\nExplainable AI\nAdversarial Robustness\nCausal Learning\nEducation\nPhD in Applied Mathematics, 2015-2021\nSun Yat-Sen University\nBSc in Applied Mathematics, 2021-2015\nCentral China Normal University\nResearch Experience\nShanghai Jiao Tong University, Postdoctoral Fellow.\nAdvisor:\nProf. Quanshi Zhang\n.\nSep 2021 - present\nTexas A & M University, Visiting student.\nAdvisor:\nProf. Xia Hu\n.\nJan 2020 - Jan 2021\nHongKong Bapatist University, Research Assistant\nAdvisor:\nProf. PongChi Yuen\n.\nOct 2016 - Jun 2017, and Jan 2018 - Jan 2019\nSelected Publications\nQuickly discover relevant content by\nfiltering publications\n.\nHuiqi Deng\n,\nQihan Ren\n,\nXu Chen\n,\nHao Zhang\n,\nJie Ren\n,\nQuanshi Zhang\n(2021).\nDiscovering and Explaining the Representation Bottleneck of DNNs\n.\narxiv 2021.\nPDF\nSource Document\nHuiqi Deng\n,\nNa Zou\n,\nMengnan Du\n,\nWeifu Chen\n,\nGuocan Feng\n,\nXia Hu\n(2021).\nA General Taylor Framework for Unifying and Revisiting Attribution Methods\n.\narxiv 2021.\nPDF\nHuiqi Deng\n,\nNa Zou\n,\nWeifu Chen\n,\nGuocan Feng\n,\nMengnan Du\n,\nXia Hu\n(2021).\nMutual Information Preserving Back-propagation Learn to Invert for Faithful Attribution\n.\nKDD 2021.\nPDF\nHuiqi Deng\n,\nNa Zou\n,\nMengnan Du\n,\nWeifu Chen\n,\nGuocan Feng\n,\nXia Hu\n(2021).\nA Unified Taylor Framework for Revisiting Attribution Methods\n.\nAAAI 2021.\nPDF\nHuiqi Deng\n,\nWeifu Chen\n,\nQi Shen\n,\nAndy Jinhua Ma\n,\nPongChi Yuen\n,\nGuocan Feng\n(2020).\nInvariant subspace learning for time series data based on dynamic time warping distance\n.\nPR 2020.\nPDF\nAcademic Talks\n[2021]\nIJCAI 2021 Tutorial on Interpretability\n[2021] The Eighth Issue of “Artificial Intelligence Security and Privacy” Series Forum.\n[2021] The nineteenth Annual Meeting of the Chinese Society of Industrial and Applied Mathematics.\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
