    "homepage_text": "Xi Lin\nXi Lin (林熙)\nXi Lin is a full professor in the\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics\nat Xi'an Jiaotong University. He was a postdoctoral research fellow in the\nDepartment of Computer Science\nat City University of Hong Kong, working with\nProf. Qingfu Zhang\n. He received the B.Sc. degree from\nSouth China University of Technology\n, the M.A. degree from\nColumbia University\n, and the Ph.D. degree from\nCity University of Hong Kong\nunder the supervision of\nProf. Qingfu Zhang\nand\nProf. Sam Kwong\n.\nHis research interests include multi-objective optimization, learning-based optimization, multi-task learning, and evolutionary computation. His work has been published in top-tier machine learning conferences such as ICML, NeurIPS, and ICLR. He serves as an Area Chair for NeurIPS and ICLR, and as an Action Editor for the Transactions on Machine Learning Research (\nTMLR\n). He regularly reviews for numerous machine learning and evolutionary computation conferences and journals, and has received several outstanding reviewer awards from ICML, ICLR and TMLR.\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGithub\nPreprints\n(*: equal contribution, __: student/postdoc first author I co-mentor, #: corresponding author, full list:\nGoogle Scholar\n)\nQuality-Diversity Optimization as Multi-Objective Optimization\n(New)\nXi Lin*\n#\n, Ping Guo*, Yilu Liu, Qingfu Zhang, Jianyong Sun\n#\npdf\n/\narXiv\nEvoEngineer: Mastering Automated CUDA Kernel Code Evolution with Large Language Models\nPing Guo\n, Chenyu Zhu, Siyuan Chen, Fei Liu,\nXi Lin\n, Zhichao Lu, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nURS: A Unified Neural Routing Solver for Cross-Problem Zero-Shot Generalization\nChangliang Zhou\n, Canhong Yu, Shunyu Yao,\nXi Lin\n, Zhenkun Wang, Yu Zhou, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nFoMEMO: Towards Foundation Models for Expensive Multi-objective Optimization\nYiming Yao, Fei Liu, Liang Zhao,\nXi Lin\n, Yilu Liu, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nFine-tuning Large Language Model for Automated Algorithm Design\nFei Liu\n, Rui Zhang,\nXi Lin\n, Zhichao Lu, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nLearning to Reduce Search Space for Generalizable Neural Routing Solver\nChangliang Zhou*\n,\nXi Lin*\n, Zhenkun Wang, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nInstance-Conditioned Adaptation for Large-scale Generalization of Neural Combinatorial Optimization\nChangliang Zhou*\n,\nXi Lin*\n, Zhenkun Wang, Xialiang Tong, Mingxuan Yuan, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nPuriDefense: Randomized Local Implicit Adversarial Purification for Defending Black-box Query-based Attacks\nPing Guo\n, Zhiyuan Yang,\nXi Lin\n, Qingchuan Zhao, Qingfu Zhang\npdf\n/\narXiv\nSelected Publications\nFew-for-Many Personalized Federated Learning\nPing Guo\n, Tiantian Zhang,\nXi Lin\n, Xiang Li, Zhi-Ri Tang, Qingfu Zhang\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2026\nComing Soon\nBeyond Myopic Alignment: Lookahead Optimization for Online Class-Incremental Learning\nSong Lai, Zhe Zhao, Fei Zhu, Ji Cheng,\nXi Lin\n, Qingfu Zhang, Gaofeng Meng\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2026\nComing Soon\nFew for Many: Towards Efficient and Flexible Many-Objective Optimization\nYilu Liu\n,\nXi Lin\n#\n, Liang Zhao, Qingfu Zhang\n#\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, Early Access\nIEEE Xplore\nParametric Pareto Set Learning: Amortizing Multi-Objective Optimization with Parameters\nJi Cheng\n,\nXi Lin\n, Bo Xue, Qingfu Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, Early Access\nIEEE Xplore\nCoEvo: Continual Evolution of Symbolic Solutions Using Large Language Models\nPing Guo\n, Qingfu Zhang,\nXi Lin\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2026\npdf\n/\narXiv\n/\ncode\nRobust Causal Discovery under Imperfect Structural Constraints\nZidong Wang,\nXi Lin\n, Chuchao He, Xiaoguang Gao\nAnnual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2026\n(Oral Presentation)\npdf\n/\