    "homepage_text": "Tianyu Zhang's WebPage\nSearch\nTianyu Zhang\nPh.D. Student in Machine Learning\nMILA - Québec Institute for\n                      Artificial Intelligence\nBiography\nTianyu Zhang is a Ph.D. student supervised by\nProf.\n                  Yoshua Bengio\nat\nMila\n. He leads the RICE-N project which wins\nNetexplo Innovation Award in 2023\n. His research interests include Latent Reasoning,\n                LLM/VLM Reasoning and Planning, Agent-based Model Simulator, Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning,\n                AI for Climate Change, etc.\n                Previously, he worked as a quantitative researcher in financial engineering. Please\n                feel free to contact him if you are interested in his work.\nOne of his work:\n[🎵] CLAP has achieved\nLoading...\ntotal downloads and\nLoading...\nnew downloads this month.\nDownload the\nCV\n.\nOther notable representitive work:\nScaling Latent\n                  Reasoning via Looped Language Models (pretrained)\n.\nEducation\nPh.D Student in Machine Learning, 09/2021 - Present\nMILA - Québec Institute for Artificial Intelligence\nM.Sc. in Machine Learning, 09/2020 - 06/2021\nMILA - Québec Institute for Artificial Intelligence\nM.S. in Applied Mathematics, 09/2018 - 01/2020\nCourant Institute at New York University\nB.S. in Mathematics and B.Econ. in Finance, 09/2014 - 06/2018\nWuhan University\nRecent Publications\nQuickly discover relevant content by\nfiltering publications\n.\nRui-Jie Zhu\n,\nZixuan Wang\n,\nKai Hua\n,\nTianyu\n                  Zhang\n,\nZiniu Li\n,\nHaoran Que\n,\nBoyi Wei\n,\nZixin Wen\n,\nFan Yin\n,\nHe Xing\n,\nLu Li\n,\nJiajun Shi\n,\nKaijing\n                  Ma\n,\nShanda Li\n,\nTaylor Kergan\n,\nAndrew Smith\n,\nXingwei Qu\n,\nMude Hui\n,\nBohong Wu\n,\nQiyang Min\n,\nHongzhi Huang\n,\nXun Zhou\n,\nWei Ye\n,\nJiaheng Liu\n,\nJian Yang\n,\nYunfeng Shi\n,\nChenghua Lin\n,\nEnduo Zhao\n,\nTianle Cai\n,\nGe Zhang\n,\nWenhao Huang\n,\nYoshua Bengio\n,\nJason Eshraghian\n(2025).\nScaling Latent\n                Reasoning via Looped Language Models\n.\n              In\nIndustry research project\n.\nPDF\nCite\nYusong Wu\n,\nKe\n                  Chen\n,\nTianyu Zhang\n,\nYuchen Hui\n,\nTaylor Berg-Kirkpatrick\n,\nShlomo\n                  Dubnov\n(2023).\nLarge-scale Contrastive Language-Audio Pretraining\n                with Feature Fusion and Keyword-to-Caption Augmentation (CLAP)\n.\n              In\nICASSP\n.\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nDataset\nCLAP Models Downloads Summary\nDownloads (last 30 days):\nLoading...\nDownloads (all time):\nLoading...\nTianyu Zhang\n,\nSuyuchen Wang\n,\nChao Wang\n,\nJuan Rodriguez\n,\nAhmed\n                  Masry\n,\nXiangru Jian\n,\nYoshua Bengio\n,\nPerouz\n                  Taslakian\n(2025).\nSCOPE: Selective Cross-modal Orchestration of Visual Perception\n                Experts\n.\n              In\nPreprint\n.\nPDF\nCite\nTianyu Zhang\n,\nXinyu Wang\n,\nZhenghan Tai\n,\nLu Li\n,\nJijun\n                  Chi\n,\nJingrui Tian\n,\nHailin He\n,\nSuyuchen Wang\n(2025).\nSTRICT: Stress Test of Rendering Images Containing Text\n.\n              In\nEMNLP 2025\n.\nCite\nLu Li\n,\nTianyu\n                  Zhang\n,\nZhiqi Bu\n,\nSuyuchen Wang\n,\nHuan He\n,\nJie Fu\n,\nYonghui Wu\n,\nJiang Bian\n,\nYong Chen\n,\nYoshua Bengio\n(2025).\nMAP: Low-compute Model Merging with Amortized Pareto Fronts via\n                Quadratic Approximation\n.\n              In\nICLR 2025\n.\nCite\nTianyu Zhang\n,\nSuyuchen Wang\n,\nLu Li\n,\nGe Zhang\n,\nPerouz\n                  Taslakian\n,\nSai Rajeswar\n,\nJie Fu\n,\nBang Liu\n,\nYoshua\n                  Bengio\n(2025).\nVCR: A Task for Pixel-Level Complex Reasoning in Vision Language\n                Models via Restoring Occluded Text\n.\n              In\nICLR 2025\n.\nCite\nAhmed Masry\n,\nJuan A Rodriguez\n,\nTianyu Zhang\n,\nSuyuchen Wang\n,\nChao\n                  Wang\n,\nAarash Feizi\n,\nAkshay Kalkunte Suresh\n,\nAbhay\n                  Puri\n,\nXia