    "homepage_text": "Xifeng Guo\nXifeng Guo\nMachine Learning and Computer Vision\nInstitute:\nCollege of Computer, National University of Defense Technology, China.\nEmail:\nguoxifeng13@nudt.edu.cn; guoxifeng1990@163.com\nGitHub:\nhttps://github.com/XifengGuo\nResearchGate:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Xifeng_Guo\nMenu\nResearch Interests\nEducation\nPublications\nResearch Interests\nMy interests were on Pattern Recognition and Image Processing, especially on Fingerprint Recognition before 2016.\nNow I'm interested in Machine Learning and Computer Vision. To be specific, my study focuses on clustering using deep neural networks, unsupervised transfer learning and unsupervised representation learning.\nI'm a PC member for top AI coferences\nAAAI 2020, AAAI 2021, IJCAI 2020, IJCAI 2021, and ECAI-20\n.\n\t\t\t\t\tI'm also a reviewer for top AI journals\nIEEE T-NNLS, IEEE T-Cybernetics, IEEE T-Robotics, Neural Networks, Pattern Recognition, Soft Computing\n, and\nSignal Processing\n.\nEducation\n2016 - 2020\nNUDT\nI'm a PhD candidate in College of Computer, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT), China.\nAdvisor: Prof. Jianping Yin and Prof. En Zhu.\n2013 - 2015\nNUDT\nM.S. in College of Computer, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT), China.\nAdvisor: Prof. En Zhu.\n2009 - 2012\nUESTC\nB.S. in School of Automation Engineering, University of Electronic Science Technology of China.\nPublications\nSihang Zhou, Xinwang Liu, Jiyuan Liu,\nXifeng Guo\n, et al.\nMulti-View Spectral Clustering with Optimal Neighborhood Laplacian Matrix.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\n, 2020 (oral presentation).\nXifeng Guo\n, En Zhu, Xinwang Liu, and Jianping Yin.\nAffine Equivariant Autoencoder.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI)\n, 2019.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nXifeng Guo\n, Xinwang Liu, En Zhu, Xinzhong Zhu, Miaomiao Li, Xin Xu, and Jianping Yin.\nAdaptive Self-paced Deep Clustering with Data Augmentation.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE)\n, 32(9):1680-1693. 2020.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nSiqi Wang, Qiang Liu,\nXifeng Guo\n, En Zhu, and Jianping Yin.\nFast and unsupervised outlier removal by recurrent adaptive reconstruction extreme learning machine.\nInternational Journal of Machine Learning and Cybernetics\n, 2019.\nJingtao Hu, En Zhu, Siqi Wang, Xinwang Liu,\nXifeng Guo\n, and Jianping Yin.\nAn Efficient and Robust Unsupervised Anomaly Detection Method Using Ensemble Random Projection in Surveillance Videos.\nSENSORS\n, 2019.\nYongkai Ye, Xinwang Liu, Qiang Liu,\nXifeng Guo\n, and Jianping Yin.\nIncomplete Multiview Clustering via Late Fusion.\nComputational Intelligence and Neuroscience\n, 2018.\n[\npdf\n]\nXifeng Guo\n, En Zhu, Xinwang Liu, and Jianping Yin.\nDeep Embedded Clustering with Data Augmentation.\nThe 10th Asian Conference on Machine Learning (ACML)\n, 2018.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nErxue Min,\nXifeng Guo\n, Qiang Liu, Gen Zhang, Jianjing Cui, and Jun Long.\nA Survey of Clustering with Deep Learning: From the Perspective of Network Architecture.\nDOI: 10.1109/ACCESS.2018.2855437, IEEE Access,\nvol. 6, pp. 39501-39514, 2018.\n[\npdf\n]\nYiqi Wang, Zhan Shi,\nXifeng Guo\n, Xinwang Liu, En Zhu, and Jianping Yin.\nDeep Embedding for Determining the Number of Clusters.\nAAAI (Student Abstracts)\n, 2018.\nMengchi Lu, Long Gao,\nXifeng Guo\n, and Jianping Yin.\nA Framework of Predicting Drug Resistance of Lung Tuberculosis by Utilizing Radiological Images.\nInternational Conference on Advanced Computational Intelligence (ICACI)\n, 2018.\nXifeng Guo\n, Xinwang Liu, En Zhu, and Jianping Yin.\nDeep Clustering with Convolutional Autoencoders.\nInternational Conference on Neural Information Processing (ICONIP)\n, 2017.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nXifeng Guo\n, Long Gao, Xinwang Liu, and Jianping Yin.\nImproved Deep Embedded Clustering with Local Structure Preservation.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI)\n, 2017.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nMengchi Lu, Long Gao,\nXifeng Guo\n, Qiang Liu, and Jianping Yin.\nHEp-2 cell image classification method based on very deep convolutional networks with small datasets.\nInternational Conference on Digital Image Processing (ICDIP)\n, 2017.\nXifeng Guo\n, Wei Chen, and Jianping Yin.\nA Simple Approach for Unsupervised Domain Adaptation.\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition (ICPR)\n, 2016.\n[\npdf\n|\ncode\n]\nWei Chen,\nXifeng Guo\n, Xinwang Liu, En Zhu and Jianping Yin.\nAppearance Changes Detection during Tracking.\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition (ICPR)\n, 2016.\n[\npdf\n]\nXifeng Guo\n, En Zhu and Jianping Yin.\n\"A fast and accurate method for detecting fingerprint reference point.\"\nNeural Computing & Applications\n. 29(1): 21-31. 2018.\n[\npdf\n(final version is\nhere\n)]\nEn Zhu,\nXifeng Guo\nand Jianping Yin.\n\"Walking to singular points of fingerprints.\"\nPattern Recognition\n. 56: 116-128. 2016.\n[\npdf\n(final version is\nhere\n) |\ncode\n]"
