    "homepage_text": "Fuhai Chen (陈福海)'s Homepage\nFuhai Chen (陈福海)\nEmails: chenfuhai3c AT 163.com (best), fhchen AT cs.hku.hk\nI am currently a postdoctoral fellow in the Department of Computer Science of the University of Hong Kong, working with\nProf. Wenping Wang\n. Before that, I received the PH.D. Degree from the Department of Artificial Intelligence of Xiamen University in 2020, supervised by\nProf. Rongrong Ji\nin\nMedia Analysis and Computing Lab (MAC)\n. I joint the Department of Computer Science of National University of Singapore in the same year, working with\nA/Prof. Angela Yao\n. Earlier, I received the B.S. Degree from the Department of Cognitive Science and Technology (now renamed as Department of Artificial Intelligence) of Xiamen University in 2014. I obtained the M.S.-Ph.D. qualification and finished my M.S. career in Xiamen University in 2016.\nMy research interests are on computer vision, multimedia, natural language processing, and machine learning, especially on vision-language content understanding, multi-modal structured semantic modeling, diverse semantic inference, causal semantic inference, as well as their applications, including image/video captioning, multimedia sentiment analysis, image-sentence retrieval, human-computer interaction, sentence grounding in video, and medical diagnostic report analysis.\nPre-print\nChengpeng Dai#,\nFuhai Chen\n#, Xiaoshuai Sun*, Rongrong Ji, Qixiang Ye, Yongjian Wu.\nGlobal2Local: A Joint-Hierarchical Attention for Video Captioning\n. ArXiv:2203.06663.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Chengpeng Dai, Xuri Ge, Shengchuang Zhang, Xiaojing Ma, Yue Gao.\nFactored Attention and Embedding for Unstructured-view Topic-related Ultrasound Report Generation\n. ArXiv:2203.06458.\nFuhai Chen\n, Xuri Ge, Xiaoshuai Sun, Yue Gao, Jianzhuang Liu, Fufeng Chen, Wenjie Li.\nDifferentiated Relevances Embedding for Group-based Referring Expression Comprehension\n. ArXiv:2203.06382.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Chengpeng Dai, Xiaoshuai Sun, Chia-Wen Lin, Jiayi Ji, Baochang Zhang, Feiyue Huang, Liujuan Cao.\nSemantic-aware Image Deblurring\n. ArXiv:1910.03853.\nChen Shen, Rongrong Ji*,\nFuhai Chen\n, Xiangming Li.\nScene-based Factored Attention for Image Captioning\n. ArXiv:1908.02632.\nPublication\nXuri Ge,\nFuhai Chen\n*, Songpei Xu, Fuxiang Tao.\nCross-modal Semantic Enhanced Interaction for Image-Sentence Retrieval\n. Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision, 2023 (WACV 2023) [Accepted].\nXuri Ge,\nFuhai Chen\n, Joemon Jose, Zhilong Ji, Zhongqin Wu, Xiao Liu.\nStructured Multi-modal Feature Embedding and Alignment for Image-Sentence Retrieval\n. ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2021.\nHaotong Zhang,\nFuhai Chen\n, Angela Yao.\nWeakly-Supervised Dense Action Anticipation\n. The British Machine Vision Conference (BMVC 2021), 2021.\nMingliang Xu,\nFuhai Chen\n, Lu Li, Chen Shen, Pei Lv, Bing Zhou, Rongrong Ji*.\nBio-Inspired Deep Attribute Learning Towards Facial Aesthetic Prediction\n. IEEE Transactions on Affective Computing (TAC), 2021.\nJiayi Ji, Yunpeng Luo, Xiaoshuai Sun,\nFuhai Chen\n, Gen Luo, Yongjian Wu, Yue Gao, Rongrong Ji*.\nImproving Image Captioning by Leveraging Intra- and Inter-layer Global Representation in Transformer Network\n. Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2021.\nJiayi Ji, Rongrong Ji*, Yiyi Zhou, Xiaoshuai Sun,\nFuhai Chen\n, Jianzhuang Liu, Qi Tian.\nAttacking Image Captioning Towards Accuracy-Preserving Target Words Removal\n. ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2020.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Jiayi Ji, Xiaoshuai Sun, Baochang Zhang, Xuri Ge, Yongjian Wu, Feiyue Huang, Yan Wang.\nVariational Structured Semantic Inference for Diverse Image Captioning\n. Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2019.\nRongrong Ji,\nFuhai Chen\n, Liujuan Cao*, Yue Gao*.\nCross-Modality Microblog Sentiment Prediction via Bi-Layer Multimodal Hypergraph Learning\n. IEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM), 2019.\nXuri Ge,\nFuhai Chen\n, Chen Shen, Rongrong Ji*.\nColloquial Image Captioning\n. IEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo (ICME), 2019.\nZongyue Liu,\nFuhai Chen\n, Jinsong Su, Chen Shen, Rongrong Ji*.\nTopic-Guided Automatical Human-Simulated Tweeting System\n. Pacific Rim International Conference on Artificial Intelligence (PRICAI), 2018.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Xiaoshuai Sun, Yongjian Wu, Jinsong Su.\nGroupCap: Group-based Image Captioning with Structured Relevance and Diversity Constraints\n. IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2018.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Jinsong Su, Donglin Cao, and Yue Gao.\nPredicting Microblog Sentiments via Weakly Supervised Multi-Modal Deep Learning\n. IEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM), 2018.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Jinsong Su, Yongjian Wu, Yunsheng Wu.\nStructCap: Structured Semantic Embedding for Image Captioning\n. ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2017.\nRongrong Ji, Donglin Cao*, Yiyi Zhou,\nFuhai Chen\n.\nSurvey of visual sentiment prediction for social media analysis\n. Frontiers of Computer Science, 2016.\nYue Gao, Weizhi Nie, Anan Liu, Yuting Su, Qionghai Dai, Le An,\nFuhai Chen\n, et al.\n3D object retrieval with multimodal views\n. Eurographics Workshop on 3D Object Retrieval, 2016.\nFuhai Chen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Liujuan Cao.\nMultimodal learning for view-based 3D object classification\n. Neurocomputing, 2016.\nChao Chen,\nFuhai Chen\n, Donglin Cao, Rongrong Ji*.\nA cross-media sentiment analytics platform for microblog\n. ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2015.\nFuhai Chen\n, Yue Gao, Donglin Cao, Rongrong Ji*.\nMultimodal hypergraph learning for microblog sentiment prediction\n. IEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo (ICME), 2015. (Listed in the top papers)\nFei Chao,\nFuhai Chen\n, Yunhang Shen, Wenli He, Yan Sun, Zhengshuai Wang, Changle Zhou, Min Jiang.\nRobotic free writing of Chinese characters via human-robot interactions\n. International journal of humanoid robotics, 2014.\nActivities\nDeveloping Cross-media Sentiment Analysis System (First Version, Chinese) (2014).\nUnfold/Fold\nInterdiscipline research participations: MRI Data based MCI identification with\nA/Prof. Yue Gao\n(2014), financial sentiment dictionary construction with\nProf. Jiaquan Yao\n(2016), policy uncertainty estimation with\nA/Prof. Juanjuan Huang\n(2017), and real-time CEO facial expression classification with Dr. Lefu Wang (2017).\nOrganizing committee of AutoGen-CDR19 challenge in MICCAI 2019 (\nLink\n).\nTeaching assistant of Pattern Recognition, Spring 2019, Xiamen University.\nResearch intern at\nPeng Cheng Laboratory (PCL)\n(2019.5 ~ 2019.11).\nReviewer: IEEE TMM, ACM TOMM, Pattern Recognition, Neural Processing Letters, NCIG.\nEditor: Electronics.\nTalks\nStructCap: Structured Semantic Embedding for Image Captioning, The 27th ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM 2017), Mountain View, USA, 2017.\nAutomatic Generation of Cardiovascular Diagnostic Report, The 22th Medical Image Computing Computer Assisted Intervention (MICCAI 2019), Shenzhen, China, 2019.\nHonors and Awards\nNational Scholarship, China, 2011\nOutstanding Merit Student Award, Xiamen University, 2011\nNational \"Freescale Cup\" Smart Car Competition (South China division, Captain, 2nd class), 2012\nMerit Student Award, Xiamen University, 2013\nNational \"Huawei Cup\" Intelligent Design Competition (Captain, 1st class), 2013\nAcademic Innovation Scholarship, Xiamen University, 2014\nAward of Innovation and Entrepreneurship Training Project (Leader), Xiamen University, 2014\nAcademic Excellence Scholarship, Xiamen University, 2014\nBest Graduate, Xiamen University, 2014\nHighlights in SHREC 2015 Track \"3D Object Retrieval with Multimodal Views\" (\nLink\n)\nNational Scholarship, China, 2018"
  },
