    "github": "https://github.com/xinwangliu",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Xinzhong Zhu: Homepage\nXinzhong Zhu’s Homepage | Professor with the College of Mathematics, Physics and Information Engineering, Zhejiang Normal University, Jinhua 321004, China, and also with the Research Institute of Ningbo Cixing Co. Ltd, Ningbo 315336, China.\nXinzhong Zhu\nProfessor\nzxz@zjnu.edu.cn\nzxz@ci-xing.com\nxinzhong.zhu@geekplus.com\nhttps://xinzhongzhu.github.io\n©\n          2026\nContact Information:\nXinzhong Zhu, a Special Expert of Zhejiang Province, received a Ph.D. from Xidian University and an M.S. from the National University of Defense Technology (NUDT), China. He is a professor at the School of Computer Science and Technology (School of Artificial Intelligence), Zhejiang Normal University, and also the dean of Hangzhou Institute of Artificial Intelligence, Zhejiang Normal University, and the chief scientist of Beijing Geekplus Technology Co., Ltd. and president of the Research Institute of Ningbo Cixing Co., Ltd., China. His research interests include Machine learning, Deep clustering, Computer vision, Manufacturing informatization, Robotics and System integration, Laser SLAM, Vision SLAM, Diffusion Model, Low-Quality Data Learning, Multiple Kernel Learning, and Intelligent manufacturing. He is a member of the ACM and certified as a CCF distinguished member. Dr. Zhu has published more than 30 peer-reviewed papers, including those in highly regarded journals and conferences such as the IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, the IEEE Transactions on Image Processing, the IEEE Transactions on Multimedia, the IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering, CVPR, NeurIPS, AAAI, IJCAI, etc. He served on the Technical Program Committees of IJCAI 2020 and AAAI 2020.\nPlease drop me a message by email:\nzxz@zjnu.edu.cn\nor\nzxz@ci-xing.com\nor\nxinzhong.zhu@geekplus.com\nSelected Journal Papers\n(\nClick to Hide\n)\n:\n[KBS' 2]\nMinghao Li#, Huiying Xu#*, Ziying Wang, Hechuan Lin, Xiaolei Zhang*,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n:\nSemideﬁnite program-inspired continuous relaxation robust multi-view clustering for large-scale data\n.\nKnowledge-Based Systems\n(28 Feb 2026) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n(# Equal contribution)\n[KBS' 1]\nQian Chen#, Huiying Xu*#, Ruidong Wang, Yue Liu,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n:\nStructure adversarial augmented graph anomaly detection via multi-view contrastive learning\n.\nKnowledge-Based Systems\n(1 Feb 2026) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n(# Equal contribution)\n[BSPC' 1]\nYi Li, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Xiao Huang, Hongbo Li:\nBTDet: Towards lightweight and enhanced feature aggregation network for brain tumor detection\n.\nBiomedical Signal Processing and Control\n(29 Nov 2025) (SCI Q2/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[JVCI' 1]\nZiqing He, Longfei Wang, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n:\nA Multi-Task Visual Framework: Geometry-Guided UAV Crowd Counting and Localization for Media Practice\n.\nJournal of Visual Communication and Image Representation\n(2025) (SCI Q2/中科院4区)\n[PDF]\n[AIMS Mathematics' 4]\nNafissa T. Trouba, Huiying Xu*, Reham M. A.Shohib*, Mohamed E. M. Alngar,  Mohammed El-Meligy,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Adham E. Ragab:\nStochastic soliton dynamics in the perturbed Gerdjikov-Ivanov equation with multiplicative noise via the new Jacobi elliptic function expansion method\n.\nAIMS Mathematics\n(20 Nov 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[ESWA' 2]\nYi Li, Huiying Xu*, Yiming Sun, Pengfei Zhu, Lingling Xu,\nXinzhong Zhu\n:\nKSCNet: Exploring KAN and state space model collaboration network for small object detection from UAV imagery\n.\nExpert Systems With Applications\n(28 Oct 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n[Scientific Reports' 1]\nNafissa T. Trouba, Huiying Xu*, Mohamed E. M. Alngar*, Reham M. A.Shohib,  Mohammed El-Meligy,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Mohamed Sharaf:\nOptical soliton solutions of the stochastic generalized nonlinear Schrödinger equation with arbitrary refractive index in Itô sense\n.\nScientific Reports\n(Oct 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[ITJ' 1]\nJunaid Hassan, Zhen Qin, Muhammad Arslan Rauf, Muhammad Umar Aftab, Negalign Wake Hundera,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n:\nRevocable Policy Hiding Bilateral Access Control Scheme With Equality Test for IIoT Environment\n.\nIEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL\n. (17 Oct 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区TOP)\n[PDF]\n[CSI' 1]\nZohaib Ali, Junaid Hassan, Muhammad Umar Aftab*, Negalign Wake Hundera*, Huiying Xu,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n:\nSecuring Wireless Body Area Network with lightweight certificateless signcryption scheme using equality test\n.\nComputer Standards & Interfaces\n. (17 Sep 2025) (SCI Q2/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[TII' 1]\nWenjie Yao, Guanglu Sun, Suxia Zhu, Ruidong Wang,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Huiying Xu*, Xiguang Wei:\nFedRDA: Representation Deviation Alignment in Heterogeneous Federated Learning\n.\nIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\n. (Nov 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n[Medical Physics' 1]\nYue Hu, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Xiao Huang:\nAn exploratory study on ultrasound image denoising using feature extraction and adversarial diffusion model\n.\nMedical Physics\n. (8 Sep 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[Food Chemistry' 1]\nJinhong Li, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Jiping Xiong, Xiaolei Zhang:\nFSF-ViT: Image augmentation and adaptive global-local feature fusion for Few-Shot Food classification\n.\nFood Chemistry\n. (12 July 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n[EAAI' 1]\nXuedong He***, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu**\n, Hongbo Li, Xiao Huang, Yunliang Jiang:\nLearning color prompt and position constraint for visual tracking\n.\nEngineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence\n. (4 June 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院1区TOP)\n[PDF]\n[TKDE' 6]\nTuanfei Zhu, Xingchen Hu*, Xinwang Liu, EnZhu,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Huiying Xu:\nDynamic Ensemble Framework for Imbalanced Data Classiﬁcation\n.\nIEEE TRANSACTIONS ON KNOWLEDGE AND DATA ENGINEERING\n. (May 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[electronics' 1]\nBalong Wang, Nassim Bessaad, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Hongbo Li:\nMergeable Probabilistic Voxel Mapping for LiDAR–Inertial–Visual Odometry\n.\nelectronics\n. (24 May 2025) (SCI Q2/中科院4区)\n[PDF]\n[CJPH' 1]\nZahoor Iqbal*, Nisha A․, Vinoth kumar B․, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n, Ridha Selmi*, Sahar Ahmed Idris, Ines Hilali Jaghdam, Ahmed M. Abed:\nNumerical simulations of combined effect of viscosity variation and magnetohydrodynamic (MHD) characteristics for wide porous slider bearings with exponential film profile\n.\nChinese Journal of Physics\n. (24 March 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[Neurocomputing' 4]\nYunzhong Si, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Wenhao Zhang, Yao Dong, Yuxing Chen, Hongbo Li:\nSCSA: Exploring the synergistic effects between spatial and channel attention\n.\nNeurocomputing\n634: 129866. (8 March 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[CSTE' 2]\nZahoor lqbal, Md Fayz- Al- Asad, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n, Muhammad Sajjad Hossain, Ridha Selmi, M.M. Algarn, Sharifah E. Alhazmi, Fahima Hajjej, M.M.H. Imran:\nArtificial neural networks analysis of entropy generation inmagnetic-micropolar nanofluid flow equipped with porous mediaand Darcy-Forchheimer law\n.\nCase Studies in Thermal Engineering\n(12 Feb 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[CSTE' 1]\nZahoor lqbal, Farhan Ali, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu*\n, M.M. Alqarni, Arafat Hussain, Sharifah E. Alhazmi, Ehab M. Ragab, M. Faizan Ahmed:\nNumerical simulations of thermal convection in unsteady Darcy Forchheimer flow of radiative Ag- GO/KO hybrid nanofluid over a slipping spinning porous disk\n.\nCase Studies in Thermal Engineering\n(2 Feb 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[AIMS Mathematics' 3]\nNafissa T. Trouba, Mohamed E. M. Alngar, Reham M. A.Shohib, Haitham A. Mahmoud, Yakup Yildirim, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n:\nNovel solitary wave solutions of the (3+1)–dimensional nonlinear Schrödinger equation with generalized Kudryashov self–phase modulation\n.\nAIMS Mathematics\n(28 January 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[AIMS Mathematics' 2]\nNafissa T. Trouba, Huiying Xu*, Mohamed E. M. Alngar, Reham M. A.Shohib, Haitham A. Mahmoud,\nXinzhong Zhu\n:\nSoliton solutions and stability analysis of the stochastic nonlinear reaction-diffusion equation with multiplicative white noise in soliton dynamics and optical physics\n.\nAIMS Mathematics\n(24 January 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[Neurocomputing' 3]\nYunzhong Si, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Rihao Liu, Hongbo Li:\nAttention-modulated frequency-aware pooling via spatial guidance\n.\nNeurocomputing\n625: 129507. (27 January 2025) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[IVC' 1]\nWenhao Zhang, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Yunzhong Si, Yao Dong, Xiao Huang, Hongbo Li:\nRFSC-net: Re-parameterization forward semantic compensation network in low-light environments\n.\nImage and Vision Computing\n151: 105271. (7 September 2024) (SCI Q1/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[JKSU' 2]\nFatene Dioubi, Negalign Wake Hundera, Huiying Xu∗,\nXinzhong Zhu\n:\nEnhancing stock market predictions via hybrid external trend and internal components analysis and long short term memory model\n.\nJournal of King Saud University - Computer and Information Sciences\n36(5): 102044. (22 Nov 2024) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[DSP' 1]\nYi Li, Huiying Xu*,\nXinzhong Zhu\n, Xiao Huang and Hongbo Li:\nTHDet: A Lightweight and Efficient Traffic Helmet Object Detector based on YOLOv8\n.\nDigital Signal Processing: 155 104765\n(7 September 2024) (SCI Q2/中科院3区)\n[PDF]\n[Axioms' 3]\nMahvish Samar,\nXinzhong Zhu\n*, Abdul Shakoor, Mawia Osman:\nNew Nonlinear Retarded Integral Inequalities and Their Applications to Nonlinear Retarded Integro-Differential Equations\n.\nAxioms\n: 13 356.  (27 May 2024)  (SCI Q2/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[Axioms' 2]\nMahvish Samar,\nXinzhong Zhu\n*, Huiying Xu:\nConditioning Theory for ML-Weighted Pseudoinverse and ML-Weighted Least Squares Problem\n.\nAxioms\n: 13 345. (22 May 2024) (SCI Q2/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[Vehicular Communications' 1]\nNegalign Wake Hundera, Muhammad Umar Aftab, Dagmawit Mesfin, Fatene Dioubi∗, Huiying Xu,\nXinzhong Zhu\n*:\nAn efficient heterogeneous online/offline anonymous certificateless signcryption with proxy re-encryption for Internet of vehicles\n.\nVehicular Communications\n: 100811. (4 Jun 2024) (SCI Q1/中科院2区)\n[PDF]\n[JKSU' 1]\nNegalign Wake Hundera, Shumeng Wang, Dagmawit Mesfin, Huiying Xu,\nXinzhong Zhu\n*:\nAn efficient online/offline heterogeneous proxy signcryption for secure communication in UAV networks...[truncated]"
