    "homepage_text": "About me - Zhenyu Pan\nZhenyu Pan\n(潘震宇)\n2nd year PhD student in Computer Science at Northwestern University\n📍 Evanston, IL 60201\n🔗 Github\n🎓 Google Scholar\n💼 LinkedIn\n🐦 Twitter\nAbout me\nI'm a PhD student in the Computer Science Department at\nNorthwestern University\n, advised by\nHan Liu\n. I hold an MS (Quited from Phd in Electrical and Computer Engineering) degree from\nUniversity of Rochester\nand a BS (Software Engineering) degree from\nCentral South University\n. I'm proud to have graduated from\nGuiyang No.1 High School\n. My research interests include LLM/VLM, diffusion models, GNN, and energy-based models.\nIf you are interested in collaborating with me in code generation, information retrieval, 3D world generation, or other domains, please don't hesitate to contact me! Let's have a chat!\n📧 email: A = \"zhenyupan\", B = \"@u.northwestern\", C = \".edu\"; address = A + B + C\nNews\n[2026-02] Honored to receive a Tinker Research Grant from Thinking Machines Lab.\n[2026-01] 1 paper was accepted to ICLR 2026.\n[2025-10] 1 paper was accepted to Physica A: Statistical Mechanics and its Applications.\n[2025-10] Honored to receive the\nLambda's Research Grant Program\n.\n[2025-09] 1 paper was accepted to NeurIPS 2025.\n[2025-09] 1 paper was accepted to\nNature Computational Science\n.\n[2025-09] I'm starting a new internship as an applied scientist intern at Amazon in Seattle.\n[2025-08] 2 papers were accepted to the Trustworthy FMs workshop in ICCV 2025.\n[2025-07] Honored to receive the\nNVIDIA Academic Grant\nfor our project on\nInteractive Spatial Reasoning and 3D Scene Generation with RL-Enhanced VLMs\n! Thanks to NVIDIA for supporting academic innovation.\n[2025-03] Excited to introduce\nMetaSpatial\n! The first RL-based framework for enhancing\n3D spatial reasoning\nin VLMs, enabling more structured and realistic scene generation for\nthe metaverse, AR/VR, and game development\n. Check it out\nhere\n!\n[2025-01] 1 paper was accepted to ICLR 2025.\n[2024-12] 1 paper was accepted to LLM4Code workshop in ICSE 2025.\n[2024-06] I'm starting a new internship at Tongyi Lab@Alibaba Group.\n[2023-04] 1 paper was accepted to ICS 2023.\n[2023-02] 1 paper was accepted to DAC 2023.\n[2022-11] 1 paper was accepted to AAAI 2023.\n[2022-09] 1 paper was accepted to ICCD 2022.\nAwards\n[2026-02] Tinker Research Grant from Thinking Machines Lab: $ 5,000\n[2025-10] Lambda's Research Grant Program: $ 1,000\n[2025-10] 2025 NeurIPS Scholar Award\n[2025-07] NVIDIA Academic Grant: $ 110,000\n[2025-03] 2025 ICLR Travel Grant\n[2024-09] Northwestern University Fellowship: $ 45,000\n[2023-02] 2023 AAAI Student Travel Grant\nTalks\n[2025-05]\nMetaSpatial: Reinforcing 3D Spatial Reasoning in VLMs for the Metaverse\nPresented to Salesforce.\n[2024-11]\nHigh-quality and Low-latency 3D Molecule Generation\nPresented to AbbVie leadership.\nPublications\nSelected Publications\nAll Publications\nAdvEvo-MARL: Shaping Internalized Safety through Adversarial Co-Evolution in Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning\nZhenyu Pan\n, Yiting Zhang, Zhuo Liu, Yolo Yunlong Tang, Zeliang Zhang, Haozheng Luo, Yuwei Han, Jianshu Zhang, Dennis Wu, Hong-Yu Chen, Haoran Lu, Haoyang Fang, Manling Li, Chenliang Xu, Philip S. Yu, Han Liu\n[arXiv 2025/10]\nMetaSpatial: Reinforcing 3D Spatial Reasoning in VLMs for the Metaverse\nZhenyu Pan\n, Han Liu\n14th International Conference on Learning Representations\n[ICLR 2026]\nMetaFind: Scene-Aware 3D Asset Retrieval for Coherent Metaverse Scene Generation\nZhenyu Pan\n, Yucheng Lu, Han Liu\n39th Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems\n[NeurIPS 2025]\nChain-of-Action: Faithful and Multimodal Question Answering through Large Language Models\nZhenyu Pan\n, Haozheng Luo, Manling Li, Han Liu\n13th International Conference on Learning Representations\n[ICLR 2025]\nVideo-LMM Post-Training: A Deep Dive into Video Reasoning with Large Multimodal Models\nYunlong Tang, Jing Bi, Pinxin Liu,\nZhenyu Pan\n, Zhangyun Tan, Qianxiang Shen, Jiani Liu, Hang Hua, Junjia Guo, Yunzhong Xiao, Chao Huang, Zhiyuan Wang, Susan Liang, Xinyi Liu, Yizhi Song, Yuhe Nie, Jia-Xing Zhong, Bozheng Li, Daiqing Qi, Ziyun Zeng, Ali Vosoughi, Luchuan Song, Zeliang Zhang, Daiki Shimada, Han Liu, Jiebo Luo, Chenliang Xu\n[arXiv 2025/10]\nAdvEvo-MARL: Shaping Internalized Safety through Adversarial Co-Evolution in Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning\nZhenyu Pan\n, Yiting Zhang, Zhuo Liu, Yolo Yunlong Tang, Zeliang Zhang, Haozheng Luo, Yuwei Han, Jianshu Zhang, Dennis Wu, Hong-Yu Chen, Haoran Lu, Haoyang Fang, Manling Li, Chenliang Xu, Philip S. Yu, Han Liu\n[arXiv 2025/10]\nCodev-Bench: How Do LLMs Understand Developer-Centric Code Completion?\nZhenyu Pan\n, Rongyu Cao, Yongchang Cao, Yingwei Ma, Binhua Li, Fei Huang, Han Liu, Yongbin Li\n[arXiv 2024/10]\nHeteGraph-Mamba: Heterogeneous Graph Learning via Selective State Space Model\nZhenyu Pan*\n, Yoonsung Jeong*, Xiaoda Liu, Han Liu\n[arXiv 2024/05]\nConv-CoA: Improving Open-domain Question Answering in Large Language Models via Conversational Chain-of-Action\nZhenyu Pan*\n, Haozheng Luo*, Manling Li, Han Liu\n[arXiv 2024/05]\nMetaSpatial: Reinforcing 3D Spatial Reasoning in VLMs for the Metaverse\nZhenyu Pan\n, Han Liu\n14th International Conference on Learning Representations\n[ICLR 2026]\nCoRMF: Criticality-Ordered Recurrent Mean Field Ising Solver\nZhenyu Pan\n, Ammar Gilani, En-Jui Kuo, Zhuo Liu\nPhysica A: Statistical Mechanics and its Applications\nMetaFind: Scene-Aware 3D Asset Retrieval for Coherent Metaverse Scene Generation\nZhenyu Pan\n, Yucheng Lu, Han Liu\n39th Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems\n[NeurIPS 2025]\nSciSciGPT: Advancing Human-AI Collaboration in the Science of Science\nErzhuo Shao, Yifang Wang, Yifan Qian,\nZhenyu Pan\n, Han Liu, Dashun Wang\n[Nature Computational Science 2025]\nEvo-MARL: Co-Evolutionary Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning for Internalized Safety\nZhenyu Pan\n, Yiting Zh