, 09/2025 - 12/2025\nWorking as a research intern in Tongyi Lab, Alibaba Group, 06/2024 - 11/2024\nAcademic Service\nConference Reviewer:\n[ICCV 2025], [CVPR (2024,2025,2026)], [EMNLP 2024], [ACL 2025], [LoG 2024,2025], [AAAI 2025,2026], [NeurIPS (2024, 2025)], [ICLR 2025, 2026], [ICML 2025], [AISTATS 2025,2026]\nJournal Reviewer:\n[IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems], [IEEE Transactions on Audio, Speech and Language Processing], [IEEE Transactions on Games]\nTeaching Assistant\nECE-101: Intro to Electrical and Computer Engineering\nECE-113: Circuits and Signals\nECE-221: Electronic Devices and Circuits\nECE-222: Analysis & Design of Integrated Circuits\nReferences\nHan Liu\nOrrington Lunt Professor of Computer Science, Statistics and Data Science Departments\nNorthwestern University\nEmail: hanliu@northwestern.edu\nWebsite:\nProfile\nPhilip S. Yu\nDistinguished Professor, Computer Science Department\nUniversity of Illinois at Chicago\nEmail: psyu@uic.edu\nWebsite:\nProfile"
