    "homepage_text": "Research of L. (Liangliang) Cheng, PhD | How to find us | University of Groningen\nJavascript must be enabled for the correct page display\nSkip to Content\nSkip to Navigation\nUniversity of Groningen\nfounded in 1614  -  top 100 university\nClose\nSearch\nSearch\nSearch\nAbout us\nPractical matters\nHow to find us\nL. (Liangliang) Cheng, PhD\nL. (Liangliang) Cheng, PhD\nTenure Track Assistant Professor\nFaculty of Science and Engineering\nTelephone:\n+31 50 36 33395\nE-mail:\nliangliang.cheng rug.nl\nHomepage\nORCID\nResearch Portal\nResearch interests\nPublications\nPress/media\nResearch interests\nThe research of Dr. Cheng Liangliang mainly focuses on the field\nof Non-Destructive Testing and Structural Health Monitoring (NDT\n& SHM), which involves the knowledge of, but not limited to,\nDynamics and Vibration, Dynamic System Identification, Signal\nProcessing, and Artificial intelligence.\nPublications\nCompressed Sparse Regression for Anchored Design of Experiments and\nSensor Placement in Structure Health Monitoring\nZhu, Y., Cheng, L. &\nCheng, L.\n,\n2026\n,\n4th International Conference on\nStructural Health Monitoring and Engineering Structures, SHM and ES\n2025 - Advances in Sustainable Engineering and Management:\nInnovations for Reducing Energy Consumption and Carbon\nFootprint.\nCuong, L. T., Khatir, S., Fantuzzi, N., Capozucca,\nR. & Quyen, V. T. B. (eds.).\nSpringer Science and\nBusiness Media Deutschland GmbH\n,\np.\n49-55\n7 p.\n(Lecture Notes\nin Civil Engineering; vol. 747 LNCE).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nIdentifying Non-linear Output Frequency Response Functions Using\nGeneralized Associated Linear Equations with Recursive and Coupled\nComputational Methods\nZhang, W.\n, Zhu, Y. &\nCheng, L.\n,\n2026\n,\n4th International Conference on Structural Health Monitoring\nand Engineering Structures, SHM and ES 2025 - Advances in\nSustainable Engineering and Management: Innovations for Reducing\nEnergy Consumption and Carbon Footprint.\nCuong, L. T., Khatir,\nS., Fantuzzi, N., Capozucca, R. & Quyen, V. T. B. (eds.).\nSpringer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH\n,\np. 907-914\n8\np.\n(Lecture Notes in Civil Engineering; vol. 747 LNCE).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nLightweight underwater acoustic time-frequency separation network\nfor efficient marine target recognition\nChen, M., Lu, Y.,\nCheng, L.\n, Zhu, R.,\nTao, K., Li, Y. & Abdel Wahab, M.,\n15-Jan-2026\n,\nIn:\nOcean Engineering.\n343\n,\n1\n,\n14 p.\n, 123234.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nNonlinear Modal Analysis Based on Nonlinear Output Frequency\nResponse Functions (NOFRFs)\nZhang, W.\n, Zhu, Y., Kosova, G.,\nJayawardhana, B.\n&\nCheng, L.\n,\n23-Feb-2026\n,\nASME 2025 International\nMechanical Engineering Congress and Exposition.\nASME\n,\n9 p.\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nThe Generalized Frequency Response Functions of Multiple Inputs\nMultiple Outputs Nonlinear Systems: A Probing Evaluation Algorithm\nZhang, W.\n, Zhu, Y. &\nCheng, L.\n,\n23-Feb-2026\n,\nASME 2025 International\nMechanical Engineering Congress and Exposition.\nASME\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nA lightweight network for defect detection in polyethylene\npipelines using multi-mode ultrasonic guided waves\nMa, L., Bao, R., Zhu, J., Zeng, T.,\nCheng,\nL.\n, Zhang, J., Guan, K., Yang, H., Sun, X. & Sang, H.,\nSept-2025\n,\nIn:\nEngineering Research Express.\n7\n,\n3\n,\n17 p.\n, 035551.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nA Model Updating Framework for Railway Ballasted Track Stiffness\nIrregularity Interference Based on the 2D Dynamic Train-Track MDOF\nModel\nHan, X.\n, Li, S. &\nCheng, L.\n,\n2025\n,\nExperimental Vibration Analysis for Civil Engineering\nStructures: EVACES 2025.\nCunha, Á. & Caetano, E.\n(eds.).\nSpringer Science and Business Media Deutschland\nGmbH\n,\nVol. 1\n.\np. 745-752\n8\np.\n(Lecture Notes in Civil Engineering; vol. 674 LNCE).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nA novel two-dimensional Hilbert transform method for structural\nvibration measurement and modal analysis\nXie, K.\n&\nCheng, L.\n,\n15-Feb-2025\n,\nIn:\nMechanical Systems and Signal Processing .\n225\n,\n16\np.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nAS-2DHPME: A Novel Phase-Based Motion Estimation Method for Structural\nDynamics Measurement and Analysis Based on 2D Hilbert Transform and\nSteerable Angular Filter\nXie, K.\n, Lei, D., Du, W. &\nCheng, L.\n,\n2025\n,\nExperimental Vibration Analysis for Civil Engineering\nStructures: EVACES 2025 .\nCunha, Á. & Caetano, E.\n(eds.).\nSpringer Science and Business Media Deutschland\nGmbH\n,\nVol. 1\n.\np. 719-728\n10\np.\n(Lecture Notes in Civil Engineering; vol. 674 LNCE).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in\nBook/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nDamage Detection in Beam Structures Based on Frequency-Domain\nAnalysis Methods for Nonlinear Systems\nZhang, W.\n, Guo, X.,\nCheng, L.\n& Zhang, B.,\n1-May-2025\n,\nIn:\nSensors.\n25\n,\n10\n,\n19\np.\n, s25092901.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nRead more\nClose\nAll (64) publications\nPress/media\nFinanciering voor realiseren veiligere toepassing van metalen in\n3D-printingtechnologie\nCheng, L.\n23/07/2024\nPress/Media\n:\nExpert Comment\n›\nPopular\nNieuwe testmethodiek voor verbeteren kwaliteit 3D-printen |\nEngineeringnet\nCheng, L.\n22/07/2024\nPress/Media\n:\nExpert Comment\n›\nPopular\nNWO Open Technology financiering voor verbeteren kwaliteit 3D\nprinttechnologie\nCheng, L.\n09/07/2024\nPress/Media\n:\nExpert Comment\n›\nPopular\nAll (3) press/media\nView full research profile\nFollow the UG\nfacebook\nlinkedin\nrss\ninstagram\nyoutube\nFunctional\nProvides basic functions and uses anonymized cookies.\nStandard\nProvides optimal operation and uses video cookies, among others.\nComplete\nProvides personalized content and uses marketing cookies.\nSet your cookie preferences. Read our\nprivacy\nand\ncookie disclaimer\nfor more information."
