    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/xulong-tang-14a6a393",
    "homepage_text": "Xulong Tang\nXulong Tang\nAssociate Professor · Department of Computer Science · University of Pittsburgh\nWelcome! I am an associate professor in the Department of Computer Science at the University of Pittsburgh.\n          My research spans computer architecture and systems, with a focus on multi-GPU architectures,\n          high-performance LLM infrastructure and systems, edge AI, and quantum systems.\n          I received my Ph.D. from Penn State and Master from USTC.\nContact:\n210 S. Bouquet Street, SENSQ 6115.\nDepartment of Computer Science\n,\nUniversity of Pittsburgh\n, Pittsburgh, PA 15213\nEmail:\ntax6 AT pitt DOT edu\nCurriculum Vitae\nGoogle Scholar\nDBLP\nLinkedIn\nProspective Students:\nI am looking for 2–3 self-motivated students to join my research group\n    in Fall 2026. Potential research topics include: (i) multi-GPU infrastructure for LLMs,\n    (ii) software–hardware co-design for edge AI, and (iii) fault-tolerant quantum compilers and systems.\n    If you are interested, please send me a brief email along with your CV.\nRecent News\n02/2026\nOne paper accepted at CVPR 2026.\n02/2026\nServing as ASPLOS 2026 General Co-Chair with\nDr. Vijaykrishnan Narayanan\nfrom Penn State.\n11/2025\nCollaborating with URI Physics, CMU, PQI, and Pitt Physics on a $5M quantum project. Thanks to NSF.\n          (\nPitt News\n)\n05/2025\nPromoted to Associate Professor with Tenure from Sep 1st 2025 :-)\n06/2025\nOne paper accepted at ICCAD 2025.\n05/2025\nOne paper accepted at ICML 2025.\n04/2025\nCongrats to\nBingyao Li\n,\n          who will join CSE@UCRiverside as a Tenure-Track Assistant Professor!\n04/2025\nCongrats to\nYue Dai\n,\n          who will join CS@IIT as a Tenure-Track Assistant Professor!\nCurrent PhD Students\nSheng Li\nPh.D. Candidate\nYueqi Wang\nPh.D. Candidate\nYingheng Li\nPh.D. Candidate\nHaoqing Yang\nPh.D. Candidate\nAlumni\nBingyao Li\nPh.D. Candidate\n→ TTAP, CSE@UCRiverside\nYue Dai\nPh.D. Candidate\nco-advised w/\nDr. Youtao Zhang\n· → TTAP, CS@IIT\nTianao Ge\nVisiting Scholar (HKUST GZ)\nAdvisor:\nDr. Hongyuan Liu\nMehrnoosh Raoufi\nPh.D., co-advised w/ Dr. Youtao Zhang\n→ Oracle\nZhongxuan Song\nMaster\nWeizheng Xu\nMaster\nZachary Michael Smith\nMaster\nThomas Matthew Dicarlo\nMaster\nAntony Paul\nMaster\nYuan Yao\nMaster\n→ Bloomberg LP\nZiyu Zhang\nMaster\n→ Apple\nYilun Zhao\nPh.D. Candidate\n→ Ph.D.@ICT-CAS\nQi Xue\nUndergrad\n→ MS@UPenn"
