    "homepage_text": "Zhou Fan\nZhou Fan\nCV\nPublications\n/\nContact\n/\nAbout\n/\nAbout Me\nI received my Ph.D. in Computer Science from\nHarvard University\n, where I was fortunate to be advised by\nProf. David C. Parkes\n. Before that, I obtained a bachelor’s degree from the\nACM Honors Class\n,\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n.\nResearch Interests\nMechanism design, decentralized finance, algorithmic game theory, multi‑agent systems, and machine learning methods such as reinforcement learning and Bayesian optimization.\n© 2023 Zhou Fan. Powered by\nJekyll\nwith theme\nresearcher\n."
  },
