    "homepage_text": "Kun Li\nKun Li（李琨）\nAssistant Professor @ Tsinghua University\nDr. Kun Li is an Assistant Professor at the\nInstitute for AI Industry Research (AIR), Tsinghua University\n. He was previously a Senior Research Scientist at\nMicrosoft Research\n. He received his Ph.D. degree from the\nInstitute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences (ICT, CAS)\n, and conducted research internships at Microsoft Research and\nPeking University\n. His research focuses on HPC, Physical AI and AI for Science.\nHighly self-motivated undergraduate and PhD students are welcome to apply early for long-term internships. If you are interested in Physical AI, AI for Science, and HPC, please feel free to contact me.\nCV\nheadshot.jpg\n2024-03-01\nPHOTO AT Edinburgh\nMore photos ↗\nUpcoming Talks\nMar 27, 2026\nToward Integrated Supercomputing Scalability and AI Modeling for Nuclear Materials Simulation\nTsinghua Interdisciplinary Salon\nInvited by\nProf. Zhe Gao @ THU\nTsinghua University, Beijing\nRead More"
