    "homepage_text": "合肥工业大学主页平台管理系统 Dan Guo--Home--Home\nHome\nScientific Research\nGrants and Awards\nResearch Field\nPaper Publications\nPatents\nPublished Books\nResearch Projects\nTeaching Research\nTeaching Information\nInnovation Project\nStudent Information\nPersonal Homepage\nPersonal Information\nMORE+\nProfessor\nSupervisor of Doctorate Candidates\nSupervisor of Master's Candidates\nSchool/Department:Lab for Multimedia Computing, School of Computer Sci & Information Engineering,   School of Artificial Intelligence Hefei University of Technology (HFUT)\nAdministrative Position:Professor\nEducation Level:Postgraduate (Doctoral)\nBusiness Address:Kejiao A Building, Feicui Campus of HFUT, Hefei, Anhui, China\nGender:Female\nDegree:Doctoral degree\nStatus:Employed\nAlma Mater:Huazhong University of Science and Technology\nHefei University of   Technology\nDan Guo\n+\nGender:Female\nEducation Level:Postgraduate (Doctoral)\nAlma Mater:Huazhong University of Science and Technology\nProfile\nMORE+\nPersonal Profile\nDan Guo\n,\nearned a Ph.D. degree (2010.06) from Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan, China. She then joined Hefei University of Technology in July 2010, initially as a postdoctoral researcher in data mining and she is currently a professor and PhD supervisor in the Laboratory of Media Computing. Her current main research include: computer vision, machine learning, deep learning, and pattern recognition. She has led various projects, such as National Natural Science Foundation of China - General Program (Principal Investigator), National Key Research and Development Program of China (Sub-Project Principal Investigator),  National Natural Science Foundation of China - Key Program\n(Sub-Project Principal Investigator), Natural Science Foundation of Anhui Province - General Program\n(Principal Investigator), Postdoctoral Foundation of Hefei University of Technology - General Program\n(Principal Investigator), etc. She also participated in\nNational Key Research and Development Program of China\n,\nNational Natural Science Foundation of China - Key Program\n, and National Natural Science Foundation of China -\nJoint\nProgram\n.\nAcademic Experience\nAcademic Member\n·\nIEEE Senior Member,\nCCF Senior Member,\nACM Member, AAAI Member，CSIG\nSenior\nMember；\n·\nDeputy Secretary-General of CSIG Multimedia Professional Committee;\n·\nChairman of Computer Vision Committee of Anhui Association of Artificial Intelligence, Director of Anhui Artificial Intelligence Society;\n·\nSecretary General of the Female Professors Association of Hefei University of Technology.\nJournal Reviewer\n·\nCCF-A\n:\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)，IEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP)，IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE),\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS),\nScience China Information Sciences (\nSCIS).\n·\nCCF-A Chinese Journal\n:\nChinese Journal of Computers,  Journal of Software,\nActa Automatica Sinica.\n·\nOther ACM/IEEE Transactions\n:\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\n(AE)\n，IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT)，IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS)，IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics (TCYB), ACM Transactions on Multimedia Computing Communications and Applications (TOMM)\n(AE)\n.\nConference Reviewer/PC Member\n·\nCCF-A\n:\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV),\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS),\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM)(AC), European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV);\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM) Area Chair;\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI)\nSenior Program Committee (SPC) Member.\nExecutive Guest Editor\n·\nIn 2023, proposed and served as the executive guest editor for a special issue of “Deep Learning for Robust Human Body Language Understanding\" on the ACM Transactions on Multimedia Computing, Communications, and Applications (TOMM) journal.\n·\nIn 2023, proposed and served as the\nexecutive\nguest editor for a special issue of \"Trustworthy Cross-Modal Reasoning for Video-Language Understanding\" on the Computer Vision and Image Understanding (CVIU) journal.\nTalk\n·\nIn Honor of Outstanding Academic Performance in Artificial Intelligence, I had been invited as a speaker of 2021 International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI)-SAA Young Elite Symposium.\nCALL FOR PAPERS\n1.  ACM TOMM.\nSpecial issue of ACM TOMM on \"Deep Learning for Robust Human Body Language Understanding\".\nFor more information, please see\nhttps://mc.manuscriptcentral.com/tomm\n，or\nCFP-SI-Deep-Learning-Robust-Human-Body-Language-Understanding.pdf\n2.  CVIU( Computer Vision and Image Understanding).\nSpecial Issue Proposal on \"Trustworthy Cross-Modal Reasoning for Video-Language Understanding\".  For more information, please see\nhttps://www2.cloud.editorialmanager.com/cviu/default2.aspx\n，or\n[SI-Proposal] .pdf\nOther Contacts\n📨\nEMail：guodan@hfut.edu.cn\nWebpage of Our VUT\n：\nhttps://vut-hfut.github.io/\nWelcome partners with the same professional interests to join together!\nEducational Experience\nWork Experience\nNo content\nNo content\nClick:\nMOBILE Version\nThe Last Update Time:\n.\n.\nContact us: No. 193, Tunxi Road, Hefei City, Anhui Province (230009) Post Code: 230009\nCopyright © 2019 Hefei University of  Technology\nAnhui Public Network Security No. 34011102000080 Anhui ICP No. 05018251-1"
  },
