lized Route Recommendation\nJingyuan Wang, Ning Wu, Xin Zhao, Fanzhang Peng and Xin Lin\nSIGKDD 2019 （CCF A）\nGenerating Long and Informative Reviews with Aspect-Aware Coarse-to-Fine Decoding\nJunyi Li, Wayne Xin Zhao, Ji-Rong Wen and Yang Song\nACL 2019 （CCF A）\n2018\nJoint Representation Learning for Location-based Social Networks with Multi-Grained Sequential Contexts\nZhao Xin, Feifan Fan, Ji-Rong Wen and Edward Y Chang\nTo appear in ACM TKDD 2018.******(CCF B, SCI).\nAutomatically Learning Topics and Diculty Levels of Problems in Online Judge Systems\nXin Zhao, Wenhui Zhang, Yulan He, Xing Xie and Ji-Rong Wen\nTo appear in ACM TOIS 2018.******(CCF A, SCI).\nCharacterizing and Predicting Early Reviewers for Effective Product Marketing on E-Commerce Websites\nTing Bai, Wanye Xin Zhao, Yulan He, Jian-Yun Nie, Ji-Rong Wen\nTo appear in IEEE TKDE 2018.******(CCF A, SCI).\nAn Attribute-aware Neural Attentive Model for Next Basket Recommendation\nTing Bai, Jian-Yun Nie, Xin Zhao, Yutao Zhu, Pan Du and Ji-Rong Wen\nTo appear in SIGIR 2018, short paper (CCF A).\nImproving Sequential Recommendation with Knowledge-enhanced Memory Networks\nJin Huang, Wayne Xin Zhao, Hongjian Dou, Ji-Rong Wen and Edward Y. Chang\nTo appear in SIGIR 2018, full paper (CCF A).\nHeterogeneous Information Network Embedding for Recommendation\nChuan Shi, Binbin Hu, Wayne Xin Zhao and Philip S. Yu\nTo appear in TKDE ******(CCF A, SCI).\n-hyperdoc2vec: Distributed Representations of Hypertext Documents\nJialong Han, Yan Song, Wayne Xin Zhao, Shuming Shi and Haisong Zhang\nTo appear in ACL 2018 (CCF A).\nMulti-Turn Response Selection for Chatbots with Deep Attention Matching Network\nXiangyang Zhou, Lu Li, Daxiang Dong, Yi Liu, Ying Chen, Wayne Xin Zhao, Dianhai Yu and Hua Wu\nTo appear in ACL 2018 (CCF A).\nLeveraging Meta-path based Context for Top N recommendation with Co-attention mechanism\nBinbin Hu, Chuan Shi, Xin Zhao and Philip S. Yu\nTo appear in KDD 2018 (CCF A).\nLocal and Global Information Fusion for Top-N Recommendation in Heterogeneous Information Network\nBinbin Hu, Chuan Shi, Xin Zhao and Tianchi Yang\nTo appear in CIKM 2018 (CCF B, short paper)\n2017\nA Probabilistic Li...[truncated]"
