    "homepage_text": "Home | Xinyu Dai\nXinyu Dai\nWelcome!\nI am a Ph.D. student in Economics at Brown University. My research connects econometrics, decision theory, and machine learning, with a focus on robust data-driven decision-making in dynamic and potentially misspecified environments.\nResearch Interests\nEconometrics\nDecision Theory\nMachine Learning\nRobust Statistics"
