  "serper::Huabin Liu": {
    "homepage": "https://r00kie-liu.github.io/",
    "emails": [
      "huabinliu@sjtu.edu.cn"
    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/R00Kie-Liu",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Huabin Liu's Homepage\nContact\nPublications\nBio\nHuabin Liu\nPh.D.\nShanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU)\nhuabinliu (at) sjtu.edu.cn\nShort Bio\nCurrently, Huabin Liu (刘华斌) is a researcher at the DeepLearning Lab of\nAnt Research Institute\n, whose research focuses on\ndiffusion large language model (dLLM) pre-training\n, with an emphasis on efficient training paradigms and MoE architectures.\nI received my Ph.D. from Shanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU), working with\nProf. Weiyao Lin\non\nvideo understanding and analysis\n. From 2024 to 2025, I visited to the\nVISLab\nat University of Amsterdam as a visiting researcher for 1 year, advised by\nProf. Cees Snoek\nand\nProf. Filip Ilievski\n. From 2023 to 2024, I was a research intern at the Shanghai AI Lab, working with\nXiao Sun\n.During 2019, I was lucky to be a research intern at Aibee, supervised by\nDian Li\nand\nJianguo Li\n. Prior to this, I obtained my bachelor’s degree from\nXidian University\nin 2019.\nNews\n[02/2026]\n😁 Paper about\nFew-shot action recogition\nis accepted to\nTPAMI\n.\n[02/2026]\n✍🏻 Our team release\nLLaDA 2.1\n, which supports token editing now!\n[12/2025]\n🤖 Our team release the largest diffusion large language model (dLLM)\nLLaDA 2.0\n[11/2025]\n🥳 Paper about\nStreaming Video Reasoning\nis accepted to\nAAAI\n.\n[06/2025]\n👨‍🎓 I successfully defended my\nPh.D.\ndissertation at SJTU！\n[06/2025]\n😊 Paper about\nvideo recognition\nis accepted to\nTCSVT\n.\n[02/2025]\n😭 Paper about\nvideo QA & reasoning\nis accepted to\nCVPR 2025\n, many thanks to Filip and Cees!\n[09/2024]\n😊 Paper about\nvideo causal discovery & reasoning\nis accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024\n.\n[07/2024]\n🥳 Paper about\nvideo QA & reasoning\nis accepted to\nECCV 2024\n.\n[03/2024]\n😃 Paper about\ndense video captioning\nis accepted to\nCVPR 2024\n.\n[01/2024]\n🛫 Start my visit to the\nVISLab\nat University of Amsterdam as a\nvisiting researcher\n.\n[12/2023]\n😆 Paper about\ninstructional video understanding\nis accepted to\nAAAI 2024\n.\n[07/2023]\n😚 Paper about\nhuman-centric video analysis\nis accepted to\nIJCV\njournal.\n[07/2022]\n😁 Paper about\nfew-shot action recognition\nis accepted to\nACM MM 2022\n.\n[11/2021]\n😊 Paper about\nfew-shot action recognition\nis accepted to\nAAAI 2022\n.\n[05/2021]\n🥳 Paper about\nfine-grained image recognition\nis accepted to\nTMM\njournal.\n[12/2020]\n🏆 Our hosted\nHiEve Challenge\nwon the\nbest Challenge organization award\nin ACM MM 2020.\nTech Report\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n[\nDBLP\n]\nReport\nLLaDA2.1: Speeding Up Text Diffusion via Token Editing\nInclusion AI Team, Ant Group\nTechnical Report, 2026\nPDF\nProject Page\nBibTex\nReport\nLLaDA2.0: Scaling Up Diffusion Language Models to 100B\nInclusion AI Team, Ant Group\nTechnical Report, 2025\nPDF\nProject Page\nBibTex\nPublications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n[\nDBLP\n]\nTPAMI\nFew-shot Action Recognition via Intra-and Inter-Video Information Maximization\nHuabin Liu\n, Weiyao Lin, Tieyuan Chen, Yuxi Li, Shuyuan Li, John See\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\n, 2026.\nPDF\nBibTex\nTPAMI\nMECD+: Unlocking Event-Level Causal Graph Discovery for Video Reasoning\nTieyuan Chen,\nHuabin Liu\n, Yi Wang, Yihang Chen, Tianyao He, Chaofan Gan, Huanyu He, Weiyao Lin\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\n, 2025.\nPDF\nBibTex\nAAAI\nCogStream: Context-guided Streaming Video Question Answering\nZicheng Zhao*, Kangyu Wang*, Shijie Li*, Rui Qian, Weiyao Lin,\nHuabin Liu\n†\n(\n†\nCorresponding author\n，\n* Equal Contribution\n)\nAAAI, 2026\nPDF\nProject Page\nBibTex\nTCSVT\nCSTA: Spatial-Temporal Causal Adaptive Learning for Exemplar-Free Video Class-Incremental Learning\nTieyuan Chen,\nHuabin Liu\n†\n, Chern Hong Lim, John See, Xing Gao, Junhui Hou, Weiyao Lin\n†\n(\n†\nCorresponding author\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\n(TSCVT)\n, 2025.\nPDF\nBibTex\nCVPR\nCommonsense Video Question Answering through Video-Grounded Entailment Tree Reasoning\nHuabin Liu\n, Filip Ilievski, Cees G. M. Snoek\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2025.\nPDF\nBibTex\nNeurIPS\nMECD: Unlocking Multi-Event Causal Discovery in Video Reasoning\nTieyuan Chen*,\nHuabin Liu*\n, Tianyao He, Yihang Chen, Chaofan Gan, Xiao Ma, Cheng Zhong, Yang Zhang, Yingxue Wang, Hui Lin, Weiyao Lin (\n* Co-first author\n)\nNeural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2024\nPDF\nCode\nSpotlight\nECCV\nTimeCraft: Navigate Weakly-Supervised Temporal Grounded Video Question Answering via Bi-directional Reasoning\nHuabin Liu\n, Xiao Ma, Cheng Zhong, Yang Zhang, Weiyao Lin\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n, 2024\nPDF\nBibTex\nCVPR\nDIBS: Enhancing Dense Video Captioning with Unlabeled Videos via Pseudo Boundary Enrichment and Online Refinement\nHao Wu*,\nHuabin Liu*\n, Yu Qiao, Xiao Sun (\n* Co-first author\n)\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2024.\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nIJCV\nAchieving Procedure-Aware Instructional Video Correlation Learning under Weak Supervision from a Collaborative Perspective\nTianyao He,\nHuabin Liu\n, Zeling Ni, Yuxi Li, Xiao Ma, Cheng Zhong, Yang Zhang, Yingxue Wang, Weiyao Lin\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(IJCV)\n, 2024\nPDF\nCode\nAAAI\nCollaborative Weakly Supervised Video Correlation Learning for Procedure-Aware Instructional Video Analysis\nTianyao He,\nHuabin Liu\n, Yuxi Li, Xiao Ma, Cheng Zhong, Yang Zhang, Weiyao Lin\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2024.\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nIJCV\nHiEve: A Large-Scale Benchmark for Human-Centric Video Analysis in Complex Events\nWeiyao Lin,\nHuabin Liu\n, Shizhan Liu, Yuxi Li, Guojun Qi, Nicu Sebe\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(IJCV)\nPDF\nProject Page\nBibTex\nACM MM\nTask-adaptive Spatial-Temporal Video Sampler for Few-shot Action Recognition\nHuabin Liu\n, Weixian Lv, John See, Weiyao Lin\nACM International Conference on Multimedia\n(ACM MM)\n, 2023\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nCVPR\nSpeed Up Object Detection on Gigapixel-Level Images With Patch Arrangement\nJiahao Fan,\nHuabin Liu\n, Wenjie Yang, John See, Weiyao Lin\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2023.\nPDF\nBibTex\nAAAI\nTA2N: Two-Stage Action Alignment Network for Few-shot Action Recognition\nShuyuan Li,\nHuabin Liu*\n, Rui Qian, Yuxi Li, John See, Mengjuan Fei, Xiaoyuan Yu, Weiyao Lin (\n* Co-first author\n)\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2023.\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nTMM\nLearning scale-consistent attention part network for fine-grained image recognition\nHuabin Liu\n, Jianguo Li, Dian Li, John See, Weiyao Lin\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n(TMM)\n, 24, 2902-2913\nPDF\nBibTex\nBMVC\nTemporal Alignment via Event Boundary for Few-shot Action Recongnition\nShuyuan Li*,\nHuabin Liu*\n, Mengjuan Fei, Xiaoyuan Yu, Weiyao Lin (* Equal Contribution)\nBritish Machine Vision Conference\n(BMVC)\n, 2021\nPDF\nBibTex\nICCV\nEnhancing Self-supervised Video Representation Learning via Multi-level Feature Optimization\nRui Qian, Yuxi Li,\nHuabin Liu\n, John See, Shuangrui Ding, Dian Li, Weiyao Lin\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2021\nPDF\nCode\nBibTex\nTOMM\nScene Graph Lossless Compression with Adaptive Prediction for Objects and Relations\nWeiyao Lin, Yufeng Zhang, Wenrui Dai,\nHuabin Liu\n, John See, Hongkai Xiong\nACM Transactions on Multimedia Computing, Communications and Applications\n(ACM TOMM)\n, 2024\nPDF\nAwards\n[06/2025]\nOutstanding Ph.D. Graduate of SJTU.\n[12/2023]\nFounded by China Scholarship Council (CSC) as a visting researcher for 1 year\n[09/2022]\nCETC scholarship for Ph.D. students in SJTU (¥20000).\n[10/2019]\nSelected as member of Wu Wenjun (\n吴文俊\n) AI honorary PhD student in SJTU (< 1%).\n[06/2019]\nOutstanding undergraduate student of Xidian University (XDU)\n[2015-2018]\nFirst Prize Scholarship of Xidian University (< 4%), 3 times\n[2015-2018]\nOutstanding Student of Xidian University (< 3%), 2 times\n[10/2017]\nFirst prize of National college students Mathematical Contest in Shaanxi (< 3%)\nContact\nAddress:\nNo.800, Dongchuan Road, Minhang District, Shanghai, China\nEmail:\nhuabinliu (at) sjtu.edu.cn\nWechat:\na377323665"
