    "homepage_text": "Rui-Qi Wu - Academic Portfolio\nRui-Qi Wu (武睿祺)\nScholar\nGithub\nZhihu\nI am currently a\nPh.D. candidate\nat\n@MCG-NKU\n, Nankai University. My primary research interests include\nAIGC (AI-Generated Content)\nand\nEmbodied AI\n, with expertise in generative models and robust vision algorithms.\nCurrently serving as a\nBeidou Research Intern\nat\n@MeiGen-AI, Meituan\n. Previously gained significant industry experience at\n@HorizonRobotics\n,\n@megvii-research\n, and\n@StepFun\n.\nExperience\nRecent News\nSep 2025\nOne paper accepted by\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\nAug 2025\nReceived the\nMeituan Talent Program Internship Offer\nand started as a Beidou Intern.\nJun 2025\nReleased code for\nEmbodiedGen\n, a 3D world model.\nFeb 2025\nOne paper accepted by\nCVPR 2025\n.\nJul 2024\nOne paper accepted by\nECCV 2024\n.\nFeb 2024\nOne paper accepted by\nCVPR 2024\n.\nNov 2023\nServed as reviewer for CVPR 2024.\nSep 2023\nServed as reviewer for\nIEEE TPAMI\nand IEEE TCSVT.\nJul 2023\nServed as reviewer for AAAI 2024.\nMar 2023\nOne paper accepted by\nIEEE TMM\n.\nFeb 2023\nOne paper accepted by\nCVPR 2023\n.\nJan 2023\nPaper awarded\nOral Presentation\nat AAAI 2023.\nView More News\nPublications\nHonors & Awards\nNational Scholarship, 2023\n(Top 0.2% student in China).\nSecond Runner-up\n(Team Feedforward) in\nRAW Image Blind De-noising\n.\nSecond Runner-up\n(Team Feedback) in\nNight Photography Rendering Challenge, CVPR Workshop 2022\n.\nKaggle Bronze Medal\n(Top 7%), Cassava Leaf Disease Classification."
