    "homepage_text": "卢惠民 - 确实激发创新\nHuimin Lu's Homepage卢惠民的个人主页\n2018-05-17 18:30\n个人简介：\n卢惠民，男，1999年考入国防科技大学，2010年于国防科技大学获得博士学位，现为国防科技大学智能科学学院机器人研究中心教授，博士生导师。主要研究方向为机器人智能感知、多机器人协同控制、智能人机交互。主持和作为科研骨干参与国家自然科学基金、国家863、国家重点研发计划、科技委、原总装预研、预研重点基金等课题10余项。在国内外知名期刊和会议上发表高水平论文90余篇，在科学出版社和国防工业出版社出版学术专著2部。获得国家发明专利、国防专利等知识产权10余项。多年来一直指导学生参加RoboCup、Robocon、UGVC等国际国内高水平机器人学术/学科竞赛并取得优异成绩，获得湖南省科技进步一等奖1项，中国自动化学会、军队级、湖南省和校级教学成果奖8项。\nResearch group's homepage:\nhttps://nubot.trustie.net/\nMy page on ResearchGate:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Huimin_Lu\nSelected Publications:\n24.\nChenghao Shi\n,\nXieyuanli\r\nChen\n,\nKaihong Huang\n,\nJunhao Xiao\n,\nHuimin Lu\n,\nCyrill\r\nStachniss\n. Keypoint Matching for Point Cloud Registration Using\r\nMultiplex Dynamic Graph Attention Networks.\nIEEE Robotics and Automation\r\nLetters\n, vol. 6, no. 4, pp. 8221-8228, Oct. 2021.\n23. Wei Dai, Yaru Liu,\nHuimin Lu*\n, Zhiqiang Zheng and Zongtan Zhou. A Shared\r\nControl Framework for Human-Multirobot Foraging With Brain-Computer Interface.\nIEEE\r\nRobotics and Automation Letters\n,vol. 6, no. 4, pp. 6305-6312, Oct. 2021.\n22.\nWei Dai\n,\nYaru Liu\n,\nHuimin Lu*\n,\nZongtan Zhou\n,\nZhiqiang Zhen\ng\n. Shared\r\nControl Based on a Brain-Computer Interface for Human-Multirobot Cooperation,\nIEEE\r\nRobotics and Automation Letters\n, vol. 6, no. 3, pp. 6123-6130, July 2021.\n21. Hui\r\nPeng, Meiping Wu,\nHuimin Lu*\n, Junzheng Wang, Junhao Xiao, Yuan\r\nHuang, Dawei Shi.  A Distributed Strategy to\r\nAttitude Following of the Multi-DOF Parallel Electrical Manipulator Systems.\nIEEE\r\nTransactions on Industrial Electronics\n, 2021.\n20.\nHuimin\nLu*\n,\r\nWeijia Yao, Liangming Chen. Distributed Multi-robot Circumnavigation with\r\nDynamic Spacing and Time Delay.\nJournal of Intelligent & Robotic Systems\n,\n99(1): 165-182, 2020.\nhttps://doi.org/10.1007/s10846-019-01111-0\n.\n19.\nJunhao Xiao\n,\nDan Xiong, Qinghua Yu, Kaihong Huang,\nHuimin Lu\n, Zhiwen Zeng\n. A Real-Time Sliding Window based Visual-Inertial Odometry for MAVs.\nIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\n, DOI: 10.1109/TII.2019.2959380, December 2019.\n18.\nJunchong Ma,\nHui\nmin Lu*\n,\nJunhao Xiao\n, Zhiwen Zeng, Zhiqiang Zheng. Multi-robot Target\r\nEncirclement Control with Collision Avoidance via Deep Reinforcement Learning.\nJournal of Intelligent\r\n& Robotic Systems\n,\n99(3):\n371–386, 2020\n.\n17.\nWei Dai,\nHuimin Lu*\n, Junhao Xiao, Zhiwen Zeng\n, Zhiqiang Zheng. Multi-Robot Dynamic Task Allocation for Exploration and Destruction.\nJournal of Intelligent & Robotic Systems\n,\n98(2):\n455–479\n, 2020\n.\n16.\nMing Xu, Changlin Han,\nHuimin Lu\n, Junhao Xiao, Jingsheng Tang, Zongtan Zhou. The design of the bio‐magnetic field sensor without magnetic shielding.\nInternational Journal of Humanoid Robotics\n, to appear, 2019.\n15.\n熊丹,\n卢惠民*\n, 肖军浩, 郑志强. 具有尺度和旋转适应性的长时间目标跟踪.\n自动化学报\n,\nVol. 45, No. 2, pp. 289\n-304,\n2019.\n14.\nWeijia Yao,\nHuimin Lu*\n, Zhiwen Zeng,\nJunhao Xiao\n, Zhiqiang Zheng. Distributed Static and\r\nDynamic Circumnavigation Control with Arbitrary Spacings for a Heterogeneous\r\nMulti-robot System.\nJournal of Intelligent & Robotic Systems\n, Vol. 94, No. 3-4, pp. 883-905, 2019\n.\n13.\nWei Dai,\nHuimin Lu*\n,\nJunhao Xiao\n,\nZhiqiang Zheng.\nTask Allocation without Communication Based on\nIncomplete Information Game Theory for Multi-robot\nSystems.\nJournal of Intelligent & Robotic Systems\n,\nVol. 94, No. 3-4, pp. 841-856, 2019\n. (\naccompanying video\n)(\nsource code\n)\n12. Qinghua Yu, Jie Liang, Junhao Xiao,\nHuimin Lu\n, Zhiqiang Zheng. A Novel\r\nPerspective Invariant Feature Transform for RGB-D Images.\nComputer Vision and\r\nImage Understanding\n,\nVolume 167\n, pp. 109-120,\r\nFebruary 2018.\n(\nsource code\n)\n11. Junhao Xiao, Dan Xiong, Weijia Yao, Qinghua Yu,\nHuimin Lu\n*\nand Zhiqiang\r\nZheng. Building Software System and Simulation Environment for RoboCup MSL\r\nSoccer Robots Based on ROS and Gazebo.\nSpringer Book on Robot Operating System\r\n(ROS)\n– The Complete Reference (Volume 2), pp. 597-631, Springer, 2017.\n10. Lilian Zhang,\nHuimin\r\nLu\n, Xiaoping Hu, Reinhard Koch. Vanishing Point Estimation and Line\r\nClassification in a Manhattan World with a Unifying Camera Model.\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n,\r\nVol. 117,\nNo. 2,\npp.\r\n111-130, 2016.\n9. Dan Xiong, Junhao Xiao,\nHuimin Lu\n, Zhiwen Zeng, Qinghua Yu, Kaihong Huang, Xiaodong Yi,\r\nZhiqiang Zheng. The Design of an Intelligent Soccer-Playing Robot.\nIndustrial Robot: An International Journal\n,\r\nVol. 43, No.1, pp. 91-102, 2016.\n8.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n, Xun Li, Hui Zhang, and\r\nZhiqiang Zheng. Robust Place Recognition Based on Omnidirectional Vision and\r\nReal-time Local Visual Features for Mobile Robots.\nAdvanced Robotics\n, Vol.27, No.18, pp.1439-1453, 2013.\n7.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n, Xun Li, Hui Zhang, Mei Hu\r\nand Zhiqiang Zheng. Robust and Real-time Self-Localization Based on\r\nOmnidirectional Vision for Soccer Robots.\nAdvanced\r\nRobotics\n, Vol.27, No.10, pp.799-811, 2013.\n6.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n, Shaowu Yang, Hui Zhang,\r\nZhiqiang Zheng. A Robust Omnidirectional Vision Sensor for Soccer Robots.\nMechatronics\n, Elsevier, Vol.21, No.2,\r\npp. 373-389, 2011.\n5.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n, Zhiqiang Zheng. Two Novel\r\nReal-Time Local Visual Features for Omnidirectional Vision.\nPattern Recognition\n, Elsevier, Vol.43,\r\nNo.12, pp. 3938-3949, 2010.\n4.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n,\r\nLixing Jiang, Andreas Zell. Long Range Traversable Region Detection Based on\r\nSuperpixels Clustering for Mobile Robots.\nProceedings of the 2015 IEEE/RSJ\r\nInternational Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS 2015)\n,\r\nHamburg, Germany, September 28~October 02, 2015, pp. 546-552.\n3.\nHuimin Lu\n*\n, Hui Zhang, Shaowu Yang,\r\nZhiqiang Zheng. Camera Parameters Auto-Adjusting Technique for Robust Robot\r\nVision.\nProceedings of the 2010 IEEE\r\nInternational Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA 2010)\n, Anchorage,\r\nAlaska, USA, May 5~8, 2010, pp. 1518-1523.\n2.\n卢惠民\n，肖军浩，郑志强 等. ROS与中型组足球机器人. 国防工业出版社，2016年10月.\n1. 郑志强，\n卢惠民\n，刘斐. 机器人视觉系统研究. 科学出版社，2015.\n载入中..."
