    "homepage_text": "Jingtao Hu\nJingtao Hu(\n胡 婧 韬\n)\nP.h.D Candidate\nPRMI Group\nNUDT\nLocation: Sanyi Road , Kaifu District, Changsha, Hunan, China\nNews\n|\nResearch Interest\n|\nEducation\n|\nPublications\n|\nProjects\n|\nServices\n|\nAwards\nEmail: hujingtao17@nudt.edu.cn (prior);      sunshinnne@foxmail.com\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\r\n[\nGitHub\n]\r\n[\nORCID\n] \r\n[\n微信\n]\nResearch Interest\nI'm a resracher of machine learning and data mining, especially on graph anomaly detection, video anomaly detection. Currently, I focus on the following research topics:\nAnomaly Detection\nSelf-supervised Learning\nEducation\n2020.03-Now            Ph.D in\nSchool of Computer\n,\nNUDT\n.               Supervisor: Prof.\nEn Zhu\n2017.9-2020.1        M.E. in\nSchool of Computer\n,\nNUDT\n.         Supervisor: Prof.\nEn zhu\n2013.9-2017.6        B.E. in\nSchool of Computer\n,\nBUAA\n.\nPublications\nPersonal homepage on dblp\nPersonal homepage on ResearchGate\nAwards\n2020, Outstanding Student |\n优秀xx\n2019, School Schloarship |\n学校奖学金\n2016, Mathematical Contest In Modeling |\nMeritorious Winner"
