    "homepage_text": "IMS Affiliated Faculty – Institute of Marine Sciences\nInstitute of Marine Sciences\nIMS Affiliated Faculty\nFaculty are hired by their respective departments, to which they owe primary responsibility; however, the institute continues to be involved in the identification of hiring and faculty needs of the cross-disciplinary marine program through active involvement in new faculty searches and in support of departmental recommendations. Affiliated faculty and researchers are those individuals that utilize any of the ORU’s resources (space, seawater, equipment, etc) and/or individuals whose research falls within one of the seven research clusters supported by IMS. IMS only appoints affiliates in the ORU based on the individual researchers request to be associated with the ORU.\nRegular Faculty\nSuzanne H Alonzo\nTitle\nAssociate Vice Provost\nDepartment\nAcademic Affairs\nPhone\n831-502-7706 (Office)\nCampus Email\nshalonzo@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nAlonzo Lab Website\nGoogle Scholar Profile\nOffice Location\nCSC Coastal Biology Building, 223\nOffice Hours\nVaries- Please email to make an appointment.\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nAnimal Behavior\nSummary of Expertise\nSexual selection, social behavior, evolutionary theory, quantitative methods in ecology and evolution\nClaudie Beaulieu\nTitle\nAssociate professor\nDepartment\nOcean Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-5152\nCampus Email\nclbeauli@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nOcean & Climate Data Science\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A443\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nClimate Change\nSummary of Expertise\nOcean & climate variability and change, applied statistics\nRoxanne Santina Beltran\nTitle\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n8314594958\nCampus Email\nrsbeltra@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nLab Website\nGoogle Scholar\nOffice Location\nCSC Coastal Biology Building, 215\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nEcology\nSummary of Expertise\nThe Beltran Lab studies species interactions and global change in the open ocean, through the lens of marine mammal movement, behavior, and demography. Most research leverages the six-decade mark-recapture program of northern elephant seals at Año Nuevo in California along with environmental and biologging data to understand the role of among-individual variation in ecological patterns and evolutionary processes. Roxanne’s lab group integrates research with education activities to foster a highly collaborative community of undergraduate and graduate students, technicians, and postdoctoral researchers. She also advocates for diversity, equity, and inclusion in STEM – particularly in field settings – by undertaking and implementing research on education equity.\nGiacomo Bernardi\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-459-5124\nCampus Email\nbernardi@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nBernardi Lab\nSelected Publications\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, A248\nOffice Hours\nby appointment\nTerrence J Blackburn\nTitle\nAssociate Professor\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nCampus Email\nterryb@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nUCSC geochronology\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A108\nOffice Hours\nBy appointment\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nGeology\nSummary of Expertise\nU-Pb Geochronology\nMark H Carr\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-246-3524\nCampus Email\nmhcarr@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nCarr lab\nSelected Publications\nGoogle Scholar\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, 254 A\nOffice Hours\nBy appointment\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nEcology\nSummary of Expertise\nEcology of coastal marine ecosystems\nShaowei Chen\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nChemistry & Biochemistry Department\nPhone\n831-459-5841 (Office)\nCampus Email\nshaowei@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nChen Research Group\nOffice Location\nPhysical Sciences Building, Physical Sciences Bldg 148\nOffice Hours\nTBA\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nChemistry\nSummary of Expertise\nSynthesis, characterization, and manipulation of novel functional nanomaterials (metals and semiconductors); their long-range ordered assemblies and related nanoscale electron transfer; applications in fuel cells, photovoltaics and electronic devices\nWeixin Cheng\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEnvironmental Studies Department\nPhone\n831-459-5317\nCampus Email\nwxcheng@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nCheng’s Web page at UCSC\nRhizosphere Image Gallery\nOffice Location\nInterdisciplinary Sciences Building, 430\nSummary of Expertise\nRhizosphere Ecology, Carbon and Nitrogen Cycles, Isotope Ecology, Ecosystem Responses to Environmental Change\nPatrick Y Chuang\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-1501\nCampus Email\npchuang@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nMy website\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A254\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nClimate Change\nSummary of Expertise\nAtmospheric Physics and Chemistry\nMatthew E Clapham\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-1276\nCampus Email\nmclapham@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nWebsite\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A208\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nPaleontology\nSummary of Expertise\nInvertebrate Paleontology, Paleoecology\nDaniel P Costa\nTitle\nDistinguished Professor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-459-2786\nCampus Email\ncosta@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nCosta Lab\nOffice Location\nCSC Coastal Biology Auxiliary Building, CBB 256\nOffice Hours\nBy appointment\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nBehavioral Ecology\nSummary of Expertise\nB.A., University of California, Los Angeles\nPh.D., University of California, Santa Cruz\nPostdoctoral, Scripps Institution of Oceanography\nDonald A Croll\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-459-4581\nCampus Email\ndcroll@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nLab Web Page\nSelected Publications\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, 248B\nOffice Hours\nBy appointment\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nConservation\nRobin C Dunkin\nTitle\nFaculty Director | Teaching and Learning Center\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-502-8652\nCampus Email\nrdunkin@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nDunkin Lab Home\nTeaching and Learning Center\nOffice Location\nCSC Coastal Biology Building, 211\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nBiology\nChristopher A Edwards\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nOcean Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-3734\nCampus Email\ncedwards@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nUC Santa Cruz Ocean Modeling and Data Assimilation\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, 447\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nOceanography\nJerome Fiechter\nTitle\nAssociate Professor\nDepartment\nOcean Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-4736\nCampus Email\nfiechter@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nJerome Fiechter\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A450\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nOceanography\nSummary of Expertise\nPhysical and Biological Oceanography, Dynamics of Coastal Marine Ecosystems; Numerical Modeling.\nAndrew T Fisher\nTitle\nDistinguished Professor\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-5598\nCampus Email\nafisher@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nUCSC Hydrogeology\nThe Recharge Initiative\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A209\nOffice Hours\nvaries by quarter\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nWater\nSummary of Expertise\nHydrogeology, Water Resources, Crustal Studies, Heat Flow, Coupled Modeling, Geothermal Tool Development\nAlexa Fredston\nTitle\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment\nOcean Sciences Department\nCampus Email\nafredsto@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nLab Website\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A455\nAri Seth Friedlaender\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nOcean Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-000-0000\nCampus Email\narsfried@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nBio-Telemetry and Behavioral Ecology\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, OH\nBorja Gonzalez Reguero\nTitle\nAssociate Professor (provision)\nDepartment\nCoastal Science & Policy Program\nPhone\n831-459-1459\nCampus Email\nbreguero@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nGoogle Scholar\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, 209\nOffice Hours\nMondays – 1-3pm; Wednesdays 1-3pm\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nCoastal Science\nGary B Griggs\nTitle\nDistinguished Professor of Earth Sciences\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-5006\nCampus Email\ngriggs@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\ngary-griggs.com\nGary’s personal web site\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A-361\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nClimate Change\nSummary of Expertise\nCoastal Processes and Hazards, Coastal Engineering, Impacts and Adaptation to Sea Level Rise\nTheodore R Holman\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nChemistry & Biochemistry Department\nPhone\n831-459-5884 (Office)\nCampus Email\nholman@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nHolman Research Web Site\nOffice Location\nPhysical Sciences Building, 250\nOffice Hours\nTBA\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nBiochemistry\nSummary of Expertise\nBiochemistry, bioinorganic chemistry, biophysics, enzymology, inhibitor discovery, and the role of fatty acid oxidation in human disease, such as stroke, diabetes and blood coagulation\nJeremy Keith Hourigan\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEarth & Planetary Sciences Department\nPhone\n831-459-2873\nCampus Email\nhourigan@ucsc.edu\nOffice Location\nEarth & Marine Sciences, A221\nSummary of Expertise\nThermochronology, structural geology and tectonics\nAnne R Kapuscinski\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEnvironmental Studies Department\nPhone\n831-502-8722 (faster to reach me by email)\nCampus Email\nakapusci@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nKapuscinski – Sarker Lab Group\nCoastal Science and Policy website\nKapuscinski Office Hours Sign Up\nOffice Location\nLong Marine Lab Ocean Health Building, 250A\nOffice Hours\nVaries by academic term\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nAgroecology and Agriculture\nKathleen M Kay\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nPhone\n831-459-3446\nCampus Email\nkmkay@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\nKay Plant Evolution Lab\nOffice Location\nCSC Coastal Biology Building, 258\nOffice Hours\nby appointment\nFaculty Areas of Expertise\nEvolution\nSummary of Expertise\nPlant Evolutionary Ecology, Evolutionary Genetics\nJoanna L Kelley\nTitle\nProfessor\nDepartment\nEcology & Evolutionary Biology Department\nCampus Email\njokelley@ucsc.edu\nWebsite\n...[truncated]"
