    "homepage_text": "Zhuohang Yu | The Terrones Research Group\nSelect Page\nZhuohang Yu\nHolden received his B.S. in Physics from the Pennsylvania State University. He joined the Terrones group as a Ph.D. student in Materials Science & Engineering in Fall 2020. Holden mainly works on alternating physical properties of 2D materials (TMDs, graphene, 2D metals, etc.) via defect engineering."
