    "homepage_text": "Dong Wei\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nDong Wei\nDong Wei\nHello! I'm Dong Wei (\n魏冬\n). I'm an Assistant Professor of Economics\nat\nUC Santa Cruz\n.\nMy main research area is\nmicroeconomic theory\n, focusing on questions in\ni\nnformation economics\nand\ndynamic games.\nI received my Ph.D. in Economics from UC Berkeley in 2020.\nContact Information:\nDepartment of Economics\nUniversity of California, Santa Cruz\nEngineering 2, Room 423\n1156 High Street\nSanta Cruz, CA 95064\nPhone: (831) 459-5241\nEmail:\ndwei10@ucsc.edu\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
