    "homepage_text": "Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJun Wu, Ph.D.\nAbout Me\nI am a Senior Research Director at Wharton Research Data Service (WRDS), the Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania.\nI received Ph.D. in Finance from Kelley School of Business, Indiana University Bloomington. I joined WRDS in 2017.\nMy research interests are market microstructure, financial market integrity, best execution and order routing, investments, and empirical asset pricing.\nMember of Shanghai Calligraphers Association, 2006 - present.\nContact:\nEmail:\njun5@wharton.upenn.edu\nWebsite:\nhttp://www.junwu5.com\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
