    "homepage_text": "About ｜ 大礎\nTCK\nAbout\nPublications\nCV\nSoftware\nBlog\n大礎\nTCK\nTa-Chu Kao\nAbout\n2021.11.05\nI am a postdoc at the Gatsby Computational Neuroscience Unit working with Professor Professor Maneesh Sahani.\nPreviously, I was a PhD student at the Computational and Biological Learning lab working with Dr Guillaume Hennequin at the University of Cambridge (\nlab website\n).\nMy research interests lies at the intersection of motor control, machine learning, and control theory.\nOccasionally, I contribute to\nOwl\n, an open-source numerical computing library in OCaml.\nYou can reach me at\nc (dot) kao (at) ucl (dot) ac (dot) uk\n."
