    "homepage_text": "Pieter-Jan Hoedt\n      -  JKU & KUK Research Portal\nJKU & KUK Research Portal Home\nHelp & FAQ\nLink opens in a new tab\nEnglish\nDeutsch\nSearch content at JKU & KUK Research Portal\nView Scopus Profile\nPieter-Jan Hoedt\nDI Dr.\nInstitute for Machine Learning\nLIT Artificial Intelligence Lab\nEmail\npieter-jan.hoedt\njku\nat\nResearch output\n6\nConference proceedings\n2\nPreprint\n1\nArticle\n1\nDoctoral thesis\n1\nMore\n1\nMaster's / Diploma thesis\nBio-xLSTM: Generative modeling, representation and in-context learning of biological and chemical sequences\nSchmidinger, N.,\nSchneckenreiter, L.\n,\nSeidl, P.\n,\nSchimunek, J.\n,\nHoedt, P.-J.\n,\nBrandstetter, J.\n,\nMayr, A.\n,\nLuukkonen, S. I. M.\n,\nHochreiter, S.\n&\nKlambauer, G.\n,\nNov 2024\n,\n38 p.\n(arXiv.org; no. 2411.04165).\nResearch output\n:\nWorking paper and reports\n›\nPreprint\nHyperPCM: Robust Task-Conditioned Modeling of Drug--Target Interactions\nPetersson Svensson, E.,\nHoedt, P.-J.\n,\nHochreiter, S.\n&\nKlambauer, G.\n,\n08 Apr 2024\n,\nIn:\nJournal of Chemical Information and Modeling.\n64\n,\n7\n,\np. 2539-2553\n15 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nOn Signal Propagation in Neural Networks\nHoedt, P.-J.\n,\nDec 2023\n,\n97 p.\nResearch output\n:\nThesis\n›\nDoctoral thesis\nPrincipled Weight Initialisation for Input-Convex Neural Networks\nHoedt, P.-J.\n&\nKlambauer, G.\n,\n2023\n,\nConference Neural Information Processing Systems Foundation (NeurIPS 2023).\n12 p.\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference proceedings\n›\npeer-review\nRobust task-specific adaption of drug-target interaction models\nPetersson Svensson, E.,\nHoedt, P.-J.\n,\nHochreiter, S.\n&\nKlambauer, G.\n,\n2022\n,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML 2022), 3rd Women in Machine Learning Un-Workshop.\n1 p.\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference proceedings\n›\npeer-review\nView all 11 research outputs\nProjects\n1\nFinished\n1\nActive\nCluster of Excellence \"Bilateral Artificial Intelligence\"\nFürnkranz, J.\n(PI),\nHochreiter, S.\n(PI),\nKlambauer, G.\n(PI),\nSchedl, M.\n(PI),\nSeidl, M.\n(PI),\nWidmer, G.\n(PI),\nBrandstetter, J.\n(PI),\nKobler, E.\n(PI),\nAichernig, B.\n(PI),\nHeisinger, M.\n(Researcher),\nHoedt, P.-J.\n(Researcher),\nPfeiffer, P.\n(Researcher), Plank, A. (Researcher),\nRadler, A.\n(Researcher),\nRebola Pardo, A.\n(Researcher), Lin, W. (Researcher),\nEckert, H.\n(Researcher),\nCranganore, S. S.\n(Researcher),\nHartl, A.-R.\n(Researcher),\nPlasser, M.\n(Researcher),\nPammer, T.\n(Researcher),\nTommasel, A.\n(Researcher),\nNawaz, S.\n(Researcher),\nMasoudian, S.\n(Researcher) &\nFreinschlag, R.\n(Researcher)\n01.10.2024\n→\n30.09.2029\nProject\n:\nFunded research\n›\nFWF - Austrian Science Fund\nDEEPTOXGEN - Deep Learning for In-Silico Toxicogenetics Testing\nHoedt, P.-J.\n(Researcher), Renz, P. (Researcher) &\nKlambauer, G.\n(PI)\n01.03.2018\n→\n31.08.2020\nProject\n:\nFunded research\n›\nFederal / regional / local authorities\nActivities\n1\nOther talk or presentation\nMC-LSTM: Adding mass conservation to RNNs\nHoedt, P.-J.\n(Speaker) & Kratzert, F. (Speaker)\n16 Apr 2021\nActivity\n:\nTalk or presentation\n›\nOther talk or presentation\n›\nscience-to-public"
