    "homepage_text": "ExtensityAI - About Us\nOur story\nAbout us\nOur vision is to redefine how scientific research is conducted.\nABout us\nGlobal Expertise,\nInnovative Solutions\nAt ExtensityAI, our team brings together academic rigor and proven industry prowess. Our researchers and engineers combine expertise across critical domains including bioinformatics, robotics, generative AI, and neuro-symbolic systems, with multiple peer-reviewed publications at prestigious AI conferences.\nLed by researchers trained under pioneers like Sepp Hochreiter and supervised by experts including Gary Marcus, our team specializes in developing multi-step reasoning systems and verifiable architectures. Our leadership brings together proven track records from leading technology companies and successful ventures across industries, combining deep technical expertise with practical implementation experience.\nThis combination of rigorous research and validated industry experience uniquely positions us to develop the AI Research Factory. We focus on building frameworks that tackle complex research workflows while enabling collaboration across disciplines, institutions, and borders. Our goal is to create powerful tools that are both scientifically sound and responsibly implemented.\nMeet the team\n100+ Years of Combined Experience in Research & Development\nThomas Neumayer\nCEO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nDr. Marius-Constantin Dinu\nCRO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nClaudiu Leoveanu - Condrei\nCTO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nDr. Markus Hofmarcher\nResearch Director\nPrevious at:\nRyan Gold\nMachine Learning Engineer\nBogdan Petrescu\nDesign Consultant\nAdrian Kaiser\nMachine Learning Engineer\nThomas Neumayer\nCEO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nDr. Marius-Constantin Dinu\nCRO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nClaudiu Leoveanu - Condrei\nCTO & Co-Founder\nPrevious at:\nDr. Markus Hofmarcher\nResearch Director\nPrevious at:\nRyan Gold\nMachine Learning Engineer\nBogdan Petrescu\nDesign Consultant\n