Engineer\nBogdan Petrescu\nDesign Consultant\nAdrian Kaiser\nMachine Learning Engineer\nAdvisory board\nAdvised by the best in the industry\nOur Advisory Board includes industry experts and innovators who guide our strategic direction.\nSepp Hochreiter\nSepp Hochreiter\nInventor of LSTM / xLSTM\nAward-winning International Researcher\nProfessor at Johannes Kepler University\nAndreas Windisch\nAndreas Windisch\nAI Austria Member\nExpert in Theoretical Physics\nHonorary Research Scientist at Washington University\nMatt Peterman\nMatt Peterman\nInternational Business\nDevelopment Manager\nEntrepreneur & Investor\nMIT Venture Scaling Master\nBrad Mattick\nBrad Mattick\nSoftware executive with over 25 years experience in technology.\nFirst product leader at Salesforce, Ran GTM at Slack\nThe future of AI\nAvailable today\nTry Out Now"
